001	GEN	009	003	Konke okuhambayo okuphilayo kuzakuba yikudla kini; njengombhida oluhlaza ngilinikile konke.
001	GEN	009	004	Kodwa inyama lempilo yayo, igazi layo, kalisoze likudle.
