001	GEN	024	064	LoRebeka waphakamisa amehlo akhe; esembonile uIsaka waziwisa ekamelweni.
001	GEN	024	065	Wasesithi encekwini: Ngubani lindoda ehamba emasimini ukusihlangabeza? Inceku yasisithi: Yinkosi yami. Wasethatha isimbombozo, wazigubuzela.
001	GEN	024	066	Inceku yasilandisa kuIsaka zonke indaba ezenzileyo.
001	GEN	024	067	UIsaka wasemngenisa ethenteni likaSara unina, wamthatha uRebeka, waba ngumkakhe, wamthanda. UIsaka waseduduzwa emva kokufa kukanina.
001	GEN	025	001	UAbrahama wasebuya wathatha umfazi, lebizo lakhe linguKetura.
001	GEN	025	002	Wasemzalela uZimrani loJokishani loMedani loMidiyani loIshibaki loShuwa.
