001	GEN	025	030	UEsawu wasesithi kuJakobe: Ake ungivumele ngiginye kokubomvu lokho okubomvu, ngoba ngikhathele. Ngalokhu babiza ibizo lakhe ngokuthi uEdoma.
001	GEN	025	031	UJakobe wasesithi: Ngithengisela lamuhla ilungelo lobuzibulo bakho.
