004	NUM	008	005	INkosi yasikhuluma kuMozisi isithi:
004	NUM	008	006	Khupha amaLevi phakathi kwabantwana bakoIsrayeli, uwahlambulule;
004	NUM	008	007	wenze ngokunjalo kuwo ukuwahlambulula; ufafaze phezu kwawo amanzi okuhlambulula, njalo adlulise impuco emzimbeni wawo wonke, awatshe izigqoko zawo, azihlambulule.
004	NUM	008	008	Athathe ijongosi ithole lenkomo, lomnikelo walo wokudla, impuphu ecolekileyo ixubene lamafutha, uthathe lelinye ijongosi ithole lenkomo, libe ngumnikelo wesono.
