004	NUM	009	001	INkosi yasikhuluma kuMozisi enkangala yeSinayi, ngomnyaka wesibili emva kokuphuma kwabo elizweni leGibhithe ngenyanga yokuqala, isithi:
004	NUM	009	002	Futhi abantwana bakoIsrayeli kabagcine iphasika ngesikhathi salo esimisiweyo.
