004	NUM	016	044	INkosi yasikhuluma kuMozisi isithi:
004	NUM	016	045	Yenyukani lisuke phakathi kwalinhlangano, ukuze ngibaqede njengokucwayiza kwelihlo. Basebesithi mbo ngobuso babo phansi.
