004	NUM	019	001	INkosi yasikhuluma kuMozisi lakuAroni isithi:
004	NUM	019	002	Lesi yisimiso somlayo iNkosi esimisileyo isithi: Tshono ebantwaneni bakoIsrayeli ukuthi balethe kini ithokazi elibomvu elipheleleyo okungelasici kulo, okungazange kufakwe ijogwe kulo;
