010	2SA	022	019	Babephambi kwami osukwini lwenhlupheko yami, kodwa iNkosi yaba yisisekelo sami.
010	2SA	022	020	Yangikhuphela endaweni ebanzi, yangikhulula, ngoba yayithokoza ngami.
