013	1CH	001	005	Amadodana kaJafethi: OGomeri loMagogi loMadayi loJavani loThubhali loMesheki loTirasi.
013	1CH	001	006	Lamadodana kaGomeri: OAshikenazi loRifathi loTogarma.
013	1CH	001	007	Lamadodana kaJavani: OElisha loTarshishi, amaKiti lamaDodani.
013	1CH	001	008	Amadodana kaHamu: OKushi loMizirayimi, uPuti loKhanani.
013	1CH	001	009	Lamadodana kaKushi: OSeba loHavila loSabitha loRahama loSabitheka. Lamadodana kaRahama: OShebha loDedani.
013	1CH	001	010	UKushi wasezala uNimrodi; yena waqala ukuba liqhawe emhlabeni.
013	1CH	001	011	UMizirayimi wasezala amaLudi lamaAnami lamaLehabi lamaNafethuhi
013	1CH	001	012	lamaPatrusi lamaKaseluhi (okwaphuma kiwo amaFilisti), lamaKafitori.
013	1CH	001	013	UKhanani wasezala uSidoni izibulo lakhe, loHethi,
013	1CH	001	014	lomJebusi lomAmori lomGirigashi
013	1CH	001	015	lomHivi lomArki lomSini
013	1CH	001	016	lomArvadi lomZemari lomHamathi.
