013	1CH	001	034	UAbrahama wasezala uIsaka. Amadodana kaIsaka: OEsawu loIsrayeli.
013	1CH	001	035	Amadodana kaEsawu: OElifazi, uRehuweli, loJewushi, loJalamu, loKora.
