013	1CH	001	041	Amadodana kaAna: UDishoni. Lamadodana kaDishoni: OHamrani loEshibhani loJitirani loKerani.
013	1CH	001	042	Amadodana kaEzeri: OBilihani loZahavana, uJahakhani. Amadodana kaDishani: OUzi loArani.
013	1CH	001	043	Njalo la ngamakhosi abusa elizweni leEdoma, kungakabusi inkosi phezu kwabantwana bakoIsrayeli: UBhela indodana kaBeyori; lebizo lomuzi wakhe laliyiDinihaba.
013	1CH	001	044	UBhela wasesifa, uJobabi indodana kaZera weBhozira wasesiba yinkosi esikhundleni sakhe.
013	1CH	001	045	UJobabi wasesifa, uHushama owelizweni lamaThemani wasesiba yinkosi esikhundleni sakhe.
013	1CH	001	046	UHushama wasesifa, uHadadi indodana kaBedadi, owatshaya amaMidiyani emagcekeni akoMowabi, wasesiba yinkosi esikhundleni sakhe; lebizo lomuzi wakhe laliyiAvithi.
013	1CH	001	047	UHadadi wasesifa, uSamila weMasireka wasesiba yinkosi esikhundleni sakhe.
013	1CH	001	048	USamila wasesifa, uShawuli weRehobothi emfuleni wasesiba yinkosi esikhundleni sakhe.
013	1CH	001	049	UShawuli wasesifa, uBhali-Hanani indodana kaAkhibhori wasesiba yinkosi esikhundleni sakhe.
013	1CH	001	050	UBhali-Hanani wasesifa, uHadadi wasesiba yinkosi esikhundleni sakhe; lebizo lomuzi wakhe laliyiPhayi; lebizo lomkakhe lalinguMehethabheli indodakazi kaMatiredi indodakazi kaMezahabhi.
013	1CH	001	051	UHadadi wasesifa. Lezinduna zeEdoma zaziyilezi: Induna uTimina, induna uAliya, induna uJethethi,
013	1CH	001	052	induna uAholibama, induna uEla, induna uPinoni,
013	1CH	001	053	induna uKenazi, induna uThemani, induna uMibhizari,
013	1CH	001	054	induna uMagidiyeli, induna uIrama; lezi yizinduna zeEdoma.
013	1CH	002	001	La ngamadodana kaIsrayeli: ORubeni, uSimeyoni, uLevi, loJuda, uIsakari, loZebuluni,
013	1CH	002	002	uDani, uJosefa, loBhenjamini, uNafithali, uGadi, loAsheri.
013	1CH	002	003	Amadodana kaJuda: OEri loOnani loShela; amathathu wawazalelwa yindodakazi kaShuwa umKhananikazi. Kodwa uEri izibulo likaJuda wayemubi emehlweni eNkosi; yasimbulala.
013	1CH	002	004	UTamari, umalokozana wakhe, wasemzalela uPerezi loZera. Wonke amadodana kaJuda ayemahlanu.
013	1CH	002	005	Amadodana kaPerezi: OHezironi loHamuli.
013	1CH	002	006	Njalo amadodana kaZera: OZimri loEthani loHemani loKalikoli loDara; wonke ayemahlanu.
013	1CH	002	007	Njalo amadodana kaKarimi: UAkari, umhluphi kaIsrayeli, owenza isiphambeko ngokuqalekisiweyo.
013	1CH	002	008	Njalo amadodana kaEthani: UAzariya.
013	1CH	002	009	Njalo amadodana kaHezironi awazalelwayo: OJerameli loRamu loKalebi.
013	1CH	002	010	URamu wasezala uAminadaba; uAminadaba wasezala uNahishoni induna yabantwana bakoJuda.
013	1CH	002	011	UNahishoni wasezala uSalima; uSalima wasezala uBhowazi;
013	1CH	002	012	uBhowazi wasezala uObedi; uObedi wasezala uJese.
013	1CH	002	013	UJese wasezala izibulo lakhe uEliyabi, loAbinadaba owesibili, loShimeya owesithathu,
013	1CH	002	014	uNethaneli owesine, uRadayi owesihlanu,
013	1CH	002	015	uOzema owesithupha, uDavida owesikhombisa.
013	1CH	002	016	Odadewabo babengoZeruya loAbigayili. Lamadodana kaZeruya: OAbishayi loJowabi loAsaheli; abathathu.
013	1CH	002	017	UAbigayili wasezala uAmasa; loyise kaAmasa wayenguJetheri umIshmayeli.
013	1CH	002	018	UKalebi indodana kaHezironi wasezala kuAzuba umkakhe lakuJeriyothi; lala ngamadodana akhe: OJesheri loShobabi loAridoni.
013	1CH	002	019	UAzuba esefile uKalebi wazithathela uEfrathi owamzalela uHuri.
013	1CH	002	020	UHuri wasezala uUri; uUri wasezala uBhezaleli.
013	1CH	002	021	Emva kwalokho uHezironi wasengena kundodakazi kaMakiri uyise kaGileyadi; wayithatha eseleminyaka engamatshumi ayisithupha. Yasimzalela uSegubi.
013	1CH	002	022	USegubi wasezala uJayiri owayelemizi engamatshumi amabili lantathu elizweni leGileyadi.
013	1CH	002	023	Wasethatha kibo iGeshuri leAramu kanye lemizana yeJayiri, kanye leKenathi lemizana yayo; imizi engamatshumi ayisithupha. Bonke labo babengamadodana kaMakiri uyise kaGileyadi.
013	1CH	002	024	Lemva kokufa kukaHezironi eKalebi-Efratha, uAbhiya umkaHezironi wamzalela uAshuri uyise kaThekhowa.
013	1CH	002	025	Njalo amadodana kaJerameli izibulo likaHezironi ayengoRamu izibulo, loBuna, loOreni, loOzema, uAhiya.
013	1CH	002	026	UJerameli laye wayelomunye umfazi obizo lakhe lalinguAthara; wayengunina kaOnama.
013	1CH	002	027	Njalo amadodana kaRamu izibulo likaJerameli ayengoMahazi loJamini loEkeri.
013	1CH	002	028	Lamadodana kaOnama ayengoShamayi loJada. Lamadodana kaShamayi: ONadabi loAbhishuri.
013	1CH	002	029	Lebizo lomkaAbhishuri lalinguAbihayili, owamzalela oAhibani loMolidi.
013	1CH	002	030	Njalo amadodana kaNadabi: OSeledi loAphayimi; kodwa uSeledi wafa engelabantwana.
013	1CH	002	031	Njalo amadodana kaAphayimi: UIshi. Lamadodana kaIshi: USheshani. Lamadodana kaSheshani: UAhilayi.
013	1CH	002	032	Njalo amadodana kaJada umfowabo kaShamayi: OJetheri loJonathani; kodwa uJetheri wafa engelabantwana.
013	1CH	002	033	Njalo amadodana kaJonathani: OPelethi loZaza. Laba babengabantwana bakaJerameli.
013	1CH	002	034	Njalo uSheshani wayengelamadodana, kodwa amadodakazi; njalo uSheshani wayelenceku, umGibhithe, obizo layo lalinguJariha.
013	1CH	002	035	USheshani wasenika uJariha inceku yakhe indodakazi yakhe yaba ngumkakhe; yasimzalela uAthayi.
013	1CH	002	036	UAthayi wasezala uNathani, uNathani wasezala uZabadi,
013	1CH	002	037	uZabadi wasezala uEfilali, uEfilali wasezala uObedi,
013	1CH	002	038	uObedi wasezala uJehu, uJehu wasezala uAzariya,
013	1CH	002	039	uAzariya wasezala uHelezi, uHelezi wasezala uEleyasa,
013	1CH	002	040	uEleyasa wasezala uSisimayi, uSisimayi wasezala uShaluma,
013	1CH	002	041	uShaluma wasezala uJekamiya, uJekamiya wasezala uElishama.
013	1CH	002	042	Njalo amadodana kaKalebi umfowabo kaJerameli: OMesha, izibulo lakhe, onguyise kaZifi, lamadodana kaMaresha uyise kaHebroni.
013	1CH	002	043	Njalo amadodana kaHebroni: OKora loTapuwa loRekemi loShema.
013	1CH	002	044	UShema wasezala uRahama uyise kaJorikeyamu; uRekemi wasezala uShamayi.
013	1CH	002	045	Lendodana kaShamayi: UMawoni; loMawoni wayenguyise kaBeti-Zuri.
013	1CH	002	046	UEfa umfazi omncinyane kaKalebi wasezala oHarani loMoza loGazezi; uHarani wasezala uGazezi.
013	1CH	002	047	Njalo amadodana kaJahidayi: ORegema loJothamu loGeshani loPeleti loEfa loShahafi.
013	1CH	002	048	UMahaka umfazi omncinyane kaKalebi wazala oSheberi loTirihana.
013	1CH	002	049	Wasezala uShahafi uyise kaMadimana, uSheva uyise kaMakibena, loyise kaGibeya. Lendodakazi kaKalebi yayinguAkisa.
013	1CH	002	050	Laba babengabantwana bakaKalebi, indodana kaHuri, izibulo likaEfratha: OShobhali, uyise kaKiriyathi-Jeyarimi,
013	1CH	002	051	uSalima uyise kaBhethelehema, uHarefi uyise kaBeti-Gaderi.
013	1CH	002	052	UShobhali uyise kaKiriyathi-Jeyarimi wayelamadodana: UHarowe, ingxenye yamaMenuhothi.
013	1CH	002	053	Njalo insendo zikaKiriyathi-Jeyarimi: AmaIthiri lamaPuti lamaShumathi lamaMishrayi; kwaphuma kuwo amaZorathi lamaEshitawoli.
013	1CH	002	054	Amadodana kaSalima: OBhethelehema, lamaNetofa, uAtarothi, uBeti-Jowabi, lengxenye yamaManahethi, amaZori.
013	1CH	002	055	Lensendo zababhali ababehlala eJabezi, amaTirathi, amaShimeyathi, amaSukathi. Labo babengamaKeni avela kuHamathi uyise wendlu kaRekabi.
013	1CH	003	001	Njalo la ayengamadodana kaDavida awazalelwa eHebroni: Izibulo nguAmnoni kuAhinowama umJizereyelikazi; eyesibili nguDaniyeli kuAbigayili umKharmelikazi;
013	1CH	003	002	eyesithathu nguAbisalomu indodana kaMahaka indodakazi kaTalimayi inkosi yeGeshuri; eyesine nguAdonija indodana kaHagithi;
013	1CH	003	003	eyesihlanu nguShefathiya kuAbithali; eyesithupha nguIthereyamu kuEgila umkakhe.
013	1CH	003	004	Abayisithupha bazalelwa yena eHebroni, lapho abusa khona iminyaka eyisikhombisa lezinyanga eziyisithupha; leJerusalema wabusa iminyaka engamatshumi amathathu lantathu.
013	1CH	003	005	Lalaba bazalelwa yena eJerusalema: OShimeya loShobabi loNathani loSolomoni, bobane, kuBathishuwa indodakazi kaAmiyeli;
013	1CH	003	006	loIbihari loElishama loElifelethi
013	1CH	003	007	loNoga loNefegi loJafiya
013	1CH	003	008	loElishama loEliyada loElifelethi, abayisificamunwemunye.
013	1CH	003	009	Bonke babengamadodana kaDavida, ngaphandle kwamadodana abafazi abancane, loTamari udadewabo.
013	1CH	003	010	Lendodana kaSolomoni yayinguRehobhowamu, uAbhiya indodana yakhe, uAsa indodana yakhe, uJehoshafathi indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	003	011	uJoramu indodana yakhe, uAhaziya indodana yakhe, uJowashi indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	003	012	uAmaziya indodana yakhe, uAzariya indodana yakhe, uJothamu indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	003	013	uAhazi indodana yakhe, uHezekhiya indodana yakhe, uManase indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	003	014	uAmoni indodana yakhe, uJosiya indodana yakhe.
013	1CH	003	015	Njalo amadodana kaJosiya: Izibulo uJohanani, eyesibili uJehoyakhimi, eyesithathu uZedekhiya, eyesine uShaluma.
013	1CH	003	016	Lamadodana kaJehoyakhimi: UJekoniya indodana yakhe, uZedekhiya indodana yakhe.
013	1CH	003	017	Njalo amadodana kaJekoniya: UAsiri, uSheyalitiyeli indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	003	018	loMalikiramu, loPhedaya, loShenazari, uJekamiya, uHoshama, loNedabiya.
013	1CH	003	019	Njalo amadodana kaPhedaya: OZerubhabheli loShimeyi. Lamadodana kaZerubhabheli: OMeshulamu, loHananiya, loShelomithi udadewabo;
013	1CH	003	020	loHashuba, loOheli, loBerekiya, loHasadiya, uJushabi-Hesedi, amahlanu.
013	1CH	003	021	Lamadodana kaHananiya: OPelatiya loJeshaya; amadodana kaRefaya, amadodana kaArinani, amadodana kaObhadiya, amadodana kaShekaniya.
013	1CH	003	022	Lamadodana kaShekaniya: UShemaya. Lamadodana kaShemaya: OHathushi loIgali loBariya loNeyariya loShafati, ayisithupha.
013	1CH	003	023	Njalo amadodana kaNeyariya: OEliyohenayi loHizikiya loAzirikamu, amathathu.
013	1CH	003	024	Njalo amadodana kaEliyohenayi: OHodaviya loEliyashibi loPelaya loAkubi loJohanani loDelaya loAnani, ayisikhombisa.
013	1CH	004	001	Amadodana kaJuda: OPerezi, uHezironi, loKarmi, loHuri, loShobhali.
013	1CH	004	002	UReyaya indodana kaShobhali wasezala uJahathi; uJahathi wasezala uAhumayi loLahadi. Laba babezinsendo zamaZorathi.
013	1CH	004	003	Laba babengabakayise kaEtamu: OJizereyeli loIshma loIdibhashi; lebizo likadadewabo lalinguHazeleliponi.
013	1CH	004	004	LoPenuweli uyise kaGedori, loEzeri uyise kaHusha. Laba babengamadodana kaHuri, izibulo likaEfratha, uyise kaBhethelehema.
013	1CH	004	005	Njalo uAshuri uyise kaThekhowa wayelabafazi ababili, oHela loNahara.
013	1CH	004	006	UNahara wasemzalela uAhuzama loHeferi loTemeni loHahashitari. Laba babengamadodana kaNahara.
013	1CH	004	007	Lamadodana kaHela: OZerethi loIzohari loEthinani.
013	1CH	004	008	UKhozi wasezala uAnubi loZobeba, lensendo zikaAhariheli indodana kaHarumi.
013	1CH	004	009	Njalo uJabezi wayelodumo kulabafowabo; unina wasemutha ibizo wathi nguJabezi, esithi: Ngoba ngamzala ngisosizini.
013	1CH	004	010	UJabezi wasebiza uNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli esithi: Kungathi ungangibusisa lokungibusisa, uqhelise umngcele wami, lesandla sakho sibe lami, ungivikele ebubini ukuze bungangidabuli! UNkulunkulu wenza kwenzakala lokho akucelayo.
013	1CH	004	011	UKelubi umfowabo kaShuha wasezala uMehiri, onguyise kaEshitoni.
013	1CH	004	012	UEshitoni wasezala uBeti-Rafa loPhaseya loTehina uyise kaIri-Nahashi. Laba babengabantu bakaReka.
013	1CH	004	013	Lamadodana kaKenazi: O-Othiniyeli loSeraya. Lamadodana kaOthiniyeli: UHathathi.
013	1CH	004	014	UMeyonothayi wasezala uOfira. USeraya wasezala uJowabi uyise wesigodi seHarashi, ngoba babezingcitshi.
013	1CH	004	015	Lamadodana kaKalebi indodana kaJefune: OIru, uEla, loNahamu; lamadodana kaEla, ngitsho uKenazi.
013	1CH	004	016	Lamadodana kaJehaleleli: OZifi, loZifa, uTiriya, loAsareli.
013	1CH	004	017	Lamadodana kaEzra: OJetheri loMeredi loEferi loJaloni. Wasezala oMiriyamu loShamayi loIshiba uyise kaEshithemowa.
013	1CH	004	018	Umkakhe umJudakazi wasezala uJeredi uyise kaGedori, loHeberi uyise kaSoko, loJekuthiyeli uyise kaZanowa. Lalabo babengamadodana kaBithiya indodakazi kaFaro, uMeredi amthathayo.
013	1CH	004	019	Lamadodana omkaHodiya, udadewabo kaNahama, uyise kaKeyila umGarmi, loEshithemowa umMahakathi.
013	1CH	004	020	Njalo amadodana kaShimoni: OAmnoni, loRina, uBheni-Hanani, loThiloni. Lamadodana kaIshi: OZohethi loBheni-Zohethi.
013	1CH	004	021	Amadodana kaShela indodana kaJuda: OEri uyise kaLeka, loLahada uyise kaMaresha, lensendo zendlu yabenzi belembu elicolekileyo bendlu kaAshibeya,
013	1CH	004	022	loJokimi, lamadoda akoKhozeba, loJowashi, loSarafi ababebusa amaMowabi, loJashubi-Lehema. Lalezizindaba zindala.
013	1CH	004	023	Labo babengababumbi, labakhileyo ezilimeni lezintangweni; bahlala lapho lenkosi emsebenzini wayo.
013	1CH	004	024	Amadodana kaSimeyoni: ONemuweli, loJamini, loJaribi, uZera, uShawuli,
013	1CH	004	025	uShaluma indodana yakhe, uMibhisamu indodana yakhe, uMishima indodana yakhe.
013	1CH	004	026	Lamadodana kaMishima: UHamuweli indodana yakhe, uZakuri indodana yakhe, uShimeyi indodana yakhe.
013	1CH	004	027	Njalo uShimeyi wayelamadodana alitshumi lesithupha lamadodakazi ayisithupha; kodwa abafowabo babengelabantwana abanengi, losendo lonke lwabo kalwandanga njengabantwana bakoJuda.
013	1CH	004	028	Basebehlala eBherishebha leMolada leHazari-Shuwali
013	1CH	004	029	leBiliha leEzema leToladi
013	1CH	004	030	leBethuweli leHorma leZikilagi
013	1CH	004	031	leBeti-Marikabothi leHazari-Susimi leBeti-Biri leShaharayimi. Le yayiyimizi yabo kwaze kwaba sekubuseni kukaDavida.
013	1CH	004	032	Lemizana yabo: IEtamu, leAyini, iRimoni, leTokeni, leAshani, imizi emihlanu,
013	1CH	004	033	layo yonke imizana yayo, eyayiyizingelezele leyomizi, kuze kube seBahali. Lezi zindawo zabo zokuhlala, njalo baba lombhalo wosendo lwabo.
013	1CH	004	034	LoMeshobabi loJamileki loJosha indodana kaAmaziya,
013	1CH	004	035	loJoweli loJehu indodana kaJoshibhiya indodana kaSeraya indodana kaAsiyeli,
013	1CH	004	036	loEliyohenayi loJahakoba loJeshohaya loAsaya loAdiyeli loJesimiyeli loBhenaya,
013	1CH	004	037	loZiza indodana kaShifi indodana kaAloni indodana kaJedaya indodana kaShimiri indodana kaShemaya.
013	1CH	004	038	Laba abaqanjwe ngamabizo babeyizikhulu ensendweni zabo, lezindlu zaboyise zanda kakhulu ngobunengi.
013	1CH	004	039	Basebesiya ekungeneni kweGedori, baya ngempumalanga kwesihotsha, ukudingela imihlambi yabo idlelo.
013	1CH	004	040	Bafica idlelo elivundileyo lelihle, lommango obanzi emaceleni, lolokuzola, lolokuthula; ngoba abakoHamu babehlala khona endulo.
013	1CH	004	041	Lalabo ababebhalwe ngamabizo bafika ensukwini zikaHezekhiya inkosi yakoJuda, batshaya amathente lendawo zokuhlala ezazitholakala khona, babatshabalalisa kuze kube lamuhla; bahlala endaweni zabo, ngoba kwakukhona lapho idlelo lezimvu zabo.
013	1CH	004	042	Kwasekuphuma kubo, ebantwaneni bakoSimeyoni, amadoda angamakhulu amahlanu, aya entabeni yeSeyiri. LoPelatiya loNeyariya loRefaya loUziyeli amadodana kaIshi babezinhloko zabo.
013	1CH	004	043	Basebetshaya insali yabaphephayo bamaAmaleki, bahlala khona kuze kube lamuhla.
013	1CH	005	001	Njalo amadodana kaRubeni, izibulo likaIsrayeli (ngoba wayelizibulo, kodwa njengoba wayengcolise umbheda kayise, ubuzibulo bakhe banikwa amadodana kaJosefa indodana kaIsrayeli; futhi wayengabhalwanga njengezibulo;
013	1CH	005	002	ngoba uJuda wayelamandla kulabafowabo, lowayengumbusi wavela kuye, kodwa ubuzibulo babungobukaJosefa).
013	1CH	005	003	Amadodana kaRubeni, izibulo likaIsrayeli: OHanoki, loPalu, uHezironi, loKarmi.
013	1CH	005	004	Amadodana kaJoweli: UShemaya indodana yakhe, uGogi indodana yakhe, uShimeyi indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	005	005	uMika indodana yakhe, uReyaya indodana yakhe, uBhali indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	005	006	uBehera indodana yakhe, uTiligathi-Pilineseri inkosi yeAsiriya eyamthumbayo; wayeyisiphathamandla sabakoRubeni.
013	1CH	005	007	Njalo abafowabo ngensendo zabo, lapho bebhalwa ngokwezizukulwana zabo, bayizinhloko: OJeyiyeli, loZekhariya,
013	1CH	005	008	loBhela indodana kaAzazi indodana kaShema indodana kaJoweli, owayehlala eAroweri, njalo kwaze kwaba seNebo leBhali-Meyoni.
013	1CH	005	009	Langempumalanga wahlala kwaze kwaba sekungeneni kwenkangala kusukela emfuleni iYufrathi, ngoba izifuyo zabo zasezandile elizweni leGileyadi.
013	1CH	005	010	Ensukwini zikaSawuli balawula-ke impi lamaHagari, awa ngesandla sabo; bahlala emathenteni awo elizweni lonke lempumalanga yeGileyadi.
013	1CH	005	011	Labantwana bakoGadi bahlala maqondana labo elizweni leBashani kwaze kwaba seSaleka.
013	1CH	005	012	UJoweli inhloko, loShafamu owesibili, loJanayi loShafati eBashani.
013	1CH	005	013	Labafowabo ngendlu yaboyise: OMikayeli loMeshulamu loShebha loJorayi loJakani loZiya loEberi, beyisikhombisa.
013	1CH	005	014	Laba babengamadodana kaAbihayili indodana kaHuri indodana kaJarowa indodana kaGileyadi indodana kaMikayeli indodana kaJeshishayi indodana kaJahido indodana kaBuzi.
013	1CH	005	015	UAhi indodana kaAbidiyeli indodana kaGuni wayeyinhloko yendlu yaboyise.
013	1CH	005	016	Basebehlala eGileyadi, eBashani, lemizaneni yayo, lakuwo wonke amadlelo eSharoni, kwaze kwaba sekuphumeni kwawo.
013	1CH	005	017	Bonke laba babhalwa ngezizukulwana zabo ezinsukwini zikaJothamu inkosi yakoJuda lensukwini zikaJerobhowamu inkosi yakoIsrayeli.
013	1CH	005	018	Amadodana kaRubeni labakoGadi lengxenye yesizwe sakoManase, emadodeni angamaqhawe, athwala isihlangu lenkemba, anyathela idandili, lezingcitshi empini, ayeyizinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amane lane lamakhulu ayisikhombisa lamatshumi ayisithupha, ephumela ebuthweni.
013	1CH	005	019	Basebelawula impi lamaHagari loJeturi loNafishi loNodabi.
013	1CH	005	020	Bancediswa bemelene labo, amaHagari asenikelwa esandleni sabo, labo bonke ababelawo; ngoba bakhala kuNkulunkulu besempini, wasencengeka ngabo, ngoba bamthemba.
013	1CH	005	021	Bathumba izifuyo zabo, amakamela azinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amahlanu, lezimvu ezizinkulungwane ezingamakhulu amabili lamatshumi amahlanu, labobabhemi abazinkulungwane ezimbili, lemiphefumulo yabantu ezinkulungwane ezilikhulu.
013	1CH	005	022	Ngoba kwawa abanengi ababuleweyo, ngoba impi yayingekaNkulunkulu. Basebehlala ezindaweni zabo kwaze kwafika ukuthunjwa.
013	1CH	005	023	Abantwana bengxenye yesizwe sakoManase basebehlala elizweni; kusukela eBashani kusiya eBhali-Hermoni leSeniri lentabeni yeHermoni bona banda.
013	1CH	005	024	Lalezi zinhloko zendlu yaboyise, ngitsho oEferi loIshi loEliyeli loAziriyeli loJeremiya loHodaviya loJahidiyeli, amadoda angamaqhawe alamandla, amadoda alamabizo, inhloko zendlu yaboyise.
013	1CH	005	025	Kodwa bona kuNkulunkulu waboyise, baphinga ngokulandela onkulunkulu babantu balelolizwe, uNkulunkulu abachithayo phambi kwabo.
013	1CH	005	026	Ngakho uNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli wavusa umoya kaPhuli inkosi yeAsiriya, lomoya kaTiligathi-Pilineseri inkosi yeAsiriya, wabathumba, ngitsho abakoRubeni labakoGadi lengxenye yesizwe sakoManase, wabasa eHala leHabori leHara lemfuleni iGozani, kuze kube lamuhla.
013	1CH	006	001	Amadodana kaLevi: OGerishoni, uKohathi, loMerari.
013	1CH	006	002	Lamadodana kaKohathi: OAmramu, uIzihari, loHebroni, loUziyeli.
013	1CH	006	003	Labantwana bakaAmramu: OAroni loMozisi loMiriyamu. Lamadodana kaAroni: ONadabi, loAbihu, uEleyazare, loIthamari.
013	1CH	006	004	UEleyazare wazala uPhinehasi; uPhinehasi wazala uAbishuwa;
013	1CH	006	005	uAbishuwa wasezala uBuki; uBuki wasezala uUzi;
013	1CH	006	006	uUzi wasezala uZerahiya; uZerahiya wasezala uMerayothi;
