013	1CH	006	025	Njalo amadodana kaElkana: OAmasayi loAhimothi.
013	1CH	006	026	UElkana; amadodana kaElkana: UZofayi indodana yakhe, loNahathi indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	006	027	uEliyabi indodana yakhe, uJerohamu indodana yakhe, uElkana indodana yakhe.
