013	1CH	006	030	uShimeya indodana yakhe, uHagiya indodana yakhe, uAsaya indodana yakhe.
013	1CH	006	031	Lalaba yibo uDavida abamisayo phezu kwenkonzo yengoma endlini yeNkosi umtshokotsho usuphumule.
013	1CH	006	032	Njalo babekhonza phambi kwethabhanekele lethente lenhlangano ngengoma, uSolomoni waze wakha indlu yeNkosi eJerusalema. Bema ngokwesimiso sabo enkonzweni yabo.
013	1CH	006	033	Lalaba yibo abema lamadodana abo: Kumadodana amaKohathi: UHemani umhlabeleli indodana kaJoweli indodana kaSamuweli
013	1CH	006	034	indodana kaElkana indodana kaJerohamu indodana kaEliyeli indodana kaTowa
013	1CH	006	035	indodana kaZufi indodana kaElkana indodana kaMahathi indodana kaAmasayi
013	1CH	006	036	indodana kaElkana indodana kaJoweli indodana kaAzariya indodana kaZefaniya
013	1CH	006	037	indodana kaTahathi indodana kaAsiri indodana kaEbhiyasafi indodana kaKora
013	1CH	006	038	indodana kaIzihari indodana kaKohathi indodana kaLevi indodana kaIsrayeli.
