013	1CH	006	040	indodana kaMikayeli indodana kaBahaseya indodana kaMalikiya
013	1CH	006	041	indodana kaEthini indodana kaZera indodana kaAdaya
013	1CH	006	042	indodana kaEthani indodana kaZima indodana kaShimeyi
013	1CH	006	043	indodana kaJahathi indodana kaGerishoni indodana kaLevi.
013	1CH	006	044	Lamadodana kaMerari, abafowabo, ema ngakwesokhohlo: UEthani indodana kaKishi indodana kaAbidi indodana kaMaluki
013	1CH	006	045	indodana kaHashabhiya indodana kaAmaziya indodana kaHilikhiya
013	1CH	006	046	indodana kaAmizi indodana kaBani indodana kaShemeri
013	1CH	006	047	indodana kaMahli indodana kaMushi indodana kaMerari indodana kaLevi.
013	1CH	006	048	Labafowabo, amaLevi, bamiswa kuyo yonke inkonzo yethabhanekele lendlu kaNkulunkulu.
013	1CH	006	049	Kodwa uAroni lamadodana akhe banikela phezu kwelathi lomnikelo wokutshiswa laphezu kwelathi lempepha, kusenzelwa wonke umsebenzi wengcwele yezingcwele, lokwenzela uIsrayeli inhlawulo yokuthula, njengakho konke uMozisi inceku kaNkulunkulu eyakulayayo.
013	1CH	006	050	Lala ngamadodana kaAroni: OEleyazare indodana yakhe, uPhinehasi indodana yakhe, uAbishuwa indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	006	051	uBuki indodana yakhe, uUzi indodana yakhe, uZerahiya indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	006	052	uMerayothi indodana yakhe, uAmariya indodana yakhe, uAhitubi indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	006	053	uZadoki indodana yakhe, uAhimahazi indodana yakhe.
013	1CH	006	054	Lezi-ke zindawo zawo zokuhlala ezinqabeni zawo emingceleni yawo, zamadodana kaAroni, zezinsendo zamaKohathi; ngoba inkatho yayingeyawo.
013	1CH	006	055	Basebewanika iHebroni elizweni lakoJuda, lamadlelo ayo ayizingelezeleyo.
013	1CH	006	056	Kodwa amasimu omuzi lemizana yawo bakunika uKalebi indodana kaJefune.
013	1CH	006	057	Basebenika amadodana kaAroni imizi yokuphephela: IHebroni, leLibhina lamadlelo ayo, leJathiri, leEshithemowa lamadlelo ayo,
