017	EST	008	011	Ukuthi inkosi yavumela amaJuda ayesemzini ngomuzi wonke ukuthi ahlangane amele impilo yawo ukubhubhisa abulale aqede wonke amandla abantu lesabelo abawahlaseleyo, abantwanyana labesifazana, lokuphanga impango yabo,
017	EST	008	012	ngasuku lunye kuzo zonke izabelo zenkosi uAhasuwerusi, ngolwetshumi lantathu lwenyanga yetshumi lambili, eyinyanga uAdari.
017	EST	008	013	Ikhophi yombhalo yomthetho ozamiswa kuso sonke isabelo ngesabelo yayisobala kubo bonke abantu, ukuthi amaJuda azilungisele lolusuku ukuziphindiselela ezitheni zawo.
017	EST	008	014	Izigijimi zigade amabhiza esikhosini alejubane zaphuma, ziphangisiswa zicindezelwa yilizwi lenkosi, lomthetho wanikwa eShushani isigodlo.
017	EST	008	015	UModekhayi wasephuma phambi kwenkosi ekusembatho sobukhosi sobuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka lesimhlophe, lomqhele omkhulu wegolide, lesembatho selembu elicolekileyo kakhulu leliyibubende. Umuzi weShushani wasuthokoza wathaba.
017	EST	008	016	AmaJuda ayelokukhanya lentokozo lenjabulo lodumo.
017	EST	008	017	Lakuso sonke isabelo ngesabelo lakuwo wonke umuzi ngomuzi endaweni lapho ilizwi lenkosi lomthetho wayo okwafika khona amaJuda aba lentokozo, lenjabulo, idili, losuku oluhle. Labanengi babantu belizwe baba ngamaJuda, ngoba ukwesaba amaJuda kwabehlela.
017	EST	009	001	Kwathi ngenyanga yetshumi lambili, eyinyanga uAdari, ngosuku lwetshumi lantathu lwayo, sekusondele ilizwi lenkosi lomlayo wayo ukuthi kwenziwe, ngosuku izitha zamaJuda ezazithemba ukuwabusa ngalo, kwaguquka, ngoba amaJuda ngokwawo abusa kwababewazonda.
017	EST	009	002	AmaJuda abuthana emizini yawo kuzo zonke izabelo zenkosi uAhasuwerusi ukwelulela isandla kulabo ababedinge ukulinyazwa kwawo; njalo kakho owayengema phambi kwawo, ngoba ukwesabeka kwawo kwakwehlele bonke abantu.
017	EST	009	003	Zonke-ke iziphathamandla zezabelo, lezikhulu, lababusi, labenzi bomsebenzi inkosi eyayilabo, basiza amaJuda, ngoba ukwesabeka kukaModekhayi kwakubehlele.
017	EST	009	004	Ngoba uModekhayi wayemkhulu endlini yenkosi, lodumo lwakhe lwahamba kuzo zonke izabelo, ngoba lindoda uModekhayi yaqhubeka ikhula.
017	EST	009	005	Ngakho amaJuda atshaya phakathi kwezitha zawo zonke ngokutshaya kwenkemba lokubulala lokubhubhisa, enza ngabazondi bawo ngokwentando yawo.
017	EST	009	006	EShushani isigodlo amaJuda asebulala abhubhisa abantu abangamakhulu amahlanu,
017	EST	009	007	loParishanidatha, loDalifoni, loAsiphatha,
017	EST	009	008	loPoratha, loAdaliya, loAridatha,
017	EST	009	009	loParimashita, loArisayi, loAridayi, loVayizatha.
017	EST	009	010	Amadodana alitshumi kaHamani indodana kaHamedatha, isitha samaJuda, awabulala; kodwa kawelulelanga isandla sawo empangweni.
017	EST	009	011	Ngalolosuku inani lababulawayo eShushani isigodlo lafika phambi kwenkosi.
017	EST	009	012	Inkosi yasisithi kuEsta indlovukazi: EShushani isigodlo amaJuda abulele abhubhisa abantu abangamakhulu amahlanu lamadodana alitshumi kaHamani. Enzeni kwezinye izabelo zenkosi? Siyini-ke isicelo sakho? Njalo uzasinikwa. Siyini-ke isifiso sakho futhi? Njalo sizakwenziwa.
017	EST	009	013	UEsta wasesithi: Uba kulungile enkosini kawavunyelwe amaJuda aseShushani ukwenza lakusasa njengokomthetho walamuhla; lamadodana alitshumi kaHamani kabawalengise egodweni.
017	EST	009	014	Inkosi yasisithi kwenziwe njalo; kwasekunikwa umthetho eShushani, lamadodana alitshumi kaHamani bawalengisa.
017	EST	009	015	AmaJuda eyeseShushani asebuthana futhi ngosuku lwetshumi lane lwenyanga uAdari, abulala abantu abangamakhulu amathathu eShushani; kodwa kawelulelanga isandla sawo empangweni.
017	EST	009	016	Amanye kumaJuda ayesezabelweni zenkosi abuthana-ke amela impilo yabo, aphumula ezitheni zawo, abulala kwabawazondayo izinkulungwane ezingamatshumi ayisikhombisa lanhlanu; kodwa kawelulelanga isandla sawo empangweni.
017	EST	009	017	Kwakungosuku lwetshumi lantathu lwenyanga uAdari. Asephumula ngolwetshumi lane lwayo, alwenza lwaba lusuku lwedili lentokozo.
017	EST	009	018	Kodwa amaJuda aseShushani abuthana ngolwetshumi lantathu lwayo langolwetshumi lane lwayo; asephumula ngolwetshumi lanhlanu lwayo, alwenza lwaba lusuku lwedili lentokozo.
017	EST	009	019	Ngenxa yalokhu amaJuda emaphandleni ahlala emizini emaphandleni enza usuku lwetshumi lane lwenyanga uAdari lwaba ngolwentokozo ledili, losuku oluhle, lolokuthumelana izabelo.
017	EST	009	020	UModekhayi wasezibhala lezizinto, wathumela izincwadi kuwo wonke amaJuda ayekuzo zonke izabelo zenkosi uAhasuwerusi, aseduze lakhatshana,
017	EST	009	021	ukumisa phakathi kwabo ukwenza usuku lwetshumi lane lwenyanga uAdari losuku lwetshumi lanhlanu lwayo kuwo wonke umnyaka ngomnyaka,
017	EST	009	022	njengokwensuku amaJuda aphumula ngazo ezitheni zawo, lenyanga eyaphendulwa kuwo kusuka osizini kusiya kuntokozo, lekulileni kube lusuku oluhle, azenze zibe zinsuku zedili lentokozo, lezokuthumelana izabelo, lezipho kubayanga.
017	EST	009	023	AmaJuda emukela lokho ayesekuqalile ukukwenza, lalokho uModekhayi ayewabhalele khona.
017	EST	009	024	Ngoba uHamani indodana kaHamedatha umAgagi, isitha sawo wonke amaJuda, wayecebe mayelana lamaJuda ukuwachitha, waphosa iPuri, eyinkatho, ukuwachoboza lokuwabhubhisa.
017	EST	009	025	Kodwa lapho uEsta efika phambi kwenkosi, yalaya ngencwadi ukuthi icebo lakhe elibi ayelicebe ngamaJuda libuyele ekhanda lakhe; basebebalengisa yena lamadodana akhe egodweni.
017	EST	009	026	Ngenxa yalokhu babiza lezozinsuku ngokuthi iPurimi ngebizo lePuri. Ngenxa yalokhu, ngenxa yawo wonke amazwi aleyoncwadi, lababekubonile mayelana lalokho, lokwakubehlele,
017	EST	009	027	amaJuda amisa azemukelela wona lenzalo yawo labo bonke abazihlanganisa lawo, ukuze bangeqi, ukugcina lezinsuku ezimbili, njengokombhalo wazo, lanjengokwesikhathi sazo esimisiweyo, kuwo wonke umnyaka lomnyaka,
017	EST	009	028	ukuthi lezinsuku zikhunjulwe zigcinwe kuso sonke isizukulwana lesizukulwana, usapho losapho, isabelo ngesabelo, lomuzi ngomuzi, ukuthi lezinsuku zePurimi zingeqiwa phakathi kwamaJuda, lesikhumbuzo sazo singapheli enzalweni yawo.
017	EST	009	029	UEsta indlovukazi, indodakazi kaAbihayili, loModekhayi umJuda, basebebhala ngamandla wonke ukuqinisa lincwadi yesibili yePurimi.
017	EST	009	030	Wasethumela izincwadi kuwo wonke amaJuda ezabelweni ezilikhulu lamatshumi amabili lesikhombisa zombuso kaAhasuwerusi, amazwi okuthula leqiniso,
017	EST	009	031	ukuqinisa lezinsuku zePurimi ngezikhathi zazo ezimisiweyo njengokumisa phezu kwawo kukaModekhayi umJuda loEsta indlovukazi, lanjengokuzimisela kwawo wona lenzalo yawo, indaba zokuzila ukudla lokukhala kwawo.
017	EST	009	032	Ilizwi likaEsta laseliqinisa lezizindaba zePurimi; kwasekubhalwa egwalweni.
017	EST	010	001	Inkosi uAhasuwerusi yasibeka umthelo elizweni lezihlengeni zolwandle.
017	EST	010	002	Zonke-ke izenzo zamandla ayo lawengalo zayo, lomlando wobukhulu bukaModekhayi, inkosi eyamkhulisayo, kakubhalwanga yini egwalweni lwemilando yamakhosi eMede lePerisiya?
017	EST	010	003	Ngoba uModekhayi umJuda wayengowesibili enkosini uAhasuwerusi, emkhulu phakathi kwamaJuda, ethandeka kulo inengi labafowabo, edingela isizwe sakibo okuhle, ekhuluma ukuthula kuyo yonke inzalo yakhe.
#
# BOOK	018	JOB	Job	UJobe
018	JOB	001	001	Kwakukhona indoda elizweni leUzi, ibizo layo lalinguJobe. Leyondoda yayiphelele-ke, iqondile, imesaba uNkulunkulu, ixwaya okubi.
018	JOB	001	002	Yasizalelwa amadodana ayisikhombisa lamadodakazi amathathu.
018	JOB	001	003	Lemfuyo yayo yayiyizimvu eziyizinkulungwane eziyisikhombisa, lamakamela ayizinkulungwane ezintathu, lezipane zenkabi ezingamakhulu amahlanu, labobabhemi abasikazi abangamakhulu amahlanu, lenceku ezinengi kakhulu. Ngakho lowomuntu wayemkhulu okwedlula bonke abantu bempumalanga.
018	JOB	001	004	Njalo amadodana akhe ahamba enza idili endlini yaleyo laleyo ngosuku lwayo; athuma abiza odadewabo abathathu ukuze badle banathe lawo.
018	JOB	001	005	Kwakusithi lapho esephelile amazopha ensuku zedili, uJobe athume, awangcwelise, avuke ekuseni kakhulu, anikele iminikelo yokutshiswa ngokwenani lawo wonke, ngoba uJobe wathi: Mhlawumbe amadodana ami onile, amthuka uNkulunkulu enhliziyweni yawo. Wenza njalo uJobe zonke izinsuku.
018	JOB	001	006	Kwasekusiba losuku lapho amadodana kaNkulunkulu eza ukuzimisa phambi kweNkosi, loSathane laye wafika phakathi kwawo.
018	JOB	001	007	INkosi yasisithi kuSathane: Uvela ngaphi? USathane wasephendula iNkosi wathi: Ekuzulazuleni emhlabeni lekuhambahambeni kuwo.
018	JOB	001	008	INkosi yasisithi kuSathane: Ubekile yini inhliziyo yakho encekwini yami uJobe, ngoba kakho onjengayo emhlabeni, umuntu opheleleyo loqondileyo, owesaba uNkulunkulu loxwaya ububi?
018	JOB	001	009	USathane wasephendula iNkosi wathi: UJobe umesabela ize uNkulunkulu yini?
018	JOB	001	010	Kawumbiyelanga yini yena lendlu yakhe lakho konke alakho inhlangothi zonke? Ubusisile umsebenzi wezandla zakhe, lezifuyo zakhe zanda kakhulu elizweni.
018	JOB	001	011	Kodwa isibili yelula isandla sakho khathesi, uthinte konke alakho; sibili uzakuthuka ebusweni bakho.
018	JOB	001	012	INkosi yasisithi kuSathane: Khangela konke alakho kusesandleni sakho; kuphela kuye ungeluleli isandla sakho. Wasephuma uSathane phambi kweNkosi.
018	JOB	001	013	Kwasekusiba losuku lapho amadodana lamadodakazi akhe ayesidla enatha iwayini endlini yomfowabo olizibulo.
018	JOB	001	014	Kwasekufika isithunywa kuJobe sathi: Inkabi bezilima labobabhemi besidla emaceleni azo;
018	JOB	001	015	kwasekutheleka amaShebha, akuthatha, atshaya izinceku ngobukhali benkemba, njalo yimi ngedwa kuphela engiphephileyo ukuze ngikubikele.
018	JOB	001	016	Lesi sisakhuluma, kwafika lesinye, sathi: Umlilo kaNkulunkulu uwile uvela emazulwini, watshisa izimvu lezinceku, waziqeda; njalo yimi ngedwa kuphela engiphephileyo ukuze ngikubikele.
018	JOB	001	017	Lesi sisakhuluma, kwafika lesinye, sathi: AmaKhaladiya amise amaxuku amathathu atheleka phezu kwamakamela, awathatha, atshaya izinceku ngobukhali benkemba, njalo yimi ngedwa kuphela engiphephileyo ukuze ngikubikele.
018	JOB	001	018	Lesi sisakhuluma, kwafika lesinye, sathi: Amadodana akho lamadodakazi akho bebesidla benatha iwayini endlini yomfowabo, izibulo.
018	JOB	001	019	Khangela-ke, umoya omkhulu wafika uvela ngaphetsheya kwenkangala, watshaya amagumbi womane endlu, yawela phezu kwamajaha, afa; njalo yimi ngedwa kuphela engiphephileyo ukuze ngikubikele.
018	JOB	001	020	UJobe wasesukuma, wadabula ibhatshi lakhe, waphuca ikhanda lakhe, wawa emhlabathini, wakhonza;
018	JOB	001	021	wasesithi: Ngaphuma ngize esiswini sikamama, njalo ngizabuyela khona ngize; iNkosi yapha, iNkosi ithethe; kalibusiswe ibizo leNkosi.
018	JOB	001	022	Kukho konke lokhu uJobe konanga, kambalelanga ubuwula uNkulunkulu.
018	JOB	002	001	Kwakulosuku futhi lapho amadodana kaNkulunkulu afika ukuzimisa phambi kweNkosi, uSathane laye wafika phakathi kwawo ukuzimisa phambi kweNkosi.
018	JOB	002	002	INkosi yasisithi kuSathane: Uvela ngaphi? USathane wasephendula iNkosi wathi: Ekuzulazuleni emhlabeni lekuhambahambeni kuwo.
018	JOB	002	003	INkosi yasisithi kuSathane: Ubekile yini inhliziyo yakho encekwini yami uJobe? Ngoba kakho onjengaye emhlabeni, umuntu opheleleyo loqondileyo, owesaba uNkulunkulu, loxwaya ububi? Usabambelele kubo ubuqotho bakhe, lanxa ungivuse ukuze ngimchithe kungelasizatho.
018	JOB	002	004	USathane wasephendula iNkosi wathi: Isikhumba ngesikhumba, yebo, konke umuntu alakho uzakunikelela impilo yakhe.
018	JOB	002	005	Kodwa khathesi yelula isandla sakho, uthinte ithambo lakhe lenyama yakhe; isibili uzakuthuka ebusweni bakho.
018	JOB	002	006	INkosi yasisithi kuSathane: Khangela, usesandleni sakho; kodwa gcina impilo yakhe.
018	JOB	002	007	USathane wasephuma phambi kweNkosi, wamtshaya uJobe ngamathumba amabi, kusukela ngaphansi konyawo lwakhe kuze kube enkanda yakhe.
018	JOB	002	008	Wasezithathela udengezi ukuziphala ngalo, wahlala phakathi kwesilotha.
018	JOB	002	009	Umkakhe wasesithi kuye: Usabambelele yini kubuqotho bakho? Thuka uNkulunkulu, ufe.
018	JOB	002	010	Kodwa wathi kuye: Ukhuluma njengokukhuluma komunye wabesifazana abayiziwula. Kambe, sizakwemukela okuhle kuNkulunkulu, singemukeli lokubi yini? Kukho konke lokhu uJobe konanga ngendebe zakhe.
018	JOB	002	011	Abangane abathathu bakaJobe sebezwile ngakho konke lokhu okubi okumehleleyo, beza, lowo lalowo evela endaweni yakhe, uElifazi umThemani, loBilidadi umShuhi, loZofari umNahama; bavumelana ndawonye ukuthi beze bamkhalele bamduduze.
018	JOB	002	012	Lapho bephakamisa amehlo abo bekhatshana, kabamazanga, baphakamisa ilizwi labo, bakhala inyembezi, badabula ngulowo ibhatshi lakhe, bavuvuzela uthuli emakhanda abo ngasemazulwini.
018	JOB	002	013	Basebehlala laye emhlabathini insuku eziyisikhombisa lobusuku obuyisikhombisa, njalo kakho owakhuluma ilizwi kuye, ngoba babona ukuthi ubuhlungu bukhulu kakhulu.
018	JOB	003	001	Emva kwalokho uJobe wavula umlomo wakhe, waqalekisa usuku lwakhe.
018	JOB	003	002	UJobe wasephendula wathi:
018	JOB	003	003	Kalubhubhe usuku engazalwa ngalo, lobusuku okwathiwa ngalo: Kukhulelwe umntwana wesilisa.
018	JOB	003	004	Lolosuku kalube ngumnyama, uNkulunkulu angalunanzi ephezulu, lokukhanya kungalukhanyisi.
018	JOB	003	005	Umnyama lethunzi lokufa kakuluhlenge, iyezi lihlale phezu kwalo, umnyama welanga ulwesabise.
018	JOB	003	006	Lobobusuku, umnyama ububambe, lungathokozi ensukwini zomnyaka, lungezi kunani lezinyanga.
018	JOB	003	007	Khangela, lobobusuku kabube yinyumba, umsindo wentokozo ungangeni kubo.
018	JOB	003	008	Kababuqalekise abaqalekisi bosuku, abalungele ukuvusa uLeviyathani.
018	JOB	003	009	Zibe mnyama inkanyezi zokusa kwabo, bulindele ukukhanya, kodwa kungabi khona, bungaboni inkophe zokusa.
018	JOB	003	010	Ngoba bungavalanga iminyango yesisu sikamama wami, bungafihlanga usizi emehlweni ami.
018	JOB	003	011	Kungani ngingafanga kusukela esizalweni, ngiphele ekuphumeni kwami esiswini?
018	JOB	003	012	Kungani amadolo angandulela? Kungani lamabele ukuthi ngimunye?
018	JOB	003	013	Ngoba khathesi ngabe ngacambalala ngathula, ngalala, khona ngaba lokuphumula,
018	JOB	003	014	kanye lamakhosi labeluleki bomhlaba abazakhela amanxiwa,
018	JOB	003	015	kumbe kanye leziphathamandla ezazilegolide ezagcwalisa izindlu zazo ngesiliva.
018	JOB	003	016	Kumbe njengomphunzo ofihliweyo ngingabi khona, njengensane ezingabonanga ukukhanya.
018	JOB	003	017	Lapho ababi bayekela ukuhlupha, lapho abakhathele ngamandla bephumula.
018	JOB	003	018	Izibotshwa ziyaphumula ndawonye, kazizwa ilizwi lomcindezeli.
018	JOB	003	019	Omncinyane lomkhulu balapho, lesigqili sikhululekile enkosini yaso.
018	JOB	003	020	Kungani enika ukukhanya kohluphekayo, lempilo kwabalokubaba komphefumulo;
018	JOB	003	021	abalindele ukufa, kodwa kungekho, bekugebha kulenotho efihliweyo,
018	JOB	003	022	abathabayo kakhulu ngentokozo, bajabule lapho bethola ingcwaba?
018	JOB	003	023	Emuntwini yini, ondlela yakhe ifihliwe, uNkulunkulu ambiyeleyo?
018	JOB	003	024	Ngoba ukububula kwami kuza phambi kokudla kwami, lokubhonga kwami kuthululeka njengamanzi.
018	JOB	003	025	Ngoba engikwesabayo ngokwesaba sekungehlele, lengilovalo ngakho kufikile kimi.
018	JOB	003	026	Ngangingahlalisekanga, ngingaphumuli, ngingelakuthula, lohlupho lweza.
018	JOB	004	001	UElifazi umThemani wasephendula wathi:
018	JOB	004	002	Uba sizama ilizwi kuwe, uzadabuka yini? Kodwa ngubani ongazibamba emazwini?
018	JOB	004	003	Khangela, uqondisile abanengi, waqinisa izandla ezibuthakathaka.
018	JOB	004	004	Amazwi akho amvusile okhubekayo, waqinisa amadolo axegayo.
018	JOB	004	005	Kodwa khathesi kufikile kuwe, uyadinwa; kuyakuthinta wena, utshaywa luvalo.
018	JOB	004	006	Ukwesaba kwakho uNkulunkulu kakusiso isibindi sakho yini, lobuqotho bendlela zakho ithemba lakho?
018	JOB	004	007	Akukhumbule, ngubani owake wachithwa engelacala? Kumbe abalungileyo bake baqunywa ngaphi?
018	JOB	004	008	Njengengikubonileyo, abalima ububi behlanyela udubo, bavuna khona.
018	JOB	004	009	Ngokuphephetha kukaNkulunkulu bayabhubha, langokuphefumula kwamakhala akhe bayaphela.
018	JOB	004	010	Ukubhonga kwesilwane, lelizwi lesilwane esesabekayo, lamazinyo amabhongo esilwane, kwephukile.
018	JOB	004	011	Isilwane esidala siyabhubha ngokuswela impango, lemidlwane yesilwanekazi isabalale.
018	JOB	004	012	Ngasenginyenyezelwa ilizwi, lendlebe yami yemukela okuncinyane kwalo.
018	JOB	004	013	Phakathi kwemicabango yemibono yebusuku, lapho ubuthongo obukhulu busehlela abantu,
018	JOB	004	014	ukwesaba kwangifikela lokuthuthumela okwenza ubunengi bamathambo ami baqhaqhazela.
018	JOB	004	015	Kwasekusedlula umoya ebusweni bami, loboya benyama yami bavuka.
018	JOB	004	016	Wema, kodwa angikuqondanga ukubonakala kwawo; isimo sasiphambi kwamehlo ami; kwathula, ngasengisizwa ilizwi lisithi:
018	JOB	004	017	Kambe umuntu angalunga okwedlula uNkulunkulu? Umuntu angahlambuluka okwedlula uMenzi wakhe yini?
018	JOB	004	018	Khangela, kazithembi inceku zakhe, lengilosi zakhe uthi zingabaphosisi.
018	JOB	004	019	Kangakanani abahlala endlini zebumba, abasisekelo sabo sisethulini, abachotshozwa phambi kwenundu.
018	JOB	004	020	Bakhandwa kusukela ekuseni kuze kube kusihlwa, kungelakunanzwa bayabhubha kuze kube nininini.
018	JOB	004	021	Ubuhle babo kabususwa labo yini? Bayafa kodwa bengalanhlakanipho.
018	JOB	005	001	Ake umemeze, ukhona ongakuphendula yini? Uzaphendukela kuwuphi wabangcwele?
018	JOB	005	002	Ngoba ulaka luyasibulala isiwula, lomhawu ubulale isiphukuphuku.
018	JOB	005	003	Mina ngibone isiwula sigxila, kodwa ngahle ngaqalekisa indawo yaso yokuhlala.
018	JOB	005	004	Abantwana baso bakhatshana losindiso, bachothozwa esangweni, njalo kungekho umkhululi.
018	JOB	005	005	Osivuno saso olambileyo uyasidla, esithatha lemeveni, lomphangi uginya inotho yaso.
018	JOB	005	006	Ngoba usizi kaluveli ethulini, lenhlupheko kayihlumi emhlabathini.
018	JOB	005	007	Kube kanti umuntu uzalelwe inhlupheko njengoba inhlansi ziqhatshela phezulu.
018	JOB	005	008	Kodwa mina bengizadinga uNkulunkulu, lakuNkulunkulu bengizabeka udaba lwami.
018	JOB	005	009	Owenza izinto ezinkulu lezingelakuhlolwa, imimangaliso engelakubalwa.
018	JOB	005	010	Onika izulu ebusweni bomhlaba, athumele amanzi ebusweni bamaphandle,
018	JOB	005	011	ukuze abamise phezulu abaphansi, ukuze abalilayo baphakanyiselwe ekuvikelekeni.
018	JOB	005	012	Uchitha amacebo abalobuqili, ukuze izandla zabo zingenzi cebo.
018	JOB	005	013	Ubamba abahlakaniphileyo ebuqilini babo, ukuze icebo labangaqondanga liwiselwe phansi.
018	JOB	005	014	Bahlangana lomnyama emini, baphumputhe phakathi kwemini njengebusuku.
018	JOB	005	015	Kodwa ukhulula umyanga enkembeni, emlonyeni wabo, lesandleni solamandla.
018	JOB	005	016	Ngakho umyanga ulethemba, lobubi buzavala umlomo wabo.
018	JOB	005	017	Khangela, ubusisiwe lowomuntu uNkulunkulu amlayayo; ngakho ungadeleli ukukhuza kukaSomandla.
018	JOB	005	018	Ngoba yena uzwisa ubuhlungu, abuye abophe; uyalimaza, lezandla zakhe ziyapholisa.
018	JOB	005	019	Uzakukhulula enhluphekweni eziyisithupha, lakweziyisikhombisa ububi kabuyikukuthinta.
018	JOB	005	020	Endlaleni uzakuhlenga ekufeni, lempini emandleni enkemba.
018	JOB	005	021	Uzafihlelwa isiswepu solimi, njalo kawuyikwesaba incithakalo lapho ifika.
018	JOB	005	022	Uzahleka incithakalo lendlala, njalo kawuyikwesaba izilo zomhlaba.
018	JOB	005	023	Ngoba uzakuba lesivumelwano lamatshe eganga, lezilo zeganga zizakuba lokuthula lawe.
018	JOB	005	024	Njalo uzakwazi ukuthi ithente lakho lilokuthula, uzakwethekela indawo yakho yokuhlala ungasweli lutho.
018	JOB	005	025	Uzakwazi futhi ukuthi inzalo yakho izakuba nengi, lembewu yakho njengotshani bomhlaba.
018	JOB	005	026	Uzafika engcwabeni lakho usuluphele, njengenqumbi zamabele zisenyuka ngesikhathi sawo.
018	JOB	005	027	Khangela lokhu, sesikuhlolile; kunjalo. Kuzwe, uzazele wena.
018	JOB	006	001	UJobe wasephendula wathi:
018	JOB	006	002	Kungathi ukudabuka kwami bekungalinganiswa lokulinganiswa, lenhlupheko yami ibekwe ndawonye esikalini!
018	JOB	006	003	Ngoba khathesi kungaba nzima kuletshebetshebe lolwandle. Ngenxa yalokho amazwi ami angawamawala.
018	JOB	006	004	Ngoba imitshoko kaSomandla iphakathi kwami, obuhlungu bayo umoya wami uyabunatha; izesabiso zikaNkulunkulu ziyazihlela zimelene lami.
018	JOB	006	005	Ubabhemi weganga uyakhala yini esohlazeni, kumbe inkabi iyakhonya yini ekudleni kwayo?
018	JOB	006	006	Kambe okuduma kungadliwa kungelatshwayi? Kulokuhlabusa kokumhlophe kweqanda yini?
018	JOB	006	007	Umphefumulo wami uyala ukukuthinta, kunjengokudla kwami okunengekayo.
018	JOB	006	008	Kungathi isicelo sami singafika, njalo uNkulunkulu anginike ithemba lami,
018	JOB	006	009	ukuthi kumthokozise uNkulunkulu ukungichoboza, ayekele isandla sakhe, angiqume.
018	JOB	006	010	Khona kungahlala kube yinduduzo yami, bengingajabula ebuhlungwini obungayekeliyo; ngoba kangiwafihlanga amazwi oNgcwele.
018	JOB	006	011	Ayini amandla ami ukuze ngithembe? Lokuphela kwami kuyini ukuze ngelule impilo yami?
018	JOB	006	012	Amandla ami angamandla amatshe yini? Inyama yami ilithusi yini?
018	JOB	006	013	Usizo lwami kalukimi yini? Lenhlakanipho iyaxotshwa kimi yini?
018	JOB	006	014	Ohluphekayo nga ehawukelwa ngumngane wakhe, kodwa udela ukwesabeka kukaSomandla.
018	JOB	006	015	Abafowethu kabenzanga ngokuthembeka njengesifula, njengempophoma yezifula bayedlula,
018	JOB	006	016	ezimnyama ngenxa yongqwaqwane, okucatsha kizo iliqhwa elikhithikileyo.
018	JOB	006	017	Ngesikhathi sokufudumala kwazo ziyanyamalala, sekutshisa zicitshe endaweni yazo.
018	JOB	006	018	Imikhondo yendlela yazo iyajika, yenyukele enkangala ibhubhe.
018	JOB	006	019	Izihambi zeTema zakhangela, indwendwe zezihambi zeShebha zalindela kuyo.
018	JOB	006	020	Zaba lenhloni ngoba zazithembile, zafika kuyo zayangeka.
018	JOB	006	021	Ngoba khathesi kalisilutho; liyabona isesabiso, liyesaba.
018	JOB	006	022	Ngitshilo yini ukuthi: Lethani kimi? Kumbe: Phanini isipho ngenxa yami empahleni yenu?
018	JOB	006	023	Kumbe: Ngikhululani esandleni sesitha? Kumbe: Lingihlenge esandleni sabalesihluku?
018	JOB	006	024	Ngifundisani, khona mina ngizathula; lingenze ngiqedisise engiduhe khona.
018	JOB	006	025	Alamandla angakanani amazwi aqotho; kodwa ukusola okuvela kini kusolani?
018	JOB	006	026	Likhumbula amazwi okusola yini, lezinkulumo zophelelwe lithemba zingumoya?
018	JOB	006	027	Yebo, liziwisela phezu kwentandane, ligebhele umngane wenu umgodi.
018	JOB	006	028	Ngakho-ke, vumani lingikhangele, ngoba kuphambi kobuso benu nxa ngiqamba amanga.
018	JOB	006	029	Ake liphenduke, kungabi lobubi, yebo, libuye liphenduke, ukulunga kwami kukukho.
018	JOB	006	030	Kambe kukhona ububi olimini lwami? Ukunambitha kwami bekungehlukanise yini izinto ezimbi?
018	JOB	007	001	Kakukho yini imfazo kumuntu emhlabeni, lensuku zakhe kazinjengensuku zoqhatshiweyo yini?
018	JOB	007	002	Njengesigqili sikhefuzelela umthunzi, lanjengesiqatshwa silindele iholo laso,
018	JOB	007	003	ngokunjalo mina ngidliswe ilifa lenyanga zeze, lobusuku bezinhlupheko bubalelwe mina.
018	JOB	007	004	Lapho ngilala phansi ngithi: Ngizavuka nini? Ngoba ubusuku bude, njalo ngigcwele ukutshukuma kuze kuse.
018	JOB	007	005	Inyama yami yembethe impethu lamagade othuli; isikhumba sami siyadabuka siyenyanyeka.
018	JOB	007	006	Insuku zami ziyaphangisa kuleselukiso someluki, ziphele kungelathemba.
018	JOB	007	007	Khumbula ukuthi impilo yami ingumoya; ilihlo lami kaliyikuphinda libone okuhle.
018	JOB	007	008	Ilihlo longibonayo kaliyikungibona futhi; amehlo akho aphezu kwami, kodwa ngizakuba ngingasekho.
018	JOB	007	009	Iyezi liyaphela linyamalale; ngokunjalo owehlela engcwabeni kayikwenyuka.
018	JOB	007	010	Kaphindi abuyele emzini wakhe, lendawo yakhe kayisayikumazi.
018	JOB	007	011	Ngakho mina kangiyikubamba umlomo wami; ngizakhuluma ekucindezelweni komoya wami, ngisole ekubabeni komphefumulo wami.
018	JOB	007	012	Ngilulwandle yini, kumbe isilo solwandle, ukuze lingibekele abalindi?
018	JOB	007	013	Lapho ngisithi: Umbheda wami uzangiduduza, icansi lami liphungule ukusola kwami;
018	JOB	007	014	ubusungiqhaqhazelisa ngamaphupho, angethuse ngemibono;
018	JOB	007	015	ukuze umphefumulo wami ukhethe ukuklinywa, ukufa kulamathambo ami.
018	JOB	007	016	Ngiyanengwa yikho, kangiyikuphila njalonjalo; ngiyekele, ngoba insuku zami ziyize.
018	JOB	007	017	Uyini umuntu ukuthi umkhulise, lokuthi ubeke inhliziyo yakho kuye,
018	JOB	007	018	lokuthi umhambele ikuseni yonke, umlinge sonke isikhathi?
018	JOB	007	019	Koze kube nini ungayekeli ukungiqaphela, ungangiyekeli ngize ngiginye amathe ami yini?
018	JOB	007	020	Ngonile, ngizakwenzani kuwe, wena mlindi wabantu? Ungimiseleni ngibe yinto yakho yokunenjwa, ngize ngibe ngumthwalo kimi?
018	JOB	007	021	Njalo kawuthetheleli ngani isiphambeko sami, ususe isono sami? Ngoba sengizalala phansi othulini; uzangidinga ngovivi, kodwa kangiyikuba khona.
018	JOB	008	001	Wasephendula uBilidadi umShuhi wathi:
018	JOB	008	002	Koze kube nini ukhuluma lezizinto, lamazwi omlomo wakho abe ngumoya olamandla?
018	JOB	008	003	UNkulunkulu uyahlanekela isahlulelo yini? Kumbe uSomandla uyahlanekela ukulunga yini?
018	JOB	008	004	Uba abantwana bakho bonile kuye, yena usebalahlile emandleni esiphambeko sabo;
018	JOB	008	005	uba wena umdinga uNkulunkulu ngovivi, uncenge kuSomandla;
018	JOB	008	006	uba uhlambulukile, uqotho; isibili khathesi ubezavuka ngenxa yakho, aphumelelise indawo yokuhlala yokulunga kwakho.
018	JOB	008	007	Lanxa ukuqala kwakho bekukuncinyane, kube kanti isiphetho sakho sizakwanda kakhulu.
018	JOB	008	008	Ngoba ake ubuze esizukulwaneni sakuqala, uzilungisele isidingo saboyise.
018	JOB	008	009	Ngoba singabezolo, njalo kasazi, ngoba insuku zethu emhlabeni ziyisithunzi.
018	JOB	008	010	Kabayikukufundisa yini, bakutshele, bakhuphe amazwi enhliziyweni yabo?
018	JOB	008	011	Imihlanga ingakhula lapho okungelaxhaphozi khona yini? Ibhuma likhule lapho okungelamanzi khona?
018	JOB	008	012	Nxa lisebuluhlazeni balo lingakakhiwa, kube kanti libuna kuqala kwazo zonke izihlahlakazana.
018	JOB	008	013	Zinjalo indlela zabo bonke abamkhohlwayo uNkulunkulu, lethemba lomzenzisi lizabhubha.
018	JOB	008	014	Othemba lakhe lizaqunywa, lokuthemba kwakhe kuyibulembu besayobe.
018	JOB	008	015	Uyeyama endlini yakhe, kodwa kayimi; ubambelela kiyo, kodwa kayihlali.
018	JOB	008	016	Uluhlaza phambi kwelanga, lamahlumela akhe aphuma esivandeni sakhe.
018	JOB	008	017	Impande zakhe zithandele enqunjini; ubona indawo yamatshe.
018	JOB	008	018	Uba emchitha endaweni yakhe, izamphika ithi: Kangizange ngikubone.
018	JOB	008	019	Khangela, le yintokozo yendlela yakhe; njalo kuzakhula abanye emhlabathini.
018	JOB	008	020	Khangela, uNkulunkulu kayikumlahla opheleleyo, kabambi isandla sabenzi bobubi.
018	JOB	008	021	Aze agcwalise umlomo wakho ngohleko, lezindebe zakho ngokumemeza kwentokozo.
018	JOB	008	022	Abakuzondayo bazakwembeswa ngenhloni, lethente lababi lingabi khona.
018	JOB	009	001	UJobe wasephendula wathi:
018	JOB	009	002	Ngeqiniso ngiyazi ukuthi kunjalo. Kodwa umuntu angalunga njani kuNkulunkulu?
018	JOB	009	003	Uba efisa ukuphikisana laye, kayikumphendula okukodwa phakathi kwenkulungwane.
018	JOB	009	004	Uhlakaniphile enhliziyweni, uqinile emandleni: Ngubani oziqinisileyo wamelana laye waphumelela?
018	JOB	009	005	Osusa izintaba njalo zingazi, ozigenqula entukuthelweni yakhe.
018	JOB	009	006	Onyikinya umhlaba awususe endaweni yawo, lensika zawo zizamazame.
018	JOB	009	007	Olaya ilanga ukuthi lingaphumi, avalele inkanyezi ngophawu.
018	JOB	009	008	Owendlala amazulu eyedwa, anyathele phezu kwezingqonga zolwandle.
018	JOB	009	009	Owenza iBhere, iziNja, lesiLimela, lamakamelo eningizimu.
018	JOB	009	010	Owenza izinto ezinkulu ezingelakuhlolwa, lezimangalisayo ezingelakubalwa.
018	JOB	009	011	Khangela, uyedlula phansi kwami ngingamboni, edlulele phambili ngingamuzwa.
018	JOB	009	012	Khangela, uyahluthuna, ngubani ongamnqanda? Ngubani ongathi kuye: Wenzani?
018	JOB	009	013	UNkulunkulu kayinqandi intukuthelo yakhe. Abasizi bakaRahabi bayakhothama phansi kwakhe.
018	JOB	009	014	Pho-ke, mina ngingamphendula ngithini, ngikhethe amazwi ami okuqondana laye?
018	JOB	009	015	Ebengingeke ngamphendula loba bengilungile; ngizacela isihawu kumahluleli wami.
018	JOB	009	016	Uba bengibizile, wangiphendula, bengingayikukholwa ukuthi ubekile indlebe elizwini lami.
018	JOB	009	017	Ngoba uyangihlifiza ngesiphepho, andise amanxeba ami kungelasizatho.
018	JOB	009	018	Kangivumeli ukukhokha umoya, kodwa engigcwalisa ngezinto ezibabayo.
018	JOB	009	019	Uba kungamandla, khangela, ulamandla. Njalo uba kungesahlulelo, ngubani ozangibiza?
018	JOB	009	020	Aluba ngilungile, umlomo wami uzangilahla; uba ngiphelele, uzakuthi ngonakele.
018	JOB	009	021	Ngiphelele, angikhathaleli umphefumulo wami, ngidelela impilo yami.
018	JOB	009	022	Kunye lokho, ngenxa yalokho ngithi: Uyabhubhisa olungileyo lomubi.
018	JOB	009	023	Lapho isiswepu sibulala ngokujumayo, uzahleka ukudangala kwabangelacala.
018	JOB	009	024	Umhlaba unikelwe esandleni somubi; wembesa ubuso babehluleli bawo. Uba kungenjalo, pho, ngubani?
018	JOB	009	025	Njalo insuku zami zilejubane kulesigijimi; ziyabaleka, kaziboni okuhle.
018	JOB	009	026	Ziyedlula njengezikepe zomhlanga, njengokhozi olutheleka empangweni.
018	JOB	009	027	Uba ngisithi: Ngizakhohlwa ukusola kwami, ngitshiye ukunyukumala kwami, ngithokoze,
018	JOB	009	028	ngiyesaba zonke insizi zami, ngiyazi ukuthi kawuyikungiphatha njengongelacala.
018	JOB	009	029	Ngilecala mina, pho, ngizatshikatshikelelani ize?
018	JOB	009	030	Uba ngizigezisa ngamanzi eliqhwa elikhithikileyo, ngihlambulule izandla zami ngesepa,
018	JOB	009	031	khona uzangiphosela emgodini, besengisenyanywa yizigqoko zami.
018	JOB	009	032	Ngoba kasuye umuntu njengami ukuze ngimphendule, ukuze siye ndawonye kusahlulelo.
018	JOB	009	033	Kakukho umqamuli phakathi kwethu ongabeka isandla sakhe phezu kwethu sobabili.
018	JOB	009	034	Kasuse uswazi lwakhe kimi, njalo uvalo ngaye lungangethusi.
018	JOB	009	035	Bengingakhuluma ngingamesabi, kodwa anginjalo ngokwami.
018	JOB	010	001	Umphefumulo wami ukhathele yimpilo yami; ngizatshiya insolo yami phezu kwami; ngizakhuluma ekubabeni komphefumulo wami.
018	JOB	010	002	Ngizakuthi kuNkulunkulu: Ungangilahli; ngazisa ukuthi kungani uphikisana lami.
018	JOB	010	003	Kuhle yini kuwe ukuthi ucindezele, ukuthi udelele umsebenzi wezandla zakho, ukhanye phezu kwecebo lababi?
018	JOB	010	004	Ulamehlo enyama yini? Ubona njengokubona komuntu?
018	JOB	010	005	Insuku zakho zinjengensuku zomuntu na? Iminyaka yakho injengensuku zomuntu yini,
018	JOB	010	006	ukuthi udinge ngobubi bami, uhlolisise ngesono sami?
018	JOB	010	007	Ngoba usazi ukuthi kangikhohlakalanga, lokuthi kakho ongakhulula esandleni sakho.
018	JOB	010	008	Izandla zakho zangibumba zangenza kanyekanye inhlangothi zonke, kanti uyangichitha.
018	JOB	010	009	Ake ukhumbule ukuthi wangenza njengebumba. Pho, uzangibuyisela ethulini?
018	JOB	010	010	Kawungithululanga njengochago, wangijiyisa njengamasi yini?
018	JOB	010	011	Ungigqokise isigogo lenyama, wangihlanganisa ndawonye ngamathambo langemisipha.
018	JOB	010	012	Ungenzele impilo lomusa, lokunakekela kwakho kulondolozile umoya wami.
018	JOB	010	013	Kanti lezizinto uzifihlile enhliziyweni yakho; ngiyazi ukuthi lokhu kukuwe.
018	JOB	010	014	Uba ngisona, ungiqaphele, kawuyikungiyekela ngingelacala esonweni sami.
018	JOB	010	015	Uba ngimubi, maye kimi! Uba ngilungile, bengingayikuphakamisa ikhanda lami. Ngigcwele ihlazo, ngakho bona inhlupheko yami.
018	JOB	010	016	Ngoba kuyaziphakamisa; uyangizingela njengesilwane; ubuye uzenze okumangalisayo kimi.
018	JOB	010	017	Uyavuselela abafakazi bakho abamelene lami, wandise ulaka lwakho kimi; izinguquko lempi kulami.
018	JOB	010	018	Pho kungani wangikhupha esizalweni? Kungathi ngabe ngaphela, lelihlo lingangibonanga!
018	JOB	010	019	Ngangizakuba njengokungathi kangikho; ngangizathwalwa ngisuswe esizalweni ngisiwe engcwabeni.
018	JOB	010	020	Insuku zami kazinlutshwana yini? Khawula phela, ungiyekele ukuze ngithokoze kancinyane,
018	JOB	010	021	ngingakayi - ngingabuyi- elizweni lomnyama lethunzi lokufa,
018	JOB	010	022	ilizwe lomnyama, njengobumnyama, ithunzi lokufa, elingelahlelo, lokukhanya kunjengobumnyama.
018	JOB	011	001	Wasephendula uZofari umNahama wathi:
018	JOB	011	002	Kambe kabuphendulwa yini ubunengi bamazwi? Njalo isilawuli singalungisiswa yini?
018	JOB	011	003	Ukulawula kwakho kuzathulisa abantu yini? Lapho ukloloda, kakho ongakuyangisa yini?
018	JOB	011	004	Ngoba uthe: Imfundiso yami ihlanzekile, ngihlambulukile emehlweni akho.
018	JOB	011	005	Kodwa-ke kungathi uNkulunkulu angakhuluma, avule indebe zakhe kuwe,
018	JOB	011	006	ukuze akwazise imfihlakalo zenhlakanipho, ukuthi ziphindwe kabili ngenhlakanipho eqotho. Yazi-ke ukuthi uNkulunkulu ubiza kuwe okulutshwana kulecala lakho.
018	JOB	011	007	Ungafumana ukujula kukaNkulunkulu na? Ungamfumana yini uSomandla kuze kube sekupheleleni?
018	JOB	011	008	Kuphakeme njengamazulu, ungenzani? Kutshonile kulesihogo, ungazini?
018	JOB	011	009	Isilinganiso sakho side kulomhlaba, sibanzi kulolwandle.
018	JOB	011	010	Uba esedlula avalele kumbe abuthanise, ngubani-ke ongamnqanda?
018	JOB	011	011	Ngoba yena uyabazi abantu abayize, uyabona ububi; ngakho kayikukuqaphelisa yini?
018	JOB	011	012	Ngoba umuntu oyisiphukuphuku angaba lokuqedisisa, lanxa umuntu engazalwa njengethole likababhemi weganga.
018	JOB	011	013	Uba wena ulungisa inhliziyo yakho, welulele izandla zakho kuye,
018	JOB	011	014	uba ububi busesandleni sakho, bubeke khatshana, lobubi kabungahlali emathenteni akho.
018	JOB	011	015	Ngoba lapho uzaphakamisa ubuso bakho ungelasici, njalo uqine, ungesabi.
018	JOB	011	016	Ngoba wena uzakhohlwa usizi lwakho, ulukhumbule njengamanzi asedlulile.
018	JOB	011	017	Lobude bempilo yakho buzakhanya kulemini enkulu; loba kulomnyama kuzakuba njengekuseni.
018	JOB	011	018	Njalo uzakuba lethemba ngoba kulethemba; uzagebha, uzalala ngokuvikeleka.
018	JOB	011	019	Uzalala, njalo kakho ozakwethusa, labanengi bazancenga phambi kwakho.
018	JOB	011	020	Kodwa amehlo ababi azafiphala, lesiphephelo sizachitheka kubo, lethemba labo lizakuba yikuphela komphefumulo.
018	JOB	012	001	Wasephendula uJobe wathi:
018	JOB	012	002	Ngoba isibili lingabantu, lenhlakanipho izakufa lani.
018	JOB	012	003	Lami ngilengqondo njengani, kangiphansi kulani. Njalo ngubani ongelazo izinto ezinje?
018	JOB	012	004	Ngiyinhlekisa kumngane wami, obiza kuNkulunkulu amphendule; olungileyo oqondileyo uyinhlekisa.
018	JOB	012	005	Uyisibane esidelelekayo emnakanweni wowonwabileyo; ulungele ukutshelela ngonyawo.
