018	JOB	015	001	Wasephendula uElifazi umThemani wathi:
018	JOB	015	002	Ohlakaniphileyo angaphendula yini ulwazi olungumoya, agcwalise isisu sakhe ngomoya wempumalanga?
018	JOB	015	003	Aphikise ngamazwi angasizi lutho, langenkulumo ezingelanzuzo yini?
