018	JOB	015	005	Ngoba umlomo wakho ufundisa ububi bakho, ukhethe ulimi lwamaqili.
018	JOB	015	006	Umlomo wakho uyakulahla, kayisimi; yebo, indebe zakho ziyafakaza ngawe.
018	JOB	015	007	Ungumuntu wokuqala owazalwayo yini? Kumbe wazalwa mandulo kwamaqaqa yini?
018	JOB	015	008	Uzwile yini icebo langasese likaNkulunkulu? Kumbe uzigodlele inhlakanipho yini?
018	JOB	015	009	Kuyini okwaziyo esingakwaziyo? Kuyini okuqedisisayo okungekho kithi?
018	JOB	015	010	Kukhona phakathi kwethu lempunga lekhehla, omdala ngensuku kuloyihlo.
018	JOB	015	011	Zincinyane yini kuwe induduzo zikaNkulunkulu, lelizwi elikhulunywa kuhle lawe?
