018	JOB	015	034	Ngoba inhlangano yabazenzisi izakuba ngengelazithelo, lomlilo uzaqothula amathente ezivalamlomo.
018	JOB	015	035	Bamitha uhlupho, bazale isono, lesizalo sabo silungisa inkohliso.
018	JOB	016	001	Wasephendula uJobe wathi:
018	JOB	016	002	Ngizwile izinto ezinengi ezinje; lingabaduduzi abakhathazayo lina lonke.
018	JOB	016	003	Kuzakuba lesiphetho yini emazwini angumoya? Kumbe kuyini okulicunulayo ukuthi liphendule?
018	JOB	016	004	Lami bengingakhuluma njengani uba umphefumulo wenu ubusendaweni yomphefumulo wami; bengingabuthelela amazwi phezu kwenu, ngilinikinele ikhanda lami.
