018	JOB	016	006	Uba ngikhuluma, ubuhlungu bami kabudedi; uba ngiyekela, kuyini okusuka kimi?
018	JOB	016	007	Kodwa khathesi ungidinisile yena, wena uchithile yonke inhlangano yami.
018	JOB	016	008	Ungitshwabhanisile, kube yibufakazi, lokucaka kwami kungivukele, kuyafakaza ebusweni bami.
018	JOB	016	009	Ulaka lwakhe luyangidwengula, njalo uyangizonda; ungigedlela amazinyo akhe; isitha sami singicijisela amehlo aso.
018	JOB	016	010	Bangikhamisela umlomo wabo, bangiwakala esihlathini ngokuyangisa, bengihlanganyela ndawonye.
018	JOB	016	011	UNkulunkulu unginikele kokhohlakeleyo, wangiphosela ezandleni zababi.
018	JOB	016	012	Ngangonwabile, kodwa wangichoboza, wangidumela ngentamo, wangiphahlaza, wangimisa ngaba yinto yakhe yokunenjwa.
