018	JOB	016	014	Wangivodloza ngokuvodlovodloza, wagijimela kimi njengeqhawe.
018	JOB	016	015	Ngathunga isaka phezu kwesikhumba sami, ngathukuza uphondo lwami othulini.
018	JOB	016	016	Ubuso bami bubomvu ngokukhala, lenkotsheni zami kulethunzi lokufa,
018	JOB	016	017	lanxa kungekho isihluku ezandleni zami, lomkhuleko wami uhlanzekile.
018	JOB	016	018	Mhlaba, ungaligqibeli igazi lami, lokukhala kwami kakungabi landawo.
018	JOB	016	019	Lakhathesi, khangelani, ubufakazi bami busemazulwini, lomfakazi wami usezindaweni eziphakemeyo.
018	JOB	016	020	Abangane bami bayangiklolodela; ilihlo lami liyathonta kuNkulunkulu.
018	JOB	016	021	Kungathi kungaba khona ongamlamulela umuntu kuNkulunkulu, njengendodana yomuntu kumngane wayo.
018	JOB	016	022	Ngoba iminyaka emilutshwana izafika, njalo ngizahamba ngendlela engingayikubuya ngayo.
018	JOB	017	001	Umoya wami wonakele, insuku zami zicitshiwe, amangcwaba ngawami.
018	JOB	017	002	Kabakho lami yini abaklolodayo, lelihlo lami lichitha ubusuku ekuvukeleni kwabo?
