018	JOB	017	004	Ngoba inhliziyo yabo uyifihlele ukuqedisisa; ngenxa yalokhu kawuyikubaphakamisa.
018	JOB	017	005	Okhuluma ngokuyenga kubangane, lamehlo abantwana bakhe azafiphala.
018	JOB	017	006	Njalo ungimise ngaba yisaga sezizwe, ngaze ngaba ngokhafulelwayo phambi kwazo.
018	JOB	017	007	Njalo ilihlo lami lifiphele ngosizi, lamalunga ami anjengesithunzi wonke.
018	JOB	017	008	Abaqotho bazakwethuswa yikho, longelacala uvukela ongamesabiyo uNkulunkulu.
018	JOB	017	009	Lolungileyo uzabambelela endleleni yakhe, lolezandla ezihlambulukileyo uzakwengeza amandla.
018	JOB	017	010	Kodwa-ke lina lonke, phendukani ake libuye, ngoba kangitholi ohlakaniphileyo phakathi kwenu.
018	JOB	017	011	Insuku zami zedlule, amacebo ami adabuke phakathi, lezifiso zenhliziyo yami.
018	JOB	017	012	Bamisa ubusuku bube yimini; ukukhanya kuseduze phambi kobumnyama.
018	JOB	017	013	Uba ngilinda, ingcwaba lizakuba yindlu yami; ngendlala umbheda wami emnyameni.
