018	JOB	017	016	Kuzakwehlela kumijabo yengcwaba, lapho sizaphumula khona ndawonye enhlabathini.
018	JOB	018	001	Wasephendula uBilidadi umShuhi wathi:
018	JOB	018	002	Koze kube nini libekela amazwi imigibe? Nanzelelani, lemva kwalokho sikhulume.
