018	JOB	018	004	Udwengula umphefumulo wakhe ngokuthukuthela kwakhe. Umhlaba uzatshiywa ngenxa yakho yini, loba idwala lisuswe endaweni yalo?
018	JOB	018	005	Yebo, ukukhanya kwabakhohlakeleyo kuzacitshwa, lenhlansi yomlilo wakhe kayiyikukhanya.
018	JOB	018	006	Ukukhanya kuzafiphala ethenteni lakhe, lesibane sakhe ngaphezu kwakhe sizacitshwa.
018	JOB	018	007	Izinyathelo zamandla akhe zizafinyezwa, lecebo lakhe lizamwisela phansi.
018	JOB	018	008	Ngoba uzaphoselwa embuleni zinyawo zakhe, ahambe phezu kwembule.
018	JOB	018	009	Umjibila uzambamba isithende, isihitshela sizamkhulela.
018	JOB	018	010	Igoda lakhe lifihlwe emhlabathini, lomjibila wakhe endleleni.
018	JOB	018	011	Izesabiso zizamethusa inhlangothi zonke, zixotshane laye enyaweni zakhe.
018	JOB	018	012	Amandla akhe azaqedwa yindlala, lengozi ilindele ukukhubeka kwakhe.
018	JOB	018	013	Kuzakudla ingxenye zesikhumba sakhe; izibulo lokufa lidle ingxenye zakhe.
018	JOB	018	014	Ithemba lakhe lizahluthunwa ethenteni lakhe, njalo kumenze aye enkosini yezesabiso.
018	JOB	018	015	Kuzahlala ethenteni lakhe elingeyisilo lakhe; isolufa izavuvuzelwa phezu kwendawo yakhe yokuhlala.
018	JOB	018	016	Impande zakhe zizakoma ngaphansi, logatsha lwakhe lubune ngaphezulu.
018	JOB	018	017	Ukukhunjulwa kwakhe kuzabhubha emhlabeni, angabi labizo ezitaladeni.
018	JOB	018	018	Bazamfuqa bamsuse ekukhanyeni bamuse emnyameni, bamxotshe emhlabeni.
018	JOB	018	019	Kayikuba lenzalo lasizukulwana ebantwini bakibo; kakuyikuba lansali endaweni zakhe zokuhlala.
018	JOB	018	020	Abalandelayo bazakwethuswa lusuku lwakhe, labokuqala bazabanjwa yisesabiso.
018	JOB	018	021	Isibili zinjalo indawo zokuhlala zomubi, njalo yiyo le indawo yongamaziyo uNkulunkulu.
018	JOB	019	001	Wasephendula uJobe wathi:
018	JOB	019	002	Koze kube nini lihlupha umphefumulo wami, lingiphahlaza ngamazwi?
018	JOB	019	003	Lezizikhathi ezilitshumi lingithela ngehlazo; kalilanhloni, lingiphatha kubi.
018	JOB	019	004	Uba-ke kuliqiniso ukuthi ngiduhile, ukuduha kwami kuzahlala lami.
018	JOB	019	005	Uba isibili lizikhukhumeza phezu kwami, liphikisane lami ngehlazo lami,
018	JOB	019	006	yazini-ke ukuthi nguNkulunkulu ongihlanekeleyo, wangigombolozela ngembule lakhe.
018	JOB	019	007	Khangela, ngiyamemeza ngithi: Okubi! Kodwa kangiphendulwa. Ngicela usizo, kodwa akulasahlulelo.
018	JOB	019	008	Uyivalile indlela yami ngomduli ukuze ngingedluli, wamisa umnyama emikhondweni yami.
018	JOB	019	009	Ungihlubule udumo lwami, wasusa umqhele wekhanda lami.
018	JOB	019	010	Ungibhidlizile inhlangothi zonke, sengihambile, ulisiphule ithemba lami njengesihlahla.
018	JOB	019	011	Ulumathisile ulaka lwakhe kimi, ungibale njengezitha zakhe kuye.
018	JOB	019	012	Amabutho akhe afika kanyekanye, abuthelela indlela yawo emelene lami, amisa inkamba agombolozela ithente lami.
018	JOB	019	013	Ubeke abafowethu khatshana lami, labangaziyo isibili sebengabemzini kimi.
018	JOB	019	014	Izihlobo zami zinyamalele, labazana lami bangikhohliwe.
018	JOB	019	015	Abahlala endlini yami lencekukazi zami bangibala njengowezizwe; ngingumfokazi emehlweni abo.
018	JOB	019	016	Ngabiza inceku yami, kodwa kayiphendulanga; ngayincenga ngomlomo wami.
018	JOB	019	017	Umoya wami uyenyanyeka kumkami, sengiyisinengiso kumadodana esizalo sami.
018	JOB	019	018	Labantwana abancinyane bayangidelela; ngasukuma, basebekhuluma bemelene lami.
018	JOB	019	019	Bonke abantu besifuba sami banengwa yimi, labo ebengibathanda sebengiphendukele.
018	JOB	019	020	Ithambo lami linamathelana lesikhumba sami lenyama yami, njalo ngiphephe ngesikhumba samazinyo ami.
018	JOB	019	021	Ngihawukelani, ngihawukelani, lina bangane bami; ngoba isandla sikaNkulunkulu singithintile.
018	JOB	019	022	Lingizingelelani njengoNkulunkulu, lingeneliswa yinyama yami?
018	JOB	019	023	Kungathi ngabe khathesi amazwi ami abhaliwe! Kungathi ngabe acindezelwe egwalweni!
018	JOB	019	024	Ngabe abazwe ngepheni yensimbi langomnuso edwaleni kuze kube nininini!
018	JOB	019	025	Ngoba mina ngiyazi ukuthi umhlengi wami uyaphila, lekupheleni uzakuma emhlabathini.
018	JOB	019	026	Lapho sekutshabalalise lokhu emva kwesikhumba sami, kanti enyameni yami ngizambona uNkulunkulu,
018	JOB	019	027	mina engizazibonela yena, lamehlo ami azabona, hatshi omunye. Izinso zami seziphelile ngaphakathi kwami.
018	JOB	019	028	Kodwa lithi: Kungani simzingela? Ngoba impande yendaba itholakala kimi.
018	JOB	019	029	Lina yesabeni inkemba, ngoba ulaka luletha izijeziso zenkemba, ukuze lazi ukuthi sikhona isahlulelo.
018	JOB	020	001	Wasephendula uZofari umNahama wathi:
018	JOB	020	002	Ngakho imicabango yami ingenza ngiphendule, langenxa yokuphangisa kwami phakathi kwami.
018	JOB	020	003	Ngizwile isijeziso sehlazo lami, lomoya wokuqedisisa kwami ungenza ngiphendule.
018	JOB	020	004	Uyakwazi lokhu yini, kusukela endulo, selokhu kwabekwa umuntu emhlabeni,
018	JOB	020	005	ukuthi injabulo yababi imfitshane, lentokozo yomzenzisi ngeyesikhatshana nje?
018	JOB	020	006	Loba ubukhosi bakhe busenyukela emazulwini, lekhanda lakhe lifinyelela emayezini,
018	JOB	020	007	uzabhubha phakade njengobulongwe bakhe; labo abambonileyo bathi: Ungaphi?
018	JOB	020	008	Uzaphapha njengephupho, bangabe besamthola; yebo, uzaxotshwa njengombono webusuku.
018	JOB	020	009	Ilihlo elike lambona aliyikuphinda, lendawo yakhe kayisayikumbona.
018	JOB	020	010	Abantwana bakhe bazadinga ukuthokozisa abayanga, lezandla zakhe zibuyisele inotho yakhe.
018	JOB	020	011	Amathambo akhe ayegcwele ubutsha bakhe, kodwa azalala kanye laye enhlabathini.
018	JOB	020	012	Uba ububi bumnandi emlonyeni wakhe, ebufihla ngaphansi kolimi lwakhe,
018	JOB	020	013	ebugodla, engabuyekeli, kodwa ebugcina phakathi komlomo wakhe,
018	JOB	020	014	ukudla kwakhe kuzaphenduka esiswini sakhe, kuzakuba yibuhlungu bezinyoka phakathi kwakhe.
018	JOB	020	015	Uginye inotho, kodwa uzayihlanza; uNkulunkulu uzayikhupha esiswini sakhe.
018	JOB	020	016	Uzamunya ubuhlungu bezinyoka, lolimi lwebululu luzambulala.
018	JOB	020	017	Kayikubona izifula, imifula, izifudlana zoluju lolaza.
018	JOB	020	018	Uzabuyisela lokho akusebenzelayo, angakuginyi; njengokwenotho izakuba njalo inhlawulo, njalo kayikuthokoza.
018	JOB	020	019	Ngoba ubacindezele wabadela abayanga, waphanga indlu abengayakhanga.
018	JOB	020	020	Ngoba kakwazi ukuthula esiswini sakhe, kayikusindisa lutho kusifiso sakhe.
018	JOB	020	021	Kakuyikusala lutho ekudleni kwakhe; ngenxa yalokhu okuhle kwakhe kakuyikuma.
018	JOB	020	022	Ekugcwaleni kokwanela kwakhe uzakuba lencindezelo; sonke isandla sohluphekayo sizamfikela.
018	JOB	020	023	Kuzakuthi lapho egcwalisa isisu sakhe, uNkulunkulu athumele kuye ukuvutha kwentukuthelo yakhe, akunise phezu kwakhe ekudleni kwakhe.
018	JOB	020	024	Uzabalekela isikhali sensimbi, idandili lethusi lizamhlaba.
018	JOB	020	025	Uyalihwatsha, liphume emhlana, lokubenyezelayo kuzaphuma enyongweni yakhe; izesabiso ziphezu kwakhe.
018	JOB	020	026	Ubumnyama bonke bugcinelwe izinto zakhe ezibekelelweyo; umlilo ongavuthelwayo uzamqeda; kuzakuba kubi kunsali ethenteni lakhe.
018	JOB	020	027	Amazulu azakwembula ububi bakhe, lomhlaba umvukele.
018	JOB	020	028	Ukwanda kwendlu yakhe kuzanyamalala, kukhukhulwe osukwini lwentukuthelo yakhe.
018	JOB	020	029	Lesi yisabelo somuntu omubi esivela kuNkulunkulu, lelifa alimiselwa nguNkulunkulu.
018	JOB	021	001	Wasephendula uJobe wathi:
018	JOB	021	002	Zwanini lilalele ilizwi lami, lalokho kube zinduduzo zenu.
018	JOB	021	003	Ngibekezelelani, ukuthi mina ngikhulume; lemva kokukhuluma kwami lingakloloda.
018	JOB	021	004	Mina-ke ukusola kwami kusemuntwini yini? Kodwa uba kunjalo, kungani umoya wami ungekhathazeke?
018	JOB	021	005	Ngikhangelani, likhakhamale, libeke isandla phezu komlomo.
018	JOB	021	006	Yebo, lapho ngikhumbula, ngitshaywa luvalo, lokuthuthumela kubamba inyama yami.
018	JOB	021	007	Ababi baphilelani, babe badala, yebo, bakhule emandleni?
018	JOB	021	008	Inzalo yabo izinze phambi kwabo kanye labo, lembewu yabo emehlweni abo.
018	JOB	021	009	Izindlu zabo zilokuthula kungelakwesaba, loswazi lukaNkulunkulu kaluphezu kwabo.
018	JOB	021	010	Inkunzi yakhe iyakhwela ingaphuthi; inkomokazi yakhe iyazala, ingaphunzi.
018	JOB	021	011	Bakhupha abantwanyana babo njengomhlambi, labantwana babo bayagida.
018	JOB	021	012	Baphakamisa ilizwi ngesigujana lechacho, bathokoze ngelizwi lomhlanga.
018	JOB	021	013	Bachitha insuku zabo ngokuhle, behlele engcwabeni ngokucwayiza kwelihlo.
018	JOB	021	014	Babesebesithi kuNkulunkulu: Suka kithi; ngoba kasifisi ulwazi lwendlela zakho.
018	JOB	021	015	Uyini uSomandla ukuthi simkhonze? Sizazuzani uba simncenga?
018	JOB	021	016	Khangela, okuhle kwabo kakukho esandleni sabo; icebo lababi likhatshana lami.
018	JOB	021	017	Kukangaki isibane sababi sicitshwa, kusiza ukuchitheka kwabo phezu kwabo! UNkulunkulu ubabela ubuhlungu elakeni lwakhe.
018	JOB	021	018	Banjengamahlanga phambi komoya, lanjengomule isiphepho esiwuphephulayo.
018	JOB	021	019	UNkulunkulu ubekela abantwana bakhe usizi lwakhe. Uyamvuza, njalo uzakwazi.
018	JOB	021	020	Amehlo akhe azabona ukuchitheka kwakhe, anathe okolaka lukaSomandla.
018	JOB	021	021	Ngoba iyini intokozo yakhe endlini yakhe emva kwakhe, lapho inani lenyanga zakhe liqunywa?
018	JOB	021	022	Kukhona ongafundisa uNkulunkulu ulwazi yini? Ngoba yena wehlulela abaphezulu.
018	JOB	021	023	Lo uyafa esemandleni akhe apheleleyo, yena wonke onwabile, elokuthula.
018	JOB	021	024	Iziphathelo zakhe zigcwele uchago, lomnkantsho wamathambo akhe umanzi.
018	JOB	021	025	Lomunye ufa elomphefumulo obabayo, engadlanga kokuhle.
018	JOB	021	026	Balala ndawonye ethulini, lempethu zibasibekele.
018	JOB	021	027	Khangelani, ngiyayazi imicabango yenu, lamacebo eliwaceba limelene lami.
018	JOB	021	028	Ngoba lithi: Ingaphi indlu yesiphathamandla? Njalo lingaphi ithente lendawo zababi zokuhlala?
018	JOB	021	029	Kalibabuzanga yini abadlula ngendlela, njalo kalinanzeleli iziboniso zabo?
018	JOB	021	030	Ukuthi omubi uyekelwa osukwini lokubhujiswa; bazalethwa osukwini lwezintukuthelo.
018	JOB	021	031	Ngubani ozamtshela indlela yakhe ebusweni? Ngubani ozamphindisela ngakwenzileyo?
018	JOB	021	032	Kanti yena uzasiwa engcwabeni, lilindwe idundulu.
018	JOB	021	033	Amagade esihotsha amnandi kuye, njalo udonsa wonke umuntu emva kwakhe, njengoba bengelakubalwa abaphambi kwakhe.
018	JOB	021	034	Pho lizangiduduza njani ngeze, ngoba empendulweni zenu kusele inkohliso?
018	JOB	022	001	Wasephendula uElifazi umThemani wathi:
018	JOB	022	002	Umuntu angaba losizo kuNkulunkulu yini, ngoba ohlakaniphileyo elusizo kuye ngokwakhe?
018	JOB	022	003	Kuyintokozo yini kuSomandla ukuthi ulungile? Kumbe inzuzo kuye ukuthi uphelelise indlela zakho?
018	JOB	022	004	Uzakusola yini ngenxa yokwesaba kwakho? Uzangena lawe kusahlulelo.
018	JOB	022	005	Ububi bakho kabubukhulu yini, lezono zakho kazilakuphela?
018	JOB	022	006	Ngoba uthethe isibambiso kubafowenu kungelasizatho, wahlubula abanqunu izigqoko.
018	JOB	022	007	Kawumnathisanga amanzi odiniweyo, lolambileyo umgodlele ukudla.
018	JOB	022	008	Kodwa umuntu olengalo, umhlaba ungowakhe, lowemukeleka ebusweni wahlala kuwo.
018	JOB	022	009	Uxotshile abafelokazi bengelalutho, lengalo zezintandane zichotshoziwe.
018	JOB	022	010	Ngakho-ke imijibila ikuhanqile, lovalo luhle lwakwesabisa,
018	JOB	022	011	kumbe ubumnyama ukuze ungaboni, lesikhukhula samanzi sikusibekele.
018	JOB	022	012	UNkulunkulu kakho yini engqongeni yamazulu? Bona-ke ingqonga yezinkanyezi, ukuthi ziphakeme kangakanani.
018	JOB	022	013	Kanti uthi: UNkulunkulu wazini? Angahlulela yini engemuva komnyama onzima?
018	JOB	022	014	Amayezi amnyama ayisisibekelo sakhe ukuze angaboni, uhamba esigombolozini samazulu.
018	JOB	022	015	Usunanzelele indlela endala yini abantu ababi abanyathela kuyo?
018	JOB	022	016	Abahluthunwa kungakabi yisikhathi; uzamcolo wathululwa phezu kwesisekelo sabo.
018	JOB	022	017	Abathi kuNkulunkulu: Suka kithi. LoSomandla wayenzeni kubo?
018	JOB	022	018	Kanti yena wayegcwalise izindlu zabo ngokuhle; kodwa icebo labakhohlakeleyo likhatshana lami.
018	JOB	022	019	Abalungileyo bayakubona bathokoze, lomsulwa ubahleka usulu.
018	JOB	022	020	Isibili isitha sethu sichithiwe, lomlilo uqede insali yabo.
018	JOB	022	021	Ake wejwayelane laye, ube lokuthula, ngalokho okuhle kuzakuza kuwe.
018	JOB	022	022	Ake wemukele umlayo ovela emlonyeni wakhe, ubeke amazwi akhe enhliziyweni yakho.
018	JOB	022	023	Uba ubuyela kuSomandla, uzakwakhiwa, ususe okubi khatshana lamathente akho.
018	JOB	022	024	Ubusubeka igolide lakho othulini, legolide leOfiri elitsheni lezifula.
018	JOB	022	025	Ngakho uSomandla uzakuba ligolide lakho, lesiliva sakho esinengi.
018	JOB	022	026	Ngoba ngalesosikhathi uzazithokozisa ngoSomandla, uphakamisele ubuso bakho kuNkulunkulu.
018	JOB	022	027	Uzakhuleka kuye, akuzwe, ukhokhe izifungo zakho.
018	JOB	022	028	Uzaquma-ke udaba, luqiniseke kuwe, lokukhanya kukhanye endleleni zakho.
018	JOB	022	029	Nxa behliselwe phansi, ubususithi: Phezulu! Abesesindisa othobekileyo ngamehlo.
018	JOB	022	030	Uzamkhulula ongemsulwa; njalo ukhululwa ngokuhlanzeka kwezandla zakho.
018	JOB	023	001	Wasephendula uJobe wathi:
018	JOB	023	002	Lalamuhla isikhalazo sami silokubaba; isandla sami sinzima phezu kokububula kwami.
018	JOB	023	003	Kungathi ngabe ngiyazi lapho engingamthola khona! Bengingeza enkundleni yakhe!
018	JOB	023	004	Ngibeke kuhle udaba lwami phambi kwakhe, ngigcwalise umlomo wami ngokuphikisa.
018	JOB	023	005	Bengingawazi amazwi azangiphendula ngawo, ngiqedisise azakutsho kimi.
018	JOB	023	006	Uzaphikisana lami ngobukhulu bamandla yini? Hatshi, kodwa uzabeka inhliziyo yakhe kimi.
018	JOB	023	007	Lapho oqotho angaphikisana laye; ngakho bengizaphepha phakade kumahluleli wami.
018	JOB	023	008	Khangelani ngiya phambili, kodwa kakho, lemuva, kodwa kangimboni.
018	JOB	023	009	Ngakwesokhohlo ekusebenzeni kwakhe, kodwa kangimboni; uyacatsha ngakwesokunene, kodwa kangimboni.
018	JOB	023	010	Kanti uyayazi indlela elami; kangihlole, ngizaphuma njengegolide.
018	JOB	023	011	Unyawo lwami lubambelele enyathelweni lakhe, ngiyigcinile indlela yakhe, kangiphambukanga.
018	JOB	023	012	Kangisukanga lemlayweni wezindebe zakhe, ngawalondoloza amazwi omlomo wakhe okwedlula isabelo sami.
018	JOB	023	013	Kodwa yena ukokukodwa, ngubani-ke ongambuyisela emuva? Lokho umphefumulo wakhe okufisayo uyakwenza.
018	JOB	023	014	Ngoba uzaphelelisa engikumiselweyo; lezinto ezinengi ezinjalo zikuye.
018	JOB	023	015	Ngenxa yalokho ngitshaywa luvalo phambi kwakhe; ngicabanga, ngiyamesaba.
018	JOB	023	016	Ngoba uNkulunkulu wenze inhliziyo yami yaphela amandla, loSomandla ungethusile.
018	JOB	023	017	Ngoba kangiqunywanga phambi komnyama, wagubuzela ubumnyama ebusweni bami.
018	JOB	024	001	Kungani izikhathi zingafihlelwanga uSomandla, labamaziyo bengaboni insuku zakhe?
018	JOB	024	002	Bathuthukisa imingcele, baphange imihlambi bayeluse.
018	JOB	024	003	Baxotsha ubabhemi wezintandane, bathathe inkabi yomfelokazi ibe yisibambiso.
018	JOB	024	004	Baphambula abaswelayo emigwaqweni; abayanga bomhlaba bacatsha ndawonye.
018	JOB	024	005	Khangelani, bangobabhemi beganga enkangala, baphumela emsebenzini wabo, badinge impango ngovivi; inkangala ibe yikudla kwakhe lokwabantwana.
018	JOB	024	006	Emasimini bavuna ukudla kwakhe, bakhothoze esivinini somubi.
018	JOB	024	007	Balala beze ebusuku bengelasembatho, bengelasigubuzelo emqandweni.
018	JOB	024	008	Bamanzi ngezihlambo zezintaba, babambelela edwaleni ngoba bengelasiphephelo.
018	JOB	024	009	Bahluthuna intandane ebeleni, bathathe lesibambiso kumyanga.
018	JOB	024	010	Bahamba beze bengelasigqoko, labalambileyo bathwala isithungo.
018	JOB	024	011	Phakathi kwemiduli yabo bahluza amafutha, banyathela izikhamelo zewayini, kodwa bomile.
018	JOB	024	012	Abantu bayabubula besemzini, lomphefumulo wabalimeleyo uyakhala; kodwa uNkulunkulu kababaleli ukungalungi.
018	JOB	024	013	Bona baphakathi kwabavukela ukukhanya; kabazazi indlela zakhe, kabahlali emikhondweni yakhe.
018	JOB	024	014	Umbulali uyavuka ngovivi, abulale umyanga loswelayo; lebusuku unjengesela.
018	JOB	024	015	Lelihlo lesiphingi lilindela ukuhlwa, sisithi: Kakulalihlo elizangibona; sifake isimbombozo ebusweni baso.
018	JOB	024	016	Emnyameni ugebha aphutshele ezindlini abaziphawulele zona emini; kabakwazi ukukhanya.
018	JOB	024	017	Ngoba ikuseni kanyekanye ilithunzi lokufa kubo; uba besaziwa bakuzesabiso zethunzi lokufa.
018	JOB	024	018	Ulula phezu kobuso bamanzi; isabelo sabo siqalekisiwe emhlabeni; kaphendukeli endleleni yezivini.
018	JOB	024	019	Imbalela lokutshisa kuqeda amanzi eliqhwa elikhithikileyo, ngokunjalo ingcwaba abonileyo.
018	JOB	024	020	Isizalo sizamkhohlwa, impethu izammunya, engabe esakhunjulwa, lenkohlakalo izakwephulwa njengesihlahla.
018	JOB	024	021	Udla ngokuminza inyumba engazaliyo, kamenzeli okuhle umfelokazi.
018	JOB	024	022	Njalo udonsa abalamandla ngamandla akhe, uyavuka, njalo kungabi lolethemba lempilo.
018	JOB	024	023	Uyamnika ukuze alondolozeke, eseyama kukho, kodwa amehlo akhe aphezu kwendlela zabo.
018	JOB	024	024	Bayaphakanyiswa okwesikhatshana, babesebengasekho, behliselwa phansi, bavalelwe njengaye wonke, bayaqunywa njengesihloko sesikhwebu.
018	JOB	024	025	Uba-ke kungenjalo, ngubani ongangenza umqambimanga, enze inkulumo yami ibe yize?
018	JOB	025	001	Wasephendula uBilidadi umShuhi wathi:
018	JOB	025	002	Ukubusa lokwesabeka kulaye; uyenza ukuthula endaweni zakhe eziphezulu.
018	JOB	025	003	Kukhona inani yini lamabutho akhe? Ngubani okungamphumeliyo ukukhanya kwakhe?
018	JOB	025	004	Pho umuntu angalunga njani kuNkulunkulu? Kumbe ozelwe ngowesifazana angahlambuluka njani?
018	JOB	025	005	Khangela kuze kube senyangeni, njalo kayikhazimuli, lezinkanyezi kazihlambulukanga emehlweni akhe.
018	JOB	025	006	Pho kangakanani umuntu oyimpethu, lendodana yomuntu engumswenya!
018	JOB	026	001	Wasephendula uJobe wathi:
018	JOB	026	002	Umsize njani ongelamandla, wasindisa ingalo engelamandla?
018	JOB	026	003	Umeluleke njani ongelakuhlakanipha, watshumayela ngobunengi ulwazi oluqotho?
018	JOB	026	004	Utshele bani amazwi? Njalo ngumoya kabani ophume kuwe?
018	JOB	026	005	Abafileyo bayathuthumela ngaphansi kwamanzi, labahlali bawo.
018	JOB	026	006	Isihogo sinqunu phambi kwakhe, lencithakalo kayilasisibekelo.
018	JOB	026	007	Welulela inyakatho phezu kwendawo engelalutho, aphanyeke umhlaba phezu kweze.
018	JOB	026	008	Uyabophela amanzi emayezini akhe, kodwa amayezi kawadabuki ngaphansi kwawo.
018	JOB	026	009	Uyasibekela ubuso besihlalo sakhe sobukhosi, endlale iyezi phezu kwaso.
018	JOB	026	010	Udwebe umngcele oyisigombolozi phezu kobuso bamanzi, kuze kube sekucineni kokukhanya lomnyama.
018	JOB	026	011	Insika zamazulu ziyathuthumela, zethuswa yikukhuza kwakhe.
018	JOB	026	012	Ngamandla akhe uthulisa ulwandle, langenhlakanipho yakhe uphahlaza ukuziqhenya.
018	JOB	026	013	Ngomoya wakhe ucecise amazulu; isandla sakhe sagwaza inyoka ebalekayo.
018	JOB	026	014	Khangela, lokhu kungamaphethelo ezindlela zakhe; kodwa kuzwakala into encinyane kangakanani ngaye! Kanti umdumo wamandla akhe ngubani ongawuqedisisa?
018	JOB	027	001	UJobe wasebuya ephakamisa isaga sakhe wathi:
018	JOB	027	002	Kuphila kukaNkulunkulu osuse ilungelo lami, loSomandla owenze umphefumulo wami wababa.
018	JOB	027	003	Isibili ngaso sonke isikhathi umphefumulo usekimi, lomoya kaNkulunkulu usemakhaleni ami,
018	JOB	027	004	oqotho indebe zami kaziyikukhuluma okubi, lolimi lwami sibili lungakhulumi inkohliso.
018	JOB	027	005	Kakube khatshana lami ukuthi ngithi lilungile; ngize ngiphele kangiyikususa ubuqotho bami kimi.
018	JOB	027	006	Ngizabambelela ekulungeni kwami ngingakuyekeli; inhliziyo yami kayiyikusola ensukwini zami.
018	JOB	027	007	Isitha sami kasibe njengomubi, longivukelayo njengongalunganga.
018	JOB	027	008	Ngoba liyini ithemba longamesabiyo uNkulunkulu, esequnyiwe, uNkulunkulu esekhuphile umphefumulo wakhe?
018	JOB	027	009	UNkulunkulu uzakuzwa yini ukukhala kwakhe, ukuhlupheka sekwehlele phezu kwakhe?
018	JOB	027	010	Uzazithokozisa yini ngoSomandla? Uzabiza uNkulunkulu yini sonke isikhathi?
018	JOB	027	011	Ngizalifundisa ngesandla sikaNkulunkulu; okukuSomandla kangiyikukufihla.
018	JOB	027	012	Khangela, lina lonke likubonile. Pho, kungani selibe yize lokuba yize ngokunjalo?
018	JOB	027	013	Lesi yisabelo somuntu omubi kuNkulunkulu, lelifa labalesihluku abalemukela kuSomandla.
018	JOB	027	014	Uba abantwana bakhe besanda, kungokwenkemba, lenzalo yakhe kayiyikusutha isinkwa.
