018	JOB	027	018	Wakha indlu yakhe njengenundu, lanjengedumba umlindi alenzayo.
018	JOB	027	019	Ulala enothile, kodwa kabuthwa; uvula amehlo akhe, kasekho.
018	JOB	027	020	Izesabiso zizambamba njengamanzi; ebusuku isiphepho sizameba.
018	JOB	027	021	Umoya wempumalanga uzamthatha, ahambe, umphephule asuke endaweni yakhe.
018	JOB	027	022	Abesephosela phezu kwakhe angayekeli; phambi kwesandla sakhe uzabaleka isibili.
018	JOB	027	023	Abantu bazatshaya izandla zabo ngaye, bamncifele endaweni yakhe.
018	JOB	028	001	Isibili kukhona umthapho wesiliva, lendawo yegolide abalicengayo.
018	JOB	028	002	Insimbi ithathwa enhlabathini, lethusi lincibilikiswa elitsheni.
018	JOB	028	003	Umisela umnyama umngcele, udingisisa kuze kube sekupheleleni konke, amatshe obumnyama lethunzi lokufa.
018	JOB	028	004	Uqhekeza umgodi khatshana lalapho okuhlala khona abantu, lapho abakhohlwe khona lunyawo; bayalenga bejikajika khatshana labantu.
018	JOB	028	005	Umhlaba, kuphuma ukudla kuwo, langaphansi kwawo kuphenduka kwangathi ngumlilo.
018	JOB	028	006	Amatshe awo ayindawo yesafire, njalo ulothuli lwegolide.
018	JOB	028	007	Inyoni edla inyama kayiyazi indlela, lelihlo lelinqe kaliyibonanga.
018	JOB	028	008	Imidlwane yokuziqhenyayo kayiyinyathelanga, isilwane kasihambanga kuyo.
018	JOB	028	009	Uyelula isandla sakhe elitsheni elilukhuni, uyagenqula izintaba ezimpandeni.
018	JOB	028	010	Aqhekeze imisele emadwaleni, lelihlo lakhe libona konke okuligugu.
018	JOB	028	011	Uyabopha izifula zingathonti, lokufihlakeleyo ukukhuphela ekukhanyeni.
018	JOB	028	012	Kodwa inhlakanipho ingatholakala ivela ngaphi? Lendawo yokuqedisisa ingaphi?
018	JOB	028	013	Umuntu kalazi ixabiso lakho, njalo kakutholakali elizweni labaphilayo.
018	JOB	028	014	Ukujula kuthi: Kakukho kimi. Lolwandle luthi: Kakulami.
018	JOB	028	015	Igolide elihle lingenikwe endaweni yakho, lesiliva singelinganiselwe intengo yakho.
018	JOB	028	016	Kungelingane legolide leOfiri, le-onikse eligugu, lesafire.
018	JOB	028	017	Igolide lekristali kungelingane lakho, futhi kungenaniswe ngesitsha segolide elicwengekileyo.
018	JOB	028	018	Ikorali lekristali kakuyikukhunjulwa, ngoba intengo yenhlakanipho ingaphezu kwamatshe aligugu.
018	JOB	028	019	Itopazi leEthiyophiya lingelinganiswe lakho, kungelingane legolide elicwengekileyo.
018	JOB	028	020	Pho, inhlakanipho ivela ngaphi? Lendawo yokuqedisisa ingaphi?
018	JOB	028	021	Ngoba kusithekile emehlweni abo bonke abaphilayo, kwafihlwa ezinyonini zamazulu.
018	JOB	028	022	Ukubhujiswa lokufa kuthi: Sizwile ngendlebe zethu umbiko wakho.
018	JOB	028	023	UNkulunkulu uyayiqedisisa indlela yakho, njalo yena uyayazi indawo yakho.
018	JOB	028	024	Ngoba yena uyakhangela kuze kube semikhawulweni yomhlaba, abone ngaphansi kwawo wonke amazulu.
018	JOB	028	025	Esenzela umoya isisindo, walinganisa amanzi ngesilinganiso.
018	JOB	028	026	Lapho esenzela izulu isimiso, lombane wokuduma indlela.
018	JOB	028	027	Ngalesosikhathi wakubona, walandisa ngakho; wakulungisa, yebo, wakuhlolisisa.
018	JOB	028	028	Wasesithi emuntwini: Khangela, ukwesaba iNkosi, lokhu kuyinhlakanipho, lokusuka ebubini kuyikuqedisisa.
018	JOB	029	001	UJobe wasebuya ephakamisa isaga sakhe wathi:
018	JOB	029	002	Kungathi ngabe nginjengenyangeni zamandulo, njengensukwini uNkulunkulu angigcine ngazo,
018	JOB	029	003	lapho isibane sakhe sakhanya phezu kwekhanda lami; ngahamba emnyameni ngokukhanya kwakhe!
018	JOB	029	004	Njengoba nganginjalo ensukwini zokuvuthwa kwami, lapho iseluleko sikaNkulunkulu sasiphezu kwethente lami,
018	JOB	029	005	lapho uSomandla wayeseselami, labantwana bami bengiphahlile,
018	JOB	029	006	lapho ngagezisa izinyathelo zami ngolaza, ledwala langithululela imifula yamafutha!
018	JOB	029	007	Lapho ngaphuma ngaya esangweni ngidabula umuzi, ngalungisa isihlalo sami emdangeni;
018	JOB	029	008	amajaha angibona, acatsha; lamaxhegu asukuma ema;
018	JOB	029	009	iziphathamandla zayekela ukukhuluma, zabeka isandla phezu komlomo wazo;
018	JOB	029	010	ilizwi labakhulu lacatsha, lolimi lwabo lwanamathela elwangeni lwabo.
018	JOB	029	011	Lapho indlebe isizwa yangibusisa, lelihlo libona langifakazela,
018	JOB	029	012	ngoba ngakhulula umyanga okhalayo, lentandane, longelamsizi.
018	JOB	029	013	Isibusiso sobhubhayo sehlele phezu kwami, njalo ngenza inhliziyo yomfelokazi ihlabele ngentokozo.
018	JOB	029	014	Ngembatha ukulunga, kwangembesa; isahlulelo sami saba njengesembatho lomqhele.
018	JOB	029	015	Ngangingamehlo koyisiphofu, ngangizinyawo kusiqhuli.
018	JOB	029	016	Nganginguyise wabayanga, lendaba engingayaziyo ngayihlolisisa.
018	JOB	029	017	Ngasengisephula umhlathi womubi, ngamenza alahle impango emazinyweni akhe.
018	JOB	029	018	Ngasengisithi: Ngizaphela lesidleke sami, ngandise insuku njengetshebetshebe.
018	JOB	029	019	Impande zami zinabele emanzini, lamazolo alale ubusuku ogatsheni lwami.
018	JOB	029	020	Udumo lwami lutsha kimi, ledandili lami laguquka esandleni sami.
018	JOB	029	021	Bangilalela, belindele, bathulela iseluleko sami.
018	JOB	029	022	Emva kwelizwi lami kabaphendulanga, lelizwi lami lathontela phezu kwabo.
018	JOB	029	023	Bangilindela njengezulu, lomlomo wabo bawukhamisela izulu lokucina.
018	JOB	029	024	Lapho ngibahlekela, kabakholwanga, lokukhanya kobuso bami kabakuwiselanga phansi.
018	JOB	029	025	Ngakhetha indlela yabo ngahlala ngiyinhloko, ngahlala njengenkosi phakathi kweviyo, njengoduduza abalilayo.
018	JOB	030	001	Kodwa khathesi abatsha kulami ngensuku bayangihleka, oyise babo engangingabadelela ukubafaka lezinja zomhlambi wami.
018	JOB	030	002	Yebo, amandla ezandla zabo ayengaba yini kimi, ukuvuthwa kwabo sekuphelile?
018	JOB	030	003	Ngenswelo langendlala bajujukile, bangqathuze elizweni elomileyo, elalikade liyinkangala legwadule.
018	JOB	030	004	Abakha imibhida yetshwayi enkotheni, lempande yesihlahla serotemu iyikudla kwabo.
018	JOB	030	005	Baxotshwa phakathi kwabantu; bamemeza ngabo kungathi lisela;
018	JOB	030	006	ukuthi bahlale eliweni lezihotsha, imigodi yenhlabathi, lamadwala.
018	JOB	030	007	Bayakhonya phakathi kwenkotha, babuthane phansi kokhula.
018	JOB	030	008	Bangabantwana beziphukuphuku, yebo abantwana abangelabizo; betshaywa, bexotshwa emhlabeni.
018	JOB	030	009	Khathesi sengiyingoma yabo, sengiyisiga sabo.
018	JOB	030	010	Banengwa yimi, bamela khatshana lami; kabayekeli ukungikhafulela ebusweni ngamathe.
018	JOB	030	011	Ngoba ukhulule intambo yami, wangicindezela, ngakho balahle itomu phambi kwami.
018	JOB	030	012	Ngakwesokunene abatsha bayasukuma, bafuqa inyawo zami, bangivusela indlela zabo zokubhubhisa.
018	JOB	030	013	Badiliza indlela yami, bancedisa ukuqhubela phambili incithakalo yami, kabalamncedisi.
018	JOB	030	014	Beza kungathi bafohlela esikhaleni esibanzi; phakathi kwencithakalo batheleka.
018	JOB	030	015	Izesabiso ziphendukele phezu kwami; baxotshana lodumo lwami njengomoya, lempumelelo yami yedlula njengeyezi.
018	JOB	030	016	Khathesi-ke umphefumulo wami uyazithulula phezu kwami; insuku zosizi zingibambile.
018	JOB	030	017	Ubusuku bugwaza amathambo ami phakathi kwami, lokungingqathuzayo kakuphumuli.
018	JOB	030	018	Ngobunengi bamandla akhe isembatho sami siyaguqulwa; uyangibhinca njengesiphika sebhatshi lami.
018	JOB	030	019	Ungiphosele odakeni, senginjengothuli lomlotha.
018	JOB	030	020	Ngiyakhala kuwe, kodwa kawungiphenduli; ngiyasukuma, unginanzelele nje.
018	JOB	030	021	Usuphenduke waba lesihluku kimi; ngamandla esandla sakho umelana lami.
018	JOB	030	022	Ungiphakamisela emoyeni, ungigadise kuwo, ungincibilikisele kusiphepho.
018	JOB	030	023	Ngoba ngiyazi ukuthi uzangibuyisela ekufeni, lendlini emiselwe bonke abaphilayo.
018	JOB	030	024	Kodwa umuntu kayikwelulela isandla engcwabeni, kumbe encithakalweni yakhe akhalele usizo.
018	JOB	030	025	Kangimkhalelanga inyembezi yini owayelensuku ezilukhuni, umphefumulo wami wadabuka ngongumyanga?
018	JOB	030	026	Lapho ngilindele okuhle, kweza okubi; lapho ngilindele ukukhanya, kweza umnyama.
018	JOB	030	027	Imibilini yami yabila, kayithulanga, lensuku zosizi zingandulele.
018	JOB	030	028	Ngahamba ngilila, kungelalanga; ngasukuma ebandleni ngakhalela usizo.
018	JOB	030	029	Ngingumfowabo wemigobho, lomngane wezintshe.
018	JOB	030	030	Isikhumba sami simnyama phezu kwami, lamathambo ami atshile ngokutshisa.
018	JOB	030	031	Ichacho lami selibe yisililo, lomhlanga wami uyilizwi labakhala inyembezi.
018	JOB	031	001	Ngenza isivumelwano lamehlo ami; pho ngingananzelela njani intombi?
018	JOB	031	002	Ngoba siyini isabelo sikaNkulunkulu esivela phezulu, lelifa likaSomandla elivela endaweni eziphezulu?
018	JOB	031	003	Incithakalo kayisiyomubi yini, lengozi yabenzi bobubi?
018	JOB	031	004	Yena kaziboni yini indlela zami, abale zonke izinyathelo zami?
018	JOB	031	005	Uba ngihambe ngokuyize, kumbe unyawo lwami luphuthumele enkohlisweni,
018	JOB	031	006	kangilinganise ngesilinganiso esilungileyo, ukuze uNkulunkulu azi ubuqotho bami.
018	JOB	031	007	Uba inyathelo lami liphambukile endleleni, lenhliziyo yami yalandela amehlo ami, kumbe kunamathele isici ezandleni zami;
018	JOB	031	008	kangihlanyele, kodwa kudle omunye, lezilimo zami zisitshulwe.
018	JOB	031	009	Uba inhliziyo yami iyengwe ngowesifazana, kumbe ngacathama emnyango kamakhelwane wami,
018	JOB	031	010	umkami kacholele omunye, labanye kabaguqe phezu kwakhe.
018	JOB	031	011	Ngoba lokho kuyinkohlakalo, njalo kuyisono ngabahluleli.
018	JOB	031	012	Ngoba ngumlilo odla kuze kube yincithakalo, usiphule sonke isivuno sami.
018	JOB	031	013	Uba ngalile udaba lwenceku yami loba olwencekukazi yami, lapho ziphikisana lami,
018	JOB	031	014	pho ngizakwenzani lapho uNkulunkulu esukuma? Lalapho esethekela, ngizaphendulani kuye?
018	JOB	031	015	Lowo owangenza esiswini kamenzanga yena yini, lowasibumba esiswini munye?
018	JOB	031	016	Uba ngigodlele umyanga isifiso, kumbe ngifiphaze amehlo omfelokazi,
018	JOB	031	017	kumbe ngadla ucezu lwami ngedwa, ukuze intandane ingadli kulo
018	JOB	031	018	(ngoba kwasebutsheni bami yakhula lami nginjengoyise, ngamqondisa kusukela esizalweni sikamama),
018	JOB	031	019	uba ngabona obhubha ngenxa yokuswela isigqoko, loba umyanga engelasembatho,
018	JOB	031	020	uba inkalo zakhe zingangibusisanga, ngoba ekhudunyezwe yiboya bezimvu zami,
018	JOB	031	021	uba ngaphakamisa isandla sami ngimelene lentandane, lapho ngabona usizo lwami esangweni,
018	JOB	031	022	kaliwe ihlombe lami esiphangeni sami, lengalo yami iqamuke ethanjeni layo.
018	JOB	031	023	Ngoba incithakalo kaNkulunkulu yayiyisesabiso kimi, ngingenelisi ngenxa yobukhulu bakhe.
018	JOB	031	024	Uba ngenzile igolide laba lithemba lami, ngathi kugolide elihle: Themba lami.
018	JOB	031	025	Uba ngithokozile ngoba inotho yami inengi, langoba isandla sami sithole okunengi;
018	JOB	031	026	uba ngikhangele ilanga lapho libenyezela, loba inyanga ehamba enkazimulweni,
018	JOB	031	027	lenhliziyo yami yayengwa ensitha, kumbe isandla sami sange umlomo wami,
018	JOB	031	028	lalokho yisiphambeko phambi kwabehluleli, ngoba ngabe ngimphikile uNkulunkulu waphezulu.
018	JOB	031	029	Uba ngithokozile ngokuchitheka kongizondayo, kumbe ngajabula lapho ububi bumthola;
018	JOB	031	030	njalo ngingavumelanga umlomo wami ukuthi wone, ngokucela umphefumulo wakhe ngesiqalekiso;
018	JOB	031	031	uba abantu bethente lami bebengatshongo ukuthi: Hawu, aluba besilokwenyama yakhe, ngabe kasisuthanga.
018	JOB	031	032	Owemzini kazanga alale esitaladeni; iminyango yami ngayivulela isihambi.
018	JOB	031	033	Uba ngasibekela iziphambeko zami njengoAdamu, ngokufihla isono sami esifubeni sami.
018	JOB	031	034	Ngoba ngethuswa lixuku elikhulu, lokudelelwa ngabensendo kwangesabisa, ngakho ngathula, kangaze ngaphuma emnyango.
018	JOB	031	035	Kungathi ngabe ngilongangizwa! Khangelani uphawu lwami. Kungathi uSomandla angangiphendula, lokuthi ophikisana lami ngabe ubhale ugwalo!
018	JOB	031	036	Isibili, bengingaluthwala ehlombe lami, ngilubophe lube ngumqhele kimi.
018	JOB	031	037	Ngimtshele inani lezinyathelo zami, ngisondele kuye njengesiphathamandla.
018	JOB	031	038	Uba umhlaba wami ukhalile ngami, lemifolo yawo ililile ndawonye,
018	JOB	031	039	uba ngidlile amandla awo kungelamali, kumbe ngenza umphefumulo wabaniniwo uphele,
018	JOB	031	040	kakuhlume ukhula oluhlabayo endaweni yengqoloyi, lokhula olunukayo endaweni yebhali. Amazwi kaJobe asephelile.
018	JOB	032	001	Lawomadoda amathathu aseyekela ukumphendula uJobe, ngoba wayelungile emehlweni akhe.
018	JOB	032	002	Lwaseluvutha ulaka lukaElihu indodana kaBarakeli umBuzi, owosendo lukaRamu. Ulaka lwakhe lwavuthela uJobe ngoba wazilungisisa yena kuloNkulunkulu.
018	JOB	032	003	Ulaka lwakhe lwabavuthela labo abangane bakhe abathathu, ngoba bengatholanga impendulo, kube kanti bamlahla uJobe.
018	JOB	032	004	Kodwa UElihu wayelindele uJobe ekhuluma, ngoba babebadala ngensuku kulaye.
018	JOB	032	005	UElihu esebonile ukuthi kwakungelampendulo emlonyeni walamadoda amathathu, ulaka lwakhe lwaseluvutha.
018	JOB	032	006	Ngakho uElihu indodana kaBarakeli umBuzi waphendula wathi: Mina ngingomncinyane ngezinsuku, lina-ke libadala; ngenxa yalokhu bengithikaza, ngesaba ukulitshela umcabango wami.
018	JOB	032	007	Ngathi: Kakukhulume izinsuku, lobunengi beminyaka bazise inhlakanipho.
018	JOB	032	008	Isibili umoya ukhona emuntwini, lokuphefumulela kukaSomandla kuyabanika ukuqedisisa.
018	JOB	032	009	Abakhulu kabahlakaniphi ngezikhathi zonke, labalupheleyo kabaqedisisi isahlulelo.
018	JOB	032	010	Ngakho ngithi: Lalelani kimi; lami ngizatshengisa umcabango wami.
018	JOB	032	011	Khangelani, bengiwalindele amazwi enu, ngabeka indlebe ekukhulumeni kwenu okuhlakaniphileyo, lisadinga amazwi.
018	JOB	032	012	Yebo, ngalilalela, khangelani-ke, kakho phakathi kwenu omvumisileyo uJobe, owaphenduleyo amazwi akhe.
018	JOB	032	013	Hlezi lithi: Sitholile inhlakanipho; nguNkulunkulu ozamxotsha, hatshi umuntu.
018	JOB	032	014	Kodwa kangihlelelanga amazwi, langamazwi enu kangiyikumphendula.
018	JOB	032	015	Badideka, kabasaphendulanga, basusa amazwi kubo.
018	JOB	032	016	Ngasengilinda, kodwa kabakhulumanga, ngoba bema, kabasaphendulanga.
018	JOB	032	017	Lami ngizaphendula ingxenye yami, lami ngitshengise umcabango wami.
018	JOB	032	018	Ngoba ngigcwele amazwi, umoya wesisu sami uyangiqhubezela.
018	JOB	032	019	Khangelani, isisu sami sinjengewayini engavulwanga, njengemigodla emitsha sizadabuka.
018	JOB	032	020	Ngizakhuluma ukuze ngiphefumule; ngivule indebe zami, ngiphendule.
018	JOB	032	021	Ake ngingaphakamisi ubuso bomuntu, ngingabizi umuntu ngebizo lokubamba amehlo.
018	JOB	032	022	Ngoba kangikwazi ukunika amabizo okubamba amehlo; masinyane umenzi wami angangisusa.
018	JOB	033	001	Kube kanti-ke, Jobe, ake uzwe inkulumo zami, ubeke indlebe kuwo wonke amazwi ami.
018	JOB	033	002	Khangelani, sengivule umlomo wami, ulimi lwami lukhuluma emlonyeni wami.
018	JOB	033	003	Amazwi ami angawokuqonda kwenhliziyo yami, azakhuluma ulwazi lwendebe zami ngokuhlanzeka.
018	JOB	033	004	UMoya kaNkulunkulu wangenza, lokuphefumula kukaSomandla kwanginika impilo.
018	JOB	033	005	Uba ulakho ngiphendula; zihlele phambi kwami, uzimise.
018	JOB	033	006	Khangela, nginjengawe kuNkulunkulu, lami ngathatshwa ebumbeni.
018	JOB	033	007	Khangela, ukwethusa kwami kungakwethusi, lesandla sami singabi nzima phezu kwakho.
018	JOB	033	008	Isibili ukhulume endlebeni zami, ngezwa ilizwi lamazwi, uthi:
018	JOB	033	009	Ngimsulwa, kangilasiphambeko, ngihlanzekile, njalo kakulabubi kimi.
018	JOB	033	010	Khangela, uthola amathuba okumelana lami, ungibala njengesitha sakhe.
018	JOB	033	011	Ufaka inyawo zami esigodweni, aqaphele zonke indlela zami.
018	JOB	033	012	Khangela, kulokhu kawulunganga; ngizakuphendula, ngoba uNkulunkulu mkhulu kulomuntu.
018	JOB	033	013	Umphikiselani? Ngoba engaphenduli leyodwa yezindaba zakhe.
018	JOB	033	014	Ngoba uNkulunkulu ukhuluma kanye, yebo, kabili, engekho onanzayo.
018	JOB	033	015	Ephutsheni, kumbono webusuku, lapho ubuthongo obunzima busehlela abantu, ekuwozeleni embhedeni;
018	JOB	033	016	abesesembula indlebe yabantu, aphawule ukuqondiswa kwabo;
018	JOB	033	017	ukuze aphambule umuntu ekwenzenikwakhe, afihle ukuzigqaja emuntwini,
018	JOB	033	018	anqande umphefumulo wakhe egodini, lempilo yakhe ekwedluleni ngenkemba.
018	JOB	033	019	Njalo ujeziswa ngobuhlungu embhedeni wakhe, langokuqaqamba kwamathambo akhe okungapheliyo,
018	JOB	033	020	ize impilo yakhe inengwe yisinkwa, lomphefumulo wakhe yikudla okuloyisekayo.
018	JOB	033	021	Inyama yakhe iyaphela, ingabonakali, lamathambo akhe abekade engabonakali avele.
018	JOB	033	022	Lomphefumulo wakhe useduze legodi, lempilo yakhe kubabulali.
018	JOB	033	023	Uba kulesithunywa kanye laye, umlamuli, oyedwa phakathi kwenkulungwane, ukutshela umuntu ukuqonda kwakhe,
018	JOB	033	024	uzakuba lomusa kuye athi: Mkhulule ekwehleleni egodini, sengithole inhlawulo.
018	JOB	033	025	Inyama yakhe izakuba ntsha okwedlula ubutsha; abuyele ensukwini zobutsha bakhe.
018	JOB	033	026	Akhuleke kuNkulunkulu, ozakuba lesisa kuye, abone ubuso bakhe ngentokozo; ngoba uzabuyisela emuntwini ukulunga kwakhe.
018	JOB	033	027	Ukhangela ebantwini athi: Ngonile, ngahlanekela okulungileyo, kodwa kakungisizanga.
018	JOB	033	028	Uhlengile umphefumulo wami ekwedluleni egodini, lempilo yami izabona ukukhanya.
018	JOB	033	029	Khangelani, lezizinto uNkulunkulu uyazenza ngomuntu kabili kumbe kathathu,
018	JOB	033	030	ukuze abuyise umphefumulo wakhe egodini, ukuze akhanyiswe ngokukhanya kwabaphilayo.
018	JOB	033	031	Zwana, Jobe, ungilalele, uthule, njalo mina ngikhulume.
018	JOB	033	032	Uba kulamazwi, ungiphendule; khuluma, ngoba ngifisa ukutshengisa ukuthi ulungile.
018	JOB	033	033	Uba kungenjalo, wena ngilalela; thula, njalo ngizakufundisa inhlakanipho.
018	JOB	034	001	Wasephendula uElihu wathi:
018	JOB	034	002	Zwanini amazwi ami, zihlakaniphi, lani zazi, libeke indlebe kimi.
018	JOB	034	003	Ngoba indlebe ihlola amazwi, njengolwanga lunambitha ukudla.
018	JOB	034	004	Asizikhetheleni isahlulelo; sazi phakathi kwethu okuhle.
018	JOB	034	005	Ngoba uJobe uthe: Ngilungile, kodwa uNkulunkulu ususe isahlulelo sami;
018	JOB	034	006	ngiqamba amanga ngimelene lelungelo lami; umtshoko wami kawelapheki, ngaphandle kwesiphambeko.
018	JOB	034	007	Nguwuphi umuntu onjengoJobe? Unatha ukuklolodelwa njengamanzi,
018	JOB	034	008	ahambahambe exukwini labenzi bobubi, ahambe labantu benkohlakalo.
018	JOB	034	009	Ngoba uthe: Kakumsizi umuntu nxa ethokoza ngoNkulunkulu.
018	JOB	034	010	Ngakho, bantu bengqondo, ngilalelani: Kakube khatshana loNkulunkulu ukwenza inkohlakalo, loSomandla ukwenza isiphambeko.
018	JOB	034	011	Ngoba umsebenzi womuntu uzawubuyisela kuye, amenze athole njengendlela yalowo lalowo.
018	JOB	034	012	Yebo, isibili uNkulunkulu kenzi okubi, njalo uSomandla kagobisi isehlulelo.
018	JOB	034	013	Ngubani owambeka phezu komhlaba? Kumbe ngubani owamisa umhlaba wonke?
018	JOB	034	014	Uba ebeka inhliziyo yakhe phezu kwakhe, uzabuthela umoya wakhe lomphefumulo wakhe kuye.
018	JOB	034	015	Inyama yonke ibizaphela kanyekanye, lomuntu abuyele ethulini.
018	JOB	034	016	Uba kulokuqedisisa-ke, zwana lokhu, ubeke indlebe elizwini lamazwi ami.
018	JOB	034	017	Kambe, ozonda isehlulelo ubengabusa yini? Kambe uzamlahla yini olungileyo kakhulu?
018	JOB	034	018	Angatsho yini enkosini: Mkhohlisi; kuziphathamandla: Lina abangelaNkulunkulu?
018	JOB	034	019	Kuye ongemukeli ubuso beziphathamandla, engananzi isinothi phambi komyanga? Ngoba bonke bangumsebenzi wezandla zakhe.
018	JOB	034	020	Bayafa ngesikhatshana; laphakathi kobusuku abantu bayaqhuqhiswa, bedlule; kuzasuswa olamandla kungelasandla.
018	JOB	034	021	Ngoba amehlo akhe aphezu kwendlela zomuntu, uyabona zonke izinyathelo zakhe.
018	JOB	034	022	Kakulamnyama njalo kakulathunzi lokufa lapho abenzi bobubi abangacatsha khona.
018	JOB	034	023	Ngoba kabi lokhu enaka umuntu, ukuthi aye kuNkulunkulu esahlulelweni.
018	JOB	034	024	Uyaphahlaza abalamandla kungahlolwanga, amise abanye endaweni zabo.
018	JOB	034	025	Ngakho uyayazi imisebenzi yabo, uyabagenqula ebusuku, bachotshozwe.
018	JOB	034	026	Uyabatshaya njengababi endaweni yababukelayo.
018	JOB	034	027	Ngenxa yokuthi bephambukile ekumlandeleni, bengananzanga leyodwa yezindlela zakhe,
018	JOB	034	028	baze benza ukukhala komyanga kufike kuye, njalo wakuzwa ukukhala kwabahluphekayo.
018	JOB	034	029	Lapho yena ethulisa, ngubani-ke ongaziphatha ngenkohliso? Lapho efihla ubuso, ngubani-ke ongambona? Loba esizweni loba emuntwini eyedwa.
018	JOB	034	030	Ukuze abantu abangabazenzisi bangabusi, ukuze bangabi yimijibila ebantwini.
018	JOB	034	031	Isibili uthe kuNkulunkulu: Ngithwele isijeziso, kangiyikona.
018	JOB	034	032	Lokhu engingakuboniyo ngifundise wena; uba ngenze okubi kangisayikukwenza futhi.
018	JOB	034	033	Uzaphindisela yini njengokuthanda kwakho, loba uyala, loba wena ukhetha, njalo kungesimi? Wazini-ke? Khuluma.
018	JOB	034	034	Abantu abalokuqedisisa bazakhuluma kimi, lomuntu ohlakaniphileyo uzangizwa.
018	JOB	034	035	UJobe ukhulume engelalwazi, lamazwi akhe kawalanhlakanipho.
018	JOB	034	036	Kungathi ngabe uJobe uyahlolwa kuze kube sekupheleni, ngenxa yempendulo zakhe njengabantu ababi.
018	JOB	034	037	Ngoba esonweni sakhe wengezelela ububi, etshaya izandla phakathi kwethu, esandisa amazwi akhe emelene loNkulunkulu.
018	JOB	035	001	UElihu wasephendula wathi:
018	JOB	035	002	Ukhumbula ukuthi lokhu kuqondile yini? Uthe: Ukulunga kwami kwedlula okukaNkulunkulu.
018	JOB	035	003	Ngoba uthe kusizani kuwe, kungisizani okwedlula isono sami?
018	JOB	035	004	Mina ngizakuphendula, labangane bakho kanye lawe.
018	JOB	035	005	Khangela amazulu ubone; ukhangele amayezi, aphakeme kulawe.
018	JOB	035	006	Uba usona, wenzani kuye? Uba iziphambeko zakho zizinengi, wenzani kuye?
018	JOB	035	007	Uba ulungile, umnikani, kumbe wemukelani esandleni sakho?
018	JOB	035	008	Ububi bakho buthinta umuntu onjengawe, lokulunga kwakho indodana yomuntu.
018	JOB	035	009	Ngenxa yobunengi bencindezelo babenza bakhale; bayakhala ngenxa yengalo yabalamandla.
018	JOB	035	010	Kodwa kakho othi: Ungaphi uNkulunkulu umenzi wami, onika amahubo ebusuku,
018	JOB	035	011	osifundisa okwedlula inyamazana zomhlaba, asenze sihlakaniphe okwedlula inyoni zamazulu?
018	JOB	035	012	Lapho bayakhala, kodwa kaphenduli, ngenxa yokuzigqaja kwababi.
018	JOB	035	013	Isibili uNkulunkulu kayikuzwa ize, loSomandla kayikukunanza.
018	JOB	035	014	Yebo, lanxa usithi: Kawumboni, kanti isahlulelo siphambi kwakhe; ngakho umlindele.
018	JOB	035	015	Kodwa khathesi, ngoba intukuthelo yakhe ingajezisanga, laye kayikwejwayela kakhulu yini ukuziphakamisa?
018	JOB	035	016	Ngakho uJobe uvule umlomo wakhe ngeze, wandisa amazwi engelalwazi.
018	JOB	036	001	UElihu waseqhubeka wathi:
018	JOB	036	002	Ngibekezelela kancinyane, ngizakubonisa ukuthi kuseselamazwi ngoNkulunkulu.
018	JOB	036	003	Ngizathatha ulwazi lwami luvela khatshana, nginike ukulunga kuMenzi wami.
018	JOB	036	004	Ngoba isibili amazwi ami kawayisiwo amanga; opheleleyo elwazini ulawe.
018	JOB	036	005	Khangela, uNkulunkulu ulamandla, njalo keyisi; mkhulu emandleni okuqedisisa.
018	JOB	036	006	Kayekeli omubi aphile, kodwa unika abayanga okulungileyo.
018	JOB	036	007	Kasusi amehlo akhe kolungileyo, kodwa balamakhosi esihlalweni sobukhosi; yebo, uyawahlalisa phakade, abesephakama.
018	JOB	036	008	Njalo uba bebotshiwe ngezibopho, bethunjwe ngezintambo zenhlupheko,
018	JOB	036	009	abesebatshela isenzo sabo, leziphambeko zabo, ukuthi zazilamandla.
018	JOB	036	010	Uyavula indlebe yabo ekulayweni, alaye baphenduke ebubini.
018	JOB	036	011	Uba belalela, bamkhonze, bazachitha insuku zabo kokuhle, leminyaka yabo ezintokozweni.
018	JOB	036	012	Kodwa uba bengalaleli, bazadlula ngomkhonto, baphele bengelalwazi.
018	JOB	036	013	Labangamesabiyo uNkulunkulu ngenhliziyo babuthelela intukuthelo; kabakhali esebabophile.
018	JOB	036	014	Umphefumulo wabo uzafela ebutsheni, lempilo yabo phakathi kwezinkotshana.
018	JOB	036	015	Uzakhulula ohluphekayo ekuhluphekeni kwakhe, avule indlebe yabo ecindezelweni.
018	JOB	036	016	Yebo, lawe wakuhuga ukuthi uphume emlonyeni wocindezelo uye endaweni ebanzi, okungelacindezelo kuyo, lokuphezu kwetafula lakho kuzagcwala amanono.
018	JOB	036	017	Kodwa ugcwalise isigwebo somubi; isigwebo lokulunga kukubambile.
018	JOB	036	018	Qaphela ulaka lungakuhugeli ekuklolodeni, lobukhulu benhlawulo bungakuphambuli.
018	JOB	036	019	Ubengalinganisa inotho yakho, ukuthi ubungebe ecindezelweni, lemizamo yonke elamandla?
018	JOB	036	020	Ungakhefuzeleli lobobusuku bokususwa kwabantu endaweni yabo.
018	JOB	036	021	Qaphela, ungaphendukeli ebubini, ngoba ukhethe lokho kulokuhlupheka.
018	JOB	036	022	Khangela, uNkulunkulu uziphakamisa ngamandla akhe; ngubani ongumfundisi njengaye?
018	JOB	036	023	Ngubani ommisele indlela yakhe? Kumbe ngubani othe: Wenze ububi?
018	JOB	036	024	Khumbula ukuthi ukhulise umsebenzi wakhe, abahlabela ngawo abantu.
018	JOB	036	025	Bonke abantu bayawubona; umuntu uyawukhangela ekhatshana.
018	JOB	036	026	Khangela, uNkulunkulu uphakeme, njalo kasimazi, lenani leminyaka yakhe kayilakuhlolwa.
018	JOB	036	027	Ngoba wenyusa amathonsi amanzi, ahlambulule izulu njengenkungu yawo;
018	JOB	036	028	amayezi alithululela phansi, lithonte kakhulu phezu komuntu.
018	JOB	036	029	Yebo, kukhona yini ongaqedisisa ukwendlaleka kwamayezi, umsindo wedumba lakhe?
018	JOB	036	030	Khangela, wendlala ukukhanya kwakhe phezu kwawo, agubuzele impande zolwandle.
018	JOB	036	031	Ngoba ngawo uyehlulela abantu, anike ukudla ngobunengi.
018	JOB	036	032	Ngezandla usibekela ukukhanya, abesekulaya ngalelo elingena phakathi.
018	JOB	036	033	Umdumo wakhe ubika ngakho, lenkomo ngenkungu eyenyukayo.
018	JOB	037	001	Langenxa yalokho inhliziyo yami iyathuthumela, yeqe endaweni yayo.
018	JOB	037	002	Zwana lokuzwa umdumo welizwi lakhe, lomsindo ophuma emlonyeni wakhe.
018	JOB	037	003	Uyakukhulula ngaphansi kwamazulu wonke, lokukhanya kwakhe kuze kube semikhawulweni yomhlaba.
018	JOB	037	004	Emva kwalokho kubhonga ilizwi, uyaduma ngelizwi lokuphakama kwakhe, angakunqandi lapho kuzwakala ilizwi lakhe.
018	JOB	037	005	UNkulunkulu uyaduma ngelizwi lakhe ngokumangalisayo kakhulu, wenza izinto ezinkulu, esingeziqedisise.
018	JOB	037	006	Ngoba kuliqhwa elikhithikileyo uthi: Woba semhlabeni; lakuzihlambo zezulu, lakuzihlambo zezulu elikhulu lamandla akhe.
018	JOB	037	007	Uyanamathelisa isandla somuntu wonke, ukuze bazi bonke abantu bomsebenzi wakhe.
018	JOB	037	008	Inyamazana ziyangena emihomeni yazo, zihlale ezikhundleni zazo.
018	JOB	037	009	Isivunguzane siphuma ekamelweni leningizimu, lomqando emimoyeni yenyakatho.
018	JOB	037	010	Ngomoya kaNkulunkulu kunikwa ungqwaqwane, lamanzi abanzi abe yilitshe.
018	JOB	037	011	Njalo uthwalisa amayezi ngobumanzi, ahlakaze iyezi lokukhanya kwakhe.
018	JOB	037	012	Njalo lona liyajikajika liphenduka ngokuqondisa kwakhe, ukuze enze konke awalaye khona, ebusweni bomhlaba emhlabathini.
018	JOB	037	013	Loba ngoswazi, loba ngomhlaba wakhe, loba ngomusa, uyakufikisa.
018	JOB	037	014	Beka indlebe kukho, Jobe; mana, unanzelele imisebenzi emangalisayo kaNkulunkulu.
018	JOB	037	015	Uyazi yini ukuthi uNkulunkulu uwalungisa nini, enze ukukhanya kwamayezi akhe kukhanye?
018	JOB	037	016	Uyazi yini ukulengiswa kwamayezi, izimangaliso zopheleleyo elwazini?
018	JOB	037	017	Ukuthi izigqoko zakho zikhudumala njani, ekuthuliseni umhlaba ngomoya weningizimu?
018	JOB	037	018	Uwendlalile yini amayezi kanye laye, aqine njengesibuko esibunjiweyo ngokuncibilikisa?
018	JOB	037	019	Sifundise ukuthi sizakuthini kuye; singeke silungise lutho ngenxa yomnyama.
018	JOB	037	020	Kungalandiswa kuye yini ukuthi ngiyakhuluma? Uba umuntu engakhuluma, isibili uzaginywa.
018	JOB	037	021	Khathesi-ke kabakuboni ukukhanya okubenyezelayo okusemayezini, lapho umoya udlula uwahlambulula.
018	JOB	037	022	Igolide livela enyakatho. KuNkulunkulu kulobukhosi obesabekayo.
018	JOB	037	023	USomandla singemfumane; uphakeme ngamandla, langokwahlulela, njalo mkhulu ngokulunga; kacindezeli.
018	JOB	037	024	Ngakho abantu bayamesaba; kanaki wonke owabahlakaniphileyo ngenhliziyo.
018	JOB	038	001	INkosi yasimphendula uJobe isesivunguzaneni yathi:
018	JOB	038	002	Ngubani lo ofiphaza iseluleko ngamazwi angelalwazi?
018	JOB	038	003	Bopha-ke ukhalo lwakho njengendoda, njalo ngizakubuza, njalo ungenze ngazi.
018	JOB	038	004	Wawungaphi lapho ngimisa izisekelo zomhlaba? Tshono uba usazi ukuqedisisa.
018	JOB	038	005	Ngubani owabeka izilinganiso zawo, uba ukwazi? Kumbe ngubani owelulela intambo yokulinganisa phezu kwawo?
018	JOB	038	006	Izisekelo zawo zamiswa phezu kwani? Kumbe ngubani owabeka ilitshe lawo lengonsi,
018	JOB	038	007	lapho inkanyezi zokusa zahlabela kanyekanye, lamadodana wonke kaNkulunkulu amemeza ngenjabulo?
018	JOB	038	008	Kumbe ngubani owavalela ulwandle ngezivalo, lapho lufohla luphuma esiswini,
018	JOB	038	009	lapho ngimisa iyezi laba yisembatho salo, lomnyama onzima waba yimbeleko yalo?
018	JOB	038	010	Njalo ngaluqumela isimiso, ngamisa imigoqo lezivalo,
018	JOB	038	011	ngathi: Uzafika kuze kube lapha, kodwa ungedluli, lalapha kuzamelana lokuzigqaja kwamagagasi akho.
018	JOB	038	012	Kusukela ensukwini zakho walawula ukusa yini, wenza ukudabuka kokusa ukuthi kwazi indawo yakho,
018	JOB	038	013	ukuthi kubambe imiphetho yomhlaba, ukuze kuthintithe ababi kuwo?
018	JOB	038	014	Kuyaguquka njengebumba lophawu lokunamathisela, kuzimisa njengesembatho.
018	JOB	038	015	Lakwababi ukukhanya kwabo kuyagodlwa, lengalo ephakemeyo iyephulwa.
018	JOB	038	016	Usungenile emithonjeni yolwandle yini, wahamba usiya le lale ekudingeni inziki?
018	JOB	038	017	Amasango okufa wawembulelwa yini, wawabona amasango ethunzi lokufa?
018	JOB	038	018	Uqedisisile yini kuze kube sebubanzini bomhlaba? Tshono uba ukwazi konke.
018	JOB	038	019	Ingaphi indlela lapho okuhlala khona ukukhanya? Lomnyama, ingaphi indawo yawo,
018	JOB	038	020	ukuze ukuse emngceleni wakho, lokuthi uqedisise izindlela zomuzi wakho?
018	JOB	038	021	Uyazi, ngoba wawusuzelwe, lenani lensuku zakho likhulu.
018	JOB	038	022	Usungenile eziphaleni zeliqhwa elikhithikileyo yini, wabona iziphala zesiqhotho,
018	JOB	038	023	engizigodle kuze kube yisikhathi sokuhlupheka, kuze kube lusuku lokulwa lolwempi?
018	JOB	038	024	Ingaphi indlela lapho ukukhanya okwabiwa khona, umoya wempumalanga ohlakazeka khona emhlabeni?
018	JOB	038	025	Ngubani owehlukanisela impophoma indlela yamanzi, lendlela yombane wemidumo,
018	JOB	038	026	ukuthi line emhlabeni lapho okungelamuntu khona, enkangala okungelamuntu kuyo,
018	JOB	038	027	ukusuthisa inkangala legwadule, lokuhlumisa ukuphuma kotshani?
018	JOB	038	028	Izulu liloyise yini, kumbe ngubani owazala amathonsi amazolo?
018	JOB	038	029	Ungqwaqwane waphuma esiswini sikabani? Njalo ngubani owazala iliqhwa lamazulu?
018	JOB	038	030	Amanzi afihlakele njengelitshe, lobuso bokujula bujiyile.
018	JOB	038	031	Ungazibopha yini izibopho zesiLimela, kumbe uthukulule intambo zeziNja?
018	JOB	038	032	Ungakhupha yini izinkanyezi ngesikhathi sazo? Ungakhokhela yini iBhere kanye labantwana balo?
018	JOB	038	033	Uyazazi yini izimiso zamazulu, kumbe ungamisa umbuso wazo emhlabeni?
018	JOB	038	034	Ungaphakamisela yini ilizwi lakho emayezini, ukuthi ubunengi bamanzi bukusibekele?
018	JOB	038	035	Ungathuma yini imibane ukuthi ihambe, ithi kuwe: Khangela, silapha?
018	JOB	038	036	Ngubani owabeka inhlakanipho emibilini? Kumbe ngubani onike ukuqedisisa engqondweni?
018	JOB	038	037	Ngubani ongabala amayezi ngenhlakanipho? Njalo ngubani ongalalisa imbodlela zamazulu,
018	JOB	038	038	lapho uthuli luqina lube yizigaqa, lamagade anamathelane?
018	JOB	038	039	Ungasizingelela yini isilwane ukudla, kumbe usuthise ukulamba kwezilwane ezintsha,
018	JOB	038	040	lapho zicathame emihomeni, zihlala esikhundleni ukuthi zicathame?
018	JOB	038	041	Ngubani olungisela iwabayi ukudla kwalo, lapho amaphuphu alo ekhala kuNkulunkulu, ezulazula ngoba kungelakudla?
018	JOB	039	001	Uyasazi yini isikhathi sokuzala kwamagogo edwala? Uyananzelela yini ukuhelelwa kwezimpala?
018	JOB	039	002	Ungazibala yini inyanga ezizigcwalisayo? Njalo uyasazi yini isikhathi sokuzala kwazo?
018	JOB	039	003	Zigoba, zizale abantwana bazo, zikhuphe imihelo yazo.
018	JOB	039	004	Amazinyane azo aqine akhule egangeni; asuke ahambe, angabuyi kuzo.
018	JOB	039	005	Ngubani owakhupha ubabhemi weganga ekhululekile? Njalo ngubani othukulule izibopho zikababhemi weganga,
018	JOB	039	006	engimmisele inkangala ibe ngumuzi wakhe, lesimunyu sibe zindawo zakhe zokuhlala?
018	JOB	039	007	Uhleka umsindo womuzi, angezwa imisindo yomtshayeli.
018	JOB	039	008	Udinga izintaba ezilidlelo lakhe, edinga elandela konke okuluhlaza.
018	JOB	039	009	Inyathi iyavuma yini ukukusebenzela? Izalala yini esibayeni sakho ebusuku?
018	JOB	039	010	Ungayibophela inyathi yini ngentambo yayo emfolweni? Ingabhuqa yini izihotsha emva kwakho?
018	JOB	039	011	Ungathembela kuyo yini ngoba amandla ayo makhulu? Ungayiyekelela yini umtshikatshika wakho?
018	JOB	039	012	Ungayikholwa yini ukuthi izabuyisa inhlanyelo yakho, njalo iyibuthele ebaleni lokubhulela lakho?
018	JOB	039	013	Impiko zezintshe ziyaphaphazela ngentokozo; kodwa zizimpiko lezinsiba zengabuzane yini?
018	JOB	039	014	Ngoba itshiya amaqanda ayo emhlabathini, iwakhudumeze othulini,
018	JOB	039	015	iyakhohlwa ukuthi unyawo lungawachoboza, lokuthi isilo seganga singawanyathela.
018	JOB	039	016	Iwaphatha kalukhuni amaphuphu ayo, kungathi kawayisiwo awayo; umtshikatshika wayo uyize, ingelakwesaba.
018	JOB	039	017	Ngoba uNkulunkulu wayithathela inhlakanipho, kayabelanga ukuqedisisa.
018	JOB	039	018	Lapho sekuyisikhathi iyaziphakamisela phezulu, ihleke ibhiza lomgadi walo.
018	JOB	039	019	Uzanika yini ibhiza amandla? Uyayigqokisa yini intamo yalo ngomhlonga oyephuzelayo?
018	JOB	039	020	Uyalenza leqe yini njengentethe? Ubukhosi bokukhala kwalo buyesabeka.
018	JOB	039	021	Liyaphanda esihotsheni, lithokoze ngamandla alo, liphume ukuhlangabeza izikhali.
018	JOB	039	022	Liyakuhleka ukwesaba, kalesabi, kaliphenduki phambi kwenkemba.
018	JOB	039	023	Phezu kwalo isamba semitshoko siyakhehlezela, umkhonto ophazimayo lomdikadika.
018	JOB	039	024	Ngokuqhuqha lokufutheka liginye umhlaba; kalikholwa ukuthi ngumsindo wophondo.
018	JOB	039	025	Ekukhaleni kophondo lithi: Aha! Linuke impi ikhatshana, umdumo wezinduna, lokumemeza.
018	JOB	039	026	Ukhozi luyaphapha yini ngokuqedisisa kwakho, luselulela impiko zalo eningizimu?
018	JOB	039	027	Ilinqe liyaqonga ngokulaya kwakho, lakhe isidleke salo engqongeni yini?
018	JOB	039	028	Lihlala lilale ebusuku edwaleni, engqongeni yedwala leyenqaba.
018	JOB	039	029	Lisuka lapho lidinga ukudla; amehlo alo abonela khatshana.
018	JOB	039	030	Lamaphuphu alo azitika ngegazi; lalapho okukhona ababuleweyo likhona.
018	JOB	040	001	INkosi yasiphendula uJobe yathi:
018	JOB	040	002	Ophikisana loSomandla uzamqondisa yini? Osola uNkulunkulu kakuphendule.
018	JOB	040	003	UJobe waseyiphendula iNkosi wathi:
018	JOB	040	004	Khangela, ngiphansi; ngingakuphendula ngithini? Ngibeka isandla sami emlonyeni wami.
018	JOB	040	005	Ngikhulumile kanye, kodwa kangiyikuphendula; kumbe kabili, kodwa kangiyikuqhubeka.
018	JOB	040	006	INkosi yasimphendula uJobe isesivunguzaneni yathi:
018	JOB	040	007	Bopha khathesi ukhalo lwakho njengendoda; ngizakubuza, ubusungazisa.
018	JOB	040	008	Isibili, uzachitha isahlulelo sami yini? Ungilahle, ukuze ube ngolungileyo yini?
018	JOB	040	009	Njalo ulengalo yini njengoNkulunkulu? Kumbe ungaduma yini ngelizwi njengaye?
018	JOB	040	010	Khathesi zicecise ngobukhosi lokuphakama, uzembese ngodumo lenkazimulo.
018	JOB	040	011	Usabalalise intukuthelo zolaka lwakho, ukhangele wonke ozigqajayo, umthobise.
018	JOB	040	012	Khangela wonke ozigqajayo, umehlisele phansi, unyathelele phansi ababi endaweni yabo.
018	JOB	040	013	Ubafihle bonke ethulini, ubophe ubuso babo ngasese.
018	JOB	040	014	Khona lami ngizavuma kuwe, ukuthi isandla sakho sokunene singakusindisa.
018	JOB	040	015	Ake ukhangele imvubu engayenza kanye lawe; idla utshani njengenkabi.
018	JOB	040	016	Ake ukhangele, amandla ayo asekhalweni lwayo, lokuqina kwayo kusemisipheni yesisu sayo.
018	JOB	040	017	Iyagobisa umsila wayo njengomsedari; imisipha yemilenze yayo yelukene.
018	JOB	040	018	Amathambo ayo anjengempompi zethusi, amathambo ayo anjengemigoqo yensimbi.
018	JOB	040	019	Ingeyokuqala yezindlela zikaNkulunkulu; owayenzayo wasondeza inkemba yayo.
018	JOB	040	020	Ngoba intaba ziyayivezela ukudla, lapho okudlala khona inyamazana zonke zeganga.
018	JOB	040	021	Ilala phansi kwesihlahla esiluhlaza, ekusithekeni kwemihlanga lamaxhaphozi.
018	JOB	040	022	Izihlahla eziluhlaza ziyayisibekela ngomthunzi wazo; imidubu yesifula iyayiphahla.
018	JOB	040	023	Khangela, umfula uyayicindezela, kayiphangisi; ilesibindi lanxa iJordani ingaphuphumela emlonyeni wayo.
018	JOB	040	024	Ongayibamba yini ngamehlo ayo? Ongahlaba yini amakhala ayo ngemijibila?
018	JOB	041	001	Ungamhudula yini uLeviyathani ngengwegwe, kumbe ulimi lwakhe ngentambo oyenza itshone?
018	JOB	041	002	Ungafaka yini umhlanga ekhaleni lakhe, kumbe ubhoboze umhlathi wakhe ngameva?
018	JOB	041	003	Uzakuncenga kanengi yini? Uzakhuluma lawe ngathambileyo yini?
018	JOB	041	004	Uzakwenza isivumelwano lawe yini? Uzamthatha abe yinceku kokuphela yini?
018	JOB	041	005	Uzadlala laye yini njengenyoni? Kumbe uzambophela amantombazana akho yini?
018	JOB	041	006	Abathengi bazathengiselana ngaye yini? Bazakwehlukaniselana ngaye yini phakathi kwabathengisayo?
018	JOB	041	007	Uzagcwalisa yini isikhumba sakhe ngezinhlendla, lekhanda lakhe ngemikhonto yenhlanzi?
018	JOB	041	008	Beka isandla sakho phezu kwakhe, khumbula impi, ungakwenzi futhi.
018	JOB	041	009	Khangela, ithemba lakhe lizakuba ngamanga. Laye uzaphoselwa phansi yini ngokumbona?
018	JOB	041	010	Kakho olesihluku sokuthi amvuse. Ngubani-ke yena ongazimisa phambi kwami?
018	JOB	041	011	Ngubani onganduleleyo ukuthi ngimbhadale? Okungaphansi kwamazulu wonke ngokwami.
018	JOB	041	012	Kangiyikuthula mayelana lezitho zakhe, lendaba yamandla akhe, lobuhle besimo sakhe.
018	JOB	041	013	Ngubani ongabonakalisa ubuso besembatho sakhe? Ngubani ongeza lamatomu akhe aphindwe kabili?
018	JOB	041	014	Ngubani ongavula iminyango yobuso bakhe? Amazinyo akhe ayesabeka inhlangothi zonke.
018	JOB	041	015	Imizila yamahawu akhe ilokuziqhenya, ivalelwe ngophawu oluqinisiweyo.
018	JOB	041	016	Elinye lisondele kwelinye, ukuze kungangeni umoya phakathi kwawo.
018	JOB	041	017	Ahlangene, abambana, ukuze angehlukaniswa.
018	JOB	041	018	Ukuthimula kwakhe kuphazima ukukhanya, lamehlo akhe anjengenkophe zemadabukakusa.
018	JOB	041	019	Emlonyeni wakhe kuphuma izihlanti, ziqhatshe ziphume inhlansi zomlilo.
018	JOB	041	020	Emakhaleni akhe kuphuma intuthu, njengembiza ebilayo lemihlanga.
018	JOB	041	021	Umoya wakhe uvuthela amalahle, lelangabi liphume emlonyeni wakhe.
018	JOB	041	022	Entanyeni yakhe kuhlala amandla, laphambi kwakhe kugiya usizi.
018	JOB	041	023	Amavinqo enyama yakhe anamathelene, aqinile kuye, kawanyikinyeki.
018	JOB	041	024	Inhliziyo yakhe iqinile njengelitshe, yebo, ilukhuni njengelitshe lokuchola elingaphansi.
018	JOB	041	025	Ekuvukeni kwakhe amaqhawe ayesaba, ngenxa yokwephulwa bayazihlambulula.
018	JOB	041	026	Ofinyelela kuye ngenkemba angeme, umkhonto, umtshoko, lomdikadika.
018	JOB	041	027	Uthatha insimbi njengotshani, ithusi njengogodo olubolileyo.
018	JOB	041	028	Umtshoko kawumenzi abaleke; amatshe esavutha aphendulwa nguye abe yizibi.
018	JOB	041	029	Isagila sitshaywa njengezibi; uhleka ukugenqeza komdikadika.
018	JOB	041	030	Ngaphansi kwakhe kulendengezi ezibukhali; wendlala izinto ezibukhali odakeni.
018	JOB	041	031	Wenza inziki zibile njengembiza, enze ulwandle lube njengembiza yamafutha.
018	JOB	041	032	Ngemva kwakhe wenza indlela ikhanye; inziki zingathiwa ziyimpunga.
018	JOB	041	033	Kakukho emhlabeni okufanana laye, owenziwa angabi lokwesaba.
018	JOB	041	034	Ukhangela konke okuphakemeyo; uyinkosi phezu kwabo bonke abantwana bokuzigqaja.
018	JOB	042	001	UJobe waseyiphendula iNkosi wathi:
018	JOB	042	002	Ngiyazi ukuthi ungakwenza konke, lokuthi kakulacebo elingavinjelwa kuwe.
018	JOB	042	003	Ngubani lo ofiphaza iseluleko engelalwazi? Ngakho ngikhulumile lokho ebengingakuqedisisi, izinto ezimangalisayo kakhulu kimi, ebengingazazi.
018	JOB	042	004	Ake uzwe, ngizakhuluma mina. Ngizakubuza, njalo wenze ngazi.
018	JOB	042	005	Ngokuzwa kwendlebe ngikuzwile, kodwa khathesi ilihlo lami liyakubona.
018	JOB	042	006	Ngakho-ke ngiyazinenga, ngiyaphenduka ethulini lemlotheni.
018	JOB	042	007	Kwasekusithi iNkosi isikhulume lamazwi kuJobe, iNkosi yathi kuElifazi umThemani: Ulaka lwami luyavutha kuwe lakubangane bakho ababili, ngoba kalikhulumanga ngami okuqondileyo njengenceku yami uJobe.
018	JOB	042	008	Ngakho-ke zithatheleni amajongosi ayisikhombisa lenqama eziyisikhombisa, liye encekwini yami uJobe, lizinikelele umnikelo wokutshiswa, njalo uJobe inceku yami uzalikhulekela; ngoba isibili ngizakwemukela ubuso bakhe, ukuze ngingenzi kini njengobuthutha benu; ngoba kalikhulumanga ngami okuqondileyo njengenceku yami uJobe.
018	JOB	042	009	Ngakho bahamba oElifazi umThemani loBilidadi umShuhi loZofari umNahama, benza njengokutsho kweNkosi kubo; njalo iNkosi yemukela ubuso bukaJobe.
018	JOB	042	010	INkosi yasiphendula ukuthunjwa kukaJobe esekhulekele abangane bakhe; njalo iNkosi yengezelela konke uJobe ayelakho kuze kuphindwe kabili.
018	JOB	042	011	Kwasekufika kuye bonke abafowabo labo bonke odadewabo, labo bonke ababemazi mandulo, badla isinkwa laye endlini yakhe, bamkhalela, bamduduza ngakho konke okubi iNkosi eyayimehlisele khona; bamnika ngulowo lalowo uhlamvu lwemali, langulowo lalowo isongo legolide.
018	JOB	042	012	INkosi yasibusisa isiphetho sikaJobe okwedlula ukuqala kwakhe; ngoba waba lezimvu ezizinkulungwane ezilitshumi lane, lamakamela azinkulungwane eziyisithupha, lezipane zenkabi eziyinkulungwane, labobabhemi abasikazi abayinkulungwane.
018	JOB	042	013	Wasesiba lamadodana ayisikhombisa lamadodakazi amathathu.
018	JOB	042	014	Wasebiza ibizo leyokuqala wathi nguJemima, lebizo leyesibili wathi nguKeziya, lebizo leyesithathu wathi nguKereni-Hapuki.
018	JOB	042	015	Njalo kakutholakalanga abesifazana abahle njengamadodakazi kaJobe elizweni lonke; loyise wawanika ilifa phakathi kwabanewabo.
018	JOB	042	016	Lemva kwalokho uJobe waphila iminyaka elikhulu lamatshumi amane; wabona amadodana akhe, lamadodana amadodana akhe, kwaze kwaba yizizukulwana ezine.
018	JOB	042	017	UJobe wasesifa, emdala, enele ngezinsuku.
#
# BOOK	019	PSA	Psalms	Amahubo
019	PSA	001	001	Ubusisiwe umuntu ongahambi ngeseluleko sababi, ongemi endleleni yezoni, ongahlali esihlalweni sabagconayo;
019	PSA	001	002	kodwa intokozo yakhe isemlayweni weNkosi, uzindla ngomlayo wayo emini lebusuku.
019	PSA	001	003	Njalo uzakuba njengesihlahla esihlanyelwe emifuleni yamanzi, esithela isithelo saso ngesikhathi saso, ohlamvu laso kaliyikubuna; lakho konke akwenzayo kuzaphumelela.
019	PSA	001	004	Ababi kabanjalo, kodwa banjengamakhoba umoya owaphephulayo.
019	PSA	001	005	Ngakho ababi kabayikuma ekwahlulelweni, lezoni enhlanganweni yabalungileyo.
019	PSA	001	006	Ngoba iNkosi iyayazi indlela yabalungileyo, kodwa indlela yababi izabhubha.
019	PSA	002	001	Kungani izizwe zixokozela, labantu benakana okuyize?
019	PSA	002	002	Amakhosi omhlaba azimisela, lababusi benza ugobe ndawonye bemelene leNkosi njalo bemelene logcotshiweyo wayo, besithi:
019	PSA	002	003	Asiqamule izibopho zabo, silahle intambo zabo zisuke kithi.
019	PSA	002	004	Ohlezi emazulwini uzahleka, iNkosi izabahleka usulu.
019	PSA	002	005	Khona izakhuluma kubo entukuthelweni yayo, ibethuse ngokuvutha kolaka lwayo.
019	PSA	002	006	Kube kanti mina ngibekile iNkosi yami phezu kweZiyoni, intaba yami engcwele.
019	PSA	002	007	Ngizalandisa ngesimiso: INkosi ithe kimi: Wena uyiNdodana yami, lamuhla ngikuzele.
019	PSA	002	008	Cela kimi, ngizanika izizwe zibe yilifa lakho, lemikhawulo yomhlaba ibe yimfuyo yakho.
019	PSA	002	009	Uzazephula ngentonga yensimbi, uziphahlaze njengembiza yebumba.
019	PSA	002	010	Ngakho-ke hlakaniphani makhosi, lilayeke bahluleli bomhlaba.
019	PSA	002	011	Ikhonzeni iNkosi ngokwesaba, lithokoze ngokuthuthumela,
019	PSA	002	012	liyange iNdodana, hlezi ithukuthele, libhubhe endleleni, nxa ulaka lwayo seluvutha kancinyane. Babusisiwe bonke abaphephela kuyo.
019	PSA	003	001	Nkosi, zande kangakanani izitha zami! Banengi abangivukelayo.
019	PSA	003	002	Banengi abathi ngomphefumulo wami: Kakulasindiso lwakhe kuNkulunkulu. (Sela)
019	PSA	003	003	Kodwa wena Nkosi, uyisihlangu sami, udumo lwami, lomphakamisi wekhanda lami.
019	PSA	003	004	Ngakhala ngelizwi lami eNkosini, yasingiphendula isentabeni yayo engcwele. (Sela)
019	PSA	003	005	Mina ngalala phansi, ngajumeka; ngavuka, ngoba iNkosi yangisekela.
019	PSA	003	006	Kangiyikwesaba izinkulungwane ezilitshumi zabantu abangihanqileyo bemelana lami.
019	PSA	003	007	Vuka, Nkosi! Ngisindisa, Nkulunkulu wami. Ngoba zonke izitha zami uzitshayile emhlathini, wephule amazinyo ababi.
019	PSA	003	008	Usindiso ngolweNkosi. Isibusiso sakho siphezu kwabantu bakho. (Sela)
019	PSA	004	001	Ngiphendula ekukhaleni kwami, Nkulunkulu wokulunga kwami. Ekucindezelweni wangenzela indawo ebanzi. Woba lomusa kimi, uzwe umkhuleko wami.
019	PSA	004	002	Madodana abantu, koze kube nini liphendula udumo lwami lube lihlazo, lithanda okuyize, lidinga amanga? (Sela)
019	PSA	004	003	Kodwa yazini ukuthi iNkosi izehlukanisele owesaba uNkulunkulu; iNkosi iyangizwa lapho ngikhala kuyo.
019	PSA	004	004	Thuthumelani, lingoni; khulumani lenhliziyo yenu embhedeni wenu, lithule. (Sela)
019	PSA	004	005	Nikelani imihlatshelo yokulunga, lithembe eNkosini.
019	PSA	004	006	Banengi abathi: Ngubani ozasitshengisa okuhle? Nkosi, phakamisela ukukhanya kobuso bakho phezu kwethu.
019	PSA	004	007	Ubeke intokozo enhliziyweni yami okwedlula isikhathi lapho amabele abo lewayini labo elitsha kwandile.
019	PSA	004	008	Ngizacambalala ngokuthula, khonokho ngilale ubuthongo, ngoba wena Nkosi wedwa uyangihlalisa ngokulondolozeka.
019	PSA	005	001	Beka indlebe emazwini ami, Nkosi; unanzelele ukububula kwami.
019	PSA	005	002	Lalela ilizwi lokukhala kwami, Nkosi yami loNkulunkulu wami; ngoba ngikhuleka kuwe.
019	PSA	005	003	Nkosi, ekuseni uzalizwa ilizwi lami; ekuseni ngizahlela umkhuleko wami ngakuwe, ngilinde.
019	PSA	005	004	Ngoba kawusuye uNkulunkulu othokoza ebubini; omubi kayikuhlala lawe.
019	PSA	005	005	Abazikhukhumezayo kabayikuma phambi kwamehlo akho; uzonda bonke abenzi bobubi.
019	PSA	005	006	Uzababhubhisa abaqamba amanga. INkosi iyamenyanya umuntu wegazi lenkohliso.
019	PSA	005	007	Kodwa mina, ngizangena endlini yakho ngobukhulu besihawu sakho, ngikhothame ngikhangele ethempelini lakho elingcwele, ngokukwesaba.
019	PSA	005	008	Nkosi, ngikhokhelele ekulungeni kwakho ngenxa yezitha zami, wenze indlela yakho iqonde phambi kwami.
019	PSA	005	009	Ngoba kalikho iqiniso emlonyeni wazo, ingaphakathi yazo izinkohlakalo; umphimbo wazo ulingcwaba elivulekileyo, zibamba amehlo ngolimi lwazo.
019	PSA	005	010	Tshono uthi zilecala, Nkulunkulu, kaziwe ngamacebo azo; uzilahle ngenxa yobunengi beziphambeko zazo, ngoba zikuvukele.
019	PSA	005	011	Kodwa kabathabe bonke abathembela kuwe, bamemeze kokuphela ngentokozo, ngoba ubavikele; lalabo abathanda ibizo lakho kabajabule kuwe.
019	PSA	005	012	Ngoba wena Nkosi, uzabusisa olungileyo, uzamhanqa ngomusa njengesihlangu esikhulu.
019	PSA	006	001	Nkosi, ungangikhuzi entukuthelweni yakho, ungangijezisi ekuvutheni kolaka lwakho.
019	PSA	006	002	Woba lomusa kimi, Nkosi, ngoba ngibuthakathaka. Nkosi, ngisilisa mina, ngoba amathambo ami ayakhathazeka.
019	PSA	006	003	Lomphefumulo wami ukhathazekile kakhulu: Kodwa wena, Nkosi, koze kube nini?
019	PSA	006	004	Phenduka, Nkosi, khulula umphefumulo wami; ungisindise ngenxa yomusa wakho.
019	PSA	006	005	Ngoba ekufeni kakukho ukukukhumbula; engcwabeni ngubani ozakubonga?
019	PSA	006	006	Ngikhathele yikububula kwami; ubusuku bonke ngintshezisa icansi lami, ngezinyembezi zami ngimanzise umbheda wami.
019	PSA	006	007	Ilihlo lami lidliwe ngenxa yosizi, liyaguga ngenxa yezitha zami zonke.
019	PSA	006	008	Sukani kimi, lonke benzi bobubi, ngoba iNkosi izwile ilizwi lokulila kwami.
019	PSA	006	009	INkosi izwile ukuncenga kwami; iNkosi izakwemukela umkhuleko wami.
019	PSA	006	010	Zonke izitha zami zizayangeka zitshaywe luvalo kakhulu; zizaphenduka, zihle ziyangeke.
019	PSA	007	001	Nkosi, Nkulunkulu wami, ngiyathembela kuwe; ngisindisa kubo bonke abangizingelayo, ungikhulule.
019	PSA	007	002	Hlezi adabule umphefumulo wami njengesilwane, edabudabula, kungekho okhululayo.
019	PSA	007	003	Nkosi, Nkulunkulu wami, uba ngikwenzile lokhu, uba kukhona okubi ezandleni zami,
019	PSA	007	004	uba ngiphindisele okubi kosekuthuleni lami (kuphela ngaphanga oyisitha sami ngaphandle kwesizatho),
019	PSA	007	005	isitha kasizingele umphefumulo wami, siwufice, siyinyathelele impilo yami emhlabathini, senze udumo lwami luhlale ethulini. (Sela)
019	PSA	007	006	Vuka, Nkosi, ngolaka lwakho, ziphakamise ngenxa yentukuthelo yezitha zami; vuka ungimele; ulayile isahlulelo.
019	PSA	007	007	Ngakho inhlangano yezizwe izakuhanqa; buya ngaphezulu phezu kwayo.
019	PSA	007	008	INkosi izakwahlulela izizwe. Ngahlulela, Nkosi, njengokulunga kwami lanjengobuqotho bami obukimi.
019	PSA	007	009	Ake buphele ububi bababi, kodwa umqinise olungileyo, ngoba ohlola inhliziyo lezinso nguNkulunkulu olungileyo.
019	PSA	007	010	Isihlangu sami sikuNkulunkulu osindisa abaqotho enhliziyweni.
019	PSA	007	011	UNkulunkulu ngumahluleli olungileyo, njalo nguNkulunkulu othukuthelela omubi insuku zonke.
019	PSA	007	012	Uba engaphenduki, uzalola inkemba yakhe; useligobile idandili lakhe walilungisa.
019	PSA	007	013	Usemlungisele izikhali zokufa, wenzela abazingeli imitshoko yakhe etshisayo.
019	PSA	007	014	Khangela, uhelelwa ngobubi, akhulelwe yikona, azale amanga.
019	PSA	007	015	Agebhe umgodi awugubhe, abesewela egodini alenzileyo.
019	PSA	007	016	Ububi bakhe buzabuyela phezu kwekhanda lakhe, lodlame lwakhe lwehlele enkanda yakhe.
019	PSA	007	017	Ngizayidumisa iNkosi njengokulunga kwayo, ngihlabelele ibizo leNkosi ephezu konke.
019	PSA	008	001	Nkosi, Nkosi yethu, lilenkazimulo kangakanani ibizo lakho emhlabeni wonke! Omise ubukhosi bakho ngaphezu kwamazulu.
019	PSA	008	002	Emlonyeni wezingane lowabamunyayo umisile amandla ngenxa yezitha zakho, ukuze uthulise isitha lomphindiseli.
019	PSA	008	003	Lapho ngikhangela amazulu akho, umsebenzi weminwe yakho, inyanga lenkanyezi owazimisayo,
019	PSA	008	004	uyini umuntu ukuthi umkhumbule, lendodana yomuntu ukuthi uyihambele?
019	PSA	008	005	Kanti wamenza waba ngaphansi kancinyane kulengilosi, wamethwesa umqhele wobukhosi lodumo.
019	PSA	008	006	Wamenza wabusa phezu kwemisebenzi yezandla zakho, konke wakubeka ngaphansi kwenyawo zakhe,
019	PSA	008	007	izimvu lenkabi zonke, kanye lezinyamazana zeganga,
019	PSA	008	008	inyoni zamazulu, lezinhlanzi zolwandle, okudlula ezindleleni zenlwandle.
019	PSA	008	009	Nkosi, Nkosi yethu, lilenkazimulo kangakani ibizo lakho emhlabeni wonke!
019	PSA	009	001	Ngizakudumisa, Nkosi, ngenhliziyo yami yonke, ngilandise zonke izimangaliso zakho.
019	PSA	009	002	Ngizathaba ngithokoze kuwe, ngihlabele indumiso ebizweni lakho, wena oPhezukonke.
019	PSA	009	003	Lapho izitha zami zibuyela emuva, zizakuwa, zibhubhe phambi kwakho.
019	PSA	009	004	Ngoba ulimele ilungelo lami lodaba lwami, wahlala esihlalweni sobukhosi, wahlulela ngokulungileyo.
019	PSA	009	005	Uzikhuzile izizwe, wabhubhisa omubi; walesula ibizo labo kuze kube nini lanini.
019	PSA	009	006	Izitha ziphelile, izincithakalo eziphakade; uyidilizile imizi; ukukhunjulwa kwabo kubhubhe kanye labo.
019	PSA	009	007	Kodwa iNkosi izahlala kuze kube phakade, isihlalo sayo sobukhosi isilungisele isahlulelo.
019	PSA	009	008	Yona-ke izawahlulela umhlaba ngokulunga, ibagwebe abantu ngokuqonda.
019	PSA	009	009	Njalo iNkosi izakuba yisiphephelo socindezelweyo, isiphephelo ngezikhathi zokuhlupheka.
019	PSA	009	010	Labalaziyo ibizo lakho bazathemba kuwe, ngoba wena Nkosi, kawubatshiyanga abakudingayo.
019	PSA	009	011	Hlabelani indumiso eNkosini ehlezi eZiyoni, limemezele phakathi kwabantu izenzo zayo.
019	PSA	009	012	Nxa idinga igazi, iyabakhumbula, kayikhohlwa ukukhala kwabahlutshwayo.
019	PSA	009	013	Woba lomusa kimi, Nkosi, ubone uhlupho lwami oluvela kwabangizondayo, wena ongiphakamisayo emasangweni okufa,
019	PSA	009	014	ukuze ngilandise yonke indumiso yakho emasangweni endodakazi yeZiyoni, ngithokoze kusindiso lwakho.
019	PSA	009	015	Izizwe zitshone emgodini ezawenzayo, embuleni ezalithiyayo unyawo lwazo lubanjiwe.
019	PSA	009	016	INkosi izazisile, yenza isahlulelo; omubi uthiywe emsebenzini wezandla zakhe. Higayoni. (Sela)
019	PSA	009	017	Abakhohlakeleyo bazabuyela esihogweni, zonke izizwe ezimkhohlwayo uNkulunkulu.
019	PSA	009	018	Ngoba oswelayo kayikukhohlakala kokuphela; ithemba labayanga kaliyikunyamalala phakade.
019	PSA	009	019	Vuka, Nkosi, umuntu kanganqobi; izizwe kazigwetshwe phambi kwakho.
019	PSA	009	020	Zitshayise ngovalo, Nkosi, izizwe kazikwazi ukuthi zingabantu nje. (Sela)
019	PSA	010	001	Nkosi, umeleni khatshana? Ucatshelani ezikhathini zokuhlupheka?
019	PSA	010	002	Omubi ekuzigqajeni uyamzingelisisa umyanga; kababanjwe ngamagobe abawacebileyo.
019	PSA	010	003	Ngoba omubi uyazikhukhumeza ngesifiso somphefumulo wakhe, uyasibusisa isihwaba, ayeyise iNkosi.
019	PSA	010	004	Omubi, ngokuzigqaja kobuso bakhe uthi: Kakubizi; kakho uNkulunkulu emicabangweni yakhe yonke.
019	PSA	010	005	Indlela zakhe ziqinile isikhathi sonke; izahlulelo zakho ziphakeme zikhatshana laye; izitha zakhe zonke uyazivuthela.
019	PSA	010	006	Uthi enhliziyweni yakhe: Kangiyikunyikinywa; ngoba esizukulwaneni lesizukulwana kangiyikuba sebunzimeni.
019	PSA	010	007	Umlomo wakhe ugcwele ukuthuka lezinkohliso lobuqili; ngaphansi kolimi lwakhe kukhona ukona lobubi.
019	PSA	010	008	Uhlezi endaweni yokucathama yemizi, ezindaweni ezisithekileyo ubulala ongelacala; amehlo akhe akhangele othithibeleyo ngasese.
019	PSA	010	009	Uyacatsha ekusithekeni njengesilwane ebhalwini lwaso; ucatshela ukumbamba ongumyanga, uyabamba ongumyanga ngokumhudulela embuleni lakhe.
019	PSA	010	010	Uyaqutha, uyakhothama, njalo umyanga awe ngokulamandla kwakhe.
019	PSA	010	011	Uthi enhliziyweni yakhe: UNkulunkulu ukhohliwe, ufihle ubuso bakhe, kasoze abone lanini.
019	PSA	010	012	Sukuma, Nkosi! Nkulunkulu, phakamisa isandla sakho, ungabakhohlwa abahluphekayo.
019	PSA	010	013	Kungani omubi edelela uNkulunkulu? Uthi enhliziyweni yakhe: Kawuyikukubiza.
019	PSA	010	014	Uyabona, ngoba wena uyakhangela ububi lenhlupheko, ukukubeka esandleni sakho. Umyanga uyazinikela kuwe; wena ungumsizi wezintandane.
019	PSA	010	015	Yephula ingalo yokhohlakeleyo lomubi; dinga inkohlakalo yakhe ukuze ungabe usayithola.
019	PSA	010	016	UJehova yiNkosi kuze kube nini lanini; izizwe zibhubhile elizweni layo.
019	PSA	010	017	Nkosi, uzwile isifiso sabathobekileyo, uzaqinisa inhliziyo yabo, wenze indlebe yakho izwe,
019	PSA	010	018	ukwahlulela intandane locindezelweyo, ukuze umuntu wasemhlabeni angabe esesabeka.
019	PSA	011	001	Ngithembela eNkosini. Lingatsho njani emphefumulweni wami: Balekela entabeni yenu njengenyoni.
019	PSA	011	002	Ngoba, khangela, ababi bayagobisa idandili, balungisa umtshoko wabo entanjeni, ukuze batshoke emnyameni abaqotho ngenhliziyo.
019	PSA	011	003	Nxa izisekelo zidilizwa, angenzani olungileyo?
019	PSA	011	004	INkosi isethempelini layo elingcwele; iNkosi, isihlalo sayo sobukhosi sisemazulwini; amehlo ayo ayakhangela, inkophe zayo ziyahlola, abantwana babantu.
019	PSA	011	005	INkosi iyamhlola olungileyo, kodwa omubi lothanda ubudlwangudlwangu, umphefumulo wayo uyamzonda.
019	PSA	011	006	Uzanisa phezu kwababi imijibila, umlilo, lesolufa, lomoya otshisayo, kuzakuba yisabelo senkezo yabo.
019	PSA	011	007	Ngoba ilungile iNkosi, iyathanda ukulunga; ubuso bayo buyabona oqotho.
019	PSA	012	001	Siza, Nkosi, ngoba owesaba uNkulunkulu kasekho, ngoba abathembekileyo banyamalele basuka ebantwaneni babantu.
019	PSA	012	002	Bakhuluma okuyize, ngulowo lalowo lomakhelwane wakhe; indebe ezilalisayo, bakhuluma nganhliziyombili.
019	PSA	012	003	INkosi izaquma zonke indebe ezilalisayo, ulimi olukhuluma izinto zokuzidla;
019	PSA	012	004	abathi: Sizanqoba ngolimi lwethu, indebe zethu ngezethu; ngubani oyinkosi phezu kwethu?
019	PSA	012	005	Ngenxa yokubandezelwa kwabayanga, ngenxa yokububula kwabaswelayo, sengizavuka, kutsho iNkosi. Ngizabeka ekulondolozekeni amvuthelayo.
019	PSA	012	006	Amazwi eNkosi angamazwi ahlambulukileyo, isiliva esizanywe esithandweni senhlabathi, sihlanjululwe kasikhombisa.
019	PSA	012	007	Wena, Nkosi, uzabagcina, ubavikele kulesisizukulwana kuze kube nininini.
019	PSA	012	008	Ababi bayahambahamba inhlangothi zonke, lapho amanyala ephakanyiswa phakathi kwabantwana babantu.
019	PSA	013	001	Koze kube nini, Nkosi, ungikhohlwa kokuphela? Koze kube nini ungifihlela ubuso bakho?
019	PSA	013	002	Koze kube nini ngizicebisa emphefumulweni wami, ngilosizi enhliziyweni yami insuku zonke? Koze kube nini isitha sami siphakanyiswa phezu kwami?
019	PSA	013	003	Khangela, ungiphendule, Nkosi, Nkulunkulu wami; khanyisa amehlo ami hlezi ngilale ubuthongo bokufa,
019	PSA	013	004	hlezi isitha sami sithi: Sengimehlule; labangihluphayo bathokoze lapho nginyikinywa.
019	PSA	013	005	Kodwa mina ngithembele emuseni wakho, inhliziyo yami izathaba ngosindiso lwakho.
019	PSA	013	006	Ngizayihlabelela iNkosi, ngoba ingenzele okuhle kakhulu.
019	PSA	014	001	Isithutha sithi enhliziyweni yaso: KakulaNkulunkulu. Bonakele, benza imisebenzi eyenyanyekayo; kakho owenza okuhle.
019	PSA	014	002	INkosi yakhangela phansi isemazulwini phezu kwabantwana babantu, ukubona ukuthi ukhona yini oqedisisayo, odinga uNkulunkulu.
019	PSA	014	003	Baphambukile bonke, bebonke bonakele; kakho owenza okuhle, kakho loyedwa.
019	PSA	014	004	Kabazi yini bonke abenza okubi, abadla abantu bami njengoba besidla isinkwa? Kabayibizi iNkosi.
019	PSA	014	005	Lapho besaba lokwesaba, ngoba uNkulunkulu usesizukulwaneni solungileyo.
019	PSA	014	006	Liliyangisile icebo lomyanga, ngoba iNkosi iyisiphephelo sakhe.
019	PSA	014	007	Kungathi usindiso lukaIsrayeli lungavela eZiyoni! Lapho iNkosi ibuyisa ukuthunjwa kwabantu bayo, uJakobe uzathaba, uIsrayeli athokoze.
019	PSA	015	001	Nkosi, ngubani ozahlala ethenteni lakho? Ngubani ozakwakha entabeni yakho engcwele?
019	PSA	015	002	Ngulowo ohamba ngobuqotho, lowenza okulungileyo, lokhuluma iqiniso enhliziyweni yakhe,
019	PSA	015	003	ongahlebiyo ngolimi lwakhe, ongenzi okubi kumngane wakhe, longaphakamiseli umakhelwane wakhe ihlazo;
019	PSA	015	004	olahliweyo uyenyanyeka emehlweni akhe, kodwa uyabahlonipha abayesabayo iNkosi; ofunga ngokuzilimaza, kodwa kaphenduki,
019	PSA	015	005	onganiki imali yakhe ukuthi azuze inzuzo, longemukeli umvuzo wokuthengwa ngongelacala. Owenza lezizinto kayikunyikinywa kuze kube nininini.
019	PSA	016	001	Ngilondoloza, Nkulunkulu, ngoba ngithembela kuwe.
019	PSA	016	002	Ngithe eNkosini: UyiNkosi yami, ukulunga kwami kakufiki kuwe.
019	PSA	016	003	Kodwa kubangcwele abasemhlabeni, labahlekazi, ontokozo yami yonke ikubo.
019	PSA	016	004	Zizakwanda insizi zabagijimela omunye unkulunkulu; kangiyikunikela iminikelo yabo yokunathwayo yegazi; lamabizo abo kangiyikuwaphatha endebeni zami.
019	PSA	016	005	INkosi iyisabelo selifa lami lesenkezo yami; wena uphethe isabelo sami.
019	PSA	016	006	Imizila iwele kimi ezindaweni ezithokozisayo; yebo, ngilelifa elibukekayo.
019	PSA	016	007	Ngizayibonga iNkosi engelulekayo; lebusuku izinso zami ziyangiqondisa.
019	PSA	016	008	Ngibekile iNkosi phambi kwami njalonjalo; ngoba ingakwesokunene sami, kangiyikunyikinywa.
019	PSA	016	009	Ngakho inhliziyo yami iyathokoza, lodumo lwami luyajabula, lenyama yami izahlala ivikelekile.
019	PSA	016	010	Ngoba kawutshiyanga umphefumulo wami esihogweni, njalo kawuyikunikela ongcwele wakho ukuthi abone ukubola.
019	PSA	016	011	Uzangazisa indlela yempilo; ukugcwala kwentokozo kusebukhoneni bakho, ngakwesokunene sakho kukhona izinjabulo phakade.
019	PSA	017	001	Zwana ukulunga, Nkosi, ulalele ukukhala kwami; ubeke indlebe emkhulekweni wami ongaphumi ezindebeni ezilenkohliso.
019	PSA	017	002	Ukwahlulelwa kwami kakuphume ebukhoneni bakho, amehlo akho kawabone izinto eziqondileyo.
019	PSA	017	003	Uyilingile inhliziyo yami, wangihambela ebusuku; ungihlolile, kawuficanga lutho; ngihlosile, umlomo wami kawuyikuphambuka.
019	PSA	017	004	Mayelana lezenzo zabantu, ngelizwi lendebe zakho, mina ngizinqandile ezindleleni zomchithi,
019	PSA	017	005	ukusekela izinyathelo zami emikhondweni yakho, ukuze inyawo zami zingatsheleli.
019	PSA	017	006	Mina ngikubizile, ngoba uzangiphendula, Nkulunkulu; beka indlebe yakho kimi, uzwe inkulumo yami.
019	PSA	017	007	Tshengisa ngokumangalisayo uthandolomusa wakho, wena osindisa ngesandla sakho sokunene labo abathembela kuwe kwabavukelayo.
019	PSA	017	008	Ngigcine njengenhlamvu yelihlo; ungifihle emthunzini wempiko zakho,
019	PSA	017	009	kubo ubuso bababi abangicindezelayo, izitha zempilo yami ezingihanqileyo.
019	PSA	017	010	Bayazivalela ngamahwahwa abo; ngomlomo wabo bakhuluma ngokuzigqaja.
019	PSA	017	011	Sebesihanqile emanyathelweni ethu; amehlo abo bawamise besithobele emhlabathini.
019	PSA	017	012	Unjengesilwane esikhuthalele ukudabula, lanjengesilwane esitsha esiquthileyo endaweni ezisithekileyo.
019	PSA	017	013	Vuka, Nkosi! Uhlangabeze ubuso bakhe, umphosele phansi. Khulula umphefumulo wami komubi, oyinkemba yakho,
019	PSA	017	014	kubo abantu, abayisandla sakho, Nkosi, ebantwini bomhlaba, osabelo sabo sikulokhukuphila, osisu sabo usigcwalisa ngokuligugu kwakho; bagcwele abantwana, njalo batshiyele izingane zabo okuseleyo kwabo.
019	PSA	017	015	Mina, ngizakhangela ubuso bakho ekulungeni, ngeneliswe yisimo sakho ekuphaphameni kwami.
019	PSA	018	001	Ngizakuthanda, Nkosi, mandla ami.
019	PSA	018	002	INkosi ilidwala lami, lenqaba yami, lomkhululi wami; uNkulunkulu wami, idwala lami, engizaphephela kulo, isihlangu sami, lophondo losindiso lwami, inqaba yami ephakemeyo.
019	PSA	018	003	Ngizabiza iNkosi edumisekayo, ngakho ngizasindiswa ezitheni zami.
019	PSA	018	004	Izibopho zokufa zangizingelezela, lezikhukhula zobubi zangethusa.
019	PSA	018	005	Izibopho zesihogo zangigombolozela, imijibila yokufa yayiphambi kwami.
019	PSA	018	006	Ekuhluphekeni kwami ngayibiza iNkosi, ngakhala kuNkulunkulu wami; walizwa ilizwi lami esethempelini lakhe, lokukhala kwami kweza phambi kwakhe, endlebeni zakhe.
019	PSA	018	007	Khona umhlaba wazamazama, wanyikinyeka, lezisekelo zezintaba zaqhaqhazela, zazamazama, ngoba wayethukuthele.
019	PSA	018	008	Kwenyuka intuthu emakhaleni akhe, lomlilo ophuma emlonyeni wakhe waqothula; amalahle avuthiswa yiwo.
019	PSA	018	009	Wasekhothamisa amazulu, wehlela phansi, lomnyama onzima wawungaphansi kwenyawo zakhe.
019	PSA	018	010	Wasegada ikherubhi, waphapha, wandiza phezu kwempiko zomoya.
019	PSA	018	011	Wamisa umnyama waba yindawo yakhe yensitha, idumba lakhe inhlangothi zonke zakhe, amanzi amnyama, amayezi amnyama omkhathi.
019	PSA	018	012	Ekukhazimuleni okuphambi kwakhe amayezi akhe amnyama edlula, isiqhotho lamalahle omlilo.
019	PSA	018	013	INkosi yasiduma emazulwini, oPhezukonke wazwakalisa ilizwi lakhe, isiqhotho lamalahle omlilo.
019	PSA	018	014	Yasithuma imitshoko yayo, yabachitha; lemibane eminengi, yabaphaphathekisa.
019	PSA	018	015	Khona kwabonakala imisele yamanzi, kwembulwa izisekelo zomhlaba ekusoleni kwakho, Nkosi, ekuvutheleni komoya wamakhala akho.
019	PSA	018	016	Yathuma iphezulu, yangibamba, yangenyula emanzini amanengi.
019	PSA	018	017	Yangophula esitheni sami esilamandla, lakibo abangizondayo, ngoba babelamandla kulami.
019	PSA	018	018	Babephambi kwami osukwini lwenhlupheko yami, kodwa iNkosi yaba yisisekelo sami.
019	PSA	018	019	Yangikhuphela endaweni ebanzi, yangikhulula ngoba yayithokoza ngami.
019	PSA	018	020	INkosi yangivuza njengokulunga kwami; yangibuyisela njengokuhlanzeka kwezandla zami.
019	PSA	018	021	Ngoba ngizilondolozile indlela zeNkosi, kangisukanga kuNkulunkulu wami ngenkohlakalo.
019	PSA	018	022	Ngoba zonke izahlulelo zayo zaziphambi kwami, lezimiso zayo kangiziphambulanga kimi.
019	PSA	018	023	Njalo ngangiqondile kuyo, ngizinqandile ebubini bami.
019	PSA	018	024	Ngakho iNkosi ingibuyisele njengokulunga kwami, njengokuhlanzeka kwezandla zami phambi kwamehlo ayo.
019	PSA	018	025	Kolesihawu uzaziveza ulesihawu; koqotho uzaziveza uqotho;
019	PSA	018	026	kohlanzekileyo uzaziveza uhlanzekile; lakophambukileyo uzaziveza uphambukile.
019	PSA	018	027	Ngoba wena uzabasindisa abantu abahlutshwayo; kodwa amehlo aphakemeyo uzawehlisela phansi.
019	PSA	018	028	Ngoba wena uzalumathisa isibane sami; iNkosi, uNkulunkulu wami, izakhanyisa ubumnyama bami.
019	PSA	018	029	Ngoba ngawe ngigijimile ngadabula phakathi kwebutho, langoNkulunkulu wami ngeqe umthangala.
019	PSA	018	030	UNkulunkulu, indlela yakhe iphelele; ilizwi leNkosi lihloliwe; uyisihlangu kubo bonke abaphephela kuye.
019	PSA	018	031	Ngoba ngubani onguNkulunkulu ngaphandle kweNkosi? Njalo ngubani olidwala ngaphandle kukaNkulunkulu wethu?
019	PSA	018	032	NguNkulunkulu ongibhincisa amandla, owenza indlela yami iphelele.
019	PSA	018	033	Owenza inyawo zami zibe njengezezimpala, wangimisa ezingqongeni zami.
019	PSA	018	034	Ofundisela izandla zami impi, ukuze idandili lethusi ligotshiswe zingalo zami.
019	PSA	018	035	Unginikile lesihlangu sosindiso lwakho, lesandla sakho sokunene singisekele, lobumnene bakho bungikhulisile.
019	PSA	018	036	Wenze zaba banzi izinyathelo zami ngaphansi kwami, ukuze inyawo zami zingatsheleli.
019	PSA	018	037	Ngixotshene lezitha zami, ngazifica, kangibuyanga ngaze ngaziqeda.
019	PSA	018	038	Ngazigwaza, zaze zehluleka ukuvuka, zawa ngaphansi kwenyawo zami.
019	PSA	018	039	Ngoba ungibhincise amandla kusenzelwa impi, wabakhothamisela phansi kwami abangivukelayo.
019	PSA	018	040	Unginike intamo yezitha zami, labo abangizondayo ngababhubhisa.
019	PSA	018	041	Bakhala, kodwa engekho umsindisi; eNkosini, kodwa kayibaphendulanga.
019	PSA	018	042	Ngasengibacholisisa njengothuli phambi komoya, ngabachitha njengodaka lwezitalada.
019	PSA	018	043	Wangikhulula ekuphikiseni kwabantu, wangimisa ngaba yinhloko yezizwe; abantu engangingabazi bangisebenzela.
019	PSA	018	044	Bangenela ukuzwa ngendlebe bazangilalela, abezizweni bazazithoba kimi ngokuzenzisa.
019	PSA	018	045	Abezizweni bazabuna, baphume ezinqabeni zabo bethuthumela.
019	PSA	018	046	INkosi iyaphila; njalo kalidunyiswe idwala lami, kaphakanyiswe uNkulunkulu wosindiso lwami.
019	PSA	018	047	UNkulunkulu onginika impindiselo, lowehlisela izizwe ngaphansi kwami;
019	PSA	018	048	ongikhulula ezitheni zami; yebo, phezu kwabangivukelayo wangiphakamisa, emuntwini wodlakela wangikhulula.
019	PSA	018	049	Ngenxa yalokhu ngizakudumisa, Nkosi, phakathi kwezizwe, ngihlabelele ibizo lakho indumiso.
019	PSA	018	050	Iyanika inkosi yayo usindiso olukhulu, isenzela ogcotshiweyo wayo umusa, kuDavida, lenzalweni yakhe kuze kube nininini.
019	PSA	019	001	Amazulu alandisa ngodumo lukaNkulunkulu, lomkhathi utshumayela umsebenzi wezandla zakhe.
019	PSA	019	002	Usuku kusuku luphumisela inkulumo, lobusuku kubusuku butshengisa ulwazi.
019	PSA	019	003	Kakukho nkulumo, kawakho lamazwi, lapho ilizwi lawo elingezwakali khona.
019	PSA	019	004	Intambo yawo iphumele emhlabeni wonke, lamazwi awo emkhawulweni womhlaba. Ulimisele ilanga ithente kuwo.
019	PSA	019	005	Elinjengomyeni ephuma ekamelweni lakhe, lithokoza njengeqhawe ligijima endleleni.
019	PSA	019	006	Ukuphuma kwalo kusukela emkhawulweni wamazulu, lokuzingeleza kwalo kuze kube semikhawulweni yawo; njalo kakukho okufihliweyo ekutshiseni kwalo.
019	PSA	019	007	Umlayo weNkosi uphelele, uphendula umphefumulo; ubufakazi beNkosi buqinisile, buhlakaniphisa ongelalwazi;
019	PSA	019	008	izimiso zeNkosi zilungile, zithokozisa inhliziyo; umthetho weNkosi uhlambulukile, ukhanyisa amehlo.
019	PSA	019	009	Ukuyesaba iNkosi kuhlanzekile, kumi kuze kube nininini; izahlulelo zeNkosi ziliqiniso, zilungile ngokupheleleyo.
019	PSA	019	010	Ziyaloyiseka kakhulu kulegolide, yebo kulegolide elicwengekileyo elinengi; njalo zimnandi kuloluju lolujuluka ohlangeni loluju.
019	PSA	019	011	Futhi inceku yakho iyelulekwa ngazo; ekuzigcineni kulomvuzo omkhulu.
