019	PSA	020	009	Jehova, sindisa; inkosi isiphendule osukwini lokukhala kwethu.
019	PSA	021	001	Jehova, inkosi izajabula emandleni akho, lesindisweni lwakho izathaba kangakanani!
019	PSA	021	002	Uyinikile isifiso senhliziyo yayo, kawuyincitshanga isicelo sendebe zayo. (Sela)
019	PSA	021	003	Ngoba uyihlangabeze ngezibusiso zokuhle, wayethwesa umqhele wegolide elihle ekhanda layo.
019	PSA	021	004	Yacela impilo kuwe, wayinika yona, ubude bezinsuku kuze kube nini lanini.
019	PSA	021	005	Lukhulu udumo lwayo ekusindiseni kwakho, inkazimulo lobukhosi wakubeka phezu kwayo.
019	PSA	021	006	Ngoba uyenze yabusiseka kakhulu kuze kube nininini, uyayithokozisa ngenjabulo ebukhoneni bakho.
019	PSA	021	007	Ngoba inkosi ithembela kuJehova, langomusa woPhezukonke kayiyikunyikinywa.
019	PSA	021	008	Isandla sakho sizazithola zonke izitha zakho, lesandla sakho sokunene sizabathola labo abakuzondayo.
019	PSA	021	009	Uzabenza babe njengesithando somlilo esikhathini solaka lwakho. INkosi izabaginya ekuthukutheleni kwayo, lomlilo uzabaqothula.
019	PSA	021	010	Uzachitha isithelo sabo emhlabeni, lenzalo yabo phakathi kwabantwana babantu.
019	PSA	021	011	Ngoba bezimisela okubi bemelene lawe, beceba ugobe, bazakwehluleka.
019	PSA	021	012	Ngoba uzabafulathelisa, ngezintambo zedandili uzalungisa imitshoko imelane lobuso babo.
019	PSA	021	013	Phakama, Nkosi, ngamandla akho! Sizahlabela sidumise amandla akho.
019	PSA	022	001	Nkulunkulu wami, Nkulunkulu wami, ungitshiyeleni na? Ukhatshana lokungisiza, lamazwi okubhonga kwami?
019	PSA	022	002	Nkulunkulu wami, ngiyakhala emini, kodwa kawungiphenduli, lebusuku, kodwa kangilakho ukuthula.
019	PSA	022	003	Kodwa wena ungcwele, ohlezi ezibongweni zikaIsrayeli.
019	PSA	022	004	Obaba bethu bathemba kuwe, bathemba, wasubakhulula.
019	PSA	022	005	Bakhala kuwe, bakhululwa; bathembela kuwe, kabayangekanga.
019	PSA	022	006	Kodwa ngingumswenya, kangisuye muntu, ihlazo labantu, ngeyiswa ngabantu.
019	PSA	022	007	Bonke abangibonayo bayangihleka usulu, bakhamisa indebe, banikine ikhanda,
019	PSA	022	008	besithi: Wathembela eNkosini; kayimkhulule, imophule, ngoba yathokoza kuye.
019	PSA	022	009	Kodwa nguwe owangikhupha esiswini, wangenza ngathemba ngisemabeleni kamama.
019	PSA	022	010	Ngalahlelwa phezu kwakho kusukela esizalweni; kusukela esiswini sikamama unguNkulunkulu wami.
019	PSA	022	011	Ungabi khatshana lami, ngoba uhlupho luseduze, ngoba kakho osizayo.
019	PSA	022	012	Izinkunzi ezinengi zingihanqile, ezilamandla zeBashani zingizingelezele.
019	PSA	022	013	Zangikhamisela umlomo wazo, isilwane esiphangayo lesibhongayo.
019	PSA	022	014	Ngithululiwe njengamanzi, lamathambo ami wonke ehlukene; inhliziyo yami injengengcino, incibilikile phakathi kwemibilini yami.
019	PSA	022	015	Amandla ami omile njengodengezi, lolimi lwami lunamathele emihlathini yami; ungibeke ethulini lokufa.
019	PSA	022	016	Ngoba izinja zingigombolozele; inhlangano yababi ingihanqile; izandla zami lenyawo zami bazibhobozile.
019	PSA	022	017	Ngingabala wonke amathambo ami; bona bayakhangela bayangijolozela.
019	PSA	022	018	Babelana izigqoko zami, benza inkatho yokuphosa ngezembatho zami.
019	PSA	022	019	Kodwa, wena Nkosi, ungabi khatshana; mandla ami, phangisa ukungisiza.
019	PSA	022	020	Khulula umphefumulo wami kuyo inkemba, wona wodwa owami emandleni enja.
019	PSA	022	021	Ngisindisa emlonyeni wesilwane; ngoba empondweni zezinyathi ungiphendule.
019	PSA	022	022	Ngizalandisa ibizo lakho kubafowethu, phakathi kwebandla ngizakudumisa.
019	PSA	022	023	Lina elesaba iNkosi, idumiseni; lonke nzalo kaJakobe, ihlonipheni; liyesabe, lonke nzalo kaIsrayeli.
019	PSA	022	024	Ngoba kayidelelanga kayinengwanga yinhlupheko yohluphekayo; njalo kayimfihlelanga ubuso bayo; kodwa lapho ekhala kuyo, yezwa.
019	PSA	022	025	Indumiso yami izakuba ngawe ebandleni elikhulu; ngizakhokha izifungo zami phambi kwabayesabayo.
019	PSA	022	026	Abamnene bazakudla basuthe; bazayidumisa iNkosi labo abayidingayo. Inhliziyo yenu izaphila kuze kube phakade.
019	PSA	022	027	Imikhawulo yonke yomhlaba izakhumbula, iphendukele eNkosini; lezizukulwana zonke zezizwe zizakhonza phambi kwakho.
019	PSA	022	028	Ngoba umbuso ungoweNkosi, njalo iyabusa phakathi kwezizwe.
019	PSA	022	029	Bonke abakhulupheleyo bomhlaba bazakudla bakhonze; bonke abehlela othulini bazakhothama phambi kwayo, longagcini umphefumulo wakhe uphila.
019	PSA	022	030	Inzalo izayikhonza; izabalelwa eNkosini kuso isizukulwana.
019	PSA	022	031	Bazakuza bamemezele ukulunga kwayo ebantwini abazazalwa, ukuthi ikwenzile.
019	PSA	023	001	INkosi ingumelusi wami, kangiyikuswela.
019	PSA	023	002	Iyangilalisa emadlelweni aluhlaza; iyangiholela emanzini okuphumula.
019	PSA	023	003	Ibuyisa umphefumulo wami, ingiholele endleleni zokulunga ngenxa yebizo layo.
019	PSA	023	004	Yebo, loba ngihamba esihotsheni sethunzi lokufa, kangiyikwesaba okubi, ngoba wena ulami; intonga yakho lodondolo lwakho, khona kuyangiduduza.
019	PSA	023	005	Uyalungisa itafula phambi kwami ngaphambi kwezitha zami; ugcoba ikhanda lami ngamafutha, inkezo yami iyaphuphuma.
019	PSA	023	006	Isibili okuhle lesihawu kuzangilandela insuku zonke zempilo yami; njalo ngizahlala endlini yeNkosi kuze kube nininini.
019	PSA	024	001	Umhlaba ungoweNkosi, lokugcwala kwawo, ilizwe, labahlala kulo.
019	PSA	024	002	Ngoba yona yawusekela phezu kwezinlwandle, yawumisa phezu kwemifula.
019	PSA	024	003	Ngubani ozakwenyukela entabeni yeNkosi? Kumbe ngubani ozakuma endaweni yayo engcwele?
019	PSA	024	004	Ngulowo olezandla ezihlanzekileyo lenhliziyo emhlophe, ongaphakamiseli umphefumulo wakhe kokuyize longafungi ngenkohliso.
019	PSA	024	005	Uzakwemukela isibusiso eNkosini, lokulunga kuNkulunkulu wosindiso lwakhe.
019	PSA	024	006	Lesi yisizukulwana salabo abayidingayo, abadinga ubuso bakho, ngitsho Jakobe. (Sela)
019	PSA	024	007	Phakamisani inhloko zenu, lina masango, phakanyiswani, lina minyango yaphakade, ukuze kungene iNkosi yenkazimulo.
019	PSA	024	008	Ingubani liNkosi yenkazimulo? INkosi elamandla leliqhawe, iNkosi elamandla empini.
019	PSA	024	009	Phakamisani inhloko zenu, lina masango, yebo, phakamani, lina minyango yaphakade, ukuze kungene iNkosi yenkazimulo.
019	PSA	024	010	Ingubani liNkosi yenkazimulo? INkosi yamabandla, yiyo eyiNkosi yenkazimulo. (Sela)
019	PSA	025	001	Kuwe, Nkosi, ngiphakamisela umphefumulo wami.
019	PSA	025	002	Nkulunkulu wami, ngithembela kuwe; kangingayangeki; izitha zami kazingathokozi phezu kwami.
019	PSA	025	003	Yebo, kungayangeki loyedwa kulabo abakulindelayo; kabayangeke labo abaphambukayo kungelasizatho.
019	PSA	025	004	Ngazisa izindlela zakho, Nkosi, ungifundise imikhondo yakho.
019	PSA	025	005	Ngikhokhelela eqinisweni lakho, ungifundise, ngoba unguNkulunkulu wosindiso lwami; ngilindele wena usuku lonke.
019	PSA	025	006	Khumbula izihawu zakho, Nkosi, lobubele bakho, ngoba kwakukhona kusukela phakade.
019	PSA	025	007	Ungazikhumbuli izono zobutsha bami leziphambeko zami; ngokomusa wakho wena ungikhumbule, ngenxa yokulunga kwakho, Nkosi.
019	PSA	025	008	INkosi ilungile iqondile; ngakho-ke izazifundisa izoni ngendlela.
019	PSA	025	009	Izabakhokhela abathobekileyo ekwahlulelweni, ibafundise abathobekileyo indlela yayo.
019	PSA	025	010	Zonke indlela zeNkosi zingumusa leqiniso kulabo abalondoloza isivumelwano sayo lezifakazelo zayo.
019	PSA	025	011	Ngenxa yebizo lakho, Nkosi, thethelela isiphambeko sami, ngoba sikhulu.
019	PSA	025	012	Nguwuphi umuntu owesaba iNkosi? Izamfundisa ngendlela ezayikhetha.
019	PSA	025	013	Umphefumulo wakhe uzahlala ebuhleni, lenzalo yakhe izalidla ilifa lelizwe.
019	PSA	025	014	Imfihlo yeNkosi ingeyabayesabayo, izabazisa isivumelwano sayo.
019	PSA	025	015	Amehlo ami ahlala eseNkosini, ngoba yiyo ezakhupha inyawo zami embuleni.
019	PSA	025	016	Phendukela kimi, ube lomusa kimi, ngoba ngilesizungu, ngihluphekile.
019	PSA	025	017	Inkathazo zenhliziyo yami zanda, ungikhuphe ezinhluphekweni zami.
019	PSA	025	018	Khangela inhlupheko yami losizi lwami, uthethelele zonke izono zami.
019	PSA	025	019	Khangela izitha zami ngoba zinengi, ziyangizonda ngenzondo elesihluku.
019	PSA	025	020	Londoloza umphefumulo wami, ungikhulule; kangingayangeki, ngoba ngiphephela kuwe.
019	PSA	025	021	Ubuqotho lokuqonda kakungilondoloze, ngoba ngilindele wena.
019	PSA	025	022	Nkulunkulu, hlenga uIsrayeli kuzo zonke inkathazo zakhe.
019	PSA	026	001	Ngahlulela, Nkosi, ngoba mina ngihambe ngobuqotho bami, njalo ngithembele eNkosini, angiyikutshelela.
019	PSA	026	002	Ngihlola, Nkosi, ungilinge, uhlole izinso zami lenhliziyo yami.
019	PSA	026	003	Ngoba uthandolomusa wakho luphambi kwamehlo ami, njalo ngihambe eqinisweni lakho.
019	PSA	026	004	Kangihlalanga labantu benkohliso, kangihambelani labazenzisayo.
019	PSA	026	005	Ngiyizondile inhlangano yabenzi bobubi, kangihlali lababi.
019	PSA	026	006	Ngizageza izandla zami ngokungelacala, ngizingelezele ilathi lakho, Nkosi.
019	PSA	026	007	Ukuze ngizwakalise ngelizwi lokubonga, lokuze ngilandise zonke izenzo zakho ezimangalisayo.
019	PSA	026	008	Nkosi, ngiyayithanda inhlalo yendlu yakho, lendawo yokuhlala yenkazimulo yakho.
019	PSA	026	009	Ungabuthi umphefumulo wami kanye lezoni, kumbe impilo yami kanye labantu abomele igazi.
019	PSA	026	010	Ozandla zabo zilobubi, lesandla sabo sokunene sigcwele izivalamlomo.
019	PSA	026	011	Kodwa mina ngizahamba ngobuqotho bami; ngihlenga, ube lomusa kimi.
019	PSA	026	012	Unyawo lwami lumi endaweni elingeneyo; ngizayidumisa iNkosi emabandleni.
019	PSA	027	001	INkosi iyikukhanya kwami losindiso lwami; ngizakwesaba bani? INkosi ingamandla empilo yami; ngizakwethuka bani?
019	PSA	027	002	Lapho ababi, izitha zami labamelana lami, besondela kimi ukudla inyama yami, bona bakhubeka bawa.
019	PSA	027	003	Loba ibutho lingamisa inkamba limelene lami, inhliziyo yami kayiyikwesaba; loba impi ingangivukela, kulokhu ngizathemba.
019	PSA	027	004	Into yinye engiyicela eNkosini, yiyo engizayidinga, yikuthi ngihlale endlini yeNkosi insuku zonke zempilo yami, ukuze ngibone ubuhle beNkosi, ngibuzisise ethempelini layo.
019	PSA	027	005	Ngoba izangifihla edumbeni layo ngosuku lobubi, ingifihle ekusithekeni kwethente layo, ingiphakamisele edwaleni.
019	PSA	027	006	Khathesi-ke ikhanda lami lizaphakanyiswa phezu kwezitha zami ezingihanqileyo; ngakho ngizanikela iminikelo yokuthaba ethenteni layo; ngizahlabela, yebo ngihlabele indumiso eNkosini.
019	PSA	027	007	Zwana, Nkosi, ilizwi lami lapho ngikhala, njalo ungihawukele, ungiphendule.
019	PSA	027	008	Uthe: Dingani ubuso bami. Inhliziyo yami yathi kuwe: Ubuso bakho, Nkosi, ngizabudinga.
019	PSA	027	009	Ungangifihleli ubuso bakho; ungayixotshi inceku yakho ngokuthukuthela; ubulusizo lwami; ungangitshiyi, ungangideli, Nkulunkulu wosindiso lwami.
019	PSA	027	010	Lapho umama lobaba bengitshiya, khona iNkosi izangemukela.
019	PSA	027	011	Ngifundisa indlela yakho, Nkosi, ungikhokhele endleleni eqondileyo, ngenxa yezitha zami.
019	PSA	027	012	Unganginikeli entandweni yezitha zami, ngoba abafakazi bamanga bangivukele, lovutha isihluku.
019	PSA	027	013	Ngangizaphela ngaphandle kokuthi ngakholwa ukuthi ngizabona okuhle kweNkosi elizweni labaphilayo.
019	PSA	027	014	Lindela iNkosi, ube lamandla, lenhliziyo yakho iqine, yebo, lindela iNkosi.
019	PSA	028	001	Ngiyakhala kuwe, Nkosi; dwala lami, ungangithuleli, hlezi nxa ungithulela, ngifanane labehlela emgodini.
019	PSA	028	002	Zwana ilizwi lokuncenga kwami lapho ngikhala kuwe, lapho ngiphakamisela izandla zami endaweni yakho yelizwi engcwele.
019	PSA	028	003	Ungangihuduli kanye lababi njalo kanye labenzi bobubi, abakhuluma ukuthula labomakhelwane babo, kodwa ububi busenhliziyweni yabo.
019	PSA	028	004	Ubanike njengokwenza kwabo, lanjengobubi bezenzo zabo; ubanike njengokomsebenzi wezandla zabo, ubabuyisele isenzo sabo.
019	PSA	028	005	Ngoba kabayinanzi imisebenzi yeNkosi lokwenza kwezandla zayo, izababhidliza ingabakhi.
019	PSA	028	006	Kayibongwe iNkosi, ngoba ilizwile ilizwi lokuncenga kwami.
019	PSA	028	007	INkosi ingamandla ami lesihlangu sami; inhliziyo yami ithembela kuyo, ngiyasizwa; ngakho inhliziyo yami iyathokoza, ngiyidumise ngengoma yami.
019	PSA	028	008	INkosi ingamandla abo, njalo iyinqaba yezinsindiso zogcotshiweyo wayo.
019	PSA	028	009	Sindisa abantu bakho, ubusise ilifa lakho, beluse, ubaphakamise kuze kube nininini.
019	PSA	029	001	Inikeni iNkosi, lina madodana abalamandla, inikeni iNkosi udumo lamandla.
019	PSA	029	002	Inikeni iNkosi udumo lwebizo layo, likhothame eNkosini ebuhleni bobungcwele.
019	PSA	029	003	Ilizwi leNkosi liphezu kwamanzi; uNkulunkulu wenkazimulo uyaduma; iNkosi iphezu kwamanzi amanengi.
019	PSA	029	004	Ilizwi leNkosi lilamandla, ilizwi leNkosi lilobukhosi.
019	PSA	029	005	Ilizwi leNkosi lephula imisedari, yebo, iNkosi yephula imisedari yeLebhanoni.
019	PSA	029	006	Yenza yona-ke iqolotshe njengethole, iLebhanoni leSiriyoni njengethole lenyathi.
019	PSA	029	007	Ilizwi leNkosi lidabula amalangabi omlilo.
019	PSA	029	008	Ilizwi leNkosi lizamazamisa inkangala, iNkosi izamazamisa inkangala yeKadeshi.
019	PSA	029	009	Ilizwi leNkosi lizalisa izimpala, lihlubule amahlathi; lethempelini layo konke kuthi: Udumo.
019	PSA	029	010	UJehova uhlezi phezu kukazamcolo, yebo, uJehova uhlezi eyiNkosi kuze kube nininini.
019	PSA	029	011	INkosi izanika abantu bayo amandla; iNkosi ibusise abantu bayo ngokuthula.
019	PSA	030	001	Ngizakuphakamisa, Nkosi, ngoba ungenyusile, njalo kawuthokozisanga izitha zami ngami.
019	PSA	030	002	Nkosi Nkulunkulu wami, ngakhalela kuwe, wangisilisa.
019	PSA	030	003	Nkosi, uwukhuphulile umphefumulo wami engcwabeni, ungigcinile ngiphila, ukuze ngingehleli emgodini.
019	PSA	030	004	Hlabelelani eNkosini, lina bangcwele bayo, libonge ekukhunjulweni kobungcwele bayo.
019	PSA	030	005	Ngoba ukuthukuthela kwayo kungokwesikhatshana, impilo isemuseni wayo. Ukulila kungahlala kusihlwa, kanti ekuseni kulentokozo.
019	PSA	030	006	Mina-ke ngathi ekuphumeleleni kwami: Kangiyikunyikinywa laphakade.
019	PSA	030	007	Nkosi, ngomusa wakho wenzile intaba yami iqine; wabufihla ubuso bakho, ngahlupheka.
019	PSA	030	008	Ngakhala kuwe, Nkosi; ngancenga eNkosini.
019	PSA	030	009	Kulenzuzo bani egazini lami ekutshoneni kwami emgodini? Uthuli luzakudumisa na? Luzatshumayela iqiniso lakho yini?
019	PSA	030	010	Zwana, Nkosi, ube lomusa kimi; Nkosi, woba ngumsizi wami.
019	PSA	030	011	Uphendule ukukhala kwami kwaba yikusina; ukhuphile isaka lami, wangibhincisa intokozo,
019	PSA	030	012	ukuze udumo lwami luhlabele indumiso kuwe, lungathuli; Nkosi, Nkulunkulu wami, ngizakubonga kuze kube nininini.
019	PSA	031	001	Kuwe, Nkosi, ngiyathemba, kangingayangeki lanini, ngikhulule ngokulunga kwakho.
019	PSA	031	002	Beka kimi indlebe yakho, ngikhulule masinyane, ube lidwala elilamandla kimi, indlu yezinqaba yokungisindisa.
019	PSA	031	003	Ngoba wena ulidwala lami lenqaba yami; ngakho ngenxa yebizo lakho ngikhokhela ungiqondise.
019	PSA	031	004	Ngikhupha embuleni abangithiye ngalo ensitha, ngoba uyinqaba yami.
019	PSA	031	005	Esandleni sakho ngibeka umoya wami; ungihlengile, Nkosi, Nkulunkulu weqiniso.
019	PSA	031	006	Ngibazondile labo abananzelela okuyize kwamanga; kodwa mina ngithembela eNkosini.
019	PSA	031	007	Ngizathaba ngithokoze emuseni wakho, ngoba ubonile uhlupho lwami, wazile umphefumulo wami ezinkathazweni.
019	PSA	031	008	Njalo kawungivalelanga esandleni sesitha, umise inyawo zami endaweni ebanzi.
019	PSA	031	009	Woba lomusa kimi, Nkosi, ngoba ngilohlupho; ilihlo lami liqedwa lusizi, umphefumulo wami lesisu sami.
019	PSA	031	010	Ngoba impilo yami iphela ngosizi, leminyaka yami ngokububula; amandla ami ayadeda ngenxa yeziphambeko zami, lamathambo ami ayaqedwa.
019	PSA	031	011	Sengilihlazo phakathi kwazo zonke izitha zami, kodwa ikakhulu kwabakhelene lami, sengiyikwesabeka kwabangejwayeleyo; abangibonayo ngaphandle bayangibalekela.
