019	PSA	040	013	Thokoza, Nkosi, ukungikhulula. Nkosi, phangisa ukungisiza.
019	PSA	040	014	Kabayangeke babe lenhloni ndawonye abadinga umphefumulo wami ukuwuchitha; kababuyiselwe emuva bayangiswe abangifisela okubi.
019	PSA	040	015	Kabachitheke kube ngumvuzo wehlazo labo abathi kimi: Aha, aha!
019	PSA	040	016	Kabathabe bajabule kuwe bonke abakudingayo; abathanda usindiso lwakho kabatsho njalonjalo bathi: Kayikhuliswe iNkosi!
019	PSA	040	017	Kodwa ngingumyanga ngiyaswela; iNkosi iyangikhumbula; ungumsizi wami lomkhululi wami; Nkulunkulu wami, ungalibali.
019	PSA	041	001	Ubusisiwe onanzelela obuthakathaka. INkosi izamkhulula ngosuku lobubi.
019	PSA	041	002	INkosi izamlondoloza, imgcine ephila; uzabusiswa emhlabeni; kawuyikumnikela entandweni yezitha zakhe.
