019	PSA	044	009	Kodwa ulahlile wasiyangisa, njalo kawuphumi lamabutho ethu.
019	PSA	044	010	Usenze ukuthi sibuyele emuva sisuka esitheni; labasizondayo baziphangela.
019	PSA	044	011	Usinikele njengezimvu zokudliwa, wasichithachitha phakathi kwezizwe.
019	PSA	044	012	Uthengisile abantu bakho ngokungelanotho, awuzuzanga lutho ngentengo yabo.
019	PSA	044	013	Usenze saba lihlazo kwabakhelene lathi, inhlekisa lendumazo kwabasiphahlileyo.
