019	PSA	044	023	Phaphama, ulaleleni, Nkosi? Vuka, ungalahli kokuphela.
019	PSA	044	024	Ufihlelani ubuso bakho, ukhohlwe ukuhlupheka kwethu locindezelo lwethu?
019	PSA	044	025	Ngoba umphefumulo wethu ukhothamele othulini, isisu sethu sinamathela emhlabathini.
019	PSA	044	026	Sukumela usizo lwethu, usihlenge ngenxa yomusa wakho.
019	PSA	045	001	Inhliziyo yami iphuphuma ngendaba enhle; ngikhuluma ngezinto engizenzele inkosi; ulimi lwami lulusiba lombhali ophangisayo.
019	PSA	045	002	Umuhle kulabantwana babantu; umusa uthululwe endebeni zakho; ngenxa yalokho uNkulunkulu ukubusisile kuze kube phakade.
019	PSA	045	003	Bhinca inkemba yakho emlenzeni, qhawe, udumo lwakho lobukhosi bakho.
019	PSA	045	004	Lebukhosini bakho gada uphumulele, ngenxa yeqiniso lobumnene bokulunga; lesandla sakho sokunene sikufundise izinto ezesabekayo.
019	PSA	045	005	Imitshoko yakho ibukhali enhliziyweni yezitha zenkosi; izizwe zizakuwa ngaphansi kwakho.
019	PSA	045	006	Isihlalo sakho sobukhosi, Nkulunkulu, ngesaphakade laphakade; intonga yakho yobukhosi iyintonga yobuqotho.
019	PSA	045	007	Uthanda ukulunga, njalo uzonda ububi; ngenxa yalokho uNkulunkulu, uNkulunkulu wakho, ukugcobile ngamafutha entokozo ngaphezu kwabanakwenu.
019	PSA	045	008	Izembatho zakho zonke ziqholiwe ngemure lenhlaba lekhasiya; ezigodlweni zempondo zendlovu abakwenze wathokoza ngazo.
