019	PSA	046	005	UNkulunkulu uphakathi kwawo, kawuyikunyikinywa; uNkulunkulu uzawusiza ngovivi lokusa.
019	PSA	046	006	Izizwe ziyaxokozela, imibuso izamazame; wakhupha ilizwi lakhe, umhlaba wancibilika.
019	PSA	046	007	INkosi yamabandla ilathi, uNkulunkulu kaJakobe uyinqaba yethu. (Sela)
019	PSA	046	008	Wozani libone imisebenzi yeNkosi, incithakalo eyenzileyo emhlabeni.
019	PSA	046	009	Yenza izimpi ziphele kuze kube semkhawulweni womhlaba; yephula idandili, iqumaqume umkhonto, itshise izinqola emlilweni.
019	PSA	046	010	Thulani, lazi ukuthi mina nginguNkulunkulu, ngizaphakanyiswa phakathi kwezizwe, ngiphakanyiswe emhlabeni.
019	PSA	046	011	INkosi yamabandla ilathi, uNkulunkulu kaJakobe uyinqaba yethu. (Sela)
019	PSA	047	001	Tshayani isandla, zizwe zonke, hlokomani kuNkulunkulu ngelizwi lentokozo.
019	PSA	047	002	Ngoba iNkosi, oPhezukonke, iyesabeka, yiNkosi enkulu phezu komhlaba wonke.
019	PSA	047	003	Izakwehlisela abantu ngaphansi kwethu, lezizwe ngaphansi kwenyawo zethu.
019	PSA	047	004	Izasikhethela ilifa lethu, udumo lukaJakobe emthandayo. (Sela)
019	PSA	047	005	UNkulunkulu wenyukile ngokuhlokoma, iNkosi ngokukhala kophondo.
019	PSA	047	006	Hlabelani indumiso kuNkulunkulu, hlabelelani indumiso. Hlabelani indumiso eNkosini yethu, hlabelelani indumiso.
019	PSA	047	007	Ngoba uNkulunkulu uyiNkosi yomhlaba wonke; hlabelelani indumiso ngokuqedisisa.
019	PSA	047	008	UNkulunkulu uyabusa phezu kwezizwe; uNkulunkulu uhlezi esihlalweni sobukhosi sobungcwele bakhe.
019	PSA	047	009	Iziphathamandla zabantu zibuthene ndawonye, abantu bakaNkulunkulu kaAbrahama. Ngoba izihlangu zomhlaba zingezikaNkulunkulu; uphakeme kakhulu.
019	PSA	048	001	Yinkulu iNkosi, ingeyokudunyiswa kakhulu emzini kaNkulunkulu wethu, intaba yobungcwele bayo.
019	PSA	048	002	Yinhle ngokuphakama, yintokozo emhlabeni wonke intaba yeZiyoni, enhlangothini zenyakatho, umuzi weNkosi enkulu.
019	PSA	048	003	Ezigodlweni zawo uNkulunkulu uyaziwa ukuthi uyinqaba.
019	PSA	048	004	Ngoba, khangela, amakhosi abuthana, adlula kanyekanye.
019	PSA	048	005	Wona awubona, ngokunjalo amangala, atshaywa luvalo, aphaphatheka.
019	PSA	048	006	Ukuthuthumela kwawabamba lapho, umhelo njengowesifazana obelethayo.
019	PSA	048	007	Ngomoya wempumalanga uphahlaza imikhumbi yeTarshishi.
019	PSA	048	008	Njengesikuzwileyo ngokunjalo sikubonile emzini weNkosi yamabandla, emzini kaNkulunkulu wethu; uNkulunkulu uzawumisa kuze kube nininini. (Sela)
019	PSA	048	009	Sizindle ngothandolomusa wakho, Nkulunkulu, phakathi kwethempeli lakho.
019	PSA	048	010	Njengalo ibizo lakho, Nkulunkulu, injalo indumiso yakho kuze kube semikhawulweni yomhlaba; isandla sakho sokunene sigcwele ukulunga.
019	PSA	048	011	Kayithokoze intaba yeZiyoni, amadodakazi akoJuda athabe, ngenxa yezahlulelo zakho.
019	PSA	048	012	Ibhodeni iZiyoni, liyizingeleze, libale imiphotshongo yayo,
019	PSA	048	013	liqaphelise umthangala wayo, lidabule lihlole izigodlo zayo, ukuze lilandisele isizukulwana esilandelayo.
019	PSA	048	014	Ngoba lo uNkulunkulu unguNkulunkulu wethu kuze kube nini lanini; yena uzasikhokhela kuze kube sekufeni.
