019	PSA	049	002	bonke abantukazana labaphakemeyo, abanothileyo labayanga, ndawonye.
019	PSA	049	003	Umlomo wami uzakhuluma izinhlakanipho, lokuzindla kwenhliziyo yami kuzakuba yikuqedisisa.
019	PSA	049	004	Ngizabeka indlebe yami kuso isaga, ngizavula ilibho lami ngechacho.
019	PSA	049	005	Ngizakwesabelani ensukwini zobubi, nxa ububi babagwenxi bami buzangihanqa.
019	PSA	049	006	Abathemba ingcebo yabo, abazincoma ngobunengi benotho yabo,
