019	PSA	049	010	Ngoba ubona ukuthi abahlakaniphileyo bayafa, lokuthi isithutha kanye lesiphukuphuku bayabhubha, batshiyele inotho yabo abanye.
019	PSA	049	011	Umcabango wabo wangaphakathi uyikuthi izindlu zabo zizakuba ngezaphakade, izindawo zabo zokuhlala zibe ngezezizukulwana, babize amazwe ngamabizo abo.
019	PSA	049	012	Kodwa umuntu elodumo kayikuma, uyafanana lenyamazana ezibhubhayo.
019	PSA	049	013	Le indlela yabo iyibuthutha babo; kube kanti ababalandelayo bathokoza ngomlomo wabo. (Sela)
019	PSA	049	014	Njengezimvu bamiselwe ingcwaba, ukufa kuzabelusa; labaqotho bazababusa ekuseni, isimo sabo ngesokuqedwa lingcwaba ukuze bangabi lendawo yokuhlala.
019	PSA	049	015	Kodwa uNkulunkulu uzahlenga umphefumulo wami emandleni engcwaba, ngoba uzangemukela. (Sela)
019	PSA	049	016	Ungesabi nxa umuntu enotha, nxa udumo lwendlu yakhe lusanda;
019	PSA	049	017	ngoba ekufeni kwakhe kayikuthatha lutho, udumo lwakhe kaluyikwehla lumlandele.
019	PSA	049	018	Lanxa empilweni yakhe wabusisa umphefumulo wakhe, njalo bakudumisa nxa uzenzela okuhle,
019	PSA	049	019	uzakuya esizukulwaneni saboyise, kabayikubona ukukhanya kuze kube phakade.
019	PSA	049	020	Umuntu olodumo, engaqedisisi, unjengezinyamazana ezibhubhayo.
019	PSA	050	001	USomandla, uNkulunkulu, iNkosi, ukhulumile, ubiza umhlaba kusukela ekuphumeni kwelanga kuze kube sekutshoneni kwalo.
019	PSA	050	002	EseZiyoni, ukuphelela kobuhle, uNkulunkulu ukhanyile.
019	PSA	050	003	UNkulunkulu wethu uzakuza, kayikuthula; umlilo phambi kwakhe uzaqothula, enhlangothini zonke zakhe kuzakuba lesiphepho esikhulu.
019	PSA	050	004	Uzabiza amazulu ephezulu, lomhlaba, ukwahlulela abantu bakhe.
019	PSA	050	005	Buthelani kimi abangcwele bami, abenza isivumelwano lami ngomhlatshelo.
019	PSA	050	006	Lamazulu azatshumayela ukulunga kwakhe, ngoba uNkulunkulu ngokwakhe ungumahluleli. (Sela)
019	PSA	050	007	Zwanini bantu bami, ngizakhuluma; Israyeli, ngizafakaza ngimelene lawe. NginguNkulunkulu, uNkulunkulu wakho.
019	PSA	050	008	Kangikusoli ngenxa yemihlatshelo yakho; leminikelo yakho yokutshiswa ihlala iphambi kwami.
019	PSA	050	009	Kangiyikuthatha ijongosi elivela emzini wakho, lezimpongo ezivela ezibayeni zakho.
019	PSA	050	010	Ngoba ngeyami yonke inyamazana yehlathi, izinkomo ezisentabeni eziyizinkulungwane.
019	PSA	050	011	Ngiyazazi izinyoni zonke zezintaba, lezilo zommango zikimi.
019	PSA	050	012	Uba bengilambile, bengingayikukutshela, ngoba umhlaba ngowami lokugcwala kwawo.
019	PSA	050	013	Ngizayidla yini inyama yezinkunzi, kumbe nginathe igazi lezimpongo?
019	PSA	050	014	Nikela kuNkulunkulu umhlatshelo wokubonga, ukhokhe izithembiso zakho koPhezukonke.
019	PSA	050	015	Ungibize osukwini lokuhlupheka, ngizakukhulula, ubusungidumisa.
019	PSA	050	016	Kodwa komubi uNkulunkulu uthi: Ulani lokuthi utshumayele izimiso zami, kumbe uthathe isivumelwano sami emlonyeni wakho?
019	PSA	050	017	Ngoba wena uzonda ukuqondiswa, ulahla amazwi ami emva kwakho.
019	PSA	050	018	Uba ubona isela, uthokozelana lalo, lesabelo sakho sisezifebeni.
019	PSA	050	019	Umlomo wakho uyawunikela ebubini, lolimi lwakho luqambe inkohliso.
019	PSA	050	020	Uhlala ukhulume umelene lomfowenu, uhlebe indodana kanyoko.
019	PSA	050	021	Lezizinto uzenzile, ngathula; wacabanga ukuthi nginjengawe kanye. Ngizakukhuza, ngikuhlele phambi kwamehlo akho.
019	PSA	050	022	Kuqapheleni-ke lokhu, lina elikhohlwa uNkulunkulu, hlezi ngilidabule, kungabi khona okukhululayo.
019	PSA	050	023	Onikela umnikelo wokubonga uyangidumisa; lolungisa indlela yakhe ngizambonisa usindiso lukaNkulunkulu.
019	PSA	051	001	Ngihawukela, Nkulunkulu, ngokothandolomusa wakho; ngobunengi besihawu sakho yesula iziphambeko zami.
019	PSA	051	002	Ungigezisise ebubini bami, ungihlambulule esonweni sami.
019	PSA	051	003	Ngoba mina ngiyazivuma iziphambeko zami, lesono sami sihlezi siphambi kwami.
019	PSA	051	004	Ngonile kuwe, kuwe wedwa, ngenze okubi emehlweni akho, ukuze kuthiwe ulungile ekukhulumeni kwakho, uhlanzeke ekwahluleleni kwakho.
019	PSA	051	005	Khangela, ngazalelwa ebubini, lomama wangomulela esonweni.
019	PSA	051	006	Khangela, uthanda iqiniso endaweni ezingaphakathi; lekusithekeni ungenza ngazi inhlakanipho.
019	PSA	051	007	Ngihlanze ngehisope, ngizahlambuluka; ngigezisa, ngizakuba mhlophe kuleliqhwa elikhithikileyo.
019	PSA	051	008	Ngizwise intokozo lenjabulo, ukuze athabe amathamboowachobozileyo.
019	PSA	051	009	Fihla ubuso bakho ezonweni zami, wesule zonke iziphambeko zami.
019	PSA	051	010	Nkulunkulu, dala kimi inhliziyo ehlambulukileyo, njalo uvuselele umoya oqinileyo phakathi kwami.
019	PSA	051	011	Ungangilahli ebusweni bakho, njalo ungasusi umoya wakho ongcwele kimi.
019	PSA	051	012	Buyisela kimi intokozo yosindiso lwakho, ungisekele ngomoya ovumayo.
019	PSA	051	013	Khona ngizafundisa abaphambukayo indlela zakho, lezoni zizaphendukela kuwe.
019	PSA	051	014	Ngikhulula ecaleni legazi, Nkulunkulu, Nkulunkulu wosindiso lwami, ulimi lwami luzahlabelela kakhulu ngokulunga kwakho.
019	PSA	051	015	Nkosi, vula indebe zami, lomlomo wami uzamemezela indumiso yakho.
019	PSA	051	016	Ngoba kawuthandi umhlatshelo, ngoba bengizawunika; kawuthokozi ngomnikelo wokutshiswa.
019	PSA	051	017	Imihlatshelo kaNkulunkulu ingumoya odabukileyo; inhliziyo edabukileyo leyephukileyo, Nkulunkulu, kawuyikuyidelela.
019	PSA	051	018	Yenzele iZiyoni okuhle ngokuthanda kwakho; uyakhe imiduli yeJerusalema.
019	PSA	051	019	Khona uzajabulela iminikelo yokulunga, umnikelo wokutshiswa, lomnikelo wonke; khona bezanikela amajongosi phezu kwelathi lakho.
019	PSA	052	001	Uzincomelani ngokubi, qhawe? Umusa kaNkulunkulu ukulo lonke usuku.
019	PSA	052	002	Ulimi lwakho luceba konke ukuganga, njengensingo ebukhali, lwenza inkohliso.
019	PSA	052	003	Uthanda okubi kulokuhle; amanga kulokukhuluma iqiniso. (Sela)
019	PSA	052	004	Uthanda wonke amazwi okuginya, limi lwenkohliso.
019	PSA	052	005	UNkulunkulu laye uzakubhidliza phakade, akususe, akuhluthune ethenteni, akusiphune elizweni labaphilayo. (Sela)
019	PSA	052	006	Abalungileyo bazakubona besabe, bazamhleka, besithi:
019	PSA	052	007	Khangelani, umuntu ongamenzanga uNkulunkulu abe yinqaba yakhe, kodwa wathembela ebunengini benotho yakhe, eqinile ekugangeni kwakhe.
019	PSA	052	008	Kodwa nginjengesihlahla somhlwathi esiluhlaza endlini kaNkulunkulu. Ngiyathemba emuseni kaNkulunkulu phakade laphakade.
019	PSA	052	009	Ngizakudumisa kuze kube phakade ngoba ukwenzile. Ngizalindela ibizo lakho, ngoba lihle phambi kwabangcwele bakho.
019	PSA	053	001	Isithutha sithi enhliziyweni yaso: KakulaNkulunkulu. Bonakele, benza ububi obunengekayo; kakho owenza okuhle.
019	PSA	053	002	UNkulunkulu wakhangela phansi esemazulwini phezu kwabantwana babantu, ukubona ukuthi ukhona yini oqedisisayo, odinga uNkulunkulu.
019	PSA	053	003	Bonke ngamunye wabo babuyele emuva, bonke bonakele; kakho owenza okuhle, kakho loyedwa.
019	PSA	053	004	Kabazi yini bonke abenzi bobubi, abadla abantu bami njengoba besidla isinkwa? Kababizi uNkulunkulu.
019	PSA	053	005	Lapho besaba lokwesaba, kungekho okwesabekayo. Ngoba uNkulunkulu uchithachithe amathambo akhe omisa inkamba emelane lawe; ubayangisile, ngoba uNkulunkulu ubadelile.
019	PSA	053	006	Kungathi insindiso zikaIsrayeli zingavela eZiyoni! Lapho uNkulunkulu ebuyisa ukuthunjwa kwabantu bakhe, uJakobe uzathaba, uIsrayeli athokoze.
019	PSA	054	001	Nkulunkulu, ngisindisa ngebizo lakho, ungahlulele ngamandla akho.
019	PSA	054	002	Nkulunkulu, zwana umkhuleko wami, ubeke indlebe emazwini omlomo wami.
019	PSA	054	003	Ngoba abemzini bangivukele, abalolunya badinga umphefumulo wami, kababekanga uNkulunkulu phambi kwabo. (Sela)
019	PSA	054	004	Khangela, uNkulunkulu ungumsizi wami; iNkosi ilalabo abasekela umphefumulo wami.
019	PSA	054	005	Izaphindisela ububi ezitheni zami. Baqume ngeqiniso lakho.
019	PSA	054	006	Ngizanikela umhlatshelo kuwe ngokukhululeka, ngizadumisa ibizo lakho, Nkosi, ngoba lihle.
019	PSA	054	007	Ngoba ungikhulule ekuhluphekeni konke, lelihlo lami libonile isiloyiso sami ezitheni zami.
019	PSA	055	001	Beka indlebe, Nkulunkulu, emkhulekweni wami, ungazifihli ekunxuseni kwami.
019	PSA	055	002	Lalela kimi, ungiphendule; ngiyazulazula ekukhalazeni kwami, ngenza umsindo,
019	PSA	055	003	ngenxa yelizwi lesitha, ngenxa yembandezelo yomubi; ngoba bangethwesa ububi, langentukuthelo bayangizonda.
019	PSA	055	004	Inhliziyo yami iyafutha phakathi kwami, lezethuso zokufa ziwele phezu kwami.
019	PSA	055	005	Uvalo lokuthuthumela kungifikele, lokwesaba okukhulu kungigubuzele.
019	PSA	055	006	Ngasengisithi: Kungathi ngabe ngilempiko njengejuba! Bengizaphaphela khatshana, ngiphumule.
019	PSA	055	007	Khangela, bengingabalekela khatshana ngihlale enkangala. (Sela)
019	PSA	055	008	Bengizaphangisisa ukuphunyuka kwami, ngisuke emoyeni ovunguzayo, esiphephweni.
019	PSA	055	009	Sanganisa, Nkosi, yehlukanisa ulimi lwabo. Ngoba ngibone udlakela lokuxabana emzini.
019	PSA	055	010	Emini lebusuku bayawubhoda phezu kwemithangala yawo; njalo ububi lenkathazo kuphakathi kwawo.
019	PSA	055	011	Inkohlakalo iphakathi kwawo; imbandezelo lenkohliso kakusuki emgwaqweni wawo.
019	PSA	055	012	Ngoba kakusisitha esingiyangisayo, uba kunjalo bengizakuthwala; kakusuye ongizondayo oziphakamisa phezu kwami; uba kunjalo bengizamcatshela.
019	PSA	055	013	Kodwa nguwe, umuntu olingana lami, umngane wami lowejwayelene lami.
019	PSA	055	014	Esasicebisana ngokumnandi sonke, saya endlini kaNkulunkulu silixuku.
019	PSA	055	015	Ukufa kakubazume, kabehlele esihogweni bephila, ngoba ububi busemizini yabo, phakathi kwabo.
019	PSA	055	016	Mina ngizabiza uNkulunkulu, iNkosi ingisindise-ke.
019	PSA	055	017	Kusihlwa lekuseni lemini ngizakhalaza ngikhale kakhulu, ibisilizwa ilizwi lami.
019	PSA	055	018	Ikhululile umphefumulo wami ngokuthula empini emelene lami, ngoba babebanengi kimi.
019	PSA	055	019	UNkulunkulu uzakuzwa, abahluphe, ngitsho yena obehlezi endulo. (Sela) Ngoba bengelazinguquko, ngakho kabamesabi uNkulunkulu.
019	PSA	055	020	Welule isandla sakhe kwabaxolelene laye, wasingcolisa isivumelwano sakhe.
019	PSA	055	021	Umlomo wakhe wawubutshelezi kulolaza, kanti inhliziyo yakhe yimpi; amazwi akhe abuthakathaka kulamafutha, kanti azinkemba ezihwatshiweyo.
019	PSA	055	022	Phosela umthwalo wakho phezu kweNkosi, yona izakusekela; kayiyikuvuma lanini ukuthi olungileyo anyikinywe.
019	PSA	055	023	Kodwa wena, Nkulunkulu, uzabehlisela emgodini wokubhujiswa; abantu begazi lenkohliso kabayikufinyelela lengxenyeni eyodwa kwezimbili yensuku zabo. Kodwa mina ngizathemba kuwe.
019	PSA	056	001	Woba lomusa kimi, Nkulunkulu, ngoba umuntu ufuna ukungiginya; usuku lonke esilwa uyangicindezela.
019	PSA	056	002	Izitha zami zifuna ukungiginya usuku lonke, ngoba zinengi ezilwa zimelene lami ngokuziphakamisa.
019	PSA	056	003	Mhla ngisesaba, mina ngizathemba kuwe.
019	PSA	056	004	KuNkulunkulu ngizadumisa ilizwi lakhe, kuNkulunkulu ngiyathemba, angiyikwesaba. Inyama ingenzani kimi?
019	PSA	056	005	Usuku lonke baphambanisa amazwi ami; yonke imicabango yabo imelene lami ngokubi.
019	PSA	056	006	Bayabuthana, bagugube, bona baqaphelise izinyathelo zami, lapho belindele umphefumulo wami.
019	PSA	056	007	Bazaphunyuka yini ngobubi? Ekuthukutheleni wisela phansi abantu, Nkulunkulu.
019	PSA	056	008	Ukuzulazula kwami ukubalile; wena faka izinyembezi zami embodleleni yakho; kazikho ogwalweni lwakho yini?
019	PSA	056	009	Khona izitha zami zizabuyela emuva mhla ngibizayo. Ngiyakwazi lokhu ukuthi uNkulunkulu ukimi.
019	PSA	056	010	KuNkulunkulu ngizadumisa ilizwi, eNkosini ngizadumisa ilizwi.
019	PSA	056	011	KuNkulunkulu ngiyathemba, angiyikwesaba. Umuntu angenzani kimi?
019	PSA	056	012	Nkulunkulu, izifungo zakho ziphezu kwami; ngizabuyisela kuwe izindumiso.
019	PSA	056	013	Ngoba uwukhulule umphefumulo wami ekufeni, yebo, inyawo zami ekukhubekeni, ukuze ngihambe phambi kukaNkulunkulu ekukhanyeni kwabaphilayo.
019	PSA	057	001	Ngihawukela, Nkulunkulu, ngihawukela, ngoba umphefumulo wami uthembela kuwe; yebo, emthunzini wempiko zakho ngizaphephela, zize zedlule incithakalo.
019	PSA	057	002	Ngizakhala kuNkulunkulu oPhezukonke, kuNkulunkulu ongiphelelisela khona.
019	PSA	057	003	Uzathumela esemazulwini, angisindise, ayangise ofuna ukungiginya. (Sela) UNkulunkulu uzathumela umusa wakhe leqiniso lakhe.
019	PSA	057	004	Umphefumulo uphakathi kwezilwane, ngilala phakathi kwabavuthayo, amadodana abantu, omazinyo abo ayimikhonto lemitshoko, lolimi lwabo luyinkemba ebukhali.
019	PSA	057	005	Phakama ngaphezu kwamazulu, Nkulunkulu; ubukhosi bakho bube phezu komhlaba wonke.
019	PSA	057	006	Balungisele izinyathelo zami imbule; umphefumulo wami ukhotheme; bagebhe igodi phambi kwami; bawele phakathi kwalo. (Sela)
019	PSA	057	007	Inhliziyo yami iqinisiwe, Nkulunkulu, inhliziyo yami iqinisiwe. Ngizahlabelela ngihube indumiso.
019	PSA	057	008	Vuka, dumo lwami! Vuka, gubhu lwezintambo lechacho! Ngizavusa ukusa.
019	PSA	057	009	Ngizakudumisa phakathi kwabantu, Nkosi, ngihlabelele kuwe phakathi kwezizwe.
019	PSA	057	010	Ngoba umusa wakho mkhulu kuze kube semazulwini, leqiniso lakho kuze kube semayezini.
019	PSA	057	011	Phakama ngaphezu kwamazulu, Nkulunkulu; ubukhosi bakho bube phezu komhlaba wonke.
019	PSA	058	001	Isibili likhuluma okulungileyo yini, babusi? Lehlulela ngokuqonda yini, madodana abantu?
019	PSA	058	002	Yebo, enhliziyweni lenza okubi, lilinganisa udlakela lwezandla zenu emhlabeni.
019	PSA	058	003	Ababi baba ngabemzini kusukela esiswini, bayaduha kusukela esizalweni, beqamba amanga.
019	PSA	058	004	Ubuhlungu babo bunjengobuhlungu benyoka, banjengebululu elingezwayo, elivimba indlebe yalo,
019	PSA	058	005	ukuze lingezwa ilizwi labalumbi abalumba amalumbo ngokuhlakanipha.
019	PSA	058	006	Nkulunkulu, yephula amazinyo abo emlonyeni wabo, uphohloze amazinyo emihlathi yamabhongo ezilwane, Nkosi.
019	PSA	058	007	Kabancibilike njengamanzi agelezayo; nxa egobisa idandili lakhe ukutshoka umtshoko wakhe, babe njengabaqunywe iziqa.
019	PSA	058	008	Kahambe njengomnenke oncibilikayo; njengomphunzo owesifazana, kabangaliboni ilanga.
019	PSA	058	009	Imbiza zenu zingakaluzwa ukhuni lwameva, uzabaphephula esiphephweni njengabaphilayo njengentukuthelweni.
019	PSA	058	010	Olungileyo uzathokoza lapho ebona impindiselo, uzageza inyawo zakhe egazini lomubi.
019	PSA	058	011	Ukuze umuntu athi: Impela ukhona umvuzo wolungileyo; impela ukhona uNkulunkulu owahlulela emhlabeni.
019	PSA	059	001	Ngikhulula ezitheni zami, Nkulunkulu wami, ungimise ngaphezu kwabangivukelayo.
019	PSA	059	002	Ngikhulula kubenzi bobubi, ungisindise ebantwini abomele igazi.
019	PSA	059	003	Ngoba, khangela, bacathamela umphefumulo wami; abalamandla bayangihlanganyela, kungekho siphambeko sami njalo kungekho sono sami, Nkosi.
019	PSA	059	004	Ngaphandle kwecala bayagijima bezilungisa. Vuka, ungisize, ubone.
019	PSA	059	005	Wena-ke, Nkosi Nkulunkulu wamabandla, Nkulunkulu kaIsrayeli; vuka ukuze uhambele zonke izizwe, ungahawukeli lamunye wabakhohlisayo ebubini. (Sela)
019	PSA	059	006	Bayabuyela kusihlwa, behlaba umkhulungwane njengenja, bezingelezela umuzi.
019	PSA	059	007	Khangela, bempompoloza ngomlomo wabo, inkemba zisendebeni zabo, ngoba bathi: Ngubani ozwayo?
019	PSA	059	008	Kodwa wena, Nkosi, uzabahleka, uzaziklolodela zonke izizwe.
019	PSA	059	009	Ngenxa yamandla akhe ngizalindela kuwe, ngoba uNkulunkulu uyinqaba yami.
019	PSA	059	010	UNkulunkulu womusa wami uzangandulela; uNkulunkulu uzangenza ngibone isiloyiso sami ezitheni zami.
019	PSA	059	011	Ungazibulali, hlezi abantu bakithi bakhohlwe; uzizulazulise ngamandla akho, uzehlisele phansi, wena sihlangu sethu, Nkosi.
019	PSA	059	012	Ngesono somlomo wazo, ngelizwi lendebe zazo, kazibanjwe ekuzigqajeni kwazo, langenxa yokuhlambaza lokuqamba amanga ezikukhulumayo.
019	PSA	059	013	Uziqede ngokuthukuthela, uziqede zingabi khona, ukuze bazi ukuthi uNkulunkulu uyabusa koJakobe, kuze kube sekupheleni komhlaba. (Sela)
019	PSA	059	014	Kababuyele-ke kusihlwa behlaba umkhulungwane njengenja, bezingelezela umuzi.
019	PSA	059	015	Bona kabazulazulele ukudla, nxa bengasuthanga kabalale.
019	PSA	059	016	Kodwa mina ngizahlabelela ngamandla akho; yebo, ngizahlabelela kakhulu ekuseni ngomusa wakho; ngoba ube yinqaba yami lesiphephelo sami ngosuku lokuhlupheka kwami.
019	PSA	059	017	Mandla ami, ngizahlabelela kuwe, ngoba uNkulunkulu uyinqaba yami, uNkulunkulu womusa wami.
019	PSA	060	001	Nkulunkulu, ubusilahlile, wasibhidliza, wathukuthela; buyela kithi.
019	PSA	060	002	Uzamazamisile umhlaba, wawuqhekeza; silisa imikenke yawo, ngoba uyazamazama.
019	PSA	060	003	Abantu bakho ubabonisile okulukhuni; usinathise iwayini lokudiyazela.
019	PSA	060	004	Ubanikile labo abakwesabayo isiboniso, ukuze siphakanyiswe ngenxa yeqiniso. (Sela)
019	PSA	060	005	Ukuze abathandekayo bakho bakhululwe; sindisa ngesandla sakho sokunene, usiphendule.
019	PSA	060	006	UNkulunkulu ukhulumile ebungcweleni bakhe. Ngizathaba, ngilabe iShekema, ngilinganise isihotsha seSukothi.
019	PSA	060	007	Ngeyami iGileyadi, njalo ngowami uManase, loEfrayimi ungamandla ekhanda lami, uJuda ngumnikumthetho wami.
019	PSA	060	008	UMowabi ungumganu wami wokugezela; phezu kukaEdoma ngizaphosela inyathela lami; mayelana lami, wena Filisti, memeza ngokunqoba.
019	PSA	060	009	Ngubani ozangisa emzini oqinileyo? Ngubani ozangiholela eEdoma?
019	PSA	060	010	Kawusilahlanga yini, Nkulunkulu; kawuphumanga, Nkulunkulu, lamabutho ethu?
019	PSA	060	011	Siphe usizo ekuhlupheni, ngoba luyize uncedo lomuntu.
019	PSA	060	012	KuNkulunkulu sizakwenza ngobuqhawe, ngoba yena uzanyathelela phansi izitha zethu.
019	PSA	061	001	Zwana, Nkulunkulu, ukukhala kwami, ulalele umkhuleko wami.
019	PSA	061	002	Ngisemkhawulweni womhlaba ngizakhala kuwe, inhliziyo yami isiphela amandla; ngikhokhelela edwaleni eliphakemeyo kulami.
019	PSA	061	003	Ngoba ubuyisiphephelo sami, inqaba eqinileyo kuso isitha.
