019	PSA	063	004	Ngokunjalo ngizakubonga ngisaphila, ngiphakamise izandla zami ebizweni lakho.
019	PSA	063	005	Umphefumulo wami uzasutha kungathi ngomnkantsho lamahwahwa, lomlomo wami uzadumisa ngezindebe ezithabisayo.
019	PSA	063	006	Lapho ngikukhumbula embhedeni wami, emilindweni yebusuku ngizindla ngawe.
019	PSA	063	007	Ngoba ubulusizo lwami, ngakho emthunzini wempiko zakho ngizahlabela ngithokoze.
019	PSA	063	008	Umphefumulo wami unamathele ekukulandeleni, isandla sakho sokunene siyangisekela.
019	PSA	063	009	Kodwa abadinga umphefumulo wami ukuwuchitha bazakuya ezindaweni zomhlaba eziphansi.
019	PSA	063	010	Bazanikelwa emandleni enkemba, babe yisabelo samakhanka.
019	PSA	063	011	Kodwa inkosi izathokoza kuNkulunkulu; wonke ofunga ngaye uzazincoma; kodwa umlomo wabaqamba amanga uzavalwa.
019	PSA	064	001	Zwana, Nkulunkulu, ilizwi lami esikhalazweni sami, ulondoloze impilo yami ekwesabeni isitha.
019	PSA	064	002	Ungifihle ecebeni elifihliweyo lababi, ekuxokozeleni kwabenzi bobubi,
019	PSA	064	003	abalola ulimi lwabo njengenkemba, bagobise umtshoko wabo, ngitsho amazwi ababayo,
