019	PSA	065	012	Ithontela amadlelo eganga, lamaqaqa embethe intokozo.
019	PSA	065	013	Amadlelo embethe imihlambi, lezigodi zisitshekelwe ngamabele; kuyajabula kakhulu, njalo kuhlabele.
