019	PSA	066	008	Bongani uNkulunkulu, zizwe, lizwakalise ilizwi lendumiso yakhe.
019	PSA	066	009	Obeka umphefumulo wethu empilweni, ongavumanga ukuthi unyawo lwethu lutshelele.
019	PSA	066	010	Ngoba usihlolile, Nkulunkulu, wasicenga njengokucengwa kwesiliva.
019	PSA	066	011	Wasingenisa embuleni, wabeka inhlupheko enkalweni zethu.
019	PSA	066	012	Wenze abantu bagade phezu kwekhanda lethu; sadabula emlilweni lasemanzini, kodwa wasikhuphela endaweni elokunengi.
019	PSA	066	013	Ngizangena endlini yakho ngileminikelo yokutshiswa; ngizakhokha kuwe izifungo zami,
