019	PSA	066	018	Uba benginanze ububi enhliziyweni yami, ibingayikuzwa iNkosi.
019	PSA	066	019	Qotho uNkulunkulu uzwile, walalela ilizwi lomkhuleko wami.
019	PSA	066	020	Kabongwe uNkulunkulu, ongabuyiselanga emuva umkhuleko wami, kumbe umusa wakhe kimi.
019	PSA	067	001	Nkulunkulu, woba lomusa kithi usibusise, ukhanyise ubuso bakho phezu kwethu. (Sela)
019	PSA	067	002	Ukuze indlela yakho yaziwe emhlabeni, usindiso lwakho ezizweni zonke.
019	PSA	067	003	Kazikudumise izizwe, Nkulunkulu, kabakudumise abantu bonke.
