019	PSA	069	007	Ngoba ngenxa yakho ngithwele ihlazo; inhloni zisibekele ubuso bami.
019	PSA	069	008	Sengaba ngowemzini kubafowethu, lowezizweni kubantwana bakamama.
019	PSA	069	009	Ngoba ukutshisekela indlu yakho kungidlile, lenhlamba yabakuhlambazayo iwele phezu kwami.
