019	PSA	070	004	Kabathabe bajabule kuwe bonke abakudingayo; labathanda usindiso lwakho kabatsho njalo bathi: Kabe mkhulu uNkulunkulu!
019	PSA	070	005	Kodwa ngingumyanga njalo ngiyaswela; Nkulunkulu, phangisa uze kimi. Wena ungumsizi wami lomkhululi wami; Nkosi, ungaphuzi.
019	PSA	071	001	Kuwe, Nkosi, ngiyaphephela; kangingayangeki lanininini.
019	PSA	071	002	Ngikhulula ngokulunga kwakho, ungophule; beka indlebe yakho kimi, ungisindise.
