019	PSA	088	016	Ulaka lwakho olutshisayo ludlulile phezu kwami, okwesabekayo kwakho kungiqedile.
019	PSA	088	017	Kungizingelezile njengamanzi usuku lonke, kungihanqile kanyekanye.
019	PSA	088	018	Ususele khatshana lami othandayo lomngane, abejwayelene lami basemnyameni.
019	PSA	089	001	Ngizahlabela ngezisa zeNkosi, kuze kube nininini; ngomlomo wami ngizakwazisa ukuthembeka kwakho kusizukulwana lesizukulwana.
019	PSA	089	002	Ngoba ngithe: Umusa uzakwakhiwa kuze kube phakade; emazulwini ngokwawo uzaqinisa uthembeko lwakho.
019	PSA	089	003	Ngenze isivumelwano lomkhethwa wami, ngifungile kuDavida inceku yami.
019	PSA	089	004	Ngizaqinisa inzalo yakho kuze kube nininini, ngakhe isihlalo sakho sobukhosi esizukulwaneni lesizukulwana. (Sela)
019	PSA	089	005	Lamazulu azadumisa izimangaliso zakho, Nkosi, lalo uthembeko lwakho ebandleni labangcwele.
019	PSA	089	006	Ngoba ngubani esibhakabhakeni ongafananiswa leNkosi? Ngubani ofanana leNkosi phakathi kwamadodana abalamandla?
019	PSA	089	007	UNkulunkulu uyesabeka kakhulu emhlanganweni wabangcwele, njalo umele ukuhlonitshwa phezu kwabo bonke abamhanqileyo.
019	PSA	089	008	Nkosi Nkulunkulu wamabandla, ngubani olamandla njengawe, Nkosi? Lothembeko lwakho lukuhanqile.
019	PSA	089	009	Wena uyabusa ukukhukhumala kolwandle; lapho amagagasi alo ephakama wena uyawathulisa.
019	PSA	089	010	Wena wamchoboza uRahabi njengobuleweyo, wazihlakaza izitha zakho ngengalo yamandla akho.
019	PSA	089	011	Amazulu ngawakho, lomhlaba ngowakho; ilizwe lokugcwala kwalo, wena wakusekela.
019	PSA	089	012	Inyakatho leningizimu wakudala wena; iThabhori leHermoni kuzajabula ngebizo lakho.
019	PSA	089	013	Ulengalo elamandla, isandla sakho siqinile, isandla sakho sokunene siphakeme.
019	PSA	089	014	Ukulunga lesahlulelo kuyisisekelo sesihlalo sakho sobukhosi; umusa leqiniso kuhamba phambi kobuso bakho.
019	PSA	089	015	Babusisiwe abantu abawaziyo umsindo wentokozo; bazahamba ekukhanyeni kobuso bakho, Nkosi.
019	PSA	089	016	Ebizweni lakho bazathokoza usuku lonke, langokulunga kwakho bazaphakanyiswa.
019	PSA	089	017	Ngoba wena uludumo lwamandla abo; langomusa wakho uphondo lwethu luzaphakanyiswa.
019	PSA	089	018	Ngoba isihlangu sethu singeseNkosi, lenkosi yethu ingeyoNgcwele kaIsrayeli.
019	PSA	089	019	Khona wakhuluma ngombono kongcwele wakho, wathi: Ngibekile usizo phezu kweqhawe, ngimphakamisile okhethiweyo phakathi kwabantu.
019	PSA	089	020	Ngithole uDavida inceku yami, ngamafutha ami angcwele ngimgcobile,
019	PSA	089	021	osandla sami sizakuba laye siqinile, ingalo yami layo izamqinisa.
019	PSA	089	022	Isitha kasiyikumcindezela, lendodana yenkohlakalo kayiyikumhlupha.
019	PSA	089	023	Ngizazichoboza izitha zakhe phambi kobuso bakhe, ngihluphe abamzondayo.
019	PSA	089	024	Kodwa uthembeko lwami lomusa wami kuzakuba laye, lebizweni lami luzaphakanyiswa uphondo lwakhe.
019	PSA	089	025	Njalo ngizabeka isandla sakhe olwandle, lesandla sakhe sokunene emifuleni.
019	PSA	089	026	Yena uzangibiza ngokuthi: Wena ungubaba wami, uNkulunkulu wami, ledwala losindiso lwami.
019	PSA	089	027	Njalo mina ngizammisa abe lizibulo, aphakame kakhulu kulamakhosi omhlaba.
019	PSA	089	028	Ngizaligcinela umusa wami kuze kube nininini, lesivumelwano sami sizaqina kuye.
019	PSA	089	029	Njalo ngizamisa inzalo yakhe kuze kube nininini, lesihlalo sakhe sobukhosi njengensuku zamazulu.
019	PSA	089	030	Uba abantwana bakhe betshiya umlayo wami, bangahambi ngezahlulelo zami,
019	PSA	089	031	uba besephula izimiso zami, bengagcini imithetho yami,
019	PSA	089	032	ngizaphindisela iziphambeko zabo ngenduku, lesono sabo ngenswazi.
019	PSA	089	033	Kodwa kangiyikulususa du uthandolomusa wami kuye, ngingakhohlisi ngothembeko lwami.
019	PSA	089	034	Kangiyikwephula isivumelwano sami, lalokho okuphuma endebeni zami kangiyikukuguqula.
019	PSA	089	035	Ngafunga kwaba kanye ngobungcwele bami: Kangiyikuqamba amanga kuDavida.
019	PSA	089	036	Inzalo yakhe izakuba khona kuze kube nininini, lesihlalo sakhe sobukhosi njengelanga phambi kwami.
