019	PSA	089	038	Kodwa wena usulahlile wala, wamthukuthelela ogcotshiweyo wakho.
019	PSA	089	039	Usenze ize isivumelwano senceku yakho; wangcolisa umqhele wakhe emhlabathini.
019	PSA	089	040	Uyibhobozile yonke imithangala yakhe, wazenza inqaba zakhe amanxiwa.
019	PSA	089	041	Bonke abadlula ngendlela bayamphanga; ulihlazo kubomakhelwane bakhe.
019	PSA	089	042	Usiphakamisile isandla sokunene sabamelene laye; wazithokozisa zonke izitha zakhe.
019	PSA	089	043	Futhi ubuyisele emuva ubukhali benkemba yakhe; kawumenzanga ame empini.
019	PSA	089	044	Uyiqedile inkazimulo yakhe, lesihlalo sakhe sobukhosi wasiphosela emhlabathini.
019	PSA	089	045	Ufinyezile insuku zobutsha bakhe, wamembesa ihlazo. (Sela)
019	PSA	089	046	Koze kube nini, Nkosi, ucatsha kuze kube phakade? Ulaka lwakho luvutha njengomlilo yini?
019	PSA	089	047	Khumbula ukuthi isikhathi sempilo yami singakanani; kungani wadalela ize bonke abantwana babantu?
019	PSA	089	048	Ngubani umuntu ophilayo ongaboni ukufa? Akhulule umphefumulo wakhe esandleni sengcwaba na? (Sela)
019	PSA	089	049	Zingaphi izisa zakho zakuqala, Nkosi, owazifunga kuDavida ngothembeko lwakho?
019	PSA	089	050	Khumbula, Nkosi, ihlazo lezinceku zakho, engilithwele esifubeni sami, elazo zonke izizwe ezinengi,
