019	PSA	089	052	Kayibongwe iNkosi kuze kube nininini. Ameni, loAmeni.
019	PSA	090	001	Nkosi, wena ubuyindawo yethu yokuhlala kusizukulwana lesizukulwana.
019	PSA	090	002	Zingakazalwa intaba, kumbe uveze umhlaba lelizwe, ngitsho kusukela ephakadeni kuze kube sephakadeni wena unguNkulunkulu.
019	PSA	090	003	Uyambuyisela umuntu encithakalweni, uthi: Buyelani, bantwana babantu.
019	PSA	090	004	Ngoba iminyaka eyinkulungwane emehlweni akho injengelanga lezolo selidlulile, lanjengomlindo ebusuku.
019	PSA	090	005	Uyabakhukhula, banjengobuthongo, ekuseni banjengotshani obuhlumayo.
019	PSA	090	006	Ekuseni buyakhahlela, bukhule, ntambama buyasikwa, bubune.
019	PSA	090	007	Ngoba siqedwa yikuthukuthela kwakho, langolaka lwakho sibhujiswe.
019	PSA	090	008	Ubekile iziphambeko zethu phambi kwakho, izono zethu ezifihlakeleyo ekukhanyeni kobuso bakho.
019	PSA	090	009	Ngoba insuku zethu zonke ziyedlula elakeni lwakho; sichitha iminyaka yethu njengokubeka iphika.
019	PSA	090	010	Insuku zeminyaka yethu, kuleminyaka engamatshumi ayisikhombisa kuzo; njalo uba ngenxa yamandla zingamatshumi ayisificaminwembili, kanti ukuzigqaja kwayo kuyinhlupheko losizi, ngoba aphangisa aqunywe, sibe sesiphapha sinyamalale.
019	PSA	090	011	Ngubani owaziyo amandla okuthukuthela kwakho? Lanjengokwesabeka kwakho lunjalo ulaka lwakho.
019	PSA	090	012	Ngokunjalo sifundise ukubala insuku zethu, ukuze sizuze inhliziyo yenhlakanipho.
019	PSA	090	013	Phenduka, Nkosi! Koze kube nini? Hawukela izinceku zakho.
019	PSA	090	014	Sisuthise ekuseni ngomusa wakho, ukuze sithabe sijabule insuku zethu zonke.
019	PSA	090	015	Sithokozise njengokwensuku owasihlupha ngazo, iminyaka esabona okubi kuyo.
019	PSA	090	016	Umsebenzi wakho kawubonakale ezincekwini zakho, lenkazimulo yakho ebantwaneni bazo.
019	PSA	090	017	Ubuhle beNkosi, uNkulunkulu wethu, kabube phezu kwethu; uqinise umsebenzi wezandla zethu kithi, yebo, umsebenzi wezandla zethu uwuqinise.
019	PSA	091	001	Ohlezi ekusithekeni koPhezukonke uzahlala emthunzini kaSomandla.
019	PSA	091	002	Ngizakuthi eNkosini: Uyisiphephelo sami lenqaba yami, uNkulunkulu wami, engithemba kuye.
