019	PSA	091	007	Bazakuwa abayinkulungwane eceleni kwakho, labayizinkulungwane ezilitshumi ngakwesokunene sakho; kuwe kakuyikusondela.
019	PSA	091	008	Uzakhangela nje ngamehlo akho, ubone impindiselo kwababi.
019	PSA	091	009	Ngoba wena, Nkosi, uyisiphephelo sami; umenzile oPhezukonke waba yindawo yakho yokuhlala.
019	PSA	091	010	Kakulabubi obuzakwehlela, lenhlupheko kayiyikusondela ethenteni lakho.
019	PSA	091	011	Ngoba uzalaya ingilosi zakhe ngawe, ukuthi zikulondoloze endleleni zakho zonke.
019	PSA	091	012	Zizakuphatha ezandleni, hlezi utshayeke ngonyawo lwakho elitsheni.
019	PSA	091	013	Uzanyathela isilwane lebululu, uzagxoba ibhongo lesilwane, lomgobho.
