019	PSA	092	006	Isiphukuphuku kasazi, lesithutha kasikuqedisisi lokhu.
019	PSA	092	007	Lapho ababi behluma njengotshani, labo bonke abenzi bobubi bekhahlela, kuyikuze babhujiswe kuze kube phakade.
019	PSA	092	008	Kodwa wena, Nkosi, uphakeme kuze kube nininini.
019	PSA	092	009	Ngoba khangela, izitha zakho, Nkosi, ngoba khangela, izitha zakho zizabhubha; bonke abenzi bobubi bazachitheka.
