019	PSA	148	003	Idumiseni langa lenyanga. Idumiseni lonke zinkanyezi ezikhanyayo.
019	PSA	148	004	Idumiseni mazulu amazulu, lani manzi aphezu kwamazulu.
019	PSA	148	005	Kakudumise ibizo leNkosi; ngoba yona yalaya, kwasekudalwa.
019	PSA	148	006	Yakumisa kuze kube nini lanini; yakhupha isimiso esingayikwedlula.
019	PSA	148	007	Dumisani iNkosi lisemhlabeni, migobho yolwandle, lani zinziki zonke,
019	PSA	148	008	mlilo lesiqhotho, liqhwa elikhithikileyo lenkungu, siphepho esenza ilizwi layo;
019	PSA	148	009	zintaba lamaqaqa wonke, zihlahla zezithelo lemisedari yonke,
019	PSA	148	010	zinyamazana zeganga lezifuyo zonke, zinto ezihuquzelayo lenyoni eziphaphayo.
019	PSA	148	011	Makhosi omhlaba, lani zizwe zonke, ziphathamandla, lani babusi bomhlaba,
019	PSA	148	012	majaha, lani-ke zintombi, maxhegu labatsha.
019	PSA	148	013	Kabadumise ibizo leNkosi, ngoba ibizo layo lodwa liphakeme; ubukhosi bayo buphezu komhlaba lamazulu.
019	PSA	148	014	Njalo iphakamisile uphondo lwabantu bayo, indumiso yabo bonke abangcwele bayo, eyabantwana bakoIsrayeli, abantu abaseduze layo. Dumisani iNkosi!
019	PSA	149	001	Dumisani iNkosi! HIabelelani iNkosi ingoma entsha, indumiso yayo ebandleni labangcwele.
019	PSA	149	002	UIsrayeli kathokoze ngoMenzi wakhe, abantwana beZiyoni kabathabe eNkosini yabo.
019	PSA	149	003	Kabadumise ibizo layo ngokusina, kabayihlabelele indumiso ngesigujana lechacho.
019	PSA	149	004	Ngoba iNkosi iyathokoza ngabantu bayo; izacecisa abamnene ngosindiso.
019	PSA	149	005	Abangcwele kabathokoze ngendumiso, kabahlabelele ngenjabulo emibhedeni yabo.
019	PSA	149	006	Indumiso zikaNkulunkulu zisemphinjeni wabo, lenkemba esika nhlangothi mbili esandleni sabo,
019	PSA	149	007	ukuze benze impindiselo phezu kwabahedeni, izijeziso phezu kwezizwe,
019	PSA	149	008	ukuze babophe amakhosi azo ngamaketane, lezikhulu zazo ngezibopho zensimbi,
019	PSA	149	009	ukuze benze isahlulelo esibhaliweyo phezu kwazo. Loludumo abangcwele bayo bonke balalo. Dumisani iNkosi!
019	PSA	150	001	Dumisani iNkosi! Dumisani uNkulunkulu endlini yakhe engcwele; mdumiseni emkhathini wamandla akhe.
019	PSA	150	002	Mdumiseni ngenxa yezenzo zakhe ezilamandla, limdumise ngenxa yobunengi bobukhulu bakhe.
019	PSA	150	003	Mdumiseni ngokuvuthelwa kophondo, limdumise ngogubhu lwezintambo lechacho,
019	PSA	150	004	limdumise ngesigujana langokusina, limdumise ngezinto zokuhlabelela ezilentambo langomhlanga,
019	PSA	150	005	limdumise ngensimbi ezincencethayo ezihlokomayo, limdumise ngensimbi ezincencethayo ezikhala kakhulu.
019	PSA	150	006	Konke okuphefumulayo kakudumise iNkosi. Dumisani iNkosi!
#
# BOOK	020	PRO	Proverbs	Izaga
020	PRO	001	001	Izaga zikaSolomoni, indodana kaDavida, inkosi yakoIsrayeli;
020	PRO	001	002	ukwazi inhlakanipho lokulaywa, ukuqedisisa amazwi okuqedisisa,
020	PRO	001	003	ukwemukela ukulaya kwenhlakanipho, ukulunga, lesahlulelo, lokuqonda;
020	PRO	001	004	ukunika abangelalwazi inhlakanipho, ijaha ulwazi lengqondo.
020	PRO	001	005	Ohlakaniphileyo uzakuzwa, andise ukufunda, loqedisisayo uzazuza izeluleko,
020	PRO	001	006	ukuqedisisa isaga lomzekeliso, amazwi abahlakaniphileyo, lamalibho abo.
020	PRO	001	007	Ukwesaba iNkosi kuyikuqala kolwazi; izithutha ziyadelela inhlakanipho lokulaywa.
020	PRO	001	008	Ndodana yami, zwana ukulaya kukayihlo, ungawudeli umlayo kanyoko;
020	PRO	001	009	ngoba kuzakuba ngumqhele womusa ekhanda lakho, lemigaxo entanyeni yakho.
020	PRO	001	010	Ndodana yami, uba izoni zikuhuga, ungavumi.
020	PRO	001	011	Uba zisithi: Hamba lathi, siyecathamela igazi, sicatshele ongelacala kungelasizatho;
020	PRO	001	012	sibaginye bephila njengengcwaba, yebo, ngokupheleleyo, njengabehlela egodini.
020	PRO	001	013	Sizathola yonke impahla eligugu, sigcwalise izindlu zethu ngempango.
020	PRO	001	014	Phosela inkatho yakho phakathi kwethu; sonke sibe lesikhwama semali sinye.
020	PRO	001	015	Ndodana yami, ungahambi lazo endleleni; unqande unyawo lwakho emkhondweni wazo.
020	PRO	001	016	Ngoba inyawo zazo zigijimela ebubini, ziphangisa ukuchitha igazi.
020	PRO	001	017	Isibili, imbule lendlalelwa ize phambi kwamehlo aloba yiyiphi inyoni.
020	PRO	001	018	Lalaba bacathamela igazi labo, bacatshele imiphefumulo yabo.
020	PRO	001	019	Zinjalo indlela zakhe wonke ozuza inzuzo ngokuphanga; ithatha impilo yabaniniyo.
020	PRO	001	020	UkuHlakanipha kuyamemeza ngaphandle, kukhupha ilizwi lakho emidangeni.
020	PRO	001	021	Kuyamemeza endaweni eqakathekileyo yokuxokozela, ekungeneni kwamasango; emzini kutsho amazwi akho,
020	PRO	001	022	kusithi: Koze kube nini, lina elingelalwazi, lithanda ukungabi lalwazi, labaklolodayo bezifisela ukukloloda, leziphukuphuku zizonda ulwazi?
020	PRO	001	023	Phendukelani ekukhuzeni kwami; khangelani, ngizathululela umoya wami kini, ngilazise amazwi ami.
020	PRO	001	024	Ngoba ngibizile, kodwa lala; ngelulile isandla sami, kodwa kakho onanzayo;
020	PRO	001	025	ladelela sonke iseluleko sami, kalivumanga ukukhuza kwami;
020	PRO	001	026	mina-ke ngizahleka ukuchitheka kwenu, ngiklolode ekufikeni kokwesaba kwenu,
020	PRO	001	027	ekufikeni kokwesaba kwenu njengesiphepho, lokuchitheka kwenu kufika njengesivunguzane, lapho ubuhlungu losizi kulehlela.
020	PRO	001	028	Khona bazangibiza, kodwa kangiyikusabela; bazangidingisisa, kodwa kabayikungithola.
020	PRO	001	029	Ngenxa yokuthi babezonda ulwazi, bengakhethanga ukwesaba iNkosi.
020	PRO	001	030	Kabavumanga iseluleko sami, bedelela konke ukukhuza kwami.
020	PRO	001	031	Ngakho bazakudla okwesithelo sendlela yabo, basuthiswe ngamacebo abo.
020	PRO	001	032	Ngoba ukuhlehla kwabangelalwazi kuzababulala, lokonwaba kweziphukuphuku kuzababhubhisa.
020	PRO	001	033	Kodwa ongilalelayo uzahlala evikelekile, onwabe ekwesabeni okubi.
020	PRO	002	001	Ndodana yami, uba usemukela amazwi ami, ugcine kuwe imilayo yami,
020	PRO	002	002	ukuthi wenze indlebe yakho ilalele inhlakanipho, uthobise inhliziyo yakho ekuqedisiseni,
020	PRO	002	003	yebo, uba ukhalela ukuqedisisa, ukhuphele ilizwi lakho ekuzwisiseni,
020	PRO	002	004	uba ukudinga njengesiliva, ukuphenye njengezimpahla eziligugu ezifihliweyo,
020	PRO	002	005	khona uzaqedisisa ukuyesaba iNkosi, uthole ulwazi lukaNkulunkulu.
020	PRO	002	006	Ngoba iNkosi inika inhlakanipho; ulwazi lokuqedisisa kuvela emlonyeni wayo.
020	PRO	002	007	Iyababekela abaqotho inhlakanipho eqotho; iyisihlangu kubo abahamba ngokuqonda,
020	PRO	002	008	ukugcina indlela zesahlulelo; izalondoloza indlela zabangcwele bayo.
020	PRO	002	009	Khona uzaqedisisa ukulunga, lesahlulelo, lokuqonda; yonke indlela elungileyo.
020	PRO	002	010	Lapho inhlakanipho izangena enhliziyweni yakho, lolwazi lube mnandi emphefumulweni wakho;
020	PRO	002	011	ingqondo izakugcina, ukuqedisisa kukulondoloze;
020	PRO	002	012	ukukophula endleleni embi, emuntwini okhuluma izinto eziphambeneyo;
020	PRO	002	013	abatshiya indlela zobuqotho, ukuze bahambe ngendlela zobumnyama;
020	PRO	002	014	abathokoza ngokwenza okubi, bejabula ekuphambukeni komubi;
020	PRO	002	015	abandlela zabo ziphambene, begobile emikhondweni yabo;
020	PRO	002	016	ukukophula kowesifazana wemzini, kowezizwe okhohlisa ngamazwi akhe;
020	PRO	002	017	otshiya umngane wobutsha bakhe, ekhohlwa isivumelwano sikaNkulunkulu wakhe;
020	PRO	002	018	ngoba indlu yakhe itshonela ekufeni, lemikhondo yakhe emimoyeni efileyo.
020	PRO	002	019	Bonke abangena kuye kabayikubuya, njalo kabayikufinyelela endleleni zempilo.
020	PRO	002	020	Ukuze uhambe endleleni yabalungileyo, ugcine imikhondo yamalungisa.
020	PRO	002	021	Ngoba abaqotho bazahlala elizweni, labapheleleyo basale kulo;
020	PRO	002	022	kodwa abakhohlakeleyo bazaqunywa basuswe elizweni, labaphambekayo badatshulwe basuswe kulo.
020	PRO	003	001	Ndodana yami, ungakhohlwa umlayo wami, kodwa inhliziyo yakho kayigcine imilayo yami.
020	PRO	003	002	Ngoba yengezelela kuwe ubude bezinsuku leminyaka yempilo lokuthula.
020	PRO	003	003	Umusa lothembeko kakungakutshiyi, kubophele entanyeni yakho, ukubhale esibhebheni senhliziyo yakho.
020	PRO	003	004	Ngalokho uzathola umusa lokuqedisisa okuhle emehlweni kaNkulunkulu labantu.
020	PRO	003	005	Themba eNkosini ngenhliziyo yakho yonke, ungeyami ekuqedisiseni kwakho.
020	PRO	003	006	Ivume endleleni zakho zonke, yona-ke izaqondisa imikhondo yakho.
020	PRO	003	007	Ungabi ngohlakaniphileyo emehlweni akho; yesabe iNkosi, usuke ebubini.
020	PRO	003	008	Kuzakuba yikwelatshwa kwenkaba yakho, lokunathwayo kwamathambo akho.
020	PRO	003	009	Hlonipha iNkosi ngemfuyo yakho, langezithelo zakho zokuqala zesivuno sakho sonke.
020	PRO	003	010	Khona iziphala zakho zizagcwaliswa ngenala, lezikhamelo zakho zewayini ziphuphume iwayini elitsha.
020	PRO	003	011	Ndodana yami, ungadeleli ukulaya kweNkosi, unganengwa yikukhuza kwayo.
020	PRO	003	012	Ngoba iNkosi iyamlaya emthandayo, yebo, njengoyise indodana athokoza ngayo.
020	PRO	003	013	Ubusisiwe umuntu othola inhlakanipho, lomuntu ozuza ukuqedisisa.
020	PRO	003	014	Ngoba inzuzo yakho ingcono kulenzuzo yesiliva, lokutholakalayo kwakho kulegolide.
020	PRO	003	015	Kuligugu elidlula amatshe aligugu, lakho konke ongakufisa kakulinganiswa lakho.
020	PRO	003	016	Ubude bezinsuku busesandleni sakho sokunene, kwesokhohlo sakho inotho lodumo.
020	PRO	003	017	Izindlela zakho zizindlela zentokozo, lemikhondo yakho yonke iyikuthula.
020	PRO	003	018	Kuyisihlahla sempilo kwabakubambayo, lobambelela kukho ubusisiwe.
020	PRO	003	019	Ngenhlakanipho iNkosi yasekela umhlaba; yamisa amazulu ngokuqedisisa.
020	PRO	003	020	Ngolwazi lwayo izinziki zaqhekezwa, lamayezi athonta amazolo.
020	PRO	003	021	Ndodana yami, kakungasuki emehlweni akho; gcina inhlakanipho eqotho lengqondo.
020	PRO	003	022	Njalo kuzakuba yimpilo yomphefumulo wakho, lesisa entanyeni yakho.
020	PRO	003	023	Khona uzahamba indlela yakho uvikelekile, lonyawo lwakho kaluyikukhubeka.
020	PRO	003	024	Nxa ulala phansi, kawuyikwesaba, yebo, uzalala, lobuthongo bakho buzakuba mnandi.
020	PRO	003	025	Ungesabi uvalo olujumayo, kumbe ukuchitheka kwababi nxa kufika.
020	PRO	003	026	Ngoba iNkosi izakuba sethembeni lakho, igcine unyawo lwakho ukuze lungabanjwa.
020	PRO	003	027	Ungagodleli umninikho okuhle nxa kusemandleni esandla sakho ukukwenza.
020	PRO	003	028	Ungathi kumakhelwane wakho: Hamba, ubuye, kusasa ngizakunika; nxa ulakho.
020	PRO	003	029	Ungacebi okubi ngomakhelwane wakho, ngoba yena uhlala lawe evikelekile.
020	PRO	003	030	Ungaphikisani lomuntu kungelasizatho, nxa engakonanga.
020	PRO	003	031	Ungahawukeli umuntu olobudlwangudlwangu; ungakhethi leyodwa yezindlela zakhe.
020	PRO	003	032	Ngoba ophambeneyo uyisinengiso eNkosini, kodwa imfihlo yayo ikwabaqotho.
020	PRO	003	033	Isiqalekiso seNkosi sisendlini yomubi, kodwa iyawubusisa umuzi wabalungileyo.
020	PRO	003	034	Isibili, yona iyabeyisa abeyisayo, kodwa inika umusa kwabathobekileyo.
020	PRO	003	035	Abahlakaniphileyo bazakudla ilifa lodumo, kodwa abayizithutha, isabelo sabo silihlazo.
020	PRO	004	001	Zwanini, bantwana, umlayo kayihlo, linanzelele ukuze lazi ukuqedisisa.
020	PRO	004	002	Ngoba ngilinika imfundiso enhle, lingawutshiyi umlayo wami.
020	PRO	004	003	Ngoba bengiyindodana kababa, ngithambile, ngingedwa phambi kukamama.
020	PRO	004	004	Wasengifundisa wathi kimi: Inhliziyo yakho kayibambelele emazwini ami; gcina imilayo yami, uphile.
020	PRO	004	005	Zuza inhlakanipho, uzuze ukuqedisisa, ungakhohlwa; ungaphambuki emazwini omlomo wami.
020	PRO	004	006	Ungakutshiyi, njalo kuzakulondoloza; ukuthande, njalo kuzakulinda.
020	PRO	004	007	Okokuqala yinhlakanipho; zuza inhlakanipho; langenzuzo yakho yonke uzuze ukuqedisisa.
020	PRO	004	008	Kukhulise, njalo kuzakuphakamisa; kuzakunika udumo nxa ukugona.
020	PRO	004	009	Kuzanika ikhanda lakho umqhele womusa; kuzakulethela umqhele wodumo.
020	PRO	004	010	Zwana, ndodana yami, wemukele amazwi ami, leminyaka yempilo izakuba minengi kuwe.
020	PRO	004	011	Ngikufundisile endleleni yenhlakanipho; ngikwenze wanyathela emikhondweni yobuqotho.
020	PRO	004	012	Ekuhambeni kwakho inyathelo lakho kaliyikufinyezwa, njalo nxa ugijima kawuyikukhubeka.
020	PRO	004	013	Bambelela ekulayweni, ungakuyekeli; kugcine, ngoba kuyimpilo yakho.
020	PRO	004	014	Ungangeni emkhondweni wabakhohlakeleyo, ungahambi endleleni yababi.
020	PRO	004	015	Iyekele, ungedluli ngayo, phambuka kuyo, wedlule.
020	PRO	004	016	Ngoba kabalali uba bengenzanga okubi; lobuthongo babo buyasuswa uba bengakhubekisanga muntu.
020	PRO	004	017	Ngoba badla isinkwa senkohlakalo, banathe iwayini lobudlwangudlwangu.
020	PRO	004	018	Kodwa indlela yabalungileyo injengokukhanya okukhanyayo, kuqhubeka kukhanya kuze kube semini enkulu.
020	PRO	004	019	Indlela yababi injengomnyama; kabazi ukuthi bazakhutshwa yini.
020	PRO	004	020	Ndodana yami, lalela amazwi ami, ubeke indlebe yakho ekukhulumeni kwami.
020	PRO	004	021	Kakungaphunyuki emehlweni akho; ukugcine phakathi kwenhliziyo yakho.
020	PRO	004	022	Ngoba kuyimpilo kwabakutholayo, lempilo enhle yenyama yabo yonke.
020	PRO	004	023	Gcina inhliziyo yakho phezu kwakho konke okungagcinwa, ngoba kuvela kikho ukuphuma kwempilo.
020	PRO	004	024	Susa kuwe ukuphambana komlomo, lokuphambeka kwendebe kususele khatshana lawe.
020	PRO	004	025	Amehlo akho kawakhangele phambili, lenkophe zakho ziqonde phambi kwakho.
020	PRO	004	026	Linganisa umkhondo wonyawo lwakho, ukuze zonke indlela zakho ziqine.
020	PRO	004	027	Ungaphambukeli ngakwesokunene kumbe ngakwesokhohlo; uphambule unyawo lwakho ebubini.
020	PRO	005	001	Ndodana yami, lalela inhlakanipho yami, beka indlebe yakho ekuqedisiseni kwami,
020	PRO	005	002	ukuze uqaphele ingqondo, lendebe zakho zigcine ulwazi.
020	PRO	005	003	Ngoba indebe zowesifazana wemzini zithonta uluju, lomlomo wakhe ubutshelezi kulamafutha.
020	PRO	005	004	Kodwa ukucina kwakhe kuyababa njengomhlonyane, kubukhali njengenkemba esika nhlangothi mbili.
020	PRO	005	005	Inyawo zakhe zehlela ekufeni; izinyathelo zakhe zibambelela esihogweni.
020	PRO	005	006	Hlezi ulinganise indlela yempilo, imikhondo yakhe iyazulazula, kananzeleli.
020	PRO	005	007	Ngakho-ke, bantwana, ngilalelani, lingaphambuki emazwini omlomo wami.
020	PRO	005	008	Dedisela indlela yakho khatshana laye, ungasondeli emnyango wendlu yakhe;
020	PRO	005	009	hlezi unikele udumo lwakho kwabanye, leminyaka yakho kolesihluku;
020	PRO	005	010	hlezi abezizwe bazisuthise ngamandla akho, lemitshikatshika yakho ibe sendlini yowezizweni;
020	PRO	005	011	njalo ububule ekupheleni kwakho, lapho inyama yakho lomzimba wakho sekudliwe;
020	PRO	005	012	njalo uthi: Ngikuzonde njani ukulaywa, lenhliziyo yami yadelela ukukhuzwa!
020	PRO	005	013	Kangizwanga-ke ilizwi labafundisi bami; kangibekanga indlebe zami kwabangifundisayo!
020	PRO	005	014	Ngaphosa ngaba ebubini bonke phakathi kwebandla lenhlangano.
020	PRO	005	015	Natha amanzi emgodini wakho, lemifula ephuma phakathi komthombo wakho.
020	PRO	005	016	Imithombo yakho ichitheke phandle, izifula zamanzi emidangeni.
020	PRO	005	017	Kakube ngokwakho wedwa, kungabi ngokwabezizweni kanye lawe.
020	PRO	005	018	Umthombo wakho kawubusiswe; uthokoze ngomfazi wobutsha bakho;
020	PRO	005	019	impala ethandekayo kakhulu, legogo elibukekayo; amabele akhe kawakusuthise sonke isikhathi, uzule othandweni lwakhe kokuphela.
020	PRO	005	020	Kungani-ke, ndodana yami, uzule kowesifazana wemzini, ugone isifuba sowemzini?
020	PRO	005	021	Ngoba indlela zomuntu ziphambi kwamehlo eNkosi; njalo iyalinganisa yonke imikhondo yakhe.
020	PRO	005	022	Ezakhe iziphambeko zizabamba omubi, abanjwe zintambo zesono sakhe.
020	PRO	005	023	Yena uzakufa ngokungalaywa, lebukhulwini bobuthutha bakhe uzaduha.
020	PRO	006	001	Ndodana yami, uba uyisibambiso somakhelwane wakho, watshayela owezizwe isandla sakho,
020	PRO	006	002	uthiywe ngamazwi omlomo wakho, ubanjwe ngamazwi omlomo wakho.
020	PRO	006	003	Yenza lokhu khathesi, ndodana yami, uzophule, lokhu usesandleni sikamakhelwane wakho; hamba, uzithobe, umncengisise umakhelwane wakho.
020	PRO	006	004	Unganiki amehlo akho ubuthongo, lokuwozela enkopheni zakho.
020	PRO	006	005	Uzophule njengomziki esandleni somzingeli, lanjengenyoni esandleni somthiyi wenyoni.
020	PRO	006	006	Yana ebunyonyweni, vila, ubone indlela zabo, uhlakaniphe.
020	PRO	006	007	Obuthi, bungelamkhokheli, induna, lombusi,
020	PRO	006	008	bulungisa isinkwa sabo ehlobo, bubuthe ukudla kwabo esivunweni.
020	PRO	006	009	Koze kube nini, vila, ulele? Uzavuka nini ebuthongweni bakho?
020	PRO	006	010	Ubuthongo obuncinyane, ukuwozela okuncinyane, ukusonga izandla okuncinyane ukuthi ulale,
020	PRO	006	011	besebusiza ubuyanga bakho njengesihambi, lenswelo yakho njengomuntu olesihlangu.
020	PRO	006	012	Umuntu kaBheliyali, umuntu okhohlakeleyo, ohamba lomlomo ophambeneyo,
020	PRO	006	013	afice amehlo akhe, akhulume ngenyawo zakhe, afundise ngeminwe yakhe,
020	PRO	006	014	ukuphambuka kusenhliziyweni yakhe, uceba okubi ngesikhathi sonke, ephosela ingxabano.
020	PRO	006	015	Ngenxa yalokhu ingozi yakhe izafika masinyane, ahle ephuke, kuze kungabi leselapho.
020	PRO	006	016	Lezizinto eziyisithupha iNkosi iyazizonda; yebo, eziyisikhombisa ziyizinengiso emphefumulweni wakhe:
020	PRO	006	017	Amehlo aphakemeyo, ulimi oluqamba amanga, lezandla ezichitha igazi elingelacala,
020	PRO	006	018	inhliziyo eceba amacebo amabi, inyawo eziphangisa ukugijimela ububi,
020	PRO	006	019	umfakazi wamanga ophafuza izinkohliso, lophosela ingxabano phakathi kwabazalwane.
020	PRO	006	020	Ndodana yami, gcina umlayo kayihlo, ungakudeli ukufundisa kukanyoko.
020	PRO	006	021	Kubophele enhliziyweni yakho njalo, kubophele entanyeni yakho.
020	PRO	006	022	Ekuhambeni kwakho kuzakukhokhela, ekulaleni kwakho kukulondoloze, lekuvukeni kwakho khona kukhulume lawe.
020	PRO	006	023	Ngoba umlayo uyisibane, lokufundisa kuyikukhanya, lokukhuza kokulaya kuyindlela yempilo,
020	PRO	006	024	ukuze kukugcine emfazini omubi, emazwini ayengayo olimi lowesifazana wemzini.
020	PRO	006	025	Ungaloyisi ubuhle bakhe enhliziyweni yakho; angakuthathi ngenkophe zakhe.
020	PRO	006	026	Ngoba ngenxa yomfazi oyisiphingi ungafika ecezwini lwesinkwa, lomfazi womuntu uzingela umphefumulo oligugu.
020	PRO	006	027	Kambe, umuntu angaphatha umlilo esifubeni sakhe, lezigqoko zakhe zingatshi?
020	PRO	006	028	Umuntu angahamba phezu kwamalahle avuthayo, lenyawo zakhe zingatshi yini?
020	PRO	006	029	Unjalo ongena kumkamakhelwane wakhe; wonke omthintayo kayikuba msulwa.
020	PRO	006	030	Kabalideleli isela, nxa liseba ukuthi ligcwalise umphefumulo walo, ngoba lilambile.
020	PRO	006	031	Uba litholwa, lihlawula kuphindwe kasikhombisa, linika yonke impahla yendlu yalo.
020	PRO	006	032	Ofeba lowesifazana uswela ingqondo; owenza lokhu nguye ochitha umphefumulo wakhe.
020	PRO	006	033	Uzathola ukutshaywa lesigcono, lehlazo lakhe kaliyikwesulwa.
020	PRO	006	034	Ngoba ubukhwele bululaka lomuntu; ngakho kayikuba lasihawu ngosuku lwempindiselo.
020	PRO	006	035	Kayikunanza loba yiyiphi inhlawulo, kayikuvuma lanxa usandisa isipho.
020	PRO	007	001	Ndodana yami, gcina amazwi ami, uzibekele imilayo yami.
020	PRO	007	002	Gcina imilayo yami, uphile, lomthetho wami njengenhlamvu yamehlo akho.
020	PRO	007	003	Ukubophele eminweni yakho, kubhale esibhebheni senhliziyo yakho.
020	PRO	007	004	Uthi kunhlakanipho: Ungudadewethu; ubize ukuqedisisa ngokuthi yisihlobo sakho;
020	PRO	007	005	ukuze kukugcine kumfazi wemzini, kowesifazana wemzini oyengayo ngamazwi akhe.
020	PRO	007	006	Ngoba ewindini lendlu yami, ngeminxibo yewindi ngalunguza phandle,
020	PRO	007	007	ngasengibona phakathi kwabangelalwazi, ngananzelela phakathi kwabatsha ijaha eliswele ingqondo,
020	PRO	007	008	lisedlula esitaladeni eceleni kwengonsi yakhe, linyathela endleleni yendlu yakhe,
020	PRO	007	009	kusihlwa, ngentambama yosuku, ebusuku obumnyama, lomnyama.
020	PRO	007	010	Khangela-ke, owesifazana walihlangabeza, lesembatho sewule, elobuqili ngenhliziyo.
020	PRO	007	011	Lo wayelomsindo, eyisiqholo; inyawo zakhe kazihlali endlini yakhe.
020	PRO	007	012	Khathesi uphandle, abesesiba ezitaladeni, ecathama kuyo yonke ingonsi.
020	PRO	007	013	Ngokunjalo walibamba, walanga, waqinisa ubuso bakhe, wathi kulo:
020	PRO	007	014	Imihlatshelo yeminikelo yokuthula ikimi; lamuhla sengibhadele izifungo zami.
020	PRO	007	015	Ngakho-ke ngiphumile ukukuhlangabeza, ngidingisise ubuso bakho; ngikutholile.
020	PRO	007	016	Ngendlele umbheda wami ngezendlalo, ngamalembu acolekileyo kakhulu alemibalabala avela eGibhithe.
020	PRO	007	017	Ngifafazile umbheda wami ngemure, izinhlaba, lekinamoni.
020	PRO	007	018	Woza, sizidakise ngothando kuze kuse, sizithokozise ngothando olukhulu.
020	PRO	007	019	Ngoba indoda kayikho endlini yayo, ihambile uhambo khatshana.
020	PRO	007	020	Ithethe isaka lemali esandleni sayo; ngosuku lwenyanga egcweleyo izakuza endlini yayo.
020	PRO	007	021	Walihuga ngobunengi bemfundiso yakhe, walivumisa ngenkulumo zakhe ezincengayo.
020	PRO	007	022	Lahle lamlandela njengenkabi isiya ekuhlatshweni, lanjengesiphukuphuku sisiya ekujezisweni esongweni lenqagala;
020	PRO	007	023	uze umtshoko uhlabe isibindi salo, njengenyoni iphangisela esifwini, ingazi ukuthi simelene lempilo yayo.
020	PRO	007	024	Khathesi-ke, bantwana, ngizweni, lilalele amazwi omlomo wami.
020	PRO	007	025	Inhliziyo yakho kayingaphambukeli endleleni zakhe; ungaduhi emikhondweni yakhe.
020	PRO	007	026	Ngoba ubawisele phansi abanengi abalimeleyo, labo bonke ababuleweyo bakhe banengi.
020	PRO	007	027	Indlu yakhe izindlela zesihogo, ezehlela emakamelweni okufa.
020	PRO	008	001	Inhlakanipho kayimemezi yini, lokuqedisisa kukhuphe ilizwi lakho?
020	PRO	008	002	Engqongeni yezindawo eziphakemeyo, ngasendleleni, phakathi kwezindlela kumi.
020	PRO	008	003	Eceleni kwamasango, entubeni yomuzi, ekungeneni kweminyango kuyamemeza kakhulu kuthi:
020	PRO	008	004	Kini, madoda, ngiyamemeza, lelizwi lami lisebantwaneni babantu.
020	PRO	008	005	Lina elingelalwazi, qedisisani inhlakanipho; lani zithutha, qedisisani ngenhliziyo.
020	PRO	008	006	Zwanini, ngoba ngizakhuluma izinto zobukhosi, lokuvula kwendebe zami kuzakuba yikuqonda.
020	PRO	008	007	Ngoba umlomo wami ukhuluma iqiniso, lenkohlakalo iyisinengiso endebeni zami.
020	PRO	008	008	Wonke amazwi omlomo wami asekulungeni; kakukho okutshilekileyo lokugobileyo kuwo.
020	PRO	008	009	Wonke aqondile kulowo oqedisisayo, alungile kulabo abathola ulwazi.
020	PRO	008	010	Yemukelani ukufundisa kwami, hatshi isiliva, lolwazi kulegolide elikhethekileyo.
020	PRO	008	011	Ngoba inhlakanipho ingcono kulamatshe amahle, lakho konke okufisekayo kakulakulinganiswa layo.
020	PRO	008	012	Mina nhlakanipho ngihlala lokuqedisisa, ngithola ulwazi lamacebo.
020	PRO	008	013	Ukwesaba iNkosi kuyikuzonda ububi; ukuzigqaja, lokuziqhenya, lendlela embi, lomlomo wokuphambeka ngiyakuzonda.
020	PRO	008	014	Iseluleko ngesami, lenhlakanipho eqotho; ngiyikuqedisisa; amandla ngawami.
020	PRO	008	015	Ngami amakhosi ayabusa, lababusi bamisa ukulunga.
020	PRO	008	016	Ngami iziphathamandla ziyabusa, lezikhulu, bonke abehluleli bomhlaba.
020	PRO	008	017	Mina ngiyathanda abangithandayo, lalabo abangidingisisayo bazangithola.
020	PRO	008	018	Inotho lodumo kukimi, inotho eqhubekayo lokulunga.
020	PRO	008	019	Isithelo sami singcono kulegolide, legolide elicwengekileyo, lokutholakalayo kwami kulesiliva esikhethekileyo.
020	PRO	008	020	Ngihamba endleleni yokulunga, phakathi kwemikhondo yesahlulelo;
020	PRO	008	021	ukuthi ngenze abangithandayo badle ilifa lemfuyo; ngigcwalise iziphala zabo.
020	PRO	008	022	INkosi, ngaba ngeyayo, ngaba yikuqala kwendlela yayo, ngaphambi kwemisebenzi yayo yendulo.
020	PRO	008	023	Ngamiswa kwasephakadeni, kusukela ekuqaleni, kusukela emandulo omhlaba.
020	PRO	008	024	Kungakabi khona izinziki ngasengizelwe, ingakabi khona imithombo enzima ngamanzi.
020	PRO	008	025	Intaba zingakamiswa, kungakabi khona amaqaqa, ngasengizelwe.
020	PRO	008	026	Ingakawenzi umhlaba lemimango, lokuqala kwentuli zomhlaba.
020	PRO	008	027	Lapho ilungisa amazulu ngangikhonapho; lapho imisa umkhathi ngaphezu kwenziki;
020	PRO	008	028	lapho imisa amayezi ngaphezulu; lapho iqinisa imithombo yenziki;
020	PRO	008	029	lapho imisela ulwandle umngcele walo ukuze amanzi angeqi umlayo wayo; lapho imisa izisekelo zomhlaba;
020	PRO	008	030	khona ngangiseduze layo njengowakhuliswa yiyo, ngizintokozo zayo usuku ngosuku, ngithokoza phambi kwayo ngaso sonke isikhathi,
020	PRO	008	031	ngidlala elizweni lomhlaba wayo, lentokozo zami zisebantwaneni babantu.
020	PRO	008	032	Ngakho-ke, bantwana bami, ngizweni; ngoba babusisiwe abagcina indlela zami.
020	PRO	008	033	Zwanini ukulaya, lihlakaniphe, lingakudeli.
020	PRO	008	034	Ubusisiwe umuntu ongizwayo, alinde insuku ngensuku emasangweni ami, alinde emigubazini yeminyango yami.
020	PRO	008	035	Ngoba ongitholayo uthola impilo, azuze umusa eNkosini.
020	PRO	008	036	Kodwa owona kimi wona umphefumulo wakhe; bonke abangizondayo bathanda ukufa.
020	PRO	009	001	Inhlakanipho enkulu yakhe indlu yayo, ibaze insika zayo eziyisikhombisa.
020	PRO	009	002	Ihlabe okuhlatshwayo kwayo, ixubanise iwayini layo, futhi yalungisa itafula layo.
020	PRO	009	003	Ithume incekukazi zayo, iyamemeza engqongeni zendawo eziphakemeyo zomuzi zisithi:
020	PRO	009	004	Loba ngubani ongelalwazi? Kaphendukele lapha; oswele ingqondo, ithi kuye:
020	PRO	009	005	Wozani, lidle okwesinkwa sami, linathe okwewayini engilixubanisileyo.
020	PRO	009	006	Yekelani abangelalwazi liphile, lihambe ngokuqonda ngendlela yokuqedisisa.
020	PRO	009	007	Osola isiklolodi uzizuzela ihlazo, lokhuza okhohlakeleyo uzizuzela isici.
020	PRO	009	008	Ungasoli isiklolodi, hlezi sikuzonde; sola ohlakaniphileyo, njalo uzakuthanda.
020	PRO	009	009	Nika ohlakaniphileyo, njalo uzakuba lokhu ehlakanipha; fundisa olungileyo, njalo uzakwandisa ukufunda.
020	PRO	009	010	Ukuyesaba iNkosi kuyikuqala kwenhlakanipho, lolwazi lwabangcwele luyikuqedisisa.
020	PRO	009	011	Ngoba ngami insuku zakho zizakwandiswa, leminyaka yempilo yengezelelwe kuwe.
020	PRO	009	012	Uba uhlakaniphile, uzakuba uzihlakaniphele; uba ukloloda, uzakuthwala wedwa.
020	PRO	009	013	Owesifazana oyisithutha ulomsindo, kalangqondo, kazi lutho.
020	PRO	009	014	Ngoba uhlala emnyango wendlu yakhe, esihlalweni, endaweni eziphakemeyo zomuzi,
020	PRO	009	015	ukubiza abadlulayo ngendlela, abahamba beqondile emikhondweni yabo, esithi:
020	PRO	009	016	Loba ngubani ongelalwazi? Kaphendukele lapha; loswele ingqondo, uthi kuye:
020	PRO	009	017	Amanzi ebiweyo amnandi, lesinkwa sensitha siyahlabusa.
020	PRO	009	018	Kodwa kazi ukuthi abafileyo balapho; abanxusiweyo bakhe basenzikini yesihogo.
020	PRO	010	001	Izaga zikaSolomoni. Indodana ehlakaniphileyo ithokozisa uyise, kodwa indodana eyisithutha ilusizi kunina.
020	PRO	010	002	Inotho yenkohlakalo kayisizi lutho, kodwa ukulunga kophula ekufeni.
020	PRO	010	003	INkosi kayiyekeli umphefumulo wolungileyo ulambe, kodwa isunduza isifiso sababi.
020	PRO	010	004	Osebenza ngesandla esixegayo uba ngumyanga, kodwa isandla sabakhutheleyo siyanothisa.
020	PRO	010	005	Ovuna ehlobo uyindodana ehlakaniphileyo; olala ubuthongo obukhulu ngesikhathi sokuvuna uyindodana ethelela ihlazo.
020	PRO	010	006	Izibusiso zisekhanda lolungileyo, kodwa ubudlwangudlwangu busibekela umlomo wabakhohlakeleyo.
020	PRO	010	007	Ukukhunjulwa kolungileyo kungokwesibusiso, kodwa ibizo labakhohlakeleyo lizabola.
020	PRO	010	008	Ohlakaniphileyo ngenhliziyo uyemukela imilayo, kodwa isithutha ngendebe sizawiselwa phansi.
020	PRO	010	009	Ohamba ngobuqotho uhamba evikelekile, kodwa ophambula indlela zakhe uzakwaziwa.
020	PRO	010	010	Ociyoza ilihlo ubanga inkathazo, njalo isithutha ngendebe sizawiselwa phansi.
020	PRO	010	011	Umlomo wolungileyo ungumthombo wempilo, kodwa ubudlwangudlwangu busibekela umlomo wabakhohlakeleyo.
020	PRO	010	012	Inzondo ibanga ingxabano, kodwa uthando lusibekela iziphambeko zonke.
020	PRO	010	013	Endebeni zoqedisisayo kutholakala inhlakanipho, kodwa intonga ingeyomhlana woswela ingqondo.
020	PRO	010	014	Abahlakaniphileyo babekelela ulwazi, kodwa umlomo wesithutha useduze lencithakalo.
020	PRO	010	015	Inotho yonothileyo ingumuzi wamandla akhe; ubuyanga babayanga buyincithakalo yabo.
020	PRO	010	016	Umsebenzi wolungileyo ngowempilo; inzuzo yokhohlakeleyo ngeyesono.
020	PRO	010	017	Ogcina ukulaywa usendleleni yempilo, kodwa odelela ukukhuzwa ubanga ukuduha.
020	PRO	010	018	Osibekela inzondo ungowendebe zamanga, lohlebayo uyisithutha.
020	PRO	010	019	Ebunengini bamazwi ukuphambeka kakusileli, kodwa othiba indebe zakhe uhlakaniphile.
020	PRO	010	020	Ulimi lolungileyo luyisiliva esikhethekileyo; inhliziyo yokhohlakeleyo injengento encinyane.
020	PRO	010	021	Indebe zolungileyo zondla abanengi, kodwa izithutha ziyafa ngokuswela ingqondo.
020	PRO	010	022	Isibusiso seNkosi sona siyanothisa; njalo kayengezi usizi kuso.
020	PRO	010	023	Kunjengenhlekisa koyisithutha ukwenza okubi; kunjalo inhlakanipho kumuntu wokuqedisisa.
020	PRO	010	024	Lokho okhohlakeleyo akwesabayo kuzamfikela, kodwa isiloyiso solungileyo sizanikwa.
020	PRO	010	025	Njengokwedlula kwesivunguzane, unjalo okhohlakeleyo kasekho; kodwa olungileyo uyisisekelo saphakade.
020	PRO	010	026	Njengeviniga emazinyweni, lanjengentuthu emehlweni, unjalo olivila kwabamthumileyo.
020	PRO	010	027	Ukuyesaba iNkosi kwandisa insuku, kodwa iminyaka yabakhohlakeleyo izafinyezwa.
020	PRO	010	028	Ithemba labalungileyo liyintokozo, kodwa okulindelwayo kwabakhohlakeleyo kuzabhubha.
020	PRO	010	029	Indlela yeNkosi iyinqaba koqotho, kodwa iyincithakalo kubenzi bobubi.
020	PRO	010	030	Olungileyo kayikunyikinywa laphakade, kodwa abakhohlakeleyo kabayikuhlala elizweni.
020	PRO	010	031	Umlomo wolungileyo ukhupha inhlakanipho, kodwa ulimi oluphambeneyo luzaqunywa.
020	PRO	010	032	Indebe zolungileyo ziyazi okuthokozisayo, kodwa umlomo wabakhohlakeleyo iziphambeko.
020	PRO	011	001	Isikali esikhohlisayo siyisinengiso eNkosini, kodwa ilitshe lokulinganisa elipheleleyo liyintokozo yayo.
020	PRO	011	002	Nxa kufika ukuzigqaja, kufika lehlazo; kodwa kwabathobekileyo kukhona inhlakanipho.
020	PRO	011	003	Ubuqotho babaqotho buzabaqondisa, kodwa ukuphambeka kwabaphambekayo kuzababhubhisa.
020	PRO	011	004	Inotho kayisizi ngosuku lolaka, kodwa ukulunga kophula ekufeni.
020	PRO	011	005	Ukulunga kwabaqotho kuzaqondisa indlela yakhe, kodwa okhohlakeleyo uzakuwa ngenkohlakalo yakhe.
020	PRO	011	006	Ukulunga kwabaqotho kuzabophula, kodwa abaphambukayo bazathunjwa zinkanuko zabo.
020	PRO	011	007	Nxa umuntu okhohlakeleyo esifa, ithemba lakhe lizabhubha, lethemba lolamandla liyabhubha.
020	PRO	011	008	Olungileyo ukhululwa ekuhluphekeni, kodwa omubi ungena endaweni yakhe.
020	PRO	011	009	Ngomlomo umzenzisi uchitha umakhelwane wakhe, kodwa ngolwazi abalungileyo bayakhululwa.
020	PRO	011	010	Ngempumelelo yabalungileyo umuzi uyathokoza; lekubhubheni kwabakhohlakeleyo kulenjabulo.
020	PRO	011	011	Ngesibusiso sabaqotho umuzi uyaphakanyiswa, kodwa ngomlomo wabakhohlakeleyo uyachitheka.
020	PRO	011	012	Oswela ingqondo udelela umakhelwane, kodwa umuntu oqedisisayo uyazithulela.
020	PRO	011	013	Ohamba enyeya wembula imfihlakalo, kodwa othembekileyo ngomoya ufihla udaba.
020	PRO	011	014	Lapho kungekho izeluleko abantu bayawa; kodwa ukukhululwa kusebunengini babeluleki.
020	PRO	011	015	Oba yisibambiso sowezizwe uzahlupheka ngokubi; kodwa ozonda ukutshaya izandla uvikelekile.
020	PRO	011	016	Owesifazana olomusa ubamba udumo, labalamandla babamba inotho.
020	PRO	011	017	Umuntu olomusa wenzela umphefumulo wakhe okuhle, kodwa olesihluku ukhathaza inyama yakhe.
020	PRO	011	018	Okhohlakeleyo wenza umsebenzi wenkohliso, kodwa ohlanyela ukulunga ulomvuzo weqiniso.
020	PRO	011	019	Njengoba ukulunga kungokwempilo, kunjalo ozingela okubi kungokokufa kwakhe.
020	PRO	011	020	Abaphambeneyo ngenhliziyo bayisinengiso eNkosini, kodwa abaqotho ngendlela bayintokozo yayo.
020	PRO	011	021	Isandla esandleni omubi kayikuyekelwa ukujeziswa, kodwa inzalo yabalungileyo izaphepha.
020	PRO	011	022	Ulisongo legolide empumulweni yengulube owesifazana obukekayo ophambuka engqondweni.
020	PRO	011	023	Isifiso sabalungileyo singokuhle kuphela; ithemba labakhohlakeleyo lulaka.
020	PRO	011	024	Kukhona ohlakazayo, kube kanti okunengi kuyengezwa; logodla okwedlula okufaneleyo, kodwa kungokokuswela.
020	PRO	011	025	Umphefumulo obusisayo uzakhuluphaliswa, lothelelayo uzathelelwa laye.
020	PRO	011	026	Ogodla amabele, abantu bazamqalekisa; kodwa isibusiso sizakuba phezu kwekhanda lothengisayo.
020	PRO	011	027	Odingisisa okuhle, udinga umusa; kodwa odinga okubi, kuzakuza kuye.
020	PRO	011	028	Othemba inotho yakhe yena uzakuwa, kodwa abalungileyo bazahluma njengamahlamvu.
020	PRO	011	029	Oletha inkathazo emzini wakhe uzakudla ilifa lomoya, lesithutha sizakuba yinceku yohlakaniphileyo ngenhliziyo.
020	PRO	011	030	Isithelo solungileyo siyisihlahla sempilo, lozuza imiphefumulo uhlakaniphile.
020	PRO	011	031	Khangela, olungileyo uzavuzwa emhlabeni; kakhulu kangakanani omubi lesoni!
020	PRO	012	001	Othanda ukulaywa uthanda ulwazi; kodwa ozonda ukukhuzwa uyisithutha.
020	PRO	012	002	Olungileyo uzuza umusa eNkosini, kodwa umuntu wamacebo amabi iyamlahla.
020	PRO	012	003	Umuntu kayikumiswa yibubi, kodwa impande yabalungileyo kayiyikunyikinywa.
020	PRO	012	004	Umfazi okhuthalela okulungileyo ungumqhele wendoda yakhe, kodwa oyangisayo unjengokubola emathanjeni ayo.
020	PRO	012	005	Imicabango yabalungileyo ilungile; izeluleko zababi ziyinkohliso.
020	PRO	012	006	Amazwi abakhohlakeleyo ngawokucathamela igazi, kodwa umlomo wabaqotho uzabophula.
020	PRO	012	007	Abakhohlakeleyo bayachithwa, bangabe besaba khona; kodwa indlu yabalungileyo izakuma.
020	PRO	012	008	Umuntu uzadunyiswa ngokwenhlakanipho yakhe, kodwa ophambeke ngenhliziyo uzakuba ngowokudelelwa.
020	PRO	012	009	Odelelekayo elesisebenzi ungcono kulozihloniphayo aswele ukudla.
020	PRO	012	010	Olungileyo unanzelela impilo yesifuyo sakhe, kodwa izihawu zabakhohlakeleyo ziyilunya.
020	PRO	012	011	Olima insimu yakhe uzasutha ngokudla, kodwa ozingela izinto eziyize uswela ingqondo.
020	PRO	012	012	Okhohlakeleyo ufisa impango yababi, kodwa impande yabalungileyo iyahluma.
020	PRO	012	013	Ekuphambekeni kwendebe kulomjibila womubi, kodwa olungileyo uzaphuma enkathazweni.
020	PRO	012	014	Umuntu uzasutha ngokulungileyo ngesithelo somlomo, lomvuzo wezandla zomuntu uzabuyiselwa kuye.
020	PRO	012	015	Indlela yesithutha ilungile emehlweni aso, kodwa olalela iseluleko uhlakaniphile.
020	PRO	012	016	Isithutha, intukuthelo yaso yaziwa ngosuku; kodwa ohlakaniphileyo ufihla ihlazo.
020	PRO	012	017	Ophefumula iqiniso wazisa ukulunga, kodwa umfakazi wamanga inkohliso.
020	PRO	012	018	Kukhona ophahluka njengokuhlaba kwenkemba, kodwa ulimi lwezihlakaniphi luyikusilisa.
020	PRO	012	019	Indebe yeqiniso izamiswa phakade, kodwa ulimi lwamanga lungolomzuzu nje.
020	PRO	012	020	Inkohliso isenhliziyweni yabaceba okubi, kodwa abeluleki bokuthula balentokozo.
020	PRO	012	021	Lokukodwa okubi kakuyikubehlela abalungileyo, kodwa abakhohlakeleyo bagcwele ububi.
020	PRO	012	022	Indebe zamanga ziyisinengiso eNkosini, kodwa abenza iqiniso bayintokozo yayo.
020	PRO	012	023	Umuntu ohlakaniphileyo ufihla ulwazi, kodwa inhliziyo yezithutha imemezela ubuthutha.
