020	PRO	024	021	Ndodana yami, yesaba uJehova lenkosi; ungahlanganyeli labaguquguqukayo;
020	PRO	024	022	ngoba incithakalo yabo izavuka masinyane; njalo ngubani owazi ukuchitheka kwabo bobabili?
020	PRO	024	023	Lala ngawabahlakaniphileyo. Ukunaka ubuso kusahlulelo kakulunganga.
020	PRO	024	024	Othi kokhohlakeleyo: Wena ulungile; abantu bazamqalekisa, izizwe zizamthukuthelela.
020	PRO	024	025	Kodwa kulabo abamkhuzayo kuzakuba lentokozo, lesibusiso esihle sizabehlela.
020	PRO	024	026	Ophendula ngamazwi aqondileyo uzakwanga indebe.
020	PRO	024	027	Lungisa umsebenzi wakho ngaphandle, uzilungiselele wona ensimini, emva kwalokho wakhe indlu yakho.
020	PRO	024	028	Ungabi ngumfakazi umelene lomakhelwane wakho kungelasizatho, kumbe ukhohlise ngendebe zakho.
020	PRO	024	029	Ungathi: Njengokwenza kwakhe kimi ngizakwenza njalo kuye; ngizaphindisela emuntwini njengokomsebenzi wakhe.
020	PRO	024	030	Ngedlula ensimini yevila, lesivinini somuntu oswele ingqondo;
020	PRO	024	031	khangela-ke, konke kwakumile ameva, imbabazane yayisibekele ubuso bakho, lomthangala wakho wamatshe udilikile.
020	PRO	024	032	Mina-ke ngakukhangela, ngakubeka enhliziyweni yami; ngakubona, ngemukela imfundiso.
020	PRO	024	033	Ubuthongo obuncinyane, ukuwozela okuncinyane, ukusonga izandla okuncinyane ukuthi kulalwe,
020	PRO	024	034	besebusiza ubuyanga bakho njengesihambi, lenswelo zakho njengomuntu ohlomileyo.
020	PRO	025	001	Lalezi yizaga zikaSolomoni abantu bakaHezekhiya inkosi yakoJuda abazikopayo.
020	PRO	025	002	Kuludumo lukaNkulunkulu ukufihla udaba, kodwa kuludumo lwamakhosi ukuhlolisisa udaba.
020	PRO	025	003	Amazulu ngokuphakama, lomhlaba ngokujula, lenhliziyo yamakhosi kakulakuhlolisiswa.
020	PRO	025	004	Susa amanyele esiliveni, besekuphuma isitsha somncibilikisi.
020	PRO	025	005	Susa okhohlakeleyo phambi kwenkosi, besekuqiniswa isihlalo sayo sobukhosi ngokulunga.
020	PRO	025	006	Ungaziqhenyi phambi kwenkosi, njalo ungemi endaweni yezikhulu;
020	PRO	025	007	ngoba kungcono kuthiwe kuwe: Yenyukela ngapha, kulokuthi wehliswe phambi kwesiphathamandla, amehlo akho asibonileyo.
020	PRO	025	008	Ungaphangisi ukuphuma ukuyaphikisana, hlezi wenze ulutho ekucineni kwakho, lapho umakhelwane wakho esekuyangisile.
020	PRO	025	009	Mela udaba lwakho lomakhelwane wakho, kodwa ungavezi imfihlo yomunye;
020	PRO	025	010	hlezi okuzwayo akuyangise, lesigcono sakho singaphambuki.
020	PRO	025	011	Ilizwi elikhulunywe ngokufaneleyo linjengama-apula egolide ezitsheni zesiliva ezibaziweyo.
020	PRO	025	012	Isongo legolide lesiceciso segolide elihle kungumkhuzi ohlakaniphileyo endlebeni ezwayo.
020	PRO	025	013	Isithunywa esithembekileyo kwabasithumileyo sinjengomqando weliqhwa elikhithikileyo ngosuku lokuvuna, ngoba sivuselela umphefumulo wamakhosi aso.
020	PRO	025	014	Umuntu oziqhenya ngesipho samanga unjengamayezi lomoya okungelazulu.
020	PRO	025	015	Ngokubekezela umbusi angavunyiswa, lolimi oluthambileyo lwephula ithambo.
020	PRO	025	016	Utholile yini uluju? Dlana okwenele wena, hlezi uludle kakhulu, uluhlanze.
020	PRO	025	017	Unyawo lwakho kalungavami endlini kamakhelwane wakho, hlezi akusuthe akuzonde.
020	PRO	025	018	Umuntu ofakaza ubufakazi bamanga ngomakhelwane wakhe uyisagila lenkemba lomtshoko obukhali.
020	PRO	025	019	Ukuthemba ongathembekanga ngosuku lokuhlupheka kunjengezinyo elephukileyo, lonyawo olwenyeleyo.
020	PRO	025	020	Ohlabelela izingoma enhliziyweni edabukileyo unjengokhupha isembatho ngosuku lwamakhaza, njengeviniga phakathi kwesoda.
020	PRO	025	021	Uba okuzondayo elambile, umnike isinkwa adle, njalo uba omile, umnike amanzi anathe;
020	PRO	025	022	ngoba uzabekelela amalahle omlilo ekhanda lakhe, leNkosi izakuvuza.
020	PRO	025	023	Umoya wenyakatho uletha izulu, lolimi lwemfihlo ubuso obulolaka.
020	PRO	025	024	Kungcono ukuhlala engonsini yophahla kulalowesifazana wezinkani lendlini yokuhlanganyela.
020	PRO	025	025	Umbiko omuhle ovela elizweni elikhatshana unjengamanzi aqandayo emphefumulweni owomileyo.
020	PRO	025	026	Olungileyo ozanyazanyiswayo phambi kokhohlakeleyo ungumthombo odungekileyo lesiphethu esonakeleyo.
020	PRO	025	027	Ukudla uluju olunengi kakulunganga; lokuthi badinge udumo lwabo kakusidumo.
020	PRO	025	028	Umuntu ongathinti umoya wakhe unjengomuzi ofohlelweyo ongelamthangala.
020	PRO	026	001	Njengeliqhwa elikhithikileyo ehlobo lanjengezulu ngesikhathi sokuvuna, ngokunjalo udumo kalusifanelanga isithutha.
020	PRO	026	002	Njengenyoni ekuzulazuleni, njengenkonjane ekuphapheni, ngokunjalo isiqalekiso kungelasizatho kasiyikufika.
020	PRO	026	003	Isiswepu ngesebhiza, itomu ngelikababhemi, loswazi ngolomhlana wezithutha.
020	PRO	026	004	Ungaphenduli isithutha ngokobuthutha baso, hlezi lawe ufanane laso.
020	PRO	026	005	Phendula isithutha ngokobuthutha baso, hlezi sibe ngesihlakaniphileyo emehlweni aso.
020	PRO	026	006	Othumela amazwi ngesandla sesithutha, uquma inyawo, unatha isihluku.
020	PRO	026	007	Imilenze yesiqhuli iyalengalenga; sinjalo isaga emlonyeni wezithutha.
020	PRO	026	008	Njengokubophela ilitshe esavutheni, unjalo onika udumo esithutheni.
020	PRO	026	009	Njengameva enyuka esandleni sesidakwa sinjalo isaga emlonyeni wezithutha.
020	PRO	026	010	Omkhulu owabumba konke uvuza isithutha, avuze abadlulayo.
020	PRO	026	011	Njengenja ebuyela emahlanzweni ayongokunjalo isithutha siphinda ubuthutha baso.
020	PRO	026	012	Uyabona yini umuntu ohlakaniphileyo emehlweni akhe? Kulethemba elikhulu esithutheni kulaye.
020	PRO	026	013	Olivila uthi: Kulesilwane endleleni; isilwane sisezitaladeni.
020	PRO	026	014	Isivalo siphenduka ngamabhanti aso, ngokunjalo ivila embhedeni walo.
020	PRO	026	015	Ivila lifihla isandla salo emganwini, liyavilapha ukusibuyisela emlonyeni walo.
020	PRO	026	016	Ivila lihlakaniphile emehlweni alo okwedlula abayisikhombisa abangaphendula ngenhlakanipho.
020	PRO	026	017	Odlulayo engenela ingxabano engeyisiyo eyakhe ungobamba indlebe zenja.
020	PRO	026	018	Njengohlanya oluphosa izikhuni ezivuthayo, imitshoko, lokufa,
020	PRO	026	019	unjalo umuntu okhohlisa umakhelwane wakhe, abesesithi: Kangisomi yini?
020	PRO	026	020	Uba kungelankuni umlilo uyacitsha; njalo uba kungelakunyeya, ukuxabana kuyathula.
020	PRO	026	021	Njengamalahle emalahleni avuthayo, lenkuni emlilweni, unjalo umuntu wenkani ngowokubasa ingxabano.
020	PRO	026	022	Amazwi onyeyayo anjengezibondlo ezehlela kokungaphakathi kwesisu.
020	PRO	026	023	Indebe ezivuthayo lenhliziyo embi kungamanyele esiliva ahuqa ukhamba.
020	PRO	026	024	Ozondayo uyazenzisa ngezindebe zakhe, kodwa ufaka inkohliso ngaphakathi kwakhe.
020	PRO	026	025	Lapho esenza ilizwi lakhe libe ngelomusa, ungamkholwa, ngoba izinengiso eziyisikhombisa zisenhliziyweni yakhe.
020	PRO	026	026	Inzondo isibekelwa ngenkohliso; ububi bakhe buzakwembulwa ebandleni.
020	PRO	026	027	Ogebhayo umgodi uzawela kuwo, logiqa ilitshe, lizabuyela kuye.
020	PRO	026	028	Ulimi lwamanga luzonda olubachobozayo, lomlomo obutshelezi usebenza incithakalo.
020	PRO	027	001	Ungazincomi ngosuku lwakusasa, ngoba kawazi ukuthi usuku luzazalani.
020	PRO	027	002	Owemzini kakudumise, njalo hatshi umlomo wakho; owezizwe, njalo hatshi indebe zakho.
020	PRO	027	003	Ilitshe linzima, letshebetshebe liyasinda, kodwa ulaka lwesithutha lunzima kulakho kokubili.
020	PRO	027	004	Ulaka lulolunya, lentukuthelo iyisikhukhula; kodwa ngubani ongema phambi komona?
020	PRO	027	005	Kungcono ukukhuzwa ngokusobala kulothando lwensitha.
020	PRO	027	006	Amanxeba omngane athembekile, kodwa ukwanga kwesitha kuyakhohlisa.
020	PRO	027	007	Umphefumulo osuthiyo unyathelela phansi uhlanga loluju, kodwa kumphefumulo olambileyo konke okubabayo kumnandi.
020	PRO	027	008	Njengenyoni eduha isuka esidlekeni sayo unjalo umuntu oduha esuka endaweni yakhe.
020	PRO	027	009	Amafutha lempepha kuthokozisa inhliziyo; kunjalo ubumnandi bomngane womuntu ngenxa yeseluleko somphefumulo.
020	PRO	027	010	Ungadeli umngane wakho lomngane kayihlo; njalo ungangeni endlini yomfowenu ngosuku lwencithakalo yakho; kungcono umakhelwane oseduze kulomfowenu okhatshana.
020	PRO	027	011	Hlakanipha, ndodana yami, uthokozise inhliziyo yami, ukuze ngibe lempendulo kongisolayo.
020	PRO	027	012	Okhaliphileyo uyabona ububi acatshe, kodwa abangelalwazi bayaqhubeka bajeziswe.
020	PRO	027	013	Thatha isigqoko soyisibambiso ngenxa yowemzini, umthathele isibambiso ngenxa yowesifazana wezizwe.
020	PRO	027	014	Obusisa umngane wakhe ngelizwi elikhulu evuka ekuseni kakhulu, kuzathiwa yisiqalekiso kuye.
020	PRO	027	015	Ukuchophelela ngosuku lwezulu eliqhubekayo lowesifazana oxabanayo kuyafanana.
020	PRO	027	016	Omfihlayo ufihla umoya, lamagcobo ahlangana lesandla sakhe sokunene.
020	PRO	027	017	Insimbi ilolwa ngensimbi; ngokunjalo umuntu ulola ubuso bomngane wakhe.
020	PRO	027	018	Olondoloza isihlahla somkhiwa uzakudla isithelo saso; lolinda inkosi yakhe uzadunyiswa.
020	PRO	027	019	Njengemanzini ubuso busebusweni, ngokunjalo inhliziyo yomuntu isemuntwini.
020	PRO	027	020	Isihogo lencithakalo kakusuthi, ngokunjalo amehlo omuntu kawasuthi.
020	PRO	027	021	Imbiza yokucenga ngeyesiliva, lesithando ngesegolide; kunjalo umuntu ngokokudunyiswa kwakhe.
020	PRO	027	022	Lanxa ugiga isithutha ngomgigo engigeni phakathi kwengqoloyi, ubuthutha baso kabuyikusuka kuso.
020	PRO	027	023	Yazi lokwazi isimo sezimvu zakho, beka inhliziyo yakho kumihlambi yakho,
020	PRO	027	024	ngoba inotho kayisiyaphakade; kumbe umqhele ube sesizukulwaneni lesizukulwana yini?
020	PRO	027	025	Utshani buyasuswa, lohlaza lubonakale, kubuthwe lemibhida yezintaba.
020	PRO	027	026	Amawundlu angawezigqoko zakho, lezimpongo ziyintengo yesiqinti.
020	PRO	027	027	Kuzakuba lochago lwezimbuzi olwanele ukudla kwakho lokudla kwendlu yakho lempilo yencekukazi zakho.
020	PRO	028	001	Ababi babaleka kungekho umzingeli, kodwa abalungileyo balesibindi njengebhongo lesilwane.
020	PRO	028	002	Ngesiphambeko sesizwe ababusi baso banengi; kodwa ngomuntu olokuqedisisa ololwazi ukuqonda kwaso kuyelulwa.
020	PRO	028	003	Umuntu ongumyanga ocindezela abayanga ulizulu elikhukhulayo ukuze kungabi lokudla.
020	PRO	028	004	Abadela umlayo badumisa ababi, kodwa labo abagcina umlayo balwa labo.
020	PRO	028	005	Abantu ababi kabaqedisisi ukulunga, kodwa abadinga iNkosi baqedisisa konke.
020	PRO	028	006	Kungcono umyanga ohamba ngobuqotho bakhe kulophambene ngezindlela lanxa enothile.
020	PRO	028	007	Ogcina umlayo uyindodana eqedisisayo, kodwa ozihlanganisa lezigangi uyangisa uyise.
020	PRO	028	008	Owandisa inotho yakhe ngenzalo langenzuzo uyibuthela olomusa kubayanga.
020	PRO	028	009	Ophambula indlebe yakhe ekulaleleni umlayo, lomkhuleko wakhe uzakuba yisinengiso.
020	PRO	028	010	Oduhisela abaqotho endleleni embi yena uzawela emgodini wakhe, kodwa abaqotho bazakudla ilifa lokuhle.
020	PRO	028	011	Indoda enothileyo ihlakaniphile emehlweni ayo, kodwa umyanga oqedisisayo uzayihlola.
020	PRO	028	012	Lapho abalungileyo bethokoza, kulenkazimulo enkulu; kodwa nxa ababi bephakama, umuntu uyadingwa.
020	PRO	028	013	Osibekela iziphambeko zakhe kayikuphumelela, kodwa ozivumayo azitshiye, uzahawukelwa.
020	PRO	028	014	Ubusisiwe umuntu owesaba njalonjalo, kodwa owenza inhliziyo yakhe ibe lukhuni uzawela ebubini.
020	PRO	028	015	Umbusi okhohlakeleyo phezu kwabantu abangabayanga uyisilwane esibhongayo lebhere elizingelayo.
020	PRO	028	016	Umbusi oswele ukuqedisisa konke wandisa lencindezelo; ozonda inzuzo embi uzakwelula insuku.
020	PRO	028	017	Umuntu ocindezelwe ligazi lomphefumulo uzabalekela emgodini; kabangamsekeli.
020	PRO	028	018	Ohamba ngobuqotho uzasindiswa, kodwa ophambene ngendlela ezimbili uzahle awe.
020	PRO	028	019	Olima umhlaba wakhe uzasutha ukudla, kodwa olandela abayize uzasutha ubuyanga.
020	PRO	028	020	Umuntu wothembeko lonke uzavama ngezibusiso, kodwa ophangisa ukunotha kayikuba msulwa.
020	PRO	028	021	Ukuhlonipha ubuso kakulunganga, ngoba umuntu uzakona ngenxa yocezu lwesinkwa.
020	PRO	028	022	Ophangisa ukunotha ungumuntu olelihlo elibi, njalo engazi ukuthi ubuyanga buzamehlela.
020	PRO	028	023	Okhuza umuntu uzathola umusa emuva okwedlula okhohlisayo ngolimi.
020	PRO	028	024	Ophanga uyise kumbe unina, athi: Akusiso isiphambeko; ungumngane womchithi.
020	PRO	028	025	Ongasuthisekiyo udunga ingxabano, kodwa othemba eNkosini uzakhuluphaliswa.
020	PRO	028	026	Othemba enhliziyweni yakhe uyisithutha, kodwa ohamba ngenhlakanipho uzakhululwa.
020	PRO	028	027	Opha umyanga kayikuswela, kodwa ofihla amehlo akhe uzakuba leziqalekiso ezinengi.
020	PRO	028	028	Nxa abakhohlakeleyo bephakanyiswa, umuntu uyacatsha, kodwa nxa bebhubha, abalungileyo bayanda.
020	PRO	029	001	Umuntu othi ekhuzwa kanengi aqinise intamo, uzahle ephulwe, njalo kungabi lakusiliswa.
020	PRO	029	002	Lapho abalungileyo besanda, abantu bayathokoza, kodwa lapho okhohlakeleyo ebusa, abantu bayabubula.
020	PRO	029	003	Umuntu othanda inhlakanipho uthokozisa uyise, kodwa ohlanganyela lamawule uchitha inotho.
020	PRO	029	004	Inkosi iqinisa ilizwe ngesahlulelo, kodwa umuntu wezipho uyalichitha.
020	PRO	029	005	Umuntu olalisa ngolimi umakhelwane wakhe wendlalela izinyawo zakhe imbule.
020	PRO	029	006	Esiphambekweni somuntu omubi kulomjibila, kodwa olungileyo uyamemeza ngenjabulo ethokoza.
020	PRO	029	007	Olungileyo uyalwazi udaba lwabayanga; okhohlakeleyo kananzeleli ulwazi.
020	PRO	029	008	Abantu abadelelayo bayawuthungela umuzi, kodwa abahlakaniphileyo badedisa ulaka.
020	PRO	029	009	Umuntu ohlakaniphileyo emangalelana lomuntu oyisithutha, loba elolaka, loba ehleka, kakulakuthula.
020	PRO	029	010	Abantu abomele igazi bazonda opheleleyo, kodwa abaqotho badinga umphefumulo wakhe.
020	PRO	029	011	Isithutha sikhupha umoya waso wonke, kodwa ohlakaniphileyo uyawuthiba.
020	PRO	029	012	Umbusi olalela amazwi amanga, zonke izinceku zakhe zikhohlakele.
020	PRO	029	013	Umyanga lomuntu wencindezelo bayahlangana; iNkosi ikhanyisa amehlo abo bobabili.
020	PRO	029	014	Inkosi eyahlulela abayanga ngothembeko, isihlalo sayo sobukhosi sizamiswa phakade.
020	PRO	029	015	Uswazi lokukhuza kunika inhlakanipho, kodwa umntwana oyekelelwayo uthelela unina inhloni.
020	PRO	029	016	Lapho abakhohlakeleyo besanda, isiphambeko siyanda, kodwa abalungileyo bazabona ukuwa kwabo.
020	PRO	029	017	Laya indodana yakho, izakuphumuza; yebo, izanika izinjabulo emphefumulweni wakho.
020	PRO	029	018	Lapho okungelambono khona, abantu babengabambeki; kodwa ubusisiwe ogcina umlayo.
020	PRO	029	019	Inceku kayilaywa ngamazwi; lanxa iqedisisa, kayiyikuphendula.
020	PRO	029	020	Uyambona yini umuntu ophangisa ngamazwi akhe? Kulethemba elingcono esithutheni kulaye.
020	PRO	029	021	Ototoza inceku yakhe kusukela ebuntwaneni, ekucineni izakuba yindodana kuye.
020	PRO	029	022	Umuntu ololaka ubanga ukuxabana, lomuntu ovutha intukuthelo wandisa isiphambeko.
020	PRO	029	023	Ukuzigqaja komuntu kuzamehlisa, kodwa olomoya othobekileyo uzabamba udumo.
020	PRO	029	024	Owabelana lesela uzonda umphefumulo wakhe; uzwa isiqalekiso, angakhulumi.
020	PRO	029	025	Ukwesaba abantu kuletha umjibila, kodwa othemba eNkosini uzabekwa phezulu evikelekile.
020	PRO	029	026	Abanengi badinga ubuso bombusi, kodwa isahlulelo salowo lalowo sivela eNkosini.
020	PRO	029	027	Umuntu ongalunganga uyisinengiso kwabalungileyo, kodwa oqotho endleleni uyisinengiso kokhohlakeleyo.
020	PRO	030	001	Amazwi kaAguri indodana kaJake umMasa. Umuntu wathi kuIthiyeli, kuIthiyeli loUkhali:
020	PRO	030	002	Isibili, ngiyisithutha kulomuntu, kangilakuqedisisa komuntu.
020	PRO	030	003	Kangifundanga inhlakanipho, kangilwazi ulwazi lwabangcwele.
020	PRO	030	004	Ngubani owenyukela emazulwini njalo wehla? Ngubani oqoqe wafumbatha umoya ezandleni zakhe? Ngubani ogoqele amanzi esembathweni? Ngubani omise yonke imikhawulo yomhlaba? Lingubani ibizo lakhe, lebizo lendodana yakhe lingubani, uba usazi?
020	PRO	030	005	Lonke ilizwi likaNkulunkulu licwengekile; uyisihlangu kwabaphephela kuye.
020	PRO	030	006	Ungengezeleli emazwini akhe, hlezi akukhuze, utholwe ungumqambimanga.
020	PRO	030	007	Zimbili izinto engizicele kuwe; ungangigodleli zona ngingakafi.
020	PRO	030	008	Susa khatshana lami ize lamazwi amanga; ungangiphi ubuyanga loba inotho; ungiphe ukudla kwesabelo sami.
020	PRO	030	009	Hlezi ngisuthe, ngikuphike ngithi: Ngubani iNkosi? Kumbe hlezi ngibe ngumyanga, ngintshontshe, ngithathe ngeze ibizo likaNkulunkulu wami.
020	PRO	030	010	Ungahlebi inceku enkosini yayo, hlezi ikuthuke, ube lecala.
020	PRO	030	011	Kulesizukulwana esithuka uyise, esingabusisi unina;
020	PRO	030	012	isizukulwana esihlambulukileyo emehlweni aso, kodwa esingahlanjululwanga engcekezeni yaso;
020	PRO	030	013	isizukulwana omehlo aso aphakeme kangaka, lenkophe zaso ziphakanyisiwe;
020	PRO	030	014	isizukulwana omazinyo aso zinkemba, lesimazinyo aso omhlathi zingqamu, zokudla abayanga emhlabeni, labaswelayo ebantwini.
020	PRO	030	015	Umkhaza ulamadodakazi amabili athi: Phana, phana; lezizontathu kazisuthi; ezine kazitsho ukuthi: Kwanele.
020	PRO	030	016	Ingcwaba, lesizalo esiyinyumba, umhlaba ongasuthi amanzi, lomlilo ongathi: Kwanele.
020	PRO	030	017	Ilihlo eliklolodela uyise, lelidelela ukulalela unina, amawabayi esihotsha azalikopola, labantwana bamanqe bazalidla.
020	PRO	030	018	Lezizinto ezintathu ziyisimangaliso esikhulu kimi, yebo, ezine engingazaziyo:
020	PRO	030	019	Indlela yokhozi emazulwini, indlela yenyoka edwaleni, indlela yomkhumbi enhliziyweni yolwandle, lendlela yejaha entombini.
020	PRO	030	020	Injalo indlela yowesifazana oliwule; udla, esule umlomo wakhe, athi: Kangenzanga isiphambeko.
020	PRO	030	021	Ngenxa yezinto ezintathu umhlaba uyazamazama, yebo, ngenxa yezine ongezithwale:
020	PRO	030	022	Ngenxa yesigqili nxa sibusa, lesithutha nxa sisuthi ukudla,
020	PRO	030	023	ngenxa yesaliwakazi nxa sendile, lencekukazi nxa iyindlalifa yenkosikazi yayo.
020	PRO	030	024	Lezi ezine zingezincinyane zomhlaba, kanti zihlakaniphile zenziwe zihlakaniphe:
020	PRO	030	025	Ubunyonyo buyisizwe esingelamandla, kanti bulungisa ukudla kwabo ehlobo.
020	PRO	030	026	Imbila ziyisizwe esingelamandla, kanti zimisa indlu yazo edwaleni.
020	PRO	030	027	Intethe kazilankosi, kanti zonke ziphuma zehlukene ngamaviyo.
020	PRO	030	028	Umbankwa ubambelela ngezandla ezimbili, njalo usezigodlweni zenkosi.
020	PRO	030	029	Lezi ezintathu zinyathela kuhle, yebo, ezine zihamba kuhle:
020	PRO	030	030	Isilwane esilamandla phakathi kwenyamazana, esingeyikubuyela emuva ngenxa yobuso loba ngobukabani;
020	PRO	030	031	inja ebhince okhalweni, kumbe impongo; lenkosi ileviyo lamabutho.
020	PRO	030	032	Uba ube yisithutha ngokuziphakamisa, njalo uba ucebe okubi, beka isandla emlonyeni.
020	PRO	030	033	Ngoba ukuphehlwa kochago kuveza iphehla, lokucindezelwa kwempumulo kuveza igazi, lokucindezelwa kwentukuthelo kuveza ingxabano.
020	PRO	031	001	Amazwi kaLemuweli inkosi yeMasa, unina amfundisa wona.
020	PRO	031	002	Ini, ndodana yami! Ini-ke, ndodana yesizalo sami! Ini-ke, ndodana yezithembiso zami!
020	PRO	031	003	Unganiki amandla akho kwabesifazana, kumbe izindlela zakho ekubhubhiseni amakhosi.
020	PRO	031	004	Kakusikwamakhosi, Lemuweli, kakusikwamakhosi ukunatha iwayini, kumbe okweziphathamandla ukuloyisa okunathwayo okulamandla.
020	PRO	031	005	Hlezi anathe, akhohlwe isimiso, aguqule isahlulelo sawo wonke amadodana enhlupheko.
020	PRO	031	006	Phana okunathwayo okulamandla kobhubhayo, lewayini kwabababayo emphefumulweni.
020	PRO	031	007	Kanathe, akhohlwe ubuyanga bakhe, angabe esakhumbula usizi lwakhe.
020	PRO	031	008	Vulela isimungulu umlomo wakho, udaba lwabo bonke abamiselwe incithakalo.
020	PRO	031	009	Vula umlomo wakho, wahlulele ngokulunga, umele ilungelo lomyanga loswelayo.
020	PRO	031	010	Ngubani ongathola umfazi okhuthela okulungileyo? Ngoba intengo yakhe iyedlula kakhulu amatshe amahle.
020	PRO	031	011	Inhliziyo yomkakhe ithemba kuye, ukuze angasweli impango.
020	PRO	031	012	Umenzela okuhle, hatshi okubi, insuku zonke zempilo yakhe.
020	PRO	031	013	Udinga uboya bezimvu lefilakisi, asebenze ngenjabulo yezandla zakhe.
020	PRO	031	014	Ufanana lemikhumbi yomthengisi; uletha ukudla kwakhe kuvela khatshana.
020	PRO	031	015	Uvuka kusesebusuku, anike indlu yakhe ukudla, lesabelo kuzincekukazi zakhe.
020	PRO	031	016	Anakane ngensimu ayizuze; ngesithelo sezandla zakhe ahlanyele ivini.
020	PRO	031	017	Uyabhinca ukhalo lwakhe ngamandla, aqinise ingalo zakhe.
020	PRO	031	018	Uyananzelela ukuthi ukuthengisa kwakhe kuhle; isibane sakhe kasicitshi ebusuku.
020	PRO	031	019	Welulela izandla zakhe kuluthi lokuphotha, lezandla zakhe zibambe isigodo esilezintambo.
020	PRO	031	020	Welulela umyanga isandla sakhe, elulele izandla zakhe koswelayo.
020	PRO	031	021	Kesabi iliqhwa elikhithikileyo ngenxa yabendlu yakhe, ngoba bonke abendlu yakhe bagqokiswe okubomvu.
020	PRO	031	022	Uzenzela izembeso; isigqoko sakhe sililembu elicolekileyo leliyibubende.
020	PRO	031	023	Umkakhe uyaziwa emasangweni, lapho ehlezi labadala belizwe.
020	PRO	031	024	Wenza ilembu elicolekileyo kakhulu, alithengise; anike umthengi ibhanti.
020	PRO	031	025	Amandla lodumo kuyisigqoko sakhe; uyahleka mayelana losuku olulandelayo.
020	PRO	031	026	Uvula umlomo wakhe ngenhlakanipho; lemfundiso yomusa iselimini lwakhe.
020	PRO	031	027	Uqaphela inhambo zomuzi wakhe; kadli isinkwa sobuvila.
020	PRO	031	028	Abantwana bakhe bayavuka bathi ubusisiwe, lomkakhe laye uyamdumisa:
020	PRO	031	029	Manengi amadodakazi enze ngenkuthalo, kodwa wena wenyukile phezu kwawo wonke.
020	PRO	031	030	Ubuhle buyinkohliso, lokubukeka kuyize; owesifazana owesaba iNkosi yena uzadunyiswa.
020	PRO	031	031	Mnikeni okuvela esithelweni sezandla zakhe, lemisebenzi yakhe kayimdumise emasangweni.
#
# BOOK	021	ECC	Ecclesiastes	UmTshumayeli
021	ECC	001	001	Amazwi omTshumayeli, indodana kaDavida, inkosi eJerusalema.
021	ECC	001	002	Ize leze, kutsho umTshumayeli, ize leze, konke kuyize.
021	ECC	001	003	Kuyinzuzoni emuntwini emtshikatshikeni wakhe wonke awutshikatshika ngaphansi kwelanga?
021	ECC	001	004	Isizukulwana siyedlula, lesizukulwana size, kodwa umhlaba umi kuze kube nininini.
021	ECC	001	005	Lelanga liyaphuma, lelanga litshone, litshetshela endaweni lapho eliphuma khona.
021	ECC	001	006	Umoya uya eningizimu, ujikele enyakatho, ujikajike uhambe, lomoya ubuyele ekubhodeni kwawo.
021	ECC	001	007	Yonke imifula iya olwandle, kodwa ulwandle kalugcwali; endaweni lapho imifula evela khona, ibuyele iye khona.
021	ECC	001	008	Zonke izinto ziyadinisa; kakulamuntu olakho ukukukhuluma. Ilihlo kalisuthi ngokubona, lendlebe kayigcwaliswa yikuzwa.
021	ECC	001	009	Okwake kwaba khona yilokho okuzakuba khona, lokwake kwenziwa yilokho okuzakwenziwa; njalo kakulalutho olutsha ngaphansi kwelanga.
021	ECC	001	010	Kungaba khona ulutho yini okungathiwa ngalo: Khangela, lokhu kutsha! Kwakuvele kukhona endulo engaphambi kwethu.
021	ECC	001	011	Kakukho ukukhunjulwa kwezinto zakuqala; njalo lezinto ezizayo ezizakuba khona kakuyikuba khona ukukhunjulwa kwazo lalabo abazakuba khona emva kwalokho.
021	ECC	001	012	Mina mTshumayeli ngangiyinkosi phezu kukaIsrayeli eJerusalema.
021	ECC	001	013	Ngasenginikela inhliziyo yami ukudinga lokuhlolisisa ngokuhlakanipha ngakho konke okwenziwayo ngaphansi kwamazulu; lumtshikatshika onzima uNkulunkulu uwunike abantwana babantu ukuthi baphatheke ngawo.
021	ECC	001	014	Ngiyibonile yonke imisebenzi eyenziwayo ngaphansi kwelanga; khangela-ke, konke kuyize lokukhathazeka komoya.
021	ECC	001	015	Okugobileyo kakulakuqondiswa; lokuswelekayo kakulakubalwa.
021	ECC	001	016	Ngakhuluma mina lenhliziyo yami ngisithi: Khangela, mina ngikhulile ngandisa inhlakanipho phezu kwabo bonke ababephambi kwami eJerusalema; njalo inhliziyo yami ibonile kakhulu inhlakanipho lolwazi.
021	ECC	001	017	Nganginikela inhliziyo yami ukwazi inhlakanipho, lokwazi ukuhlanya lobuthutha, ngabona ukuthi lalokhu yikukhathazeka komoya.
021	ECC	001	018	Ngoba kunhlakanipho enengi kulokukhathazeka okunengi, lowandisa ulwazi wandisa usizi.
021	ECC	002	001	Ngathi mina enhliziyweni yami: Woza-ke, ngizakuzama ngentokozo, njalo kholisa okuhle. Khangela-ke, lalokhu kwakuyize.
021	ECC	002	002	Ngokuhleka ngathi: Kuyibuhlanya! Langentokozo: Kwenzani?
021	ECC	002	003	Ngadinga enhliziyweni yami ukuthokozisa inyama yami ngewayini (kodwa ngakhokhela inhliziyo yami ngenhlakanipho), lokubambelela ebuthutheni, ngize ngibone ukuthi kuyini lokho okulungele abantwana babantu, abangakwenza ngaphansi kwamazulu, ngenani lensuku zempilo zabo.
021	ECC	002	004	Ngazenzela imisebenzi emikhulu; ngazakhela izindlu; ngazihlanyelela izivini;
021	ECC	002	005	ngazenzela izivande lezivande zezihlahla; ngahlanyela kuzo izihlahla zezithelo zohlobo lonke;
021	ECC	002	006	ngazenzela amachibi amanzi okuthelela ngawo ihlathi lokukhulisa izihlahla;
021	ECC	002	007	ngathenga izigqili lezigqilikazi, ngaba labazalelwe endlini; njalo ngaba lemfuyo enengi yenkomo lezimvu okwedlula bonke ababekhona ngaphambi kwami eJerusalema;
021	ECC	002	008	ngazibuthela futhi isiliva legolide lemfuyo ekhethekileyo yamakhosi leyamazwe; ngazizuzela abahlabeleli labahlabelelikazi, lentokozo zabantwana babantu, amantombazana emihlobo yonke.
021	ECC	002	009	Ngakho ngaba mkhulu nganda okwedlula wonke owayekhona ngaphambi kwami eJerusalema, lenhlakanipho yami yema lami.
021	ECC	002	010	Lakho konke amehlo ami akufisayo kangiwancitshanga khona, kangigodlanga inhliziyo yami lakuyiphi intokozo; ngoba inhliziyo yami yathokoza ekutshikatshikeni kwami konke; lalokhu kwaba yisabelo sami somtshikatshika wami wonke.
021	ECC	002	011	Mina ngasengikhangela yonke imisebenzi izandla zami eziyenzileyo, lomtshikatshika engangitshikatshike ukuwenza; khangela-ke, konke kwakuyize lokukhathazeka komoya, njalo kwakungekho nzuzo ngaphansi kwelanga.
021	ECC	002	012	Mina ngasengibuyela ukubona inhlakanipho lobuhlanya lobuthutha. Ngoba angenzani umuntu olandela inkosi? Lokho okuvele sekwenziwe.
021	ECC	002	013	Mina ngasengibona ukuthi inhlakanipho ingcono kulobuthutha njengokukhanya kungcono kulomnyama.
021	ECC	002	014	Ohlakaniphileyo, amehlo akhe asekhanda lakhe, kodwa isithutha sihamba emnyameni; ngasengisazi lami ukuthi isehlakalo sinye sehlela bonke.
021	ECC	002	015	Mina ngasengisithi enhliziyweni yami: Njengoba kusehlela isithutha kuzangehlela lami; pho, kungani-ke mina ngangihlakaniphe okwedlulisileyo? Ngasengikhuluma enhliziyweni yami ukuthi lokhu lakho kuyize.
021	ECC	002	016	Ngoba kakukho ukukhunjulwa kohlakaniphileyo okwedlula koyisithutha phakade; ngoba lokhu okukhona khathesi ensukwini ezizayo konke kuzakhohlakala. Ohlakaniphileyo ufa njani? Njengesithutha.
021	ECC	002	017	Ngasengizonda impilo, ngoba umsebenzi owenziwa ngaphansi kwelanga wawubuhlungu kimi; ngoba konke kuyize lokukhathazeka komoya.
021	ECC	002	018	Yebo, mina ngawuzonda wonke umtshikatshika wami engawutshikatshika ngaphansi kwelanga, ngoba ngizawutshiyela umuntu ozakuba khona ngemva kwami.
021	ECC	002	019	Ngubani-ke owaziyo ukuthi uzakuba ngohlakaniphileyo kumbe oyisithutha? Kanti uzabusa phezu kwawo wonke umtshikatshika wami engawutshikatshikayo lengiwenze ngenhlakanipho ngaphansi kwelanga. Lokhu lakho kuyize.
021	ECC	002	020	Mina ngasengiphenduka ngadangalisa inhliziyo yami ngomtshikatshika wonke engangiwutshikatshika ngaphansi kwelanga.
021	ECC	002	021	Ngoba kulomuntu omtshikatshika wakhe ukunhlakanipho lakulwazi lakubuqotho, kanti uzawunika umuntu ongatshikatshikanga kuwo ube yisabelo sakhe. Lokhu lakho kuyize, lobubi obukhulu.
021	ECC	002	022	Ngoba ulani umuntu ngomtshikatshika wakhe wonke langokukhathazeka kwenhliziyo yakhe akutshikatshike ngaphansi kwelanga?
021	ECC	002	023	Ngoba insuku zakhe zonke zizinsizi, lomsebenzi wakhe uyikudabuka; lebusuku inhliziyo yakhe kayiphumuli. Lokhu lakho kuyize.
021	ECC	002	024	Kakukho okungcono emuntwini kulokuthi adle anathe abonise umphefumulo wakhe okuhle emtshikatshikeni wakhe. Lokhu lakho mina ngabona ukuthi kuvela esandleni sikaNkulunkulu.
021	ECC	002	025	Ngoba ngubani ongadla kumbe ngubani ongakholisa kulami?
021	ECC	002	026	Ngoba yena uyamnika umuntu olungileyo phambi kobuso bakhe inhlakanipho lolwazi lentokozo; kodwa isoni uyasinika umsebenzi wokubutha lokubuthelela ukunika olungileyo phambi kukaNkulunkulu. Lokhu lakho kuyize lokukhathazeka komoya.
021	ECC	003	001	Konke kulesikhathi esimisiweyo, njalo kulesikhathi sayo yonke indaba ngaphansi kwamazulu:
021	ECC	003	002	Isikhathi sokuzalwa, lesikhathi sokufa; isikhathi sokuhlanyela, lesikhathi sokusiphuna okuhlanyelweyo;
021	ECC	003	003	isikhathi sokubulala, lesikhathi sokuphilisa; isikhathi sokudiliza, lesikhathi sokwakha;
021	ECC	003	004	isikhathi sokukhala inyembezi, lesikhathi sokuhleka; isikhathi sokulila, lesikhathi sokugida;
021	ECC	003	005	isikhathi sokulahla amatshe, lesikhathi sokubuthelela amatshe; isikhathi sokugona, lesikhathi sokuba khatshana lokugona;
021	ECC	003	006	isikhathi sokudinga inzuzo, lesikhathi sokuyekela kulahleke; isikhathi sokulondoloza, lesikhathi sokulahla;
021	ECC	003	007	isikhathi sokudabula, lesikhathi sokuthunga; isikhathi sokuthula, lesikhathi sokukhuluma;
021	ECC	003	008	isikhathi sokuthanda, lesikhathi sokuzonda; isikhathi sempi, lesikhathi sokuthula.
021	ECC	003	009	Ulenzuzo bani osebenzayo kwatshikatshika kikho?
021	ECC	003	010	Ngiwubonile umsebenzi uNkulunkulu awunike abantwana babantu ukuthi baphatheke ngawo.
021	ECC	003	011	Konke ukwenze kwaba kuhle ngesikhathi sakho; wasebeka iphakade enhliziyweni yabo, ukuze kungabi lomuntu ongafumana umsebenzi uNkulunkulu awenzayo kusukela ekuqaleni kuze kube sekucineni.
021	ECC	003	012	Ngiyazi ukuthi kakukho okuhle kubo ngaphandle kokuthokoza lokwenza okuhle empilweni yakhe.
021	ECC	003	013	Futhi lokuthi wonke umuntu adle anathe akholise okuhle ngomtshikatshika wakhe wonke, kuyisipho sikaNkulunkulu.
021	ECC	003	014	Ngiyazi ukuthi konke uNkulunkulu akwenzayo kuzakuba khona phakade; kakukho okuzakwengezelelwa kukho, njalo kakukho okuzaphungulwa kukho; uNkulunkulu wakwenza ukuze besabe phambi kwakhe.
021	ECC	003	015	Lokho okwakukhona kukhona khathesi, lalokho okuzakuba khona sekuvele kukhona; njalo uNkulunkulu ufuna okuxotshiweyo.
021	ECC	003	016	Futhi ngasengibona ngaphansi kwelanga indawo yokwahlulela, kwakukhona ububi lapho; lendawo yokulunga, kwakukhona ububi lapho.
021	ECC	003	017	Ngathi mina enhliziyweni yami: UNkulunkulu uzakwahlulela olungileyo lomubi, ngoba kukhona lapho isikhathi sayo yonke indaba lesawo wonke umsebenzi.
021	ECC	003	018	Ngathi mina enhliziyweni yami ngesimo sabantwana babantu ukuthi uNkulunkulu abatshengise obala ukuthi babone ukuthi bona uqobo bazinyamazana.
021	ECC	003	019	Ngoba okwehlela abantwana babantu kwehlela lezinyamazana; njalo yinye into ebehlelayo; njengoba omunye esifa, ngokunjalo enye iyafa; yebo konke kulomoya munye, lomuntu kalakho angadlula ngakho inyamazana; ngoba konke kuyize.
021	ECC	003	020	Konke kuya endaweninye; konke kuvela ethulini, njalo konke kubuyela ethulini.
021	ECC	003	021	Ngubani owazi umoya wabantwana babantu owenyukela phezulu, lomoya wenyamazana owehlela phansi emhlabathini?
021	ECC	003	022	Ngakho ngabona ukuthi kakukho okungcono okwedlula ukuthi umuntu azithokozise ngemisebenzi yakhe, ngoba lokhu kuyisabelo sakhe. Ngoba ngubani ongamletha ukuthi abone lokho okuzakuba khona emva kwakhe?
021	ECC	004	001	Mina ngasengiphenduka ngabona incindezelo zonke ezenziwa ngaphansi kwelanga; khangela-ke inyembezi zabacindezelweyo, njalo babengelamduduzi; lehlangothini lwababacindezelayo kwakulamandla, kodwa babengelamduduzi.
021	ECC	004	002	Ngakho ngancoma abafileyo, abavele sebefile, okwedlula abaphilayo, abalokhu besaphila.
021	ECC	004	003	Yebo ungcono kulabo bobabili, ongakabi khona, ongabonanga umsebenzi omubi owenziwa ngaphansi kwelanga.
021	ECC	004	004	Ngasengibona mina wonke umtshikatshika lempumelelo yonke yomsebenzi, ngoba lokhu kungumhawu womuntu ovela kumakhelwane wakhe. Lokhu lakho kuyize lokukhathazeka komoya.
021	ECC	004	005	Isiphukuphuku sigoqa izandla zaso sidle inyama yaso.
021	ECC	004	006	Singcono isandla esigcwele ukuthula kulezandla ezimbili ezigcwele ukutshikatshika lokukhathazeka komoya.
021	ECC	004	007	Mina ngasengiphenduka ngabona ize ngaphansi kwelanga.
021	ECC	004	008	Kukhona oyedwa, njalo kakho owesibili, yebo kalamntwana kumbe umfowabo, njalo kakulakuphela komtshikatshika wakhe wonke, lelihlo lakhe kalisuthiswa yinotho, njalo katsho ukuthi: Ngitshikatshikela bani, ngenze umphefumulo wami uswele okuhle? Lokhu lakho kuyize, yebo, kungumsebenzi omubi.
021	ECC	004	009	Ababili bangcono kuloyedwa, ngoba balomvuzo omuhle ngokutshikatshika kwabo.
021	ECC	004	010	Ngoba uba besiwa omunye uzamvusa umngane wakhe; kodwa maye kuye oyedwa nxa esiwa, ngoba kungekho owesibili ongamvusa.
021	ECC	004	011	Futhi uba ababili belala ndawonye, ngakho balokukhudumala; kodwa ngoyedwa angakhudumala njani?
021	ECC	004	012	Njalo uba omunye engehlula oyedwa, ababili bazamelana laye; lentambo elemicu emithathu kayiqanyulwa masinyane.
021	ECC	004	013	Umfana ongumyanga ohlakaniphileyo ungcono kulenkosi endala eyisithutha engasakwazi ukwelulekwa.
021	ECC	004	014	Ngoba uyaphuma entolongweni ukuthi abe yinkosi, lanxa futhi owayezelwe embusweni wakhe esiba ngumyanga.
021	ECC	004	015	Ngabona bonke abaphilayo abahamba ngaphansi kwelanga, lomfana wesibili ozakuma esikhundleni sakhe.
021	ECC	004	016	Kakulasiphetho sabantu bonke, sabo bonke ababephambi kwabo, lalabo abeza emva kabayikuthokoza ngaye. Isibili lokhu lakho kuyize lokukhathazeka komoya.
021	ECC	005	001	Gcina unyawo lwakho nxa usiya endlini kaNkulunkulu; sondelela ukulalela kulokunikela umhlatshelo wezithutha, ngoba kazazi ukuthi zenza okubi.
021	ECC	005	002	Ungabi lamawala ngomlomo wakho, lenhliziyo yakho ingaphangisi ukukhupha ilizwi phambi kukaNkulunkulu; ngoba uNkulunkulu usemazulwini, wena-ke usemhlabeni, ngakho amazwi akho kawabe malutshwana.
021	ECC	005	003	Ngoba iphupho liza ngobunengi bomsebenzi, lelizwi lesithutha ngobunengi bamazwi.
021	ECC	005	004	Lapho ufunga isifungo kuNkulunkulu, ungaphuzi ukusikhokha, ngoba kakulantokozo kuziwula; khokha lokho okufungileyo.
021	ECC	005	005	Kungcono ukuthi ungafungi kulokuthi ufunge ungakhokhi.
021	ECC	005	006	Ungavumeli umlomo wakho ukuthi wenze inyama yakho yone, futhi ungatsho phambi kwengilosi ukuthi bekuyisiphosiso; uNkulunkulu uzathukuthelelani ilizwi lakho, achithe umsebenzi wezandla zakho?
021	ECC	005	007	Ngoba ebunengini bamaphupho lamazwi kukhona lokuyize okunengi, kodwa mesabe uNkulunkulu.
021	ECC	005	008	Uba ubona ucindezelo lomyanga lokuphanjulwa kokulunga lesahlulelo ngodlakela esabelweni, ungamangali ngalinto, ngoba ophezulu kophezulu uyananzelela, njalo kulabaphezulu phezu kwabo.
021	ECC	005	009	Lenzuzo yomhlabathi ngeyabo bonke; inkosi isetshenzelwa yinsimu.
021	ECC	005	010	Othanda imali kayikweneliswa yimali, njalo othanda okunengi kayikweneliswa yikwanda; lokhu lakho kuyize.
021	ECC	005	011	Ekwandeni kokuhle, bayanda abakudlayo; njalo kulenzuzo bani kubanini bakho, ngaphandle kokukubuka ngamehlo abo?
021	ECC	005	012	Bumnandi ubuthongo besisebenzi loba sisidla okulutshwana loba okunengi; kodwa ukusutha kwesinothi kakusivumeli ukulala.
021	ECC	005	013	Kukhona ububi obubuhlungu esengibubonile ngaphansi kwelanga: Inotho egcinelwe abaniniyo kube yibubi kibo.
