024	JER	018	003	Ngasengisehlela endlini yombumbi, khangela-ke wayesenza umsebenzi emavilini.
024	JER	018	004	Njalo imbiza ayeyenza ngebumba yonakala esandleni sombumbi; wasebuya wenza ngayo enye imbiza njengoba kwakuqondile emehlweni ombumbi ukwenza.
024	JER	018	005	Ilizwi leNkosi laselifika kimi lisithi:
024	JER	018	006	Ndlu kaIsrayeli, ngingeze ngenza kini njengalo umbumbi yini? itsho iNkosi. Khangela, njengebumba esandleni sombumbi, linjalo lina esandleni sami, lina ndlu kaIsrayeli.
024	JER	018	007	Ngesikhatshana ngizakhuluma ngesizwe langombuso ukuthi ngizakusiphuna, ngikudilize, ngikuchithe;
