024	JER	052	016	Kodwa uNebuzaradani induna yabalindi watshiya abanye kwabangabayanga belizwe ukuthi babe ngabaphathi bezivini labalimi.
024	JER	052	017	Lensika zethusi ezazisendlini yeNkosi, lezisekelo, lolwandle lwethusi olwalusendlini yeNkosi, amaKhaladiya akuphahlaza, athwala lonke ithusi lakho alisa eBhabhiloni.
024	JER	052	018	Athatha izimbiza, lamafotsholo, lezindlawu, lemiganu yokufafaza, lezinkezo, lazo zonke izitsha zethusi abakhonza ngazo,
024	JER	052	019	lemiganu, lezitsha zokuthwala umlilo, lemiganu yokufafaza, lezimbiza, lezinti zezibane, lezinkezo, lemiganu yomnikelo wokuthululwa; okwakuligolide golide lokwakuyisiliva siliva induna yabalindi yakuthatha.
024	JER	052	020	Insika zombili, ulwandle olulodwa, lenkabi zethusi ezazilitshumi lambili ezazingaphansi kwezisekelo inkosi uSolomoni eyayikwenzele indlu yeNkosi; ithusi lazo zonke lezizitsha lalingelakulinganiswa ngesisindo.
024	JER	052	021	Mayelana lezinsika, ubude bensika eyodwa babuzingalo ezilitshumi lesificaminwembili, lentambo yezingalo ezilitshumi lambili yayigombolozela, lohlonzi lwayo lwaluyiminwe emine, yayilomwolo.
024	JER	052	022	Lesiduku esiphezu kwayo sasilithusi, lobude besiduku esisodwa babuzingalo ezinhlanu, lembule, lamapomegranati phezu kwesiduku inhlangothi zonke; konke kwakulithusi. Lensika yesibili yayilokufanana lalezi, lamapomegranati.
024	JER	052	023	Njalo kwakulamapomegranati angamatshumi ayisificamunwemunye lesithupha eceleni; wonke amapomegranati ayelikhulu phezu kwembule inhlangothi zonke.
024	JER	052	024	Induna yabalindi yasithatha uSeraya umpristi oyinhloko, loZefaniya umpristi owesibili, labalindi bombundu labo bobathathu.
024	JER	052	025	Yasithatha emzini umthenwa othile owayengumphathi phezu kwamadoda empi, lamadoda ayisikhombisa kulabo ababona ubuso benkosi, atholakala emzini, lomabhalane wenduna yebutho eyayibuthela abantu belizwe emabuthweni, lamadoda angamatshumi ayisithupha abantu belizwe, ayetholakala phakathi komuzi.
024	JER	052	026	UNebuzaradani induna yabalindi wasebathatha, wabasa enkosini yeBhabhiloni eRibila.
024	JER	052	027	Inkosi yeBhabhiloni yasibatshaya, yababulalela eRibila elizweni leHamathi. Ngokunjalo uJuda wathunjwa esuswa elizweni lakhe.
024	JER	052	028	Laba ngabantu uNebhukadirezari abathumbayo: Ngomnyaka wesikhombisa, amaJuda azinkulungwane ezintathu lamatshumi amabili lantathu;
024	JER	052	029	ngomnyaka wetshumi lesificaminwembili kaNebhukadirezari, kwasuka eJerusalema imiphefumulo engamakhulu ayisificaminwembili lamatshumi amathathu lambili;
024	JER	052	030	ngomnyaka wamatshumi amabili lantathu kaNebhukadirezari, uNebuzaradani induna yabalindi wathumba amaJuda, imiphefumulo engamakhulu ayisikhombisa lamatshumi amane lanhlanu; yonke imiphefumulo yayizinkulungwane ezine lamakhulu ayisithupha.
024	JER	052	031	Kwasekusithi ngomnyaka wamatshumi amathathu lesikhombisa wokuthunjwa kukaJehoyakhini inkosi yakoJuda, ngenyanga yetshumi lambili ngolwamatshumi amabili lanhlanu lwenyanga, uEvili-Merodaki inkosi yeBhabhiloni, ngomnyaka wokuqala wokubusa kwakhe, waphakamisa ikhanda likaJehoyakhini inkosi yakoJuda, wamkhupha entolongweni,
024	JER	052	032	wasekhuluma kuhle laye, wabeka isihlalo sakhe sobukhosi phezu kwesihlalo sobukhosi samakhosi ayelaye eBhabhiloni.
024	JER	052	033	Wasentshintsha izigqoko zokubotshwa kwakhe; njalo wadla isinkwa phambi kwayo njalonjalo insuku zonke zempilo yakhe.
024	JER	052	034	Mayelana lesabelo sakhe, isabelo esimiyo wasinikwa yinkosi yeBhabhiloni, into yosuku ngosuku lwayo, kwaze kwaba lusuku lokufa kwakhe, zonke insuku zempilo yakhe.
#
# BOOK	025	LAM	Lamentations	Izililo
025	LAM	001	001	Yeka ukuhlala kodwa komuzi owawugcwele abantu! Usunjengomfelokazi owawumkhulu phakathi kwezizwe, owawuyinkosikazi phakathi kwezabelo usuyisibhalwa!
025	LAM	001	002	Uyakhala lokukhala inyembezi ebusuku, lezinyembezi zawo zisezihlathini zawo. Kawulamduduzi phakathi kwazo zonke izithandwa zawo. Bonke abangane bawo bawuphethe ngenkohliso, sebeyizitha zawo.
025	LAM	001	003	UJuda useye ekuthunjweni ngenxa yokuhlupheka langenxa yobukhulu bobugqili; yena uhlala phakathi kwabezizwe, katholi ukuphumula; bonke abamzingelayo bamfica ephakathi kwezimbandezelo.
025	LAM	001	004	Indlela zeZiyoni ziyalila, ngoba kungekho ozayo emkhosini omisiweyo; wonke amasango ayo angamanxiwa; abapristi bayo bayabubula, izintombi zayo ezimsulwa zidabukile, layo isekubabeni.
025	LAM	001	005	Abamelani bayo sebeyinhloko, izitha zayo zonwabile; ngoba iNkosi iyidabulile ngenxa yobunengi beziphambeko zayo; abantwana bayo sebeye ekuthunjweni phambi kwesitha.
025	LAM	001	006	Labo bonke ubuhle bayo busukile kundodakazi yeZiyoni. Iziphathamandla zayo zinjengezindluzele ezingatholi idlelo, njalo ziyahamba zingelamandla phambi komzingeli.
025	LAM	001	007	Ezinsukwini zenhlupheko yayo lokuzulazula kwayo iJerusalema yakhumbula zonke izinto zayo eziloyisekayo okwakukhona kusukela ezinsukwini zasendulo, lapho abantu bayo bawela esandleni sesitha, njalo ingelamsizi; izitha zayibona, zahleka usulu amasabatha ayo.
025	LAM	001	008	IJerusalema yonile kakhulu, ngakho-ke isingcolile; bonke ababeyihlonipha bayidelela, ngoba sebebonile ubuze bayo; yona isibubula, ibuyele emuva.
025	LAM	001	009	Ukungcola kwayo kwakusemiphethweni yezigqoko zayo; kayikhumbulanga ukucina kwayo; ngakho yehla ngokumangalisayo, yayingelamduduzi. Nkosi, bona inhlupheko yami, ngoba isitha sizikhulisile.
025	LAM	001	010	Isitha selule isandla saso phezu kwazo zonke izinto zayo eziloyisekayo; ngoba ibonile izizwe zingena endaweni yayo engcwele, owazilaya ukuthi zingangeni phakathi kwebandla lakho.
025	LAM	001	011	Bonke abantu bayo bayabubula, bedinga isinkwa; banike izinto zabo eziloyisekayo ngokudla ukuthi bavuselele umphefumulo. Bona, Nkosi, ukhangele, ngoba ngiyadelelwa.
025	LAM	001	012	Kakusilutho kini yini lonke elidlulayo ngendlela? Khangelani libone uba kukhona yini usizi njengosizi lwami, olwenziwe kimi, iNkosi engidabule ngalo osukwini lokuvutha kolaka lwayo.
025	LAM	001	013	Iphezulu, ithumele umlilo emathanjeni ami, wawehlula; ithiyele unyawo lwami imbule, ingibuyisele emuva; ingenze ngaba lunxiwa, ngaphela amandla usuku lonke.
025	LAM	001	014	Ijokwe leziphambeko zami libotshwe ngesandla sayo; zelukiwe, zenyukele entanyeni yami, iwisile amandla ami; iNkosi inginikele ezandleni zabo, ngingelakho ukuvuka.
025	LAM	001	015	INkosi yeyisile wonke amaqhawe ami phakathi kwami; yabiza umhlangano omelene lami ukuchoboza amajaha ami; iNkosi inyathelele intombi emsulwa, indodakazi yakoJuda, isikhamelo sewayini.
025	LAM	001	016	Ngenxa yalezizinto ngiyakhala inyembezi; ilihlo lami, ilihlo lami lehlisa amanzi, ngoba umduduzi obengavuselela umphefumulo wami ukhatshana lami; abantwana bami bachithakele ngoba isitha sinqobile.
025	LAM	001	017	IZiyoni iyelula izandla zayo, kakho oyiduduzayo. INkosi ilayile ngoJakobe ukuthi abamzingelezeleyo babe yizitha zakhe. IJerusalema injengowesifazana ongcolileyo phakathi kwabo.
025	LAM	001	018	INkosi ilungile, ngoba ngivukele umlomo wayo. Ake lizwe, bantu lonke, libone usizi lwami. Intombi zami ezimsulwa lamajaha ami baye ekuthunjweni.
025	LAM	001	019	Ngabiza izithandwa zami, kodwa zona zangikhohlisa. Abapristi bami labadala bami baphefumula okokucina emzini, besazidingela ukudla ukuze bavuselele umphefumulo wabo.
025	LAM	001	020	Bona, Nkosi, ngoba ngilusizi; imibilini yami idungekile, inhliziyo yami iphendukile phakathi kwami, ngoba ngaba lenkani kakhulu. Ngaphandle inkemba iyemuka abantwana, endlini kunjengokufa.
025	LAM	001	021	Bezwile ukuthi mina ngiyabubula; kangilamduduzi; zonke izitha zami zizwile ngobubi bami; ziyathokoza ngoba wena ukwenzile. Uzalufikisa usuku osulumemezile, khona zizakuba njengami.
025	LAM	001	022	Kabufike bonke ububi bazo phambi kwakho, wenze kizo njengalokhu wenzile kimi ngenxa yazo zonke iziphambeko zami; ngoba ukububula kwami kunengi, lenhliziyo yami iphela amandla.
025	LAM	002	001	INkosi iyigubuzele kangakanani indodakazi yeZiyoni ngeyezi entukuthelweni yayo, yaphosa ubuhle bukaIsrayeli busuka emazulwini busiya emhlabeni; njalo kayisikhumbulanga isenabelo senyawo zayo ngosuku lwentukuthelo yayo!
025	LAM	002	002	INkosi iginyile zonke indawo zokuhlala zikaJakobe, ingahawukeli; ekuthukutheleni kwayo idilizile izinqaba zendodakazi yakoJuda, yazisa emhlabathini; yangcolisa umbuso leziphathamandla zawo.
025	LAM	002	003	Iqumile ngokuvutha kolaka lwayo lonke uphondo lwakoIsrayeli; yabuyisela emuva isandla sayo sokunene phambi kwesitha; yatshisa imelene loJakobe njengomlilo welangabi oqothula inhlangothi zonke.
025	LAM	002	004	Igobisile idandili layo njengesitha; yema ngesandla sayo njengesitha; yabulala zonke izinto eziloyisekayo zamehlo ethenteni lendodakazi yeZiyoni; yathulula ulaka lwayo njengomlilo.
025	LAM	002	005	INkosi yaba njengesitha; yaginya uIsrayeli, yaginya zonke izigodlo zakhe, yachitha inqaba zakhe; yandisa ukulila lesililo kundodakazi yakoJuda.
025	LAM	002	006	Ithethe ngodlakela idumba layo njengesivande; yachitha indawo yakhe yokuhlanganyela; uJehova wenza ukuthi kukhohlakale eZiyoni umkhosi omisiweyo lesabatha; wadelela inkosi lompristi ngokuvutha kolaka lwakhe.
025	LAM	002	007	INkosi ilahlile ilathi layo; yadelela indawo yayo engcwele; yanikela esandleni sesitha imiduli yezigodlo zayo. Zakhupha umsindo endlini yeNkosi njengosukwini lomkhosi omisiweyo.
025	LAM	002	008	INkosi yacabanga ukuchitha umduli wendodakazi yeZiyoni; yelulile intambo yokulinganisa; kayibuyisanga isandla sayo ekuginyeni; ngakho yenza ukuthi kulile umthangala lomduli, kanyekanye kuphele amandla.
025	LAM	002	009	Amasango ayo atshonile emhlabathini; yabhubhisa yephula imigoqo yayo; inkosi yayo leziphathamandla zayo ziphakathi kwabezizwe; kakulamthetho; labaprofethi bayo kabatholi umbono uvela eNkosini.
025	LAM	002	010	Abadala bendodakazi yeZiyoni bahlezi emhlabathini, bathule, bathele uthuli ekhanda labo, babhince amasaka; izintombi zeJerusalema zikhothamisele emhlabathini amakhanda azo.
025	LAM	002	011	Amehlo ami ayaphela ngezinyembezi, imibilini yami idungekile, isibindi sami sithululelwe emhlabathini, ngenxa yokwephuka kwendodakazi yabantu bami; ngoba umntwana lomunyayo bayadangala ezitaladeni zomuzi.
025	LAM	002	012	Bathi kubonina: Angaphi amabele lewayini? lapho bedangala njengabagwaziweyo ezitaladeni zomuzi, lapho umphefumulo wabo uzithululela esifubeni sabonina.
025	LAM	002	013	Ngingakufakazelani? Kuyini engingakufananisa lawe, wena ndodakazi yeJerusalema? Kuyini engingakulinganisa lawe, ukuze ngikududuze, ntombi emsulwa ndodakazi yeZiyoni? Ngoba ukwephuka kwakho kukhulu njengolwandle; ngubani ongakwelapha?
025	LAM	002	014	Abaprofethi bakho bakubonele okuyize lokungafanelanga, kabakuvezanga ukona kwakho, ukuze babuyise ukuthunjwa kwakho, kodwa bakubonele imithwalo yamanga lezinkohliso.
025	LAM	002	015	Bonke abedlulayo ngendlela batshaya izandla ngawe, bancife, banikine ikhanda labo ngendodakazi yeJerusalema, besithi: Yiwo lo umuzi yini abathi ngawo uyikuphelela kobuhle, intokozo yomhlaba wonke?
025	LAM	002	016	Zonke izitha zakho zikukhamisele umlomo wazo, ziyancifa, zigedle amazinyo, zithi: Siwuginyile; isibili lolu lusuku ebesilulindele, sesilutholile, silubonile.
025	LAM	002	017	INkosi yenzile ebikucebile, igcwalisile ilizwi layo eyalilaya kusukela ensukwini zendulo; idilizile, kayihawukelanga; yenzile ukuthi isitha sithokoze phezu kwakho; yaphakamisa uphondo lwabamelene lawe.
025	LAM	002	018	Inhliziyo yabo yakhala eNkosini: Wena mthangala wendodakazi yeZiyoni, inyembezi kazehle njengomfula imini lobusuku; ungaziphi ukuphumula, inhlamvu yelihlo lakho ingapheli!
025	LAM	002	019	Sukuma, unqongoloze ebusuku ekuqaleni kwemilindo, uthulule inhliziyo yakho njengamanzi phambi kobuso beNkosi; uphakamise izandla zakho kuyo ngenxa yempilo yabantwana bakho abancinyane, abaphela amandla ngenxa yendlala ekuqaleni kwaso sonke isitalada.
025	LAM	002	020	Bona, Nkosi, ukhangele ukuthi wenze njalo kubani. Abesifazana bazakudla isithelo sabo yini, abantwana abancinyane ababasingathileyo? Umpristi lomprofethi bazabulawa endaweni engcwele yeNkosi yini?
025	LAM	002	021	Abatsha labadala balele emhlabathini ezitaladeni; intombi zami ezimsulwa lamajaha ami bawile ngenkemba; ubabulele osukwini lolaka lwakho, ujuqile kawuhawukelanga.
025	LAM	002	022	Wabiza njengosukwini olumisiweyo izesabiso zami inhlangothi zonke, ukuze ngosuku lolaka lweNkosi kakho ophunyukileyo loseleyo; labo engabasingathayo ngabakhulisa isitha sami sabaqeda.
025	LAM	003	001	Ngiyindodaebone inhlupheko ngentonga yolaka lwayo.
025	LAM	003	002	Ingikhokhele yangihambisa emnyameni kodwa hatshi ekukhanyeni.
025	LAM	003	003	Isibili iphenduke yamelana lami; iphendule isandla sayo imelene lami usuku lonke.
025	LAM	003	004	Igugisile inyama yami lesikhumba sami; yephulile amathambo ami.
025	LAM	003	005	Yakhile imelene lami, yangihanqa ngenyongo lobunzima.
025	LAM	003	006	Ingihlalise endaweni ezimnyama, njengabafa endulo.
025	LAM	003	007	Ingibiyele ukuze ngingaphumi, yenza iketane lami lethusi laba nzima.
025	LAM	003	008	Njalo nxa ngikhala ngimemeza, ivalela phandle umkhuleko wami.
025	LAM	003	009	Ibiyele indlela yami ngamatshe abaziweyo, yenza izindlela zami zagoba.
025	LAM	003	010	Yaba kimi njengebhere elicathemeyo, isilwane ezindaweni zensitha.
025	LAM	003	011	Iphambule izindlela zami, yangidabudabula, yangenza unxiwa.
025	LAM	003	012	Igobisile idandili layo, yangimisa njengento yokunenjwa ngomtshoko.
025	LAM	003	013	Yenze amadodana esamba semitshoko yayo angena ezinsweni zami.
025	LAM	003	014	Ngaba yinhlekisa kibo bonke abantu bakithi, ingoma yabo usuku lonke.
025	LAM	003	015	Ingisuthise ngezinto ezibabayo, yanginathisa umhlonyane.
025	LAM	003	016	Njalo ichoboze amazinyo ami ngokhethe, yangigiga emlotheni.
025	LAM	003	017	Njalo wena walahla umphefumulo wami khatshana lokuthula; ngikhohlwe okuhle.
025	LAM	003	018	Ngakho ngithi: Kubhubhile amandla ami lethemba lami eNkosini.
025	LAM	003	019	Khumbula inhlupheko yami lokuzulazula kwami, umhlonyane lenyongo.
025	LAM	003	020	Umphefumulo wami uhlala ukukhumbula, njalo ukhotheme phakathi kwami.
025	LAM	003	021	Lokhu ngiyakubuyisela enhliziyweni yami, ngakho-ke ngiyathemba.
025	LAM	003	022	Kuyizihawu zeNkosi ukuthi kasiqedwanga, ngoba izisa zakhe kazipheli;
025	LAM	003	023	zintsha ikuseni yonke; lukhulu uthembeko lwayo.
025	LAM	003	024	INkosi iyisabelo sami, kutsho umphefumulo wami; ngakho-ke ngizathemba kiyo.
025	LAM	003	025	INkosi ilungile kwabayilindelayo, kumphefumulo oyidingayo.
025	LAM	003	026	Kuhle ukuthi umuntu athembe, njalo ngokuthula kusindiso lweNkosi.
025	LAM	003	027	Kuhle emuntwini ukuthi athwale ijogwe ebutsheni bakhe.
025	LAM	003	028	Kahlale yedwa, athule, ngoba isimethese lona.
025	LAM	003	029	Kabeke umlomo wakhe othulini; mhlawumbe kungaba khona ithemba.
025	LAM	003	030	Kanikele isihlathi sakhe komtshayayo; asuthe inhlamba.
025	LAM	003	031	Ngoba iNkosi kayiyikulahla kuze kube phakade.
025	LAM	003	032	Ngoba lanxa idabukisile, kanti izakuba lesihawu ngobunengi bezisa zayo.
025	LAM	003	033	Ngoba kayihluphi ngenhliziyo yayo idabukise abantwana babantu;
025	LAM	003	034	ukuchoboza ngaphansi kwenyawo zayo zonke izibotshwa zomhlaba;
025	LAM	003	035	ukuphambukisa ilungelo lomuntu phambi kobuso boPhezukonke;
025	LAM	003	036	ukuphambanisa umuntu kudaba lwakhe, iNkosi kayikuboni yini?
025	LAM	003	037	Ngubani ongakukhuluma, njalo kwenzeke, nxa iNkosi ingakulayanga?
025	LAM	003	038	Kakuphumi ububi lokuhle emlonyeni woPhezukonke yini?
025	LAM	003	039	Ngakho usolelani umuntu ophilayo, umuntu ngezono zakhe?
025	LAM	003	040	Asihlole silinge izindlela zethu, sibuyele eNkosini.
025	LAM	003	041	Asiphakamisele inhliziyo lezandla zethu kuNkulunkulu emazulwini.
025	LAM	003	042	Thina siphambukile, saba lenkani; wena kawuthethelelanga.
025	LAM	003	043	Wembese ngolaka, waxotshana lathi, wabulala, kawuhawukelanga.
025	LAM	003	044	Uzembese ngeyezi, ukuze kungedluli umkhuleko.
025	LAM	003	045	Usenze saba yimfucuza lezibi phakathi kwezizwe.
025	LAM	003	046	Zonke izitha zethu zivule umlomo wazo zimelene lathi.
025	LAM	003	047	Ukwesaba lomgodi kukhona phambi kwethu, incithakalo lokwephuka.
025	LAM	003	048	Ilihlo lami lehlisa imifula yamanzi ngokuchitheka kwendodakazi yabantu bami.
025	LAM	003	049	Ilihlo lami liyajuluka, kaliyekeli, kungelakuma,
025	LAM	003	050	ize ikhangele phansi ibone iNkosi isezulwini.
025	LAM	003	051	Ilihlo lami lenza umphefumulo wami ube buhlungu ngenxa yawo wonke amadodakazi omuzi wakithi.
025	LAM	003	052	Izitha zami zingizingele kabuhlungu njengenyoni, kungelasizatho.
025	LAM	003	053	Bayiqumile impilo yami emgodini, baphosa ilitshe phezu kwami.
025	LAM	003	054	Amanzi ageleza phezu kwekhanda lami; ngathi: Ngiqunyiwe.
025	LAM	003	055	Ngabiza ibizo lakho, Nkosi, ngisemgodini phansi;
025	LAM	003	056	wezwa ilizwi lami; ungafihli indlebe yakho ekuphefumuleni kwami, ekukhaleleni kwami usizo.
025	LAM	003	057	Wasondela ngosuku lapho ngikubiza, wathi: Ungesabi.
025	LAM	003	058	Nkosi, uzimele izindaba zomphefumulo wami, wahlenga impilo yami.
025	LAM	003	059	Nkosi, ubonile ukoniwa kwami; yahlulela udaba lwami.
025	LAM	003	060	Ubonile yonke impindiselo yabo, wonke amacebo abo amelene lami.
025	LAM	003	061	Uzwile inhlamba yabo, Nkosi, wonke amacebo abo amelene lami,
025	LAM	003	062	indebe zabangivukelayo, lokuzindla kwabo kumelene lami lonke usuku.
025	LAM	003	063	Khangela ukuhlala kwabo, lokusukuma kwabo; ngiyingoma yabo.
025	LAM	003	064	Buyisela kibo impindiselo, Nkosi, njengokomsebenzi wezandla zabo.
025	LAM	003	065	Banike ubulukhuni benhliziyo, isiqalekiso sakho kibo.
025	LAM	003	066	Xotshana labo ngolaka, ubabhubhise bangabi ngaphansi kwamazulu eNkosi.
025	LAM	004	001	Yeka ukufiphala kwegolide, ukuphenduka kwegolide elihle kakhulu! Amatshe endawo engcwele achithiwe ekuqaleni kwazo zonke izitalada.
025	LAM	004	002	Amadodana aligugu eZiyoni, alinganiswa legolide elihle, yeka ukuthiwa kwawo ayizitsha zebumba, umsebenzi wezandla zombumbi!
