028	HOS	013	008	Ngizabahlangabeza njengebhere elithathelwe imidlwane, ngidabule isisibekelo senhliziyo yabo, ngibadlele lapho njengesilwane; isilo seganga sizabadabudabula.
028	HOS	013	009	Kukuchithile, Israyeli, kodwa kimi kulosizo lwakho.
