040	MAT	026	039	Waseqhubeka ibangana, wawa ngobuso bakhe wakhuleka wathi: Baba, uba kungenzeka, kakudlule kimi linkezo; kodwa kungabi njengoba ngithanda mina, kodwa njengoba uthanda wena.
040	MAT	026	040	Wasesiza kubafundi, wabafica belele, wathi kuPetro: Kanti belingelinde lami ihola ibenye?
040	MAT	026	041	Lindani likhuleke, ukuze lingangeni ekulingweni; umoya isibili uyavuma, kodwa inyama ibuthakathaka.
040	MAT	026	042	Wabuya wasuka ngokwesibili wakhuleka, wathi: Baba, uba inkezo le ingedlule kimi, ngaphandle kokuthi ngiyinathe, kayenziwe intando yakho.
040	MAT	026	043	Wasebuya wabafica futhi belele, ngoba amehlo abo ayenzima.
040	MAT	026	044	Wasebatshiya wahamba futhi wakhuleka ngokwesithathu, esitsho wona lawomazwi.
040	MAT	026	045	Wasesiza kubafundi bakhe, wathi kubo: Qhubekani lilele, liphumule; khangelani, isikhathi sesisondele, futhi iNdodana yomuntu iyanikelwa ezandleni zezoni.
040	MAT	026	046	Sukumani, sihambe; khangelani, onginikelayo useduze.
040	MAT	026	047	Kwathi esakhuluma, khangela, kwafika uJudasi, omunye wabalitshumi lambili, lexuku elikhulu lilaye elilezinkemba lezinduku, livela kubapristi abakhulu labadala babantu.
040	MAT	026	048	Laye omnikelayo wayebanike isiboniso, esithi: Lowo engizamanga, nguye; limbambe.
040	MAT	026	049	Njalo wahle wasondela kuJesu wathi: Mpilo enhle, Rabi! Wasemanga.
040	MAT	026	050	UJesu wasesithi kuye: Mngane, ulandeni? Basebesondela bamdumela uJesu ngezandla, bambamba.
040	MAT	026	051	Futhi khangela, omunye walabo ababeloJesu welula isandla, wakhokha inkemba yakhe, wagadla inceku yompristi omkhulu waquma indlebe yayo.
040	MAT	026	052	UJesu wasesithi kuye: Buyisela inkemba yakho endaweni yayo; ngoba bonke abaphatha inkemba bazabhubha ngenkemba.
040	MAT	026	053	Kumbe ucabanga ukuthi ngingemcele uBaba yini khathesi, futhi anginike amabutho amakhulu ezingilosi edlula itshumi lambili?
040	MAT	026	054	Pho ingagcwaliseka njani imibhalo, ukuthi kumele ukuthi kube njalo?
040	MAT	026	055	Ngalelohola uJesu wathi emaxukwini: Liphume njengokuyamelana lomphangi yini lilezinkemba lezinduku ukuzangibamba? Bengihlezi insuku ngensuku ethempelini ngifundisa, kodwa kalingibambanga.
040	MAT	026	056	Kodwa konke lokhu kwenzakele, ukuze kugcwaliseke imibhalo yabaprofethi. Basebemtshiya bonke abafundi babaleka.
040	MAT	026	057	Lababembambile uJesu bamqhuba bamusa kuKayafasi umpristi omkhulu, lapho ababebuthene khona ababhali labadala.
040	MAT	026	058	Kodwa uPetro wamlandela ekhatshana, kwaze kwaba segumeni lompristi omkhulu, njalo wangena phakathi wahlala phansi lezinceku, ukuze abone isicino.
040	MAT	026	059	Njalo abapristi abakhulu labadala lomphakathi wonke badinga ubufakazi bamanga obumelana loJesu, ukuze bambulale,
040	MAT	026	060	kodwa kababutholanga; lanxa kwavela abafakazi abanengi bamanga, ababutholanga. Kwathi emva kwalokho kwavela ababili abafakazi bamanga,
040	MAT	026	061	bathi: Lo wathi: Ngilakho ukudiliza ithempeli likaNkulunkulu, njalo ngilakhe ngensuku ezintathu.
040	MAT	026	062	Kwasekusukuma umpristi omkhulu wathi kuye: Kawuphenduli lutho yini? Bafakazani laba okumelana lawe?
040	MAT	026	063	Kodwa uJesu wathula. Umpristi omkhulu wasephendula wathi kuye: Ngikufungisa ngoNkulunkulu ophilayo, ukuthi usitshele ukuthi unguKristu, iNdodana kaNkulunkulu.
040	MAT	026	064	UJesu wathi kuye: Utshilo wena. Kodwa ngithi kini: Kusukela khathesi lizabona iNdodana yomuntu ihlezi ngakwesokunene samandla isiza phezu kwamayezi ezulu.
040	MAT	026	065	Umpristi omkhulu wasedabula izembatho zakhe, wathi: Usehlambazile; sisadingelani abafakazi? Khangelani, khathesi seliyizwile inhlamba yakhe;
040	MAT	026	066	licabangani? Basebephendula besithi: Ulecala lokufa.
040	MAT	026	067	Basebemkhafulela amathe ebusweni bamdutshuza; labanye bamwakala,
040	MAT	026	068	bathi: Profetha kithi, Kristu, ngubani okutshayileyo?
040	MAT	026	069	UPetro wayesehlezi ngaphandle egumeni; kwasekusiza kuye incekukazi ethile, yathi: Lawe ubuloJesu weGalili.
040	MAT	026	070	Kodwa waphika phambi kwabo bonke, wathi: Kangikwazi lokho okutshoyo.
040	MAT	026	071	Kwathi esephuma esiya esangweni, enye incekukazi yambona, yathi kwababekhona: Laye lo ubeloJesu weNazaretha.
040	MAT	026	072	Waphika njalo ngesifungo esithi: Kangimazi lumuntu.
040	MAT	026	073	Kwathi emva kwesikhatshana labo ababemi khona basondela bathi kuPetro: Ngeqiniso lawe ungowabo; ngoba lokukhuluma kwakho kuyakuveza.
040	MAT	026	074	Waseqala ukuqalekisa lokufunga esithi: Kangimazi lumuntu. Njalo lahle lakhala iqhude.
040	MAT	026	075	UPetro wasekhumbula ilizwi likaJesu esithi kuye: Lingakakhali iqhude, uzangiphika kathathu. Wasephumela ngaphandle wakhala kabuhlungu.
040	MAT	027	001	Kwathi sekusile, bonke abapristi abakhulu labadala babantu bacebisana bemelene loJesu ukuthi bambulale;
040	MAT	027	002	sebembophile bamqhuba bamnikela kuPontiyusi Pilatu umbusi.
040	MAT	027	003	Kwathi uJudasi owamnikelayo esebonile ukuthi ulahliwe, wazisola wabuyisela inhlamvu zesiliva ezingamatshumi amathathu kubapristi abakhulu labadala,
040	MAT	027	004	wathi: Ngonile nginikele igazi elingelacala. Kodwa bona bathi: Kulani lathi? Zibonele wena.
040	MAT	027	005	Wasephosela inhlamvu zesiliva ethempelini, wasuka; wayaziphanyeka.
040	MAT	027	006	Abapristi abakhulu basebethatha inhlamvu zesiliva bathi: Kakuvunyelwa ukuzifaka emnikelweni, ngoba ziyintengo yegazi.
040	MAT	027	007	Basebecebisana bathenga ngazo isiqinti sombumbi, sibe ngesokungcwaba abezizwe.
040	MAT	027	008	Ngakho lesosiqinti sathiwa yisiqinti segazi, kuze kube lamuhla.
040	MAT	027	009	Kwasekugcwaliseka okwakhulunywa ngumprofethi uJeremiya, esithi: Basebethatha inhlamvu zesiliva ezingamatshumi amathathu, intengo yalowo owalinganiswayo, abantwana bakoIsrayeli abamlinganisayo;
040	MAT	027	010	basebebapha zona ngensimu yombumbi, njengoba iNkosi ingilayile.
040	MAT	027	011	UJesu wasesima phambi kombusi; umbusi wasembuza, wathi: Wena uyiNkosi yamaJuda yini? UJesu wasesithi: Utshilo wena.
040	MAT	027	012	Kwathi nxa esemangalelwe ngabapristi abakhulu labadala, kaphendulanga lutho.
040	MAT	027	013	UPilatu wasesithi kuye: Kawuzwa yini izinto ezingaka abazifakaza ngawe?
040	MAT	027	014	Kodwa kamphendulanga lakwelilodwa ilizwi, waze wamangala kakhulu umbusi.
040	MAT	027	015	Futhi ngomkhosi umbusi wayejwayele ukukhululela ixuku isibotshwa esisodwa, elisifunayo.
040	MAT	027	016	Njalo ngalesosikhathi babelesibotshwa esidumileyo, esithiwa nguBarabasi.
040	MAT	027	017	Ngakho sebebuthene, uPilatu wathi kubo: Lithanda ukuthi ngilikhululele bani, uBarabasi, kumbe uJesu othiwa nguKristu?
040	MAT	027	018	Ngoba wayekwazi ukuthi bamnikele ngomona.
040	MAT	027	019	Kwathi esehlezi esihlalweni sokwahlulela, umkakhe wathumela kuye, wathi: Ungabi landaba lalowo olungileyo; ngoba lamuhla ngihluphekile kakhulu ngaye ephutsheni.
040	MAT	027	020	Kodwa abapristi abakhulu labadala bancengana lamaxuku ukuthi acele uBarabasi, ambhubhise uJesu.
040	MAT	027	021	Wasephendula umbusi wathi kubo: Lithanda ukuthi ngilikhululele bani kulaba ababili? Basebesithi: UBarabasi.
040	MAT	027	022	UPilatu wathi kubo: Pho ngimenzeni uJesu othiwa nguKristu? Bonke bathi kuye: Kabethelwe.
040	MAT	027	023	Umbusi wasesithi: Ngoba wenze bubi bani? Kodwa bamemeza kakhulu, bathi: Kabethelwe!
040	MAT	027	024	Kwathi uPilatu esebonile ukuthi kakusizi lutho, kodwa ukuthi kwasekuqala kulalokhu ukuba lesiphithiphithi, wathatha amanzi, wageza izandla phambi kwexuku, wathi: Angilacala ngegazi lalumuntu olungileyo; ziboneleni lina.
040	MAT	027	025	Bonke abantu basebephendula bathi: Igazi lakhe kalibe phezu kwethu laphezu kwabantwana bethu.
040	MAT	027	026	Wasebakhululela uBarabasi; kodwa esemtshaye ngesiswepu uJesu wamnikela ukuthi abethelwe.
040	MAT	027	027	Abebutho bombusi basebemngenisa uJesu endlini yombusi, baqoqela kuye ibutho lonke;
040	MAT	027	028	bamhlubula, bamgqokisa isembatho esibomvu,
040	MAT	027	029	sebelukile umqhele wameva, bamethesa wona ekhanda, bamphathisa lomhlanga esandleni sakhe sokunene; baguqa phambi kwakhe bamklolodela, bathi: Bayethe, Nkosi yamaJuda!
040	MAT	027	030	Bamkhafulela amathe, bathatha umhlanga, batshaya ikhanda lakhe.
040	MAT	027	031	Sebemklolodele, bamhlubula isembatho, bamgqokisa izigqoko zakhe, bamqhuba ukuze bambethele.
040	MAT	027	032	Kwathi sebephuma, bafica umuntu weKurene, uSimoni ngebizo; bambamba ngamandla lowo ukuthi athwale isiphambano sakhe.
040	MAT	027	033	Sebefikile endaweni ethiwa yiGolgotha, okuyikuthi iNdawo yokhakhayi,
040	MAT	027	034	bamnika iviniga elixutshaniswe lenyongo ukuze alinathe; kodwa eselizwile kavumanga ukunatha.
040	MAT	027	035	Futhi sebembethele, baba izembatho zakhe, benza inkatho yokuphosa; ukuze kugcwaliseke okwakhulunywa ngumprofethi ukuthi: Babelana izembatho zami, benza inkatho yokuphosa ngesigqoko sami.
040	MAT	027	036	Njalo sebehlala phansi bamlinda khona.
040	MAT	027	037	Babeka ngaphezu kwekhanda lakhe incwadi yecala lakhe ilotshiwe ukuthi: LO NGUJESU INKOSI YAMAJUDA.
040	MAT	027	038	Kwasekubethelwa abaphangi ababili kanye laye, omunye ngakwesokunene lomunye ngakwesokhohlo.
040	MAT	027	039	Labadlulayo bamhlambaza, benikina amakhanda abo,
040	MAT	027	040	besithi: Wena odiliza ithempeli ulakhe ngensuku ezintathu, zisindise; uba uyiNdodana kaNkulunkulu, yehla esiphambanweni.
040	MAT	027	041	Langokunjalo labapristi abakhulu labo bekloloda kanye lababhali labadala bathi:
040	MAT	027	042	Wasindisa abanye, yena angezisindise. Uba eyiNkosi yakoIsrayeli, kehle khathesi esiphambanweni, futhi sizamkholwa.
040	MAT	027	043	Wathemba kuNkulunkulu; kamkhulule khathesi, uba emthanda. Ngoba wathi: NgiyiNdodana kaNkulunkulu.
040	MAT	027	044	Labaphangi ababebethelwe kanye laye bamyangisa ngokufananayo.
040	MAT	027	045	Njalo kusukela ngehola lesithupha kwaba lobumnyama emhlabeni wonke kwaze kwaba lihola lesificamunwemunye;
040	MAT	027	046	sekungaba lihola lesificamunwemunye uJesu wamemeza ngelizwi elikhulu, wathi: "Eli, Eli, lama sabaktani?" Okuyikuthi: Nkulunkulu wami, Nkulunkulu wami, ungitshiyeleni?
040	MAT	027	047	Njalo abanye kwababemi khona besizwa bathi: Lo ubiza uElija.
040	MAT	027	048	Njalo omunye wabo wahle wagijima, wathatha uzipho, walugcwalisa ngeviniga, waluhloma emhlangeni, wamnika ukuthi anathe.
040	MAT	027	049	Kodwa abanye bathi: Yekelani sibone ukuthi uElija uzakuza amsindise.
040	MAT	027	050	UJesu wasebuya ememeza ngelizwi elikhulu wanikela umoya.
040	MAT	027	051	Futhi khangela, iveyili lethempeli ladatshulwa incezu ezimbili laqala phezulu lisiya phansi; lomhlaba wazamazama; lamadwala aqhekezeka;
040	MAT	027	052	lamangcwaba avuleka; lezidumbu ezinengi zabangcwele abasebelele zavuswa;
040	MAT	027	053	sebephumile emangcwabeni emva kokuvuka kwakhe bangena emzini ongcwele, babonakala kwabanengi.
040	MAT	027	054	Kwathi induna yekhulu lalabo ababelayo belinde uJesu, sebebonile ukuzamazama komhlaba lezinto ezenzekileyo, besaba kakhulu, bathi: Ngeqiniso lo ubeyiNdodana kaNkulunkulu.
040	MAT	027	055	Kwakukhona lapho abesifazana abanengi bebukele bekhatshana, ababemlandele uJesu bevela eGalili, bemncedisa;
040	MAT	027	056	okwakukhona phakathi kwabo oMariya Magadalena, loMariya unina kaJakobe loJose, lonina wamadodana kaZebediya.
040	MAT	027	057	Kwathi sekuhlwile, kwafika umuntu onothileyo evela eArimathiya, ibizo lakhe linguJosefa, owayengumfundi kaJesu laye;
040	MAT	027	058	yena waya kuPilatu, wacela isidumbu sikaJesu. UPilatu waselaya ukuthi isidumbu asinikwe.
040	MAT	027	059	UJosefa wasethatha isidumbu wasigoqela ngelembu elicolekileyo elihlambulukileyo,
040	MAT	027	060	wasibeka engcwabeni lakhe elitsha, elaligujiwe edwaleni; wasegiqela ilitshe elikhulu emnyango wengcwaba, wahamba.
040	MAT	027	061	Futhi kwakukhona lapho uMariya Magadalena, lomunye uMariya, behlezi maqondana lengcwaba.
040	MAT	027	062	Langosuku olulandelayo, olulandela olwamalungiselelo, abapristi abakhulu labaFarisi babuthana kuPilatu,
040	MAT	027	063	besithi: Nkosi, siyakhumbula ukuthi lowomkhohlisi esaphila wathi: Emva kwensuku ezintathu ngizavuka.
040	MAT	027	064	Ngakho laya ukuthi ingcwaba liqiniswe kuze kube lusuku lwesithathu; hlezi abafundi bakhe bafike ebusuku bamebe, besebesithi ebantwini: Uvukile kwabafileyo; kuthi inkohliso yokucina ibembi kuleyokuqala.
040	MAT	027	065	UPilatu wasesithi kubo: Lilabalindi; hambani, liliqinise njengokubona kwenu.
040	MAT	027	066	Bahamba-ke baliqinisa ingcwaba, beliphawula ilitshe, belabalindi.
040	MAT	028	001	Kwathi ekupheleni kwesabatha, emadabukakusa kusiya osukwini lokuqala lweviki, kwafika uMariya Magadalena, lomunye uMariya, ukuzabona ingcwaba.
040	MAT	028	002	Futhi khangela, kwaba khona ukuzamazama komhlaba okukhulu; ngoba ingilosi yeNkosi yehla ivela ezulwini, yasondela yagiqa ilitshe yalisusa emnyango, yahlala phezu kwalo.
040	MAT	028	003	Lokubonakala kwayo kwakunjengombane, lesembatho sayo sasimhlophe njengeliqhwa elikhithikileyo.
040	MAT	028	004	Abalindi basebethuthumela ngokuyesaba, baba njengabafileyo.
040	MAT	028	005	Kodwa ingilosi yaphendula yathi kwabesifazana: Lingesabi lina; ngoba ngiyazi ukuthi lidinga uJesu obebethelwe;
040	MAT	028	006	kakho lapha; ngoba uvukile, njengokutsho kwakhe; wozani libone indawo lapho iNkosi ebilele khona.
040	MAT	028	007	Hambani masinyane litshele abafundi bakhe ukuthi uvukile kwabafileyo; njalo khangelani, uzalandulela ukuya eGalili; lizambona khona; khangelani, sengilitshelile.
040	MAT	028	008	Basebephuma engcwabeni ngokuphangisa belokwesaba lentokozo enkulu, bagijima baya ukubikela abafundi bakhe.
040	MAT	028	009	Kwathi besiyatshela abafundi bakhe, futhi khangela, uJesu wabahlangabeza, wathi: Mpilo enhle! Basebesondela babamba inyawo zakhe, bamkhonza.
040	MAT	028	010	UJesu wasesithi kubo: Lingesabi; hambani, libikele abafowethu ukuthi baye eGalili, njalo bazangibona khona.
040	MAT	028	011	Kwathi sebehamba, khangela, abanye kubalindi baya emzini babikela abapristi abakhulu konke okwenzakeleyo.
040	MAT	028	012	Sebebuthene labadala, benza icebo, banika abebutho imali enengi,
040	MAT	028	013	besithi: Kalibokuthi: Abafundi bakhe beze ebusuku bameba silele thina.
040	MAT	028	014	Futhi uba lokhu kuzwakala kumbusi, thina sizamncenga, silenze lingabi senkathazweni.
040	MAT	028	015	Basebethatha imali benza njengalokhu ababekufundisiwe; lalelilizwi landa phakathi kwamaJuda kuze kube lamuhla.
040	MAT	028	016	Kwathi abafundi abalitshumi lanye baya eGalili, entabeni uJesu ayebalayele yona;
040	MAT	028	017	sebembonile bamkhonza; kodwa abanye bathandabuza.
040	MAT	028	018	UJesu wasesondela wakhuluma labo, esithi: Wonke amandla aphiwe mina ezulwini lemhlabeni;
040	MAT	028	019	ngakho hambani lenze izizwe zonke zibe ngabafundi, libabhabhathiza ebizweni likaYise leleNdodana lelikaMoya oNgcwele;
040	MAT	028	020	libafundisa ukugcina konke engililaye khona; futhi khangelani, mina ngilani insuku zonke kuze kube sekupheleni kwesikhathi. Ameni.
#
# BOOK	041	MAR	Mark	UMakho
041	MAR	001	001	Ukuqala kwevangeli likaJesu Kristu, iNdodana kaNkulunkulu;
041	MAR	001	002	njengokulotshiweyo kubaprofethiukuthi: Khangela, mina ngiyathuma isithunywa sami phambi kobuso bakho, esizalungisa indlela yakho phambi kwakho.
041	MAR	001	003	Ilizwi lomemezayo enkangala, lithi: Lungisani indlela yeNkosi; qondisani izindledlana zayo.
041	MAR	001	004	Kweza uJohane ebhabhathiza enkangala, etshumayela ubhabhathizo lokuphenduka kukho ukuthethelelwa kwezono,
041	MAR	001	005	njalo kwaphumela kuye ilizwe lonke leJudiya, labo abeJerusalema, basebebhabhathizwa bonke nguye emfuleni iJordani, bevuma izono zabo.
041	MAR	001	006	Futhi uJohane wayembethe uboya bekamela, elozwezwe lwesikhumba ekhalweni lwakhe, wayesidla intethe loluju lweganga.
041	MAR	001	007	Watshumayela, esithi: Olamandla kulami uyeza emva kwami, engingafanele ukukhothama ngithukulule umchilo wamanyathela akhe.
041	MAR	001	008	Mina isibili ngilibhabhathize ngamanzi; kodwa yena uzalibhabhathiza ngoMoya oNgcwele.
041	MAR	001	009	Kwasekusithi ngalezonsuku kwafika uJesu evela eNazaretha yeGalili, wabhabhathizwa nguJohane eJordani.
041	MAR	001	010	Wenela ukukhuphuka emanzini, wabona amazulu eqhekezeka, loMoya kungathi lijuba esehlela phezu kwakhe;
041	MAR	001	011	kwasekusiza ilizwi livela emazulwini, lathi: Wena uyiNdodana yami ethandekayo, engithokoza ngayo.
041	MAR	001	012	Njalo uMoya wahle wamqhubela enkangala.
041	MAR	001	013	Wayekhona-ke lapho enkangala insuku ezingamatshumi amane elingwa nguSathane, wayelezilo, ingilosi zasezimnceda.
041	MAR	001	014	Kwathi emva kokunikelwa kukaJohane, uJesu wafika eGalili, etshumayela ivangeli lombuso kaNkulunkulu,
041	MAR	001	015	njalo esithi: Isikhathi sigcwalisekile, njalo umbuso kaNkulunkulu ususondele; phendukani, likholwe ivangeli.
041	MAR	001	016	Kwathi ehambahamba elwandle lweGalili wabona uSimoni loAndreya umfowabo, bephosela imbule olwandle; ngoba babengabagoli benhlanzi.
041	MAR	001	017	UJesu wasesithi kubo: Ngilandelani, ngizalenza libe ngabagoli babantu.
041	MAR	001	018	Njalo bahle batshiya amambule abo, bamlandela.
041	MAR	001	019	Eseqhubeke ibangana esuka lapho, wabona uJakobe okaZebediya, loJohane umfowabo, labo babesemkhunjini belungisa amambule abo.
041	MAR	001	020	Njalo wahle wababiza; basebetshiya uyise uZebediya emkhunjini leziqhatshwa, basuka bamlandela.
041	MAR	001	021	Basebengena eKapenawume; kwathi ngesabatha wahle wangena esinagogeni, wafundisa.
041	MAR	001	022	Basebebabaza ngemfundiso yakhe; ngoba wabafundisa njengolamandla, njalo kungenjengababhali.
041	MAR	001	023	Futhi kwakukhona esinagogeni labo umuntu owayelomoya ongcolileyo, wasememeza,
041	MAR	001	024	wathi: Yekela, silani lawe, Jesu weNazaretha? Uze ukusibhubhisa yini? Ngiyakwazi wena ukuthi ungubani: ONgcwele kaNkulunkulu.
041	MAR	001	025	UJesu wasemkhuza, wathi: Thula, uphume kuye.
041	MAR	001	026	Futhi umoya ongcolileyo emhlukuluza ekhala ngelizwi elikhulu, waphuma kuye.
041	MAR	001	027	Basebemangala bonke, baze babuzana, bathi: Kuyini lokhu? Yimfundiso bani entsha le, ukuthi ngamandla uyalaya labomoya abangcolileyo, futhi bamlalele.
041	MAR	001	028	Njalo yahle yaphuma indumela yakhe esigabeni sonke seGalili esizingelezeleyo.
