041	MAR	006	052	Ngoba babengaqedisisanga ngezinkwa; ngoba inhliziyo yabo yayilukhuni.
041	MAR	006	053	Kwathi sebechaphile bafika elizweni leGenesaretha, babophela umkhumbi ekhunjini.
041	MAR	006	054	Bathi sebephumile emkhunjini, bahle bamazi,
