041	MAR	008	006	Waselaya ixuku ukuthi lihlale phansi emhlabathini; wasethatha izinkwa eziyisikhombisa, esebongile wazihlephula wazinika abafundi bakhe, ukuthi babeke phambi kwabo; basebebeka phambi kwexuku.
041	MAR	008	007	Njalo babelenhlanzana ezinlutshwana; esebusisile wathi bazibeke lazo phambi kwabo.
041	MAR	008	008	Basebesidla, basutha; basebedobha imvuthu ezazisele, izitsha eziyisikhombisa.
