041	MAR	014	071	Waseqala ukuqalekisa lokufunga esithi: Kangimazi lumuntu elimtshoyo.
041	MAR	014	072	Iqhude laselikhala ngokwesibili. UPetro wasekhumbula ilizwi uJesu ayelitshilo kuye lokuthi: Lingakakhali kabili iqhude, uzangiphika kathathu. Esenakane ngalokhu wakhala.
041	MAR	015	001	Kwathi khonokho ekuseni kakhulu abapristi abakhulu benza umhlangano kanye labadala lababhali, lomphakathi wonke, bambopha uJesu bamqhuba bamnikela kuPilatu.
041	MAR	015	002	UPilatu wasembuza wathi: Wena uyiNkosi yamaJuda yini? Wasemphendula wathi kuye: Uyatsho wena.
041	MAR	015	003	Abapristi abakhulu basebemmangalela ngezinto ezinengi; kodwa yena kaphendulanga lutho.
041	MAR	015	004	UPilatu wasebuya embuza, wathi: Kawuphenduli lutho yini? Khangela, zingaki izinto abazifakazayo ezimelana lawe.
041	MAR	015	005	Kodwa uJesu kabesaphendula lutho, waze wamangala uPilatu.
041	MAR	015	006	Langomkhosi wayebakhululela isibotshwa esisodwa, loba yisiphi abasicelayo.
041	MAR	015	007	Kwakukhona umuntu othiwa nguBarabasi, owayebotshiwe lalabo ababevukele umbuso laye, ababebulele ekuvukeleni umbuso.
041	MAR	015	008	Ixuku laselimemeza laqala ukucela ukuthi enze njengalokho ayehlezi ekwenza kubo.
041	MAR	015	009	UPilatu wasebaphendula, wathi: Lithanda ukuthi ngilikhululele iNkosi yamaJuda yini?
041	MAR	015	010	Ngoba wayekwazi ukuthi ngomona abapristi abakhulu bamnikele.
041	MAR	015	011	Kodwa abapristi abakhulu bavusa ixuku, ukuthi kungcono alikhululele uBarabasi.
041	MAR	015	012	UPilatu wasephendula wathi futhi kubo: Pho lifuna ngimenzeni lo elithi uyiNkosi yamaJuda?
041	MAR	015	013	Basebememeza futhi bathi: Mbethele!
041	MAR	015	014	Kodwa uPilatu wathi kubo: Ngoba wenze ububi bani? Kodwa bamemeza kakhulu bathi: Mbethele!
041	MAR	015	015	Khona uPilatu ethanda ukukholisa ixuku, wabakhululela uBarabasi; kodwa wamnikela uJesu, esemtshaye ngesiswepu, ukuthi abethelwe.
041	MAR	015	016	Abebutho basebemngenisa phakathi, egumeni, eliyindlu yombusi, basebebizela ibutho lonke ndawonye,
041	MAR	015	017	bamgqokisa okuyibubende, sebeluke umqhele wameva bamethesa,
041	MAR	015	018	baqala ukumbingelela besithi: Bayethe, Nkosi yamaJuda!
041	MAR	015	019	Batshaya ikhanda lakhe ngomhlanga, bamkhafulela amathe, baguqa ngamadolo bamkhonza.
041	MAR	015	020	Sebemklolodele, bamhlubula okuyibubende, bamgqokisa ezakhe izembatho. Basebemusa phandle ukuze bambethele.
041	MAR	015	021	Babamba ngamandla omunye owayesedlula othiwa nguSimoni umKurene, evela emaphandleni, uyise kaAleksandro loRufusi, ukuthi athwale isiphambano sakhe.
041	MAR	015	022	Basebemusa endaweniethiwa yiGolgotha, okuyikuthi ngokuphendulelwa, iNdawo yokhakhayi.
041	MAR	015	023	Basebemnika iwayini lixutshaniswe lenhlaka ukuthi alinathe; kodwa kalemukelanga.
041	MAR	015	024	Sebembethele, babelana izembatho zakhe, benza inkatho yokuphosa ngazo, ukuthi ngamunye uzathathani.
041	MAR	015	025	Kwakulihola lesithathu, njalo bambethela.
041	MAR	015	026	Futhi kwakulombhalo wecala lakhe elalibhalwe phezulu usithi: INKOSI YAMAJUDA.
041	MAR	015	027	Njalo babethela kanye laye abaphangi ababili, omunye ngakwesokunene lomunye ngakwesokhohlo sakhe.
041	MAR	015	028	Wasugcwaliseka umbhalo othi: Futhi wabalwa kanye lezoni.
041	MAR	015	029	Labedlulayo bamhlambaza, benikina amakhanda abo, besithi: Hiya, wena odiliza ithempeli, ulakhe ngensuku ezintathu,
041	MAR	015	030	zisindise, wehle esiphambanweni.
041	MAR	015	031	Langokunjalo abapristi abakhulu labo bakloloda kanye lababhali bathi omunye komunye: Wasindisa abanye, angezisindise yena.
041	MAR	015	032	UKristu iNkosi yakoIsrayeli kehle khathesi esiphambanweni, ukuze sibone sikholwe. Lababebethelwe kanye laye bamklolodela.
041	MAR	015	033	Kwathi sekufike ihola lesithupha, kwaba khona ubumnyama phezu komhlaba wonke kwaze kwaba lihola lesificamunwemunye.
041	MAR	015	034	Ngehola lesificamunwemunye uJesu wamemeza ngelizwi elikhulu, wathi, "Eloyi, Eloyi, lama sabaktani?" Okuyikuthi ngokuphendulelwa: Nkulunkulu wami, Nkulunkulu wami, ungitshiyeleni?
041	MAR	015	035	Labanye kwababemi khona besizwa bathi: Khangelani, ubiza uElija.
041	MAR	015	036	Wasegijima omunye, wagcwalisa uzipho ngeviniga, waluhloma emhlangeni, wamnika ukuthi anathe, esithi: Yekelani, sibone uba uElija uzakuza amethule.
041	MAR	015	037	UJesu wasememeza ngelizwi elikhulu waphefumula okokucina.
041	MAR	015	038	Leveyili lethempeli ladatshulwa laba zincezu ezimbili laqala phezulu lisiya phansi.
041	MAR	015	039	Kwathi induna yekhulu eyayimi maqondana laye ibona ukuthi ukhale njalo, waphefumula okokucina, yathi: Ngeqiniso lumuntu ubeyiNdodana kaNkulunkulu.
041	MAR	015	040	Kwakukhona labesifazana bebukele bekhatshana, okwakukhona phakathi kwabo loMariya Magadalena, loMariya unina kaJakobe omncinyane lokaJose, loSalome,
041	MAR	015	041	(labo abamlandela, eseseGalili, bamsebenzela), labanye abesifazana abanengi abenyukela eJerusalema laye.
041	MAR	015	042	Kwathi sekuhlwile, ngoba kwakungamalungiselelo, okuyikuthi usuku phambi kwesabatha,
041	MAR	015	043	wafika uJosefa owayevela eArimathiya, ilunga elihloniphekayo lomphakathi, owayelindele laye umbuso kaNkulunkulu; wangena ngesibindi kuPilatu, wacela isidumbu sikaJesu.
041	MAR	015	044	UPilatu wasemangala ngokuthi usefile; wabizela kuye induna yekhulu, wayibuza ukuthi kambe sekuyisikhathi efile.
041	MAR	015	045	Esazisiwe yinduna yekhulu, wamnika uJosefa isidumbu.
041	MAR	015	046	Wasethenga ilembu elicolekileyo, wamethula, wamgoqela ngelembu elicolekileyo, wambeka engcwabeni elaligujwe edwaleni; wagiqela ilitshe emnyango wengcwaba.
041	MAR	015	047	Futhi uMariya Magadalena loMariya unina kaJose babona lapho abekwe khona.
041	MAR	016	001	Isabatha selidlulile, uMariya Magadalena loMariya unina kaJakobe loSalome bathenga amakha, ukuze bahambe bayemgcoba.
041	MAR	016	002	Kwathi ekuseni kakhulu ngosuku lokuqala lweviki beza engcwabeni, ekuphumeni kwelanga.
041	MAR	016	003	Basebekhulumisana besithi: Ngubani ozasigiqela ilitshe lisuke emnyango wengcwaba?
041	MAR	016	004	Futhi bathi ukukhangela babona ilitshe seligiqwe lasuswa; ngoba lalilikhulu kakhulu.
041	MAR	016	005	Kuthe bengena engcwabeni, babona ijaha lihlezi ngakwesokunene, lembethe isembatho eside esimhlophe; besaba.
041	MAR	016	006	Kodwa lathi kubo: Lingesabi; lidinga uJesu umNazaretha obebethelwe; uvukile, kakho lapha; khangelani, indawo lapho abebembeke khona.
041	MAR	016	007	Kodwa hambani, litshele abafundi bakhe loPetro ukuthi uzalandulela ukuya eGalili; lizambona khona, njengalokho ayekutshilo kini.
041	MAR	016	008	Basebephuma ngokuphangisa babaleka engcwabeni; futhi ukuqhuqha lokwethuka kwababamba; futhi kabakhulumanga lutho emuntwini, ngoba babesesaba.
041	MAR	016	009	(note: The most reliable and earliest manuscripts do not include Mark 16:9-20.) Kwathi uJesu esevukile ekuseni kakhulu ngolokuqala lweviki, wabonakala kuqala kuMariya Magadalena, ayekhuphe kuye amadimoni ayisikhombisa.
041	MAR	016	010	Yena wasuka wababikela labo ababelaye, belila bekhala.
041	MAR	016	011	Labo sebezwile ukuthi uyaphila lokuthi ubonwe nguye, kabakholwanga.
041	MAR	016	012	Njalo emva kwalezizinto wabonakala ngesinye isimo kwababili babo behamba, besiya emaphandleni.
041	MAR	016	013	Labo bahamba babikela abanye; lalabo kababakholwanga.
041	MAR	016	014	Emva kwalokhu wabonakala kwabalitshumi lanye behlezi ekudleni, wasola ukungakholwa kwabo lobulukhuni benhliziyo, ngoba bengakholwanga labo abambonayo esevukile.
041	MAR	016	015	Wasesithi kubo: Hambani liye emhlabeni wonke, litshumayele ivangeli kuso sonke isidalwa.
041	MAR	016	016	Lowo okholwayo abhabhathizwe uzasindiswa; kodwa ongakholwayo uzalahlwa.
041	MAR	016	017	Lalezizibonakaliso zizabalandela abakholwayo: Ebizweni lami bazakhupha amadimoni; bakhulume ngendimi ezintsha;
041	MAR	016	018	bazadobha izinyoka; uba benatha loba yikuphi okubulalayo, kakusoze kubalimaze; bazabeka izandla phezu kwabagulayo, futhi bazaphila.
041	MAR	016	019	Ngakho iNkosi, emva kokuthi isikhulumile labo, yakhutshulelwa ezulwini, yahlala ngakwesokunene sikaNkulunkulu.
041	MAR	016	020	Bona basebephuma batshumayela endaweni zonke, iNkosi isebenza labo, iqinisa ilizwi ngezibonakaliso ezazilandela. Ameni.
#
# BOOK	042	LUK	Luke	ULukha
042	LUK	001	001	Njengoba abanengi sebebeke izandla ukubeka ngendlela efaneleyo ukulandiswa kwezinto eziqiniseke ngokupheleleyo phakathi kwethu,
042	LUK	001	002	njengalokhu basinika labo ababonayo ngamehlo ekuqaleni njalo bezinceku zelizwi,
042	LUK	001	003	kukhanye kukuhle lakimi, sengizihlolisisile zonke izinto kusukela ekuqaleni, ukuthi ngikubhalele ngokulandelana, mhlekazi Teyofilu,
042	LUK	001	004	ukuze wazi iqiniso ngalezozinto ozifundisiweyo.
042	LUK	001	005	Ensukwini zikaHerodi inkosi yeJudiya kwakukhona umpristi othile othiwa nguZakariya, oweqembu likaAbhiya; lomkakhe wayevela kumadodakazi kaAroni, lebizo lakhe linguElizabethi.
042	LUK	001	006	Njalo babelungile bobabili phambi kukaNkulunkulu, behamba ngayo yonke imilayo lezimiso zeNkosi, bengasoleki.
042	LUK	001	007	Njalo babengelamntwana, ngoba uElizabethi wayeyinyumba, basebeleminyaka eminengi bobabili.
042	LUK	001	008	Kwasekusithi esenza inkonzo yobupristi phambi kukaNkulunkulu esesimisweni seqembu lakibo,
042	LUK	001	009	ngomkhuba wenkonzo yobupristi, nguye owadliwa yinkatho yokutshisa impepha esengene ethempelini leNkosi.
042	LUK	001	010	Njalo ixuku lonke labantu lalikhuleka ngaphandle ngesikhathi sokutshisa impepha.
042	LUK	001	011	Ingilosi yeNkosi yasibonakala kuye, imi ngakwesokunene selathi lempepha.
042	LUK	001	012	Kwathi uZakariya eyibona waqhuqha, lokwesaba kwawela phezu kwakhe.
042	LUK	001	013	Kodwa ingilosi yathi kuye: Ungesabi Zakariya; ngoba umkhuleko wakho uzwakele, lomkakho uElizabethi uzakuzalela indodana, njalo uzakuthi ibizo layo nguJohane.
042	LUK	001	014	Futhi uzakuba lenjabulo lentokozo, labanengi bazakujabulela ukuzalwa kwakhe.
042	LUK	001	015	Ngoba uzakuba mkhulu phambi kweNkosi, iwayini kanye lokunathwayo okulamandla kasoze akunathe, futhi uzagcwaliswa ngoMoya oNgcwele kusukela esesesiswini sikanina.
042	LUK	001	016	Labanengi kubantwana bakoIsrayeli uzabaphendulela eNkosini uNkulunkulu wabo;
042	LUK	001	017	njalo yena uzahamba phambi kwayo emoyeni lemandleni kaElija, ukuphendulela inhliziyo zaboyise kubantwana, labangalaleliyo ekuhlakanipheni kwabalungileyo, ukulungiselela iNkosi isizwe esilungisiweyo.
042	LUK	001	018	UZakariya wasesithi kuyo ingilosi: Ngizakwazi ngani lokhu? Ngoba mina ngilixhegu, lomkami useleminyaka eminengi.
042	LUK	001	019	Ingilosi yasiphendula yathi kuye: NginguGabriyeli mina, omayo phambi kukaNkulunkulu; njalo ngithunyiwe ukukhuluma lawe, lokukubikela lezizindaba ezinhle.
042	LUK	001	020	Njalo khangela, uzakuba yisimungulu njalo wehluleke ukukhuluma, kuze kube lusuku okuzakwenzeka ngalo lezizinto, ngenxa yokuthi ungakholwanga amazwi ami, azagcwaliseka ngesikhathi sawo.
042	LUK	001	021	Labantu babemlindele uZakariya; bamangala ngokuphuza kwakhe ethempelini.
042	LUK	001	022	Kuthe esephuma wehluleka ukukhuluma labo; njalo bazi ukuthi ubone umbono ethempelini; njalo yena wayesebaqhweba, wahlala eyisimungulu.
042	LUK	001	023	Kwasekusithi seziphelile insuku zokukhonza kwakhe, waya endlini yakhe.
042	LUK	001	024	Kwathi emva kwalezonsuku uElizabethi umkakhe wathatha isisu, wazifihla okwezinyanga ezinhlanu, esithi:
042	LUK	001	025	Yenze kanje kimi iNkosi ensukwini eyangikhangela ngazo ukususa ihlazo lami phakathi kwabantu.
042	LUK	001	026	Kwathi ngenyanga yesithupha ingilosi uGabriyeli yathunywa nguNkulunkulu emzini weGalili othiwa yiNazaretha,
042	LUK	001	027	entombini eyayigane indoda, ebizo layo lalinguJosefa, eyendlu kaDavida; lebizo lentombi linguMariya.
042	LUK	001	028	Ingilosi yasingena kuye yathi: Ekuhle, wena othandiweyo! INkosi ilawe, ubusisiwe wena phakathi kwabesifazana.
042	LUK	001	029	Kwathi eseyibonile wethuswa kakhulu yilizwi layo, wanakana ukuthi yikubingelela okunjani lokhu.
042	LUK	001	030	Ingilosi yasisithi kuye: Ungesabi, Mariya; ngoba uthole uthando kuNkulunkulu.
042	LUK	001	031	Njalo khangela, uzathatha isisu, uzale indodana, uzakuthi ibizo layo nguJesu.
042	LUK	001	032	Yena uzakuba mkhulu, uzabizwa ngokuthi yiNdodana yoPhezukonke; futhi iNkosi uNkulunkulu izamnika isihlalo sobukhosi sikayise uDavida,
042	LUK	001	033	njalo uzabusa phezu kwendlu kaJakobe kuze kube nininini, langombuso wakhe kawuzukuba lokuphela.
042	LUK	001	034	UMariya wasesithi kuyo ingilosi: Lokhu kungenzeka njani, njengoba ngingazi indoda?
042	LUK	001	035	Ingilosi yasiphendula yathi kuye: UMoya oNgcwele uzakuza phezu kwakho, lamandla oPhezukonke azakwembesa; ngakho lalokhu okungcwele okuzazalwa nguwe kuzakuthiwa yiNdodana kaNkulunkulu.
042	LUK	001	036	Njalo khangela, isinini sakho uElizabethi, laye ukhulelwe yindodana ebudaleni bakhe; lale yinyanga yesithupha kuye obekuthiwa uyinyumba.
042	LUK	001	037	Ngoba kuNkulunkulu kakulalutho oluzakwehlula.
042	LUK	001	038	UMariya wasesithi: Khangela, incekukazi yeNkosi; kakube kimi njengelizwi lakho. Ingilosi yasisuka kuye.
042	LUK	001	039	Ngalezonsuku uMariya wasesukuma waya ezintabeni ngokuphangisa, emzini weJuda,
042	LUK	001	040	wangena endlini kaZakariya, wabingelela uElizabethi.
042	LUK	001	041	Kwasekusithi uElizabethi ezwe ukubingelela kukaMariya, inkonyane yeqa esiswini sakhe; loElizabethi wagcwaliswa ngoMoya oNgcwele,
042	LUK	001	042	wamemeza ngelizwi elikhulu, wathi: Ubusisiwe wena phakathi kwabesifazana, njalo sibusisiwe isithelo sesizalo sakho!
042	LUK	001	043	Kanti kuvela ngaphi lokhu kimi, ukuthi unina weNkosi yami eze kimi?
042	LUK	001	044	Ngoba khangela, kuthe ilizwi lokubingelela kwakho lifika endlebeni zami, umntwana weqa esiswini sami ngokuthokoza.
042	LUK	001	045	Futhi ubusisiwe okholiweyo, ngoba kuzagcwaliseka lezozinto ezakhulunywa kuye yiNkosi.
042	LUK	001	046	UMariya wasesithi: Umphefumulo wami uyayikhulisa iNkosi,
042	LUK	001	047	lomoya wami uyathokoza kuNkulunkulu uMsindisi wami,
042	LUK	001	048	ngoba ukhangele ubuphansi bencekukazi yakhe. Ngoba khangela, kusukela khathesi zonke izizukulwana zizakuthi ngibusisiwe.
042	LUK	001	049	Ngoba yena olamandla ungenzele izinto ezinkulu, lingcwele lebizo lakhe,
042	LUK	001	050	lesihawu sakhe sikusizukulwana ngesizukulwana kulabo abamesabayo.
042	LUK	001	051	Wenzile amandla ngengalo yakhe; uhlakazile abazigqajayo ekunakaneni kwenhliziyo zabo.
042	LUK	001	052	Wehlisile iziphathamandla ezihlalweni zobukhosi, kodwa uphakamisile abantukazana.
042	LUK	001	053	Abalambileyo ubasuthise ngezinto ezinhle, kodwa abanothileyo wabamukisa beze.
042	LUK	001	054	Umsizile uIsrayeli inceku yakhe, ngokukhumbula isihawu,
