042	LUK	001	056	UMariya wasehlala laye okungaba zinyanga ezintathu, wasebuyela endlini yakhe.
042	LUK	001	057	Isikhathi sikaElizabethi sokuthi abelethe sesiphelele, wasebeletha indodana.
042	LUK	001	058	Abakhelene laye lezinini zakhe basebesizwa ukuthi iNkosi yenze isihawu sayo saba sikhulu kuye, basebethokoza laye.
042	LUK	001	059	Kwasekusithi ngosuku lwesificaminwembili, beza ukuzasoka usane; balubiza ngebizo likayise ngokuthi nguZakariya.
042	LUK	001	060	Kodwa unina waphendula wathi: Hatshi bo, kodwa luzathiwa nguJohane.
042	LUK	001	061	Basebesithi kuye: Kakho ezihlotsheni zakho obizwa ngalelibizo.
042	LUK	001	062	Basebeqhweba uyise, ukuthi angathanda ukuthi lubizwe ngokuthini.
042	LUK	001	063	Wasecela into yokubhalela, wabhala, esithi: NguJohane ibizo lalo; basebemangala bonke.
042	LUK	001	064	Njalo wahle wavulwa umlomo wakhe lolimi lwakhe lwatshwaphululwa, wasekhuluma edumisa uNkulunkulu.
042	LUK	001	065	Lokwesaba kwehlela phezu kwabo bonke abakhelene labo; njalo kwakhulunywa ngazo zonke lezizinto kulo lonke elezintabeni zeJudiya,
042	LUK	001	066	labo bonke abazizwayo bazilondoloza ezinhliziyweni zabo, besithi: Kambe lolusane luzakuba njani? Njalo isandla seNkosi sasilalo.
