042	LUK	023	022	Wasesithi kubo ngokwesithathu: Ngoba lo enze bubi bani? Kangitholanga kuye icala afanele ukufa ngalo; ngakho ngizamtshaya ngimkhulule.
042	LUK	023	023	Kodwa baqinisa ngamazwi amakhulu, befuna ukuthi abethelwe; lamazwi abo lawabapristi abakhulu aphumelela.
042	LUK	023	024	UPilatu wasequma ukuthi kwenziwe isicelo sabo.
042	LUK	023	025	Wasebakhululela lowo ababemcelile owayephoselwe entolongweni ngenxa yomvukela lokubulala; kodwa uJesu wamnikela entandweni yabo.
042	LUK	023	026	Kwathi sebemqhuba, babamba uSimoni othile umKurene owayevela emaphandleni, bamethesa isiphambano, ukuthi asithwale ngemva kukaJesu.
042	LUK	023	027	Laselimlandela ixuku elikhulu labantu, labesifazana labo ababekhala bemlilela.
042	LUK	023	028	Kodwa uJesu ephendukela kubo wathi: Madodakazi eJerusalema, lingangikhaleli mina, kodwa zikhaleleni lina labantwana benu,
042	LUK	023	029	ngoba khangelani, ziyeza insuku abazakutsho ngazo ukuthi: Zibusisiwe inyumba, lezizalo ezingazalanga, lamabele angamunyisanga.
042	LUK	023	030	Khona bezaqalisa ukuthi ezintabeni: Welani phezu kwethu; lemaqaqeni: Sisibekeleni.
042	LUK	023	031	Ngoba uba besenza lezizinto esihlahleni esimanzi, kuzakwenzakalani kwesomileyo?
042	LUK	023	032	Kwaqhutshwa labanye abenzi bobubi ababili, ukuthi babulawe kanye laye.
042	LUK	023	033	Sebefikile endaweni ethiwa luKhakhayi, bambethela khona, labenzi bobubi, omunye ngakwesokunene, lomunye ngakwesokhohlo.
042	LUK	023	034	UJesu wasesithi: Baba, bathethelele; ngoba kabakwazi abakwenzayo. Njalo babelana izembatho zakhe, benza inkatho yokuphosa.
042	LUK	023	035	Labantu bema babukela. Lababusi kanye labo bamklolodela, besithi: Wasindisa abanye, kazisindise yena, uba yena enguKristu, okhethiweyo kaNkulunkulu.
042	LUK	023	036	Labebutho bamklolodela, beza kuye bamnika iviniga,
042	LUK	023	037	besithi: Uba wena uyiNkosi yamaJuda, zisindise wena.
042	LUK	023	038	Kwakukhona lombhalo ngaphezu kwakhe kulotshiwe ngamabala esiGriki langesiRoma langesiHebheru othi: LO UYINKOSI YAMAJUDA.
042	LUK	023	039	Lomunye wabenzi bobubi ababelengisiwe wamthuka, esithi: Uba wena unguKristu, zisindise wena lathi.
042	LUK	023	040	Kodwa omunye waphendula emkhuza, esithi: Wena kawumesabi yini uNkulunkulu, lokhu lawe ukulokhukulahlwa?
042	LUK	023	041	Thina kambe kusilungele, ngoba semukela okulingene ukwenza kwethu; kodwa lo kenzanga lutho olungafanelanga.
042	LUK	023	042	Wasesithi kuJesu: Ungikhumbule, Nkosi, lapha ufika embusweni wakho.
042	LUK	023	043	UJesu wasesithi kuye: Ngiqinisile ngithi kuwe: Lamuhla uzakuba lami eParadise.
042	LUK	023	044	Kwakungaba lihola lesithupha, kwaba khona ubumnyama phezu komhlaba wonke kwaze kwaba lihola lesificamunwemunye,
042	LUK	023	045	futhi ilanga lalifiphaziwe, leveyili lethempeli ladatshulwa phakathi.
042	LUK	023	046	UJesu wasememeza ngelizwi elikhulu esithi: Baba, ezandleni zakho ngibeka umoya wami; esetshilo lokhu waphefumula okokucina.
042	LUK	023	047	Kwathi induna yekhulu isibonile okwenzekileyo, yamdumisa uNkulunkulu, isithi: Isibili lumuntu ubelungile.
042	LUK	023	048	Lamaxuku wonke ayebuthene ukubukela lokho, sebebonile izinto ezenzekileyo, babuyela betshaya izifuba zabo.
042	LUK	023	049	Bonke abazana laye, labesifazana ababemlandela bevela eGalili, bema khatshana, bebona lezizinto.
042	LUK	023	050	Njalo khangela, indoda ethiwa nguJosefa, ilunga lomphakathi, indoda elungileyo eqotho;
042	LUK	023	051	yena wayengavumelananga lecebo lesenzo sabo; wayevela eArimathiya umuzi wamaJuda, laye ngokwakhe wayelindele umbuso kaNkulunkulu;
042	LUK	023	052	lowo waya kuPilatu wacela isidumbu sikaJesu.
042	LUK	023	053	Wasesethula wasigoqela ngelembu elicolekileyo, wasibeka engcwabeni elaligujwe edwaleni, lapho okwakungazanga kubekwe khona umuntu.
042	LUK	023	054	Kwakulusuku lwamalungiselelo, lesabatha laselisondela.
042	LUK	023	055	Labesifazana, ababeze laye bevela eGalili, balandela, balibona ingcwaba, lokuthi isidumbu sibekwe njani.
042	LUK	023	056	Basebebuyela emuva balungisa amakha lamagcobo. Ngesabatha basebephumula njengokomlayo.
042	LUK	024	001	Kodwa ngosuku lokuqala lweviki, emadabukakusa, baya engcwabeni, bephethe amakha ababewalungisile, labanye ababelabo.
042	LUK	024	002	Bafica ilitshe ligiqiwe lasuswa engcwabeni.
042	LUK	024	003	Kuthe bengena kabasitholanga isidumbu seNkosi uJesu.
