042	LUK	024	037	Kodwa batshaywa luvalo besaba becabanga ukuthi babona umoya.
042	LUK	024	038	Wasesithi kubo: Likhathazekelani, njalo kuvukelani imicabango enhliziyweni zenu?
042	LUK	024	039	Khangelani izandla zami lenyawo zami, ukuthi yimi uqobo; ngibambani libone, ngoba umoya kawulanyama lamathambo, njengoba lingibona ngilakho.
042	LUK	024	040	Esekutshilo lokho wabatshengisa izandla lenyawo zakhe.
042	LUK	024	041	Kodwa belokhu bengakholwa ngenxa yentokozo bemangala, wathi kubo: Lilalo ulutho lokudla lapha yini?
042	LUK	024	042	Bamnika iqatha lenhlanzi eyosiweyo, lohlanga lwenyosi.
042	LUK	024	043	Wasekuthatha wakudla phambi kwabo.
042	LUK	024	044	Wasesithi kubo: Yila amazwi, engawakhuluma kini ngiseselani okuthi, kumele ukuthi kugcwaliseke konke okwabhalwa ngami emlayweni kaMozisi labaprofethi leziHlabelelo.
042	LUK	024	045	Wasevula ingqondo yabo, ukuze baqedisise imibhalo;
042	LUK	024	046	wasesithi kubo: Kulotshiwe kanje, njalo uKristu kumele ahlupheke kanje, njalo avuke kwabafileyo ngosuku lwesithathu,
042	LUK	024	047	njalo kutshunyayelwe ebizweni lakhe ukuphenduka lothethelelo lwezono ezizweni zonke, kuqalwa eJerusalema.
