042	LUK	024	049	Futhi khangelani, mina ngiyathumela kini isithembiso sikaBaba; kodwa lina hlalani emzini weJerusalema, lize lembathiswe amandla avela phezulu.
042	LUK	024	050	Wasebakhokhela ephuma phandle baze bafika eBethani; ephakamisa izandla zakhe wababusisa.
042	LUK	024	051	Kwasekusithi esababusisa, wehlukana labo, wenyukiselwa ezulwini.
042	LUK	024	052	Basebemkhonza, babuyela eJerusalema belentokozo enkulu;
042	LUK	024	053	baqhubeka besethempelini, bebonga bedumisa uNkulunkulu. Ameni.
#
# BOOK	043	JOH	John	UJohane
043	JOH	001	001	Ekuqaleni wayekhona uLizwi, njalo uLizwi wayeloNkulunkulu, njalo uLizwi wayenguNkulunkulu.
043	JOH	001	002	Yena lo wayeloNkulunkulu ekuqaleni.
043	JOH	001	003	Zonke izinto zenziwa ngaye, njalo ngaphandle kwakhe kakulalutho lolulodwa olwenziwayo lolo olwenziweyo.
043	JOH	001	004	Impilo yayikuye, njalo impilo yayiyikukhanya kwabantu,
043	JOH	001	005	lokukhanya kukhanya emnyameni, kodwa ubumnyama kabukwemukelanga.
043	JOH	001	006	Kwavela umuntu ethunywe nguNkulunkulu, obizo lakhe linguJohane;
043	JOH	001	007	yena lo wezela ubufakazi, ukuze afakaze ngokukhanya, ukuze bonke bakholwe ngaye.
043	JOH	001	008	Yena wayengayisikho ukukhanya, kodwa ukuze afakaze ngokukhanya.
043	JOH	001	009	Kwakuyikukhanya okuqotho, okukhanyisa wonke umuntu oza emhlabeni.
043	JOH	001	010	Wayekhona emhlabeni, njalo umhlaba wenziwa ngaye, kodwa umhlaba kawumazanga.
043	JOH	001	011	Weza kokwakhe, kodwa abakhe kabamemukelanga.
043	JOH	001	012	Kodwa bonke abamemukelayo, wabapha amandla okuthi babe ngabantwana bakaNkulunkulu, labo abakholwa ebizweni lakhe;
043	JOH	001	013	abazalwa kungeyisikho ngegazi, langentando yenyama, langentando yendoda, kodwa nguNkulunkulu.
043	JOH	001	014	ULizwi wasesiba yinyama, wahlala phakathi kwethu, njalo sabona inkazimulo yakhe, inkazimulo injengeyozelwe yedwa kaYise, egcwele umusa leqiniso.
043	JOH	001	015	UJohane wafakaza ngaye, wamemeza wathi: Nguye lo ebengisitsho ngaye ukuthi: Lowo ozayo emva kwami uphambi kwami; ngoba wayekhona kuqala kulami.
043	JOH	001	016	Lekugcwaleni kwakhe thina semukele sonke, futhi umusa ngomusa;
043	JOH	001	017	ngoba umlayo wanikwa ngoMozisi, umusa leqiniso kweza ngoJesu Kristu.
043	JOH	001	018	Kakho owake wabona uNkulunkulu; iNdodana ezelwe yodwa, esesifubeni sikaYise, yiyo emvezileyo.
043	JOH	001	019	Njalo lobu yibufakazi bukaJohane, mhla amaJuda ethuma abapristi lamaLevi bevela eJerusalema ukuze bambuze ukuthi: Wena ungubani?
043	JOH	001	020	Wasevuma, kaphikanga; futhi wavuma wathi: Kangisuye uKristu mina.
043	JOH	001	021	Bambuza futhi bathi: Kuyini pho? Wena unguElija yini? Wasesithi: Kangisuye. Wena ungulowomProfethi yini? Wasephendula wathi: Hatshi.
043	JOH	001	022	Basebesithi kuye: Ungubani? Ukuze sibaphe impendulo abasithumileyo; uthini ngawe?
043	JOH	001	023	Wathi: Mina ngiyilizwi lomemezayo enkangala: Lungisani indlela yeNkosi, njengoba uIsaya umprofethi watsho.
043	JOH	001	024	Lalabo ababethunyiwe babevela kubaFarisi.
043	JOH	001	025	Basebembuza, bathi kuye: Ubhabhathizelani pho, uba wena ungeyisuye uKristu, loElija, lalowomProfethi?
043	JOH	001	026	UJohane wabaphendula, wathi: Mina ngibhabhathiza ngamanzi; kodwa phakathi kwenu kumi, lina elingamaziyo;
043	JOH	001	027	nguye ozayo emva kwami, ophambi kwami, engingafanele mina ukuthukulula umchilo wenyathela lakhe.
043	JOH	001	028	Lezizinto zenzeka eBethabara ngaphetsheya kweJordani, lapho uJohane ayebhabhathiza khona.
043	JOH	001	029	Kusisa uJohane wabona uJesu esiza kuye, wathi: Khangelani iWundlu likaNkulunkulu, elisusa isono somhlaba.
043	JOH	001	030	Nguye lo mina ebengilitshela ngaye ukuthi: Emva kwami kuza indoda, eyayikhona phambi kwami, ngoba yayikhona kuqala kulami.
043	JOH	001	031	Lami bengingamazi; kodwa ukuze abonakaliswe kuIsrayeli, ngalokho mina ngizile ngibhabhathiza ngamanzi.
043	JOH	001	032	UJohane wasefakaza, esithi: Ngibonile uMoya esehla ezulwini njengejuba, wahlala phezu kwakhe.
043	JOH	001	033	Lami bengingamazi; kodwa owangithumayo ukubhabhathiza ngamanzi, yena wathi kimi: Lowo ozabona uMoya esehlela phezu kwakhe ahlale kuye, nguye obhabhathiza ngoMoya oNgcwele.
043	JOH	001	034	Mina ngibonile, ngafakaza ukuthi lo uyiNdodana kaNkulunkulu.
043	JOH	001	035	Kusisa futhi uJohane wayemi, lababili kubafundi bakhe;
043	JOH	001	036	wasekhangela uJesu ehambahamba, wathi: Khangelani iWundlu likaNkulunkulu.
043	JOH	001	037	Abafundi ababili bamuzwa ekhuluma, basebemlandela uJesu.
043	JOH	001	038	Kwathi uJesu enyemukula ebabona belandela, wathi kubo: Lidingani? Basebesithi kuye: Rabi, (okuyikuthi ngokuphendulelwa, Mfundisi) uhlala ngaphi?
043	JOH	001	039	Wathi kubo: Wozani libone. Beza babona lapho ayehlala khona; bahlala laye ngalolosuku; kwakungaba lihola letshumi.
043	JOH	001	040	UAndreya umfowabo kaSimoni Petro wayengomunye wababili ababekuzwe ngoJohane bamlandela.
043	JOH	001	041	Yena wathola kuqala umfowabo uqobo uSimoni, wathi kuye: Simtholile uMesiya, okuphendulelwa ngokuthi, uKristu.
043	JOH	001	042	Wasemletha kuJesu. UJesu esemkhangele wathi: Wena unguSimoni indodana kaJona; uzathiwa nguKefasi, okuphendulelwa ngokuthi uPetro.
043	JOH	001	043	Kusisa uJesu wayefuna ukusuka aye eGalili, wathola uFiliphu, wathi kuye: Ngilandela.
043	JOH	001	044	UFiliphu-ke wayengoweBhethisayida, emzini wakibo kaAndreya loPetro.
043	JOH	001	045	UFiliphu wathola uNathaniyeli, wathi kuye: Simtholile lowo abhala ngaye uMozisi emlayweni labaprofethi, uJesu weNazaretha, indodana kaJosefa.
043	JOH	001	046	UNathaniyeli wasesithi kuye: Kambe kungavela okuhle eNazaretha? UFiliphu wathi kuye: Woza ubone.
043	JOH	001	047	UJesu wabona uNathaniyeli esiza kuye, wathi ngaye: Khangelani umIsrayeli uqobo, okungekho nkohliso kuye.
043	JOH	001	048	UNathaniyeli wathi kuye: Ungazela ngaphi? UJesu waphendula wathi kuye: UFiliphu engakakubizi, ungaphansi komkhiwa, ngakubona.
043	JOH	001	049	UNathaniyeli waphendula wathi kuye: Rabi, wena uyiNdodana kaNkulunkulu, wena uyiNkosi kaIsrayeli.
043	JOH	001	050	UJesu waphendula wathi kuye: Uyakholwa ngoba ngithe kuwe, bengikubona ungaphansi komkhiwa. Uzabona izinto ezinkulu kulalezi.
043	JOH	001	051	Wasesithi kuye: Ngiqinisile, ngiqinisile, ngithi kini: Kusukela khathesi lizabona izulu livulekile, lengilosi zikaNkulunkulu zisenyuka zisehla phezu kweNdodana yomuntu.
043	JOH	002	001	Kwathi ngosuku lwesithathu kwaba khona umtshado eKana yeGalili; lonina kaJesu wayekhona lapho;
043	JOH	002	002	njalo uJesu laye wayenxusiwe labafundi bakhe emtshadweni.
043	JOH	002	003	Kwathi iwayini selisweleka, unina kaJesu wathi kuye: Kabalalo iwayini.
043	JOH	002	004	UJesu wathi kuye: Mama, ngilani lawe? Ihola lami kalikafiki.
043	JOH	002	005	Unina wathi kuzinceku: Yenzani loba yikuphi azalitshela khona.
043	JOH	002	006	Kwakukhona lapho imbiza zamanzi ezamatshe zimiswe njengokokuhlambulula kwamaJuda, inye ingena amaphoco amabili kumbe amathathu.
043	JOH	002	007	UJesu wathi kuzo: Gcwalisani imbiza zamanzi ngamanzi. Zasezizigcwalisa zathi kliki.
043	JOH	002	008	Wasesithi kuzo: Khanini khathesi, lise kumphathi wokudla. Zasezikusa.
043	JOH	002	009	Umphathi wokudla esizwa amanzi asebe liwayini, engazi ukuthi livela ngaphi (kodwa inceku ezaziwakhile amanzi zazisazi), umphathi wokudla wabiza umyeni,
043	JOH	002	010	wasesithi kuye: Wonke umuntu uletha iwayini elimnandi kuqala, kuthi lapho sebenathile kakhulu, abeseletha elibi; wena ugcinile iwayini elimnandi kwaze kwaba khathesi.
043	JOH	002	011	Lokho kuyikuqala kwezibonakaliso uJesu akwenza eKana yeGalili wabonakalisa inkazimulo yakhe; labafundi bakhe bakholwa kuye.
043	JOH	002	012	Emva kwalokho wehlela eKapenawume, yena, lonina, labafowabo, labafundi bakhe; njalo bahlala khona kungeyisikho okwensuku ezinengi.
043	JOH	002	013	Iphasika lamaJuda laselisondele, uJesu wasesenyukela eJerusalema.
043	JOH	002	014	Wafica ethempelini labo abathengisa inkabi lezimvu lamajuba, labantshintshi bemali behlezi.
043	JOH	002	015	Esenze isiswepu sezintambo wabaxotsha bonke ethempelini, izimvu kanye lenkabi; wachitha imali yabantshintshisayo, wagenqula amatafula;
