044	ACT	020	013	Kodwa thina, sesihambe phambili ukuya emkhunjini, sasuka ngomkhumbi saya eAsosi, lapho siqonde ukumkhweza uPawuli; ngoba wayemisile ngokunjalo, yena ebezahamba ngenyawo.
044	ACT	020	014	Njalo esehlangene lathi eAsosi, samkhweza safika eMithilene,
