044	ACT	020	032	Lakhathesi, bazalwane, ngilinikela kuNkulunkulu laselizwini lomusa wakhe, elilamandla okulakha, lokulipha ilifa phakathi kwabo bonke abangcwelisiweyo.
044	ACT	020	033	Kangihawukelanga isiliva kumbe igolide loba isembatho somuntu.
