044	ACT	022	021	Wasesithi kimi: Hamba, ngoba mina ngizakuthuma khatshana kwabezizwe.
044	ACT	022	022	Bamlalela kwaze kwafika kulelolizwi, baphakamisa ilizwi labo besithi: Msuseni onje emhlabeni, ngoba kakufanele ukuthi aphile!
