047	2CO	011	029	Ngubani obuthakathaka, ngingabi buthakathaka lami? Ngubani okhutshekiswayo, lami ngingatshiseki?
047	2CO	011	030	Uba kumele ukuzincoma, ngizazincoma ngezinto zobuthakathaka bami.
047	2CO	011	031	UNkulunkulu uYise weNkosi yethu uJesu Kristu, obongekayo kuze kube nini lanini, uyazi ukuthi kangiqambi manga.
047	2CO	011	032	EDamaseko induna yenkosi uAretha yalinda umuzi wabeDamaseko, efuna ukungibamba;
047	2CO	011	033	njalo ngehliswa ngewindi esilulwini ngomduli, ngasengiphepha ezandleni zayo.
