# BOOK	049	EPH	Ephesians	Kwabase-Efesu
049	EPH	001	001	UPawuli, umphostoli kaJesu Kristu ngentando kaNkulunkulu, kubo abangcwele abaseEfesu, labathembekileyo kuKristu Jesu:
049	EPH	001	002	Umusa kawube kini lokuthula okuvela kuNkulunkulu uBaba wethu laseNkosini uJesu Kristu.
049	EPH	001	003	Ubusisiwe uNkulunkulu loYise weNkosi yethu uJesu Kristu, osibusisileyo ngaso sonke isibusiso somoya ezintweni zezulwini kuKristu;
049	EPH	001	004	njengoba wasikhetha kuye ngaphambi kokusekelwa komhlaba, ukuthi sibe ngcwele, njalo singasoleki phambi kwakhe ethandweni,
049	EPH	001	005	esesimisele ngaphambili ukuma kwabantwana kuye ngoJesu Kristu, njengokufisa okuhle kwentando yakhe,
049	EPH	001	006	kube ludumo lobukhosi bomusa wakhe, asiphe wona ngesihle ngaye oThandiweyo;
049	EPH	001	007	esilohlengo kuye ngegazi lakhe, uthethelelo lweziphambeko, njengokwenotho yomusa wakhe,
049	EPH	001	008	awengezelele kithi kuyo yonke inhlakanipho lokuqonda,
049	EPH	001	009	esesazisile imfihlo yentando yakhe, njengokufisa kwakhe okuhle, akumisa kuye ngokwakhe,
049	EPH	001	010	ukuze, ekuphatheni kokugcwaliseka kwezikhathi, ahlanganise ndawonye izinto zonke kuKristu, zombili ezisemazulwini lezisemhlabeni;
049	EPH	001	011	ngitsho kuye, lathi esabelwa ilifa kuye, esamiselwa ngaphambili njengokwesimiso sakhe owenzayo izinto zonke njengokwecebo lentando yakhe,
049	EPH	001	012	ukuze sibe ngabodumo lobukhosi bakhe, esathemba kuKristu kuqala;
049	EPH	001	013	eselithemba kuye lani, selizwile ilizwi leqiniso, ivangeli losindiso lwenu; kuye selikholiwe lani laphawulwa nguMoya oNgcwele wesithembiso,
049	EPH	001	014	oyisibambiso selifa lethu, kube yikuhlengwa okuzuziweyo, kudumo lobukhosi bakhe.
049	EPH	001	015	Ngenxa yalokho lami sengizwile ngokholo lwenu eNkosini uJesu lothando kubo bonke abangcwele,
049	EPH	001	016	kangiyekeli ukulibongela, ngiliphatha emikhulekweni yami;
049	EPH	001	017	ukuze uNkulunkulu weNkosi yethu uJesu Kristu, uYise wodumo, alinike umoya wenhlakanipho lowesambulo elwazini lwakhe;
049	EPH	001	018	amehlo engqondo yenu akhanyiswe, ukuze lazi ukuthi liyini ithemba lobizo lwakhe, lokuthi iyini inotho yodumo lwelifa lakhe kwabangcwele,
049	EPH	001	019	lokuthi buyini ubukhulu bamandla akhe obudlula amalawulo kithi esikholwa njengokusebenza kobuninimandla bamandla akhe,
049	EPH	001	020	awasebenzisa kuKristu, emvusa kwabafileyo, njalo emhlalisa ngakwesokunene sakhe endaweni zezulu,
049	EPH	001	021	phezulu kakhulu kwakho konke ukubusa lobukhulu lamandla lobukhosi, lebizo lonke elibizwayo, kungeyisikho kulesisikhathi kuphela, kodwa lakwesizayo;
049	EPH	001	022	wasebeka konke ngaphansi kwenyawo zakhe, wamnikela ukuba yinhloko phezu kwakho konke kulo ibandla,
049	EPH	001	023	elingumzimba wakhe, ukugcwala kwalowo ogcwalisa konke kukho konke.
049	EPH	002	001	Lina-kewalivusa elalifile ngeziphambeko langezono,
049	EPH	002	002	elalikade lihamba kuzo njengokwendlela yalumhlaba, njengokombusi wamandla omkhathi, awomoya osebenzayo khathesi phakathi kwabantwana bokungalaleli;
049	EPH	002	003	lathi sonke sake sahamba phakathi kwabo enkanukweni zenyama yethu, sisenza intando zenyama lezemicabango, njalo ngokwemvelo sasingabantwana bolaka, njengabanye labo;
049	EPH	002	004	kodwa uNkulunkulu, enothile esihawini, ngenxa yothando lwakhe olukhulu asithanda ngalo,
049	EPH	002	005	lanxa sasifile ngeziphambeko, wasiphilisa kanye loKristu (ngomusa lisindisiwe),
049	EPH	002	006	njalo wasivusa kanye laye, wasesihlalisa kanye laye endaweni zezulwini kuKristu Jesu;
049	EPH	002	007	ukuze abonakalise ezikhathini ezizayo inotho yomusa wakhe edlula amalawulo ngobubele kithi kuKristu Jesu;
049	EPH	002	008	ngoba ngomusa lisindisiwe ngokholo, lalokhu kakuveli kini; yisipho sikaNkulunkulu;
049	EPH	002	009	kakuveli emisebenzini, ukuze kungabi khona ozincomayo.
049	EPH	002	010	Ngoba singumsebenzi wakhe, kuKristu Jesu sadalelwa imisebenzi emihle, uNkulunkulu ayilungisela ngaphambili, ukuze sihambe kiyo.
049	EPH	002	011	Ngakho khumbulani ukuthi lina lake laba ngabezizwe enyameni, ababizwa ngokuthi yikungasoki ngalokhu okuthiwa yikusoka enyameni okwenziwe ngezandla,
049	EPH	002	012	ukuthi ngalesosikhathi lalingelaye uKristu, abemzini kubusakhamuzi bakoIsrayeli, njalo abezizwe kuzivumelwano zesithembiso, lalingelathemba, njalo lingelaye uNkulunkulu emhlabeni.
049	EPH	002	013	Kodwa khathesi-ke kuKristu Jesu lina elalikade likhatshana, seliseduze ngegazi likaKristu.
049	EPH	002	014	Ngoba yena uyikuthula kwethu, owenza kokubili kwaba kunye, lowabhidliza umduli ophakathi owesehlukaniso,
049	EPH	002	015	echithile ubutha enyameni yakhe, umlayo wemithetho ezimisweni, ukuze kuye labo ababili abadale babe ngumuntu munye omutsha, enze ukuthula,
049	EPH	002	016	njalo enze ukuthi bobabili babuyisane loNkulunkulu emzimbeni munye ngesiphambano, esebulele ubutha ngaso;
049	EPH	002	017	njalo weza watshumayela ukuthula kini elalikhatshana, lakulabo ababeseduze;
049	EPH	002	018	ngoba ngaye sobabili silokungena ngoMoya munye kuBaba.
049	EPH	002	019	Ngakho-ke kaliseyibo abemzini lezihambi, kodwa izakhamizi kanye labangcwele njalo abendlu kaNkulunkulu,
049	EPH	002	020	lakhiwe phezu kwesisekelo sabaphostoli labaprofethi, uJesu Kristu uqobo eyilitshe eliyinhloko yengonsi,
049	EPH	002	021	okuhlanganiselwe kuye isakhiwo sonke sikhule sibe lithempeli elingcwele eNkosini,
049	EPH	002	022	elakhiwa kuye lani kanye labanye libe yindlu yokuhlala kaNkulunkulu kuMoya.
049	EPH	003	001	Ngenxa yalokhu mina Pawuli, isibotshwa sikaKristu Jesu ngani abezizwe,
049	EPH	003	002	uba kambe selizwile ngokuphathwa komusa kaNkulunkulu engawuphiwelwa lina,
049	EPH	003	003	ukuthi njengesambulelo wangazisa imfihlo (njengalokhu ngabhala ngaphambili ngamafitshane,
049	EPH	003	004	okungalokhu, nxa lifunda, lingazi ulwazi lwami emfihlweni kaKristu);
049	EPH	003	005	yona engaziswanga ezizukulwaneni ezinye ebantwaneni babantu, njengalokhu isiyembuliwe khathesi kubaphostoli bakhe abangcwele labaprofethi ngoMoya;
049	EPH	003	006	ukuthi abezizwe babe yizindlalifa abahlanganyeli lomzimba ofananayo labahlanganyeli besithembiso sakhe kuKristu, ngevangeli,
049	EPH	003	007	engenziwa ngalo isikhonzi njengokwesipho somusa kaNkulunkulu engiwuphiwe ngokusebenza kwamandla akhe.
049	EPH	003	008	Kimi, engimncinyane kulomncinyane wabo bonke abangcwele, lowomusa ngawuphiwa, ukuthi ngitshumayele kwabezizwe ivangeli lenotho kaKristu engelakulinganiswa,
049	EPH	003	009	lokukhanyisela bonke ukuthi buyini ubudlelwano bemfihlo, ebifihliwe kusukela endulo kuNkulunkulu owadala izinto zonke ngoJesu Kristu,
049	EPH	003	010	ukuze khathesi emibusweni lemandleni endaweni zezulu yaziswe libandla inhlakanipho kaNkulunkulu ezinhlobonhlobo,
049	EPH	003	011	njengokwecebo laphakade alenza ngoKristu Jesu iNkosi yethu;
049	EPH	003	012	esilesibindi kuye lokungena ngethemba, ngokholo lwakhe.
049	EPH	003	013	Ngakho ngiyacela ukuthi lingalahli ithemba enhluphekweni zami ngani, eziludumo lwenu.
049	EPH	003	014	Ngenxa yalokhu ngiguqa ngamadolo kuYise weNkosi yethu uJesu Kristu,
049	EPH	003	015	okubizwa ngaye usendo lonke olusemazulwini lolusemhlabeni,
049	EPH	003	016	ukuze alinike, njengokwenotho yobukhosi bakhe, liqiniswe ngamandla ngoMoya wakhe emuntwini ongaphakathi,
049	EPH	003	017	ukuze uKristu ahlale ngokholo enhliziyweni zenu; ligxilile lisekelwe ethandweni,
049	EPH	003	018	ukuze libe lamandla sibili okuqedisisa kanye labo bonke abangcwele, ukuthi kuyini ububanzi lobude lokutshona lokuphakama,
049	EPH	003	019	lokwazi uthando lukaKristu olwedlula ulwazi, ukuze ligcwaliswe ngokugcwala konke kukaNkulunkulu.
049	EPH	003	020	Njalo kuye, olamandla phezu kwakho konke okwenza okwedlula ngokwengezelelweyo kwesikucelayo kumbe esikunakanayo, njengamandla asebenza kithi,
049	EPH	003	021	kuye kakube udumo ebandleni kuKristu Jesu, ezizukulwaneni zonke zaphakade laphakade. Ameni.
049	EPH	004	001	Ngakho ngiyalincenga, mina isibotshwa eNkosini, ukuthi lihambe ngokufanele ubizo elabizwa ngalo,
049	EPH	004	002	kanye lokuthobeka konke lobumnene, lokubekezela, libekezelelane ethandweni,
049	EPH	004	003	likhuthale ukugcina ukuhlangana koMoya ngesibopho sokuthula.
049	EPH	004	004	Munye umzimba njalo munye uMoya, njengalokhu lani labizwa ethembeni linye lobizo lwenu;
049	EPH	004	005	yinye iNkosi, lunye ukholo, lunye ubhabhathizo,
049	EPH	004	006	munye uNkulunkulu loYise wabo bonke, ophezu kwabo bonke, langabo bonke, lakini lonke.
049	EPH	004	007	Kodwa ngulowo lalowo wethu waphiwa umusa njengokwesilinganiso sesipho sikaKristu.
049	EPH	004	008	Ngakho uthi: Ekwenyukeleni kwakhe phezulu wathumba ukuthunjwa, wanika abantu izipho.
049	EPH	004	009	Lokhu-ke ukuthi: Wenyuka, kuyini ngaphandle kokuthi laye wehlela kuqala kungxenye ezingaphansi zomhlaba?
049	EPH	004	010	Owehlayo, nguye owenyukela futhi khatshana ngaphezulu kwamazulu wonke, ukuze agcwalise izinto zonke.
049	EPH	004	011	Yena wasenika abanye babe ngabaphostoli, labanye babe ngabaprofethi, labanye babe ngabavangeli, labanye babe ngabelusi labafundisi,
049	EPH	004	012	ekuphelelisweni kwabangcwele, emsebenzini wenkonzo, ekwakhiweni komzimba kaKristu;
049	EPH	004	013	size sifike sonke ebunyeni bokholo, lobolwazi lweNdodana kaNkulunkulu, endodeni epheleleyo, esilinganisweni sesimo sokugcwala kukaKristu;
049	EPH	004	014	ukuze singabe sisaba zinsane, ezizuliswa ngamagagasi njalo ezithwalelwa le lale yiwo wonke umoya wemfundiso, ngenkohliso yabantu, ngobuqili becebo lokuphambuka;
049	EPH	004	015	kodwa sikhulume iqiniso ethandweni sikhule kukho konke kuye, oyinhloko, uKristu,
049	EPH	004	016	okuvela kuye umzimba wonke, ohlanganiswe kuhle njalo ubambene, ngokwelekelelana kwalo lonke ilunga, njengokusebenza esilinganisweni saleso laleso isitho, wenza ukukhula komzimba ekuzakheni kwawo ethandweni.
049	EPH	004	017	Ngakho ngitsho lokho ngifakaza eNkosini, ukuthi lingabe lisahamba lanjengabanye abezizwe behamba ebuzeni bengqondo yabo,
049	EPH	004	018	befiphaziwe engqondweni, benziwe abemzini empilweni kaNkulunkulu ngokungazi okukibo, ngobulukhuni benhliziyo yabo;
049	EPH	004	019	abathi sebentunyile, bazinikela emanyaleni, ekwenzeni kokungcola konke ngomhawu.
049	EPH	004	020	Kodwa lina kalimfundanga ngokunjalo uKristu,
049	EPH	004	021	uba-ke limzwile lafundiswa kuye, njengoba iqiniso likuJesu;
049	EPH	004	022	ukuthi lilahle mayelana lohambo lokuqala, umuntu omdala, owonakala mayelana lezifiso zenkohliso;
049	EPH	004	023	njalo lenziwe batsha emoyeni wengqondo yenu,
049	EPH	004	024	njalo lembathe umuntu omutsha, odalwe njengokukaNkulunkulu ekulungeni lebungcweleni beqiniso.
049	EPH	004	025	Ngakho lilahla amanga, khulumani iqiniso ngulowo lalowo lomakhelwane wakhe; ngoba siyizitho omunye komunye.
049	EPH	004	026	Thukuthelani lingoni; ilanga kalingatshoni phezu kolaka lwenu;
049	EPH	004	027	futhi lingamniki indawo udiyabhola.
049	EPH	004	028	Owebayo kangabe eseba; kodwa kulalokhu kakhuthale, asebenze okuhle ngezandla zakhe, ukuze abe lakho ukwabela olenswelo.
049	EPH	004	029	Kakungaphumi emlonyeni wenu lalinye ilizwi elibolileyo, kodwa kuphela okuhle okulungele ukwakha njengokufaneleyo, ukuze kunike umusa kubo abezwayo.
049	EPH	004	030	Njalo lingamdabukisi uMoya oyiNgcwele kaNkulunkulu, elaphawulwa ngaye kuze kube lusuku lohlengo.
049	EPH	004	031	Konke ukubaba lentukuthelo lolaka lomsindo lokunyeya kakususwe kini, kanye layo yonke inzondo;
049	EPH	004	032	kodwa libe mnene omunye komunye, lilesihawu, lithethelelane, njengalokhu uNkulunkulu laye walithethelela kuKristu.
049	EPH	005	001	Ngakho banini ngabalandeli bakaNkulunkulu, njengabantwana abathandekayo;
049	EPH	005	002	njalo lihambe ethandweni, njengalokhu uKristu laye wasithanda, wazinikelela thina abe ngumnikelo lomhlatshelo kuNkulunkulu ukuba luqhatshi olumnandi.
049	EPH	005	003	Kodwa ubufebe lakho konke ukungcola kumbe umhawu kakungaphathwa lakanye phakathi kwenu, njengoba kufanele abangcwele;
049	EPH	005	004	lamanyala, lokukhuluma okuyize, kumbe ukusoma okulenhlamba, okuyizinto ezingafanelanga; kodwa kulalokhu, ukubonga.
049	EPH	005	005	Ngoba lokhu liyakwazi, ukuthi sonke isifebe, kumbe ongcolileyo, kumbe olomhawu, ongumkhonzi wezithombe, kalalifa embusweni kaKristu lokaNkulunkulu.
049	EPH	005	006	Kakungabi lamuntu olikhohlisayo ngamazwi ayize; ngoba ngenxa yalezizinto ulaka lukaNkulunkulu luyehlela phezu kwabantwana bokungalaleli.
049	EPH	005	007	Ngakho lingabi ngabahlanganyeli labo.
049	EPH	005	008	Ngoba lake laba ngumnyama, kodwa khathesi liyikukhanya eNkosini; hambani njengabantwana bokukhanya,
049	EPH	005	009	ngoba isithelo sikaMoya sikubo bonke ubuhle lokulunga leqiniso,
049	EPH	005	010	lihlolisise okuthokozisayo eNkosini;
049	EPH	005	011	njalo lingahlanganyeli lemisebenzi yobumnyama engelazithelo, kodwa-ke kulalokho solani;
049	EPH	005	012	ngoba kuthelela inhloni lokukhuluma ngezinto ezenziwa yibo ekusithekeni.
049	EPH	005	013	Kodwa konke okusolwayo yikukhanya kuyabonakaliswa; ngoba konke okubonakaliswayo kuyikukhanya,
049	EPH	005	014	ngakho uthi: Phaphama wena oleleyo uvuke kwabafileyo, njalo uKristu uzakukhanyisela.
049	EPH	005	015	Ngakho qaphelani ukuthi lihamba njani ngonanzelelo, kungabi njengezithutha, kodwa njengabahlakaniphileyo,
049	EPH	005	016	lihlenga isikhathi, ngoba insuku zimbi.
049	EPH	005	017	Ngakho lingabi yizithutha, kodwa liqedisisa okuyintando yeNkosi.
049	EPH	005	018	Njalo lingadakwa liwayini, okukulo umsindo, kodwa gcwaliswani nguMoya,
049	EPH	005	019	likhulumisana ngezihlabelelo langamahubo okudumisa langezingoma zomoya, lihlabelele licule eNkosini enhliziyweni yenu,
049	EPH	005	020	limbonga njalo uNkulunkulu loBaba ngazo zonke izinto ebizweni leNkosi yethu uJesu Kristu,
049	EPH	005	021	lizehlisela ngaphansi omunye komunye ekumesabeni uNkulunkulu.
049	EPH	005	022	Bafazi, zehliseleni ngaphansi kwawenu amadoda, njengeNkosini,
049	EPH	005	023	ngoba indoda iyinhloko yomfazi, njengoba uKristu laye eyinhloko yebandla, njalo yena unguMsindisi womzimba.
049	EPH	005	024	Kodwa njengoba-ke ibandla lehliselwe ngaphansi kukaKristu, ngokunjalo labafazi kwawabo amadoda kuyo yonke into.
049	EPH	005	025	Madoda, thandani abenu abafazi, njengoKristu laye walithanda ibandla, wasezinikelela lona;
049	EPH	005	026	ukuze azingcwelisele lona, eselihlambulule ngesihlambo samanzi ngelizwi,
049	EPH	005	027	ukuze azimisele lona, ibandla elilenkazimulo, elingelachatha, kumbe umxhele kumbe okunye nje, kodwa ukuze libe ngcwele lingelacala.
049	EPH	005	028	Ngokunjalo amadoda afanele ukuthanda abawo abafazi njengeyawo imizimba. Othanda owakhe umfazi, uyazithanda yena;
049	EPH	005	029	ngoba kakho owake wazonda eyakhe inyama, kodwa uyayondla ayiphathe kuhle, njengalokhu leNkosi isenza kubandla;
049	EPH	005	030	ngoba siyizitho zomzimba wakhe, okwenyama yakhe lokwamathambo akhe.
049	EPH	005	031	Ngenxa yalokhu umuntu uzatshiya uyise lonina anamathele kumkakhe, njalo laba ababili bazakuba nyamanye.
049	EPH	005	032	Inkulu le imfihlo; kodwa mina ngikhuluma ngoKristu lebandla.
049	EPH	005	033	Ngalokho lonke ngokukhethekileyo lani-ke, ngulowo lalowo kathande ngokunjalo owakhe umfazi njengaye; lomfazi ukuze ahloniphe indoda.
049	EPH	006	001	Bantwana, lalelani abazali benu eNkosini; ngoba lokhu kulungile.
049	EPH	006	002	Hlonipha uyihlo lonyoko, okungumlayo wokuqala olesithembiso,
049	EPH	006	003	ukuze kube kuhle kuwe, njalo uphile isikhathi eside emhlabeni.
049	EPH	006	004	Lani bobaba, lingabathukuthelisi abantwana benu, kodwa libondle emlayweni lemfundisweni yeNkosi.
049	EPH	006	005	Zisebenzi, lalelani amakhosi enu ngokwenyama, ngokwesaba langokuthuthumela, ebuqothweni benhliziyo zenu, njengakuKristu;
049	EPH	006	006	kungeyisikho ngenkonzo yamehlo njengabathokozisa abantu, kodwa njengezisebenzi zikaKristu, zisenza intando kaNkulunkulu ngenhliziyo,
049	EPH	006	007	lisebenza ngenhliziyo enhle kungathi kuseNkosini njalo kungeyisikho ebantwini;
049	EPH	006	008	lisazi ukuthi loba yini enhle ngulowo lalowo angayenza, enjalo uzayemukela eNkosini, loba eyisigqili, loba engokhululekileyo.
049	EPH	006	009	Lani makhosi, yenzani izinto ezifananayo kuzo, liyekele ukuzisongela; lisazi ukuthi leyenu iNkosi isemazulwini, njalo ukubandlulula umuntu kakukho kuyo.
049	EPH	006	010	Elokucina, bazalwane bami, qinani eNkosini, lebuninimandleni bamandla ayo.
049	EPH	006	011	Hlomani izikhali zonke zikaNkulunkulu, ukuze libe lamandla okumelana lobuqili bukadiyabhola;
049	EPH	006	012	ngoba kasibindani legazi lenyama, kodwa lemibuso, lamandla, lababusi balumhlaba wobumnyama balesisikhathi, lemimoya yamabutho obubi ezindaweni zamazulu.
049	EPH	006	013	Ngakho hlomani izikhali zonke zikaNkulunkulu, ukuze libe lamandla okugxila osukwini olubi, lokuze kuthi lapho seliqede konke, lime.
049	EPH	006	014	Ngakho manini, inkalo zenu zibotshiwe ngeqiniso, lifake isivikelo sesifuba sokulunga,
049	EPH	006	015	njalo ligqokise inyawo zenu ngokulunga kwevangeli lokuthula;
049	EPH	006	016	phezu kwakho konke selithethe isihlangu sokholo, elizakuba lamandla okucitsha ngaso yonke imitshoko evuthayo yomubi.
049	EPH	006	017	Njalo thathani ikhowa losindiso, lenkemba kaMoya, eyilizwi likaNkulunkulu,
049	EPH	006	018	ngawo wonke umkhuleko lonxuso likhuleka isikhathi sonke kuMoya, lakulokhu lilinde ngesineke sonke lonxuso ngabangcwele bonke,
049	EPH	006	019	langami, ukuze ngiphiwe ilizwi ekuvuleni umlomo wami ngesibindi ukuze ngazise imfihlo yevangeli,
049	EPH	006	020	engiyisithunywa ngalo esisemaketaneni, ukuze ngikhulume ngesibindi kulo, njengoba kungifanele ukuthi ngikhulume.
049	EPH	006	021	Kodwa ukuze lani lazi izinto eziqondana lami, engikwenzayo, uzalitshela konke uTikiko umzalwane othandekayo lesikhonzi esithembekileyo eNkosini;
049	EPH	006	022	engimthume kini ngakhona lokhu, ukuze lazi izinto eziqondana lathi, lokuthi aduduze inhliziyo zenu.
049	EPH	006	023	Ukuthulakakube kubazalwane, lothando kanye lokholo oluvela kuNkulunkulu uBaba leNkosini uJesu Kristu.
049	EPH	006	024	Umusa kawube kubo bonke abathanda iNkosi yethu uJesu Kristu ngokungonakaliyo. Ameni.
#
# BOOK	050	PHI	Philippians	KwabaseFiliphi
050	PHI	001	001	UPawuli loTimothi, izinceku zikaJesu Kristu, kubo bonke abangcwele kuKristu Jesu abaseFiliphi, kanye lababonisi labadikoni:
050	PHI	001	002	Umusa kawube kini lokuthula okuvela kuNkulunkulu uBaba wethu leNkosini uJesu Kristu.
050	PHI	001	003	Ngiyambonga uNkulunkulu wami ekulikhumbuleni konke,
050	PHI	001	004	ngezikhathi zonke kuwo wonke umkhuleko wami ngani lonke ngincenga ngentokozo,
050	PHI	001	005	ngokuhlanganyela kwenu evangelini, kusukela osukwini lokuqala kuze kube khathesi;
050	PHI	001	006	ngilethemba lakhona lokhu, ukuthi owaqalisa umsebenzi omuhle kini uzawuphelelisa kuze kube sosukwini lukaJesu Kristu;
050	PHI	001	007	njengoba kulungile kimi ukuthi ngikhumbule lokhu ngani lonke, ngoba ngilani enhliziyweni, ukuthi lekubotshweni kwami, lekuvikeleni lekuqiniseleni ivangeli, lina lonke lingabahlanganyeli bomusa wami.
050	PHI	001	008	Ngoba uNkulunkulu ungumfakazi wami, wokuthi ngililangatha kangakanani lonke emibilini kaJesu Kristu.
050	PHI	001	009	Njalo ngikhuleka lokhu, ukuthi uthando lwenu luvame-ke lusanda ngokwanda elwazini lekuqedisiseni konke,
050	PHI	001	010	ukuze lizivume izinto ezinhle kakhulu, ukuze lihlambuluke lingasoleki kuze kube sosukwini lukaKristu,
050	PHI	001	011	ligcwaliswe ngezithelo zokulunga ezingoJesu Kristu, ebukhosini lodumo lukaNkulunkulu.
050	PHI	001	012	Kodwa ngithanda ukuthi lazi, bazalwane, ukuthi izinto ezangehlelayo zenza kakhulu ukuqhutshelwa phambili kwevangeli;
050	PHI	001	013	zize izibopho zami kuKristu zibonakale esigodlweni sonke lakwabanye bonke,
050	PHI	001	014	labazalwane abanengi eNkosini, beqiniswe ngezibopho zami, sebelesibindi esikhulu sokukhuluma ilizwi ngokungesabi.
050	PHI	001	015	Abanye kambe batshumayela uKristu ngomona langombango, labanye kambe ngenhliziyo enhle;
050	PHI	001	016	laba batshumayela uKristu ngokuphikisana, bengelaqiniso, besithi baletha ukuhlupheka ekubotshweni kwami;
050	PHI	001	017	kodwa labo ngothando, besazi ukuthi ngimiselwe ukuvikela ivangeli.
050	PHI	001	018	Kuyini pho? Loba kunjalo kuyo yonke indlela, loba ekuzenziseni, kumbe eqinisweni, uKristu uyatshunyayelwa; kulokhu-ke ngiyathokoza, yebo ngizathokoza futhi.
050	PHI	001	019	Ngoba ngiyazi ukuthi lokhu kuzaphendukela kimi esindisweni ngomkhuleko wenu, langokwelekelela kukaMoya kaJesu Kristu,
050	PHI	001	020	njengokulindela okukhulu lethemba lami, ukuthi kangiyikuyangiswa ngalutho, kodwa ngesibindi sonke, njengesikhathi sonke, lakhathesi uKristu uzakhuliswa emzimbeni wami, loba ngempilo, kumbe ngokufa.
050	PHI	001	021	Ngoba kimi ukuphila kunguKristu, lokufa kuyinzuzo.
050	PHI	001	022	Kodwa uba ukuphila enyameni kuyisithelo somsebenzi kimi, lengizakukhetha kangikwazi.
050	PHI	001	023	Ngoba ngiminyezelwe ngokubili; ngilesifiso sokusuka lokuba loKristu, okungcono kakhulukazi;
050	PHI	001	024	kodwa ukuhlala enyameni kuyasweleka kakhulu ngenxa yenu.
050	PHI	001	025	Njalo ngilalelithemba ngiyazi ukuthi ngizakuba khona, ngihlale lani lonke, ekuqhubekeni kwenu lentokozweni yokholo,
050	PHI	001	026	ukuze ukuzincoma kwenu ngami kwengezwe kuKristu Jesu kimi, ngobukhona bami kini futhi.
050	PHI	001	027	Kuphela hambani ngokufanele ivangeli likaKristu, kuze kuthi, loba ngifika ngilibona, loba ngingekho, ngizwe indaba zenu, zokuthi limi emoyeni munye, ngangqondonye lilwela ukholo lwevangeli ndawonye,
050	PHI	001	028	njalo lingethuswa ngalutho ngabaphikisayo; okuyisibonakaliso kubo sokubhubha, kodwa kini esosindiso, njalo lokhu kuvela kuNkulunkulu;
050	PHI	001	029	ngoba lanikwa ngesihle esikhundleni sikaKristu, kungeyisikho ukukholwa kuye kuphela, kodwa lokumhluphekela;
050	PHI	001	030	lilokulwa okufananayo njengalokho elakubona kimi, lelikuzwa kimi khathesi.
050	PHI	002	001	Ngakho uba kukhona inkuthazo kuKristu, uba kukhona induduzo yothando, uba kukhona ubudlelwano bukaMoya, uba kukhona imihelo lesihawu,
050	PHI	002	002	gcwalisani intokozo yami, ukuze libe ngqondonye, libe lothando olufananayo, libe lenhliziyonye, ukuqonda kunye;
